window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1701,"title":"Chapter 1701 The Incredibly Powerful Hua Xianyuan","paragraphs":["1701 The Incredibly Powerful Hua Xianyuan","Hua Xianyuan’s eyes were ice-cold as he stared at Xia Houjie. Though Xia Houjie was looking down on him, it wasn’t enough to make Hua Xianyuan change his expression.","A terrifying aura suddenly burst out from Xia Houjie. A suit of armor appeared on his body, emitting a faint light. Everyone focused and saw that the armor was spitting out sword light. It formed an isolated domain around him. Within this domain, a land of death was formed. If an ordinary person were to get close to this ten feet or so, it would simply be a dead end.","The expressions of many inner disciples who were watching the battle changed. This battle armor was extremely terrifying. If it were them, they would be ground into minced meat in an instant. Xia Houjie had abilities to dare to fight for first place.","“Swoosh!”","Xia Houjie erupted with all his power. The surrounding air currents began to condense, forming a terrifying torrent that headed straight for Hua Xianyuan. Just when everyone thought that Hua Xianyuan was going to dodge, he didn’t. Instead, he charged forward.","Hua Xianyuan rushed directly to Xia Houjie and started a close-quarter battle.","Boom!","Xia Houjie’s fist landed on Hua Xianyuan’s body, but immediately after, everyone saw a terrifying airflow burst out from Hua Xianyuan’s body. The airflow swept out and turned the fist force into nothingness.","“You dare to make a fool of yourself in front of me!”","At this moment, Hua Xianyuan truly displayed his powerful side. He wasn’t a peak Observer and was instead a late Observer. But in terms of cultivation, he was sufficient to contend with peak Observers. He wasn’t afraid at all.","The sword light emanating from Xia Houjie’s armor could not do anything to Hua Xianyuan. Everything turned into dust. This terrifying sword light that was capable of turning ordinary Observers into blood mist couldn’t do anything to Hua Xianyuan. It couldn’t even break through his defense.","At this moment, Hua Xianyuan finally made his move. He threw out a simple punch. A terrifying green dragon appeared around him, and terrifying power poured out. Xia Houjie did not want to be outdone and counterattacked with another punch.","Outside the arena, Chu Yunfan watched Hua Xianyuan. Hua Xianyuan was indeed a genius. He wasn’t a peak Observer yet, but he was able to defeat ordinary peak Observers. Although he couldn’t compare to Chu Yunfan, he was still a genius nonetheless.","On the other side, the beautiful woman was also staring at the two people in the arena. In her opinion, no matter who won, they would become her biggest competitors and the final obstacle in her path to first place. She had to pay attention to them.","“Xia Houjie is no match for Hua Xianyuan,” Chu Yunfan said as the two of them fought.","Although he spoke softly, everyone present was a martial arts master. They naturally heard this and looked at him. They didn’t know how he could tell the strength of the two people. Although Hua Xianyuan was powerful, Xia Houjie also seemed powerful. His armor was both offensive and defensive, and ordinary people couldn’t break it.","“Senior Chu, why do you say that?”","You Chuyun asked the question that everyone was thinking about. Even the beautiful woman perked up her ears. She could not tell the outcome of the battle, so how was Chu Yunfan so sure that his judgment was correct?","“It’s simple. Hua Xianyuan is only using 30% of his strength while Xia Houjie is using all of his,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","“What? Only 30%?”","“How can it be only 30%? Chu Yunfan must have lost his mind. Impossible, I admit that Hua Xianyuan is strong, but it’s impossible for him to fight Xia Houjie with only 30% of his strength. Xia Houjie is much stronger than me,” one of the top ten disciples said.","“Xia Houjie won’t be able to last even three moves against Hua Xianyua. Just watch.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “If it was in the past, Xia Houjie might have a chance to win, but this year is a pity. Not to mention Hua Xianyuan, even Yuwen Xing could easily defeat him.”","Chu Yunfan spoke with extreme certainty. Everyone looked at his expression and it was clear that he wasn’t spouting nonsense, but they didn’t dare to believe it.","At this moment, the winner of the battle was decided. Everyone saw that Xia Houjie was caught off guard and lost his balance. He was sent flying, and a huge dent appeared on his armor.","“How is this possible? Xia Houjie is no match for Hua Xianyuan. Did Hua Xianyuan really only use thirty percent of his power?” someone exclaimed.","Everyone saw Hua Xianyuan take advantage of the situation and chase after Xia Houjie. He didn’t give Xia Houjie a chance to recover and stomped down. This was an extremely terrifying technique.","In midair, a huge green foot appeared. The huge foot was surrounded by countless wind-type spirit energy. Like the eye of a storm, it stepped down.","Bam!","With a loud explosion, Xia Houjie was stomped into the ground and his armor shattered into pieces.","Spurt!","Xia Houjie coughed up a mouthful of blood and was instantly defeated. He turned into a streak of light and left the competition.","Hua Xianyuan won!"]},{"number":1702,"title":"Chapter 1702 Forfeit and Save Me From Being Srcutinized","paragraphs":["1702 Forfeit and Save Me From Being Srcutinized","At this moment, Hua Xianyuan was high up in the air. He looked like a war god.","For a moment, everything was silent. It was as if a large hand had grabbed everyone’s necks.","“Hua Xianyuan is so strong. Xia Houjie couldn’t even withstand three of his moves!”","As someone spoke, everyone’s eyes were not on Hua Xianyuan, but on Chu Yunfan, who was sitting on the other side. He had predicted all of this, but his expression was indifferent. It was as if he was saying, “See, I was right.”","This made everyone feel frustrated.","Why did it feel like Hua Xianyuan had defeated Xia Houjie in three moves, but Chu Yunfan had played a part in it?","“So strong. Now I believe that Hua Xianyuan didn’t even use 30% of his strength.”","“But this is unbelievable. There have been rumors that Hua Xianyuan has a special physique that allows him to cultivate at a rapid pace. Ordinary people can’t compare to him.”","“Looks like he will be this year’s champion. We were optimistic about Yuwen Xing, but now it seems that Yuwen Xing is nothing. The real dark horses are Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan.”","The crowd began to discuss excitedly. Whether it was the inner disciples, fringe disciples, or elite disciples, they were all shocked by Hua Xianyuan’s astonishing combat strength. Many people were certain that Hua Xianyuan would become a true disciple. It was only a matter of time, and it would not be long.","This was what shocked everyone the most. True disciples were different from elite disciples. It was not easy to produce one. Each of them was the true main force and elite of the sect, the seeds of inheritance. Whether or not one became a true disciple was like heaven and earth—two completely different fields.","After becoming a true disciple, one would not only become a higher-up in the Flying Celestials but also be considered a member of the ruling class in Grand Xia. Their status would soar by leaps and bounds, and it was immeasurable. If a true disciple died, even the Imperial Court of the Grand Xia would come forward to investigate.","Such a character made them despair. There was just no comparison.","“I’ll wait for you in the finals.” Hua Xianyuan glanced at the crowd and his eyes fell on Chu Yunfan.","From the beginning to the end, the competitor he really cared about was Chu Yunfan. The others were not enough to even make him look.","The beautiful woman saw this. She clenched her fists and gritted her teeth. ‘Are they underestimating me?’","She could feel that Hua Xianyuan and Chu Yunfan were ignoring her. She felt extremely humiliated. Although she was a woman, no one had ever dared to underestimate her. She had defeated all the men who had underestimated her.","“Interesting. It’ll only take a moment. It’s been a long time since I’ve been able to beat someone up. I hope you won’t disappoint me.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","At this moment, the barrier and array around the other arena were revived, and the names of Chu Yunfan and the woman appeared on it.","Sun Yao!","“It’s going to be another fierce battle. Sun Yao is Elder Sun’s granddaughter, and she has a high chance of becoming a true disciple. Now that she has met Chu Yunfan, I’m afraid there’s about to be another fierce battle.”","Some people recognized this woman. She was the granddaughter of a Flying Celestial elder. Although the elder was not a true disciple and was less important than the true disciples, the power and strength of these people were not inferior to many true disciples.","As the granddaughter of an elder, Sun Yao naturally received a lot of attention. Unfortunately, there were too many strange newcomers in this batch. First, it was the highly regarded Yuwen Xing, then Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan appeared. They had stolen her limelight. Otherwise, with her strength, she would be a favorite to become the champion of this competition.","Sun Yao took a step forward and arrived at the center of the arena. She looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “It’ll be over soon? Who do you think I am? Some random cat or dog by the roadside? I relied on my strength to get here. Don’t look down on me.”","Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched. His words had clearly offended this fiery beauty. However, at this time, he had no intention of showing her mercy. This was not the place to do so.","Chu Yunfan appeared in the arena, confronting Sun Yao from afar.","“Forfeit the match. It saves me the trouble of making a move and from being scrutinized,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","Everyone was instantly in an uproar, and all kinds of discussions were raging.","“Did he just ask Sun Yao to forfeit? He’s so arrogant!”","“Who does he think he is? Is he an elite disciple?”","“Arrogant b*stard!”","Many people began to curse. Sun Yao was powerful and extremely beautiful. She was regarded as a goddess by many people in the sect. Chu Yunfan’s actions were simply too much. Even elite disciples wouldn’t dare to ask Sun Yao to forfeit.","As expected, after hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Sun Yao was so angry that she gritted her teeth and shouted, “Chu Yunfan, if you want me to forfeit, then show me what you’re capable of!” She made up her mind to give Chu Yunfan an unforgettable memory.","Sun Yao made her move and shot out as quick as lightning. She instantly arrived before Chu Yunfan. Then, she grabbed at the air and brought out a copper hammer. Everyone was dumbfounded. No one had expected Sun Yao, who was 1.5 meters tall, to use such a weapon. Although a cultivator’s strength could not be judged by appearance, her methods were indeed shocking.","“Take this!”","Sun Yao swung down with her hammer. In the sky, the hammer transformed into a huge divine elephant, and this divine elephant stomped down. This was her martial arts conception. This divine elephant stomp could destroy a mountain range. At her level, she indeed had such strength.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at Sun Yao. He simply raised his hand and slapped her.","Bam!","There was a loud explosion. The thin Chu Yunfan caught the leg of the divine elephant with his bare hands."]},{"number":1703,"title":"Chapter 1703 Entering the Finals With Ease","paragraphs":["1703 Entering the Finals With Ease","Accompanied by a deafening boom, Chu Yunfan blocked the divine elephant’s foot. Then, the elephant martial intent shattered inch by inch, followed by a violent wave of wind that swept out in all directions from the spot where the two sides collided.","“Sun Yao is as strong as the legends say. She’s an iron lady. She truly is strong, but what’s the story with Chu Yunfan?”","Many people looked at the two sides in shock. They felt that Chu Yunfan had once again refreshed their view toward strength. Sun Yao wasn’t any weaker than Xia Houjie’s, but she still couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","“Powerful. He’s so strong. This year’s rookies are really defying the heavens. Compared to the last time, they’re simply on a different level,” an elite disciple exclaimed as he gulped.","Strictly speaking, the four people on the field were very strong. They were stronger than most of them before they advanced to elite disciples. If it were them back then, every one of them would have had a chance to win the championship. But now, it was as if they had truly been taught what it meant to be the strongest among the strongest. There was always someone stronger than the other.","At this moment, the elephant disappeared, and everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s hand hit the copper hammer, leaving an inch-deep handprint. When everyone saw this scene, the air in their lungs froze. They knew the value of weapons and naturally understood that Chu Yunfan’s physique cultivation had surpassed a supreme-grade spirit weapon. Even with Sun Yao’s cultivation, she couldn’t do anything to him.","“I told you you should forfeit. Though you’re a woman, I will still beat you up.” Chu Yunfan shook his head, looking disappointed. It was as if Sun Yao should have just surrendered and saved him from the trouble of fighting.","Countless people felt like vomiting blood. This shameless person was too shameless. He wanted others to forfeit when they just entered the stage? How could anyone accept that? If it were them, they would also not be able to accept it. Even if they could not defeat you, they would still fight you.","The group battle earlier hadn’t been a life-or-death duel, but then everyone remembered that Chu Yunfan had killed Yuwen Xing with a single strike. It seemed that people could die in this arena. They were no longer as sure as before.","“You’re going too far. Don’t think that you’ve already won!” Sun Yao said through gritted teeth. In her eyes, Chu Yunfan had gone too far.","“Divine Elephant Suppression!”","Sun Yao swung her huge hammer and smashed it down. Her martial will transformed into a huge divine elephant that suppressed Chu Yunfan. Compared to her previous strike, this strike was even more powerful. She was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan’s words.","“In that case, I’m not going to hold back.” Seeing this, Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything more. He leaped up and opened his hands like dragon claws. Boundless golden light emerged from between his fingers. Then, although it was clearly just a tear in the air, everyone saw him tear the divine elephant into pieces.","Bam!","The hammer flew out of Sun Yao’s hand as if it had been hit by a heavy blow. It then smashed into the arena barrier before falling down.","Boom!","The hammer fell to the ground. At this moment, everyone heard a loud sound. This hammer was terrifyingly heavy, at least more than 10,000 pounds. However, Sun Yao had easily waved about this 10,000 pounds. One could imagine what kind of terrifying power was hidden in her small body.","Sun Yao revealed an incredulous expression. Her palm was covered in blood as it had been split open. In that attack earlier, her palm had suffered a heavy blow, and it tore open her skin. She could not hold on to the huge hammer.","She looked at Chu Yunfan as if she was looking at a monster. It was said that Hua Xianyuan’s physique was special, but she was not convinced because she was not an ordinary person. When she was in her mother’s womb, her mother had a fortuitous encounter and mistakenly took a strange fruit. This made her different from others. When she was born, she was already able to lift a thousand pounds. She had been born with divine strength. Otherwise, it would be impossible for her to move such a huge hammer. Anyone who reached her level of cultivation could lift a few thousand pounds but being able to lift it and being able to use it as a weapon were two completely different things.","In the past, Sun Yao was able to crush all her opponents with her monstrous strength. But now, she had finally met her match. The strength that she was so proud of was easily defeated by Chu Yunfan. This was why Sun Yao was so shocked. She was called a monster by many people in secret, but now she was crushed by Chu Yunfan, whose cultivation was far inferior to hers. Who exactly was Chu Yunfan? A monster among monsters?","Thinking of this, she was speechless. However, before she could think further, a big hand came toward her. It was Chu Yunfan who took advantage of the situation and slapped Sun Yao, sending her flying out of the arena. Here, there was no doubt what falling out of the arena meant.","No matter how unwilling she was to believe it, she had to believe that Chu Yunfan had shown mercy. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be as simple as pushing her out of the arena. Compared to this junior whose cultivation was far inferior to hers, her combat strength was indeed too different.","Right at that moment, Hua Xianyuan, who looked like he had been waiting too long, stepped into the arena and faced Chu Yunfan from afar.","“Finally, it’s our turn to fight!”"]},{"number":1704,"title":"Chapter 1704 Battle at the Peak, Wind Spirit Physique","paragraphs":["1704 Battle at the Peak, Wind Spirit Physique","A battle between two monsters!","But now, it was clear that even though Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan hadn’t reached the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage, in terms of battle prowess, if three or five ordinary cultivators peak Observers stepped forward, they would only end up being beaten up. After all, whether it was Yuwen Xing, Xiahou Jie, or Sun Yao, they were all this year’s competition favorites. They were the focus of everyone’s attention, but against Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan, they were completely defeated.","“Some people say that the two of us are the strongest rookies this year, but I don’t think so. We may be the strongest but we can’t possibly be tied.” Hua Xianyuan’s eyes were like torches as he stared at Chu Yunfan. “Now, let’s decide the winner.”","As he spoke, a terrifying aura burst out from Hua Xianyuan’s body, shaking the heavens and earth. Xia Houjie was scared witless when he saw this. When they were fighting earlier, Hua Xianyuan hadn’t used his full strength. If Hua Xianyuan had used this level of strength against him, he wouldn’t have been able to take one move and would have been instantly defeated.","Chu Yunfan still looked indifferent. Hua Xianyuan might seem terrifying to others, but it was not enough for him to use his trump card. He was facing an elite disciple, but he was unafraid. If he was forced into a corner, he would immediately take on his hou form. Coupled with the Mountain River Cauldron, which could attack and defend at the same time, ordinary elite disciples were no match for him. They could not do anything to him.","This was Chu Yunfan’s true confidence.","Boom!","A lightning storm surrounded Chu Yunfan’s body, forming a lightning pillar that soared into the sky. It crossed the sky and surged violently. In an instant, the surroundings turned into a sea of lightning.","“This level of lightning mastery divine ability is not something that a normal Acquired can achieve. There is only one possibility. Chu Yunfan has a special physique!” a senior elite disciple said as he looked closely.","The other elite disciples also took a closer look. If this lightning power appeared on the body of an expert who was a true disciple or above in the sect, it would not be strange. Acquired and Divines could reach this level. However, an Abstract would have just stepped into the threshold of understanding nature’s laws. They had yet to fully understand the laws, so there was only one possibility. Chu Yunfan had a special physique.","When everyone thought of this conclusion, they were instantly shocked. None of them knew that Chu Yunfan actually had a special physique. The reason Hua Xianyuan was special was because he had a special physique and had a bright future. He would be the backbone of the Flying Celestials against the other sects in the future. Once he became a true disciple, his status would surpass ordinary true disciples. Although they were unwilling to accept it, they could only admit that some people were destined for brilliance from birth. However, Chu Yunfan had a special physique too, and it didn’t seem to be any weaker.","“We have to report this to the higher-ups. A special physique of this level is rare. I didn’t expect such power to appear from Hua Xianyuan and Chu Yunfan.”","Some elite disciples who were loyal to the sect had already informed the higher-ups of the sect. This was the difference between special physiques. Usually, geniuses with special physiques would have achievements that far exceeded ordinary geniuses. Even among geniuses, they were one in a thousand.","‘What kind of physique does he have?’ Sun Yao was now convinced. It was fine if Chu Yunfan’s combat strength crushed her, but she couldn’t go up against this special physique. Although she was born with divine strength, it was still within the range of a mortal body.","The two people fighting on the battlefield had clearly transcended the mortal body. In the future, as long as they did not die prematurely, even if they could not become the sect leader, they would at least be ranked among the grand elders and become high and mighty giants. Becoming a true disciple was no longer the pursuit of such people.","No wonder Chu Yunfan had been so indifferent toward her. The difference in strength was so great that there was no need to say anything.","“Hahahaha, interesting! Chu Yunfan, this is interesting. I thought that using my special physique would be considered bullying, but now that you also have a special physique, this will be easy.”","Hua Xianyuan’s aura became even more terrifying. Countless spirit energy condensed into a gale that surrounded him. Everyone saw him become the eye of the storm.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan’s lightning sea was not inferior. Chu Yunfan sneered. He didn’t just have a special physique. He had more than one. How could ordinary special physiques be compared to him?","In the next moment, Hua Xianyuan’s aura locked onto Chu Yunfan. Countless gusts of wind condensed into a giant that stomped down on Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at this attack and punched out, blowing up the giant.","Boom!","“I will defeat you!” Hua Xianyuan shouted and rushed at Chu Yunfan. He stepped on a gust of wind and channeled all his divine power into attacking Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, everyone knew what kind of physique Hua Xianyuan had, and their expressions changed drastically."]},{"number":1705,"title":"Chapter 1705 Attack After Attack","paragraphs":["1705 Attack After Attack","Everyone’s expression changed, and someone recalled something.","“The Wind Spirit Physique... I didn’t expect it to be this. There was once a king with this special physique. He was invincible during ancient times and ruled the world for a long time,” an elite disciple blurted out. “This physique has an unprecedented affinity with the wind. There’s no physique that can compare to it. As long as there’s airflow, it’s their home ground.”","All of a sudden, whether it was the inner disciples, fringe disciples, or elite disciples, their expressions changed drastically. They finally understood why Hua Xianyuan was so valued by the higher-ups. He had a king special physique.","There were all kinds of special physiques in the world, and physiques were divided into levels. People divided different special physiques according to the level of the strongest person during ancient times. If someone relied on this physique to become a king, then it would be a king physique. If someone relied on this physique to become an emperor, then it would be an emperor physique.","Among the many physiques, emperor physiques were naturally the best. Since ancient times, every emperor physique that had appeared would be praised and their future was limitless. In the current Grand Xia, those who ruled the world couldn’t be called emperors. They could only be called kings as their cultivation wasn’t enough to suppress the world. But even so, such an expert was already one of the top figures in the world. They were stationed in the capital of Grand Xia and their deterrence was equivalent to a nuclear weapon.","For example, the Flying Celestials’ sect leader was the leader of one of the ten great sects, but he was only a marquis. There was a huge gap between him and a king. One could imagine how rare an emperor physique was. Even if such a person couldn’t reproduce the glory of the ancient era, as long as they were nurtured properly, they would become a grand official in the future.","No one had known before this that Hua Xianyuan had the Wind Spirit Physique. It was clear that the higher-ups of the sect deliberately hid this. Once this king physique was made known, it would probably bring endless suffering.","However, Hua Xianyuan didn’t care. He didn’t take this kind of suffering seriously. He knew that without suffering, he wouldn’t reach enlightenment. Since ancient times, which expert had been raised in a greenhouse? Which one of them had not killed until blood flowed like a river and fought hard to gain their reputation?","“Hahaha! You’re right on time!”","When Chu Yunfan heard the name “Wind Spirit Body,” he wasn’t afraid. Instead, he felt his blood boil. For ordinary people, the Wind Spirit Body was terrifying. But to Chu Yunfan who had the Alchemy Emperor memories, he had seen many physiques that were far more terrifying than a king physique. There were terrifying physiques that qualified one to become an emperor. Compared to that, Hua Xianyuan was nothing.","Hua Xianyuan saw that Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised, but happy instead. His eyes flashed with a cold light as he controlled the storm, every little detail of it, and turned them into spears. He then threw these spears at Chu Yunfan.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","The spears tore through the sky, bringing with them a terrifying sound. They were like giant dragons that were about to crush the heavens and the earth.","“Lightning, come to me! Seven Violet Thunder Swords!”","Chu Yunfan casually waved his sword and a sharp sword intent rose into the air. The sword light on the tip of his sword instantly turned into a terrifying flood, heading toward the huge dragon-like spears.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan casually chopped the spears into pieces. The entire arena shattered, leaving only the barrier that was held up by the elite disciples. Otherwise, the terrifying aura that poured out could have severely injured Xia Houjie, Sun Yao, and every other disciple in the vicinity.","“This is great!” Hua Xianyuan laughed.","His hair fluttered in the wind, and he looked like a demon god. He controlled the wind dragons in his hand and attacked Chu Yunfan again. The entire sky was filled with all kinds of wind dragons shuttling back and forth, wreaking havoc on the battlefield.","But Chu Yunfan was completely different. His movements were unimaginably fast, and his every attack easily destroyed one wind dragon after another. Step by step, he approached Hua Xianyuan. The wind dragons around Hua Xianyuan couldn’t hurt Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made a move. He brandished the sword in his hand, and the seven violet thunder swords merged into one, turning into a terrifying sword torrent. This sword torrent tore through everything and arrived before Hua Xianyuan.","Chu Yunfan’s attack came too fast, giving Hua Xianyuan no time to react. He was hit and sent flying like a kite with a broken string. He coughed up a few mouthfuls of blood. The truly terrifying battle had just begun, and Chu Yunfan did not stop. After sending Hua Xianyuan flying with one strike. He continued to attack, slashing down with every strike.","The inner disciples were horrified. Any one of these sword lights would exhaust them completely, but Chu Yunfan was just casually making strike after strike. They couldn’t imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","“Is Hua Xianyuan going to lose?”","“This is so scary. Hua Xianyuan is already very scary. Even the elite disciples might not be able to do anything to him, but now he has been defeated by Chu Yunfan!”","“That’s right. It’s not that Hua Xianyuan is far from being able to do anything. He’s probably the strongest newcomer in a hundred years. Unfortunately, there are strong opponents among the strong, and the even stronger one is Chu Yunfan!”","“Is the victor about to be decided?”","Many people were discussing excitedly. They thought that it would be a long battle. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would injure Hua Xianyuan and then crazily attack him? How much hatred was in these attacks?","Just as everyone thought Chu Yunfan was going to win, Hua Xianyuan said, “If you don’t attack me seriously now, you won’t have a chance later. Attacks of this level aren’t enough to defeat me!”","Everyone was shocked. How could an attack of this level not do anything to Hua Xianyuan?","A hand suddenly reached out from the ground that had been shattered into powder, and a figure appeared in front of everyone.","“Chu Yunfan, you should be proud that you’ve forced me to this state. Give it your all, or you won’t have a chance.”","Boom!","An even more terrifying aura was released."]},{"number":1706,"title":"Chapter 1706 The Strong Among the Strong","paragraphs":["1706 The Strong Among the Strong","Everyone looked over and saw Hua Xianyuan crawling out from the ground. He was extremely terrifying in this state. His mana was boiling, and everyone could clearly see that he had turned into a giant that was several feet tall. Wind spirit energy transformed into his limbs and flesh, making him look like a wind god.","He looked absolutely terrifying. This was the true state of his Wind Spirit Physique!","Even the elite disciples were shocked. Without a doubt, Hua Xianyuan was strong enough to compete with some elite disciples. This was Hua Xianyuan’s true strength and trump card.","“So this is your trump card.” Chu Yunfan glanced at Hua Xianyuan.","The Wind Spirit Physique was pretty good. To be able to make a name for itself in the long history of the past, it could be said that none of these physiques were easy to master. Even so, if these physiques were also divided into several grades. Then whether it was the Thunderclap Physique or the Imperial Physique, they were both among the top few existences.","“However, you can’t turn the tables with just this level,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Hua Xianyuan frowned and leaped up. Countless wind dragons howled around him. A terrifying power that reversed the spirit energy of nature could be felt.","Hua Xianyuan swept out a huge hand made of energy. It was a terrifying hand condensed from wind spirit energy. It immediately rushed toward Chu Yunfan, sealing all the space up and down Chu Yunfan, leaving him with no way to retreat.","Chu Yunfan was not flustered. His body burst out with a burst of lightning. His divine power boiled and became an ocean of lightning. He was like the only supreme being among the lightning. He casually took out the Divinity Slicer. After a clang, it burst out a bright sword light and instantly fell in Hua Xianyuan’s direction.","Many people’s eyes lit up. One had to know that the kind of magic tool in the hands of the kind of person would have the same kind of power. Compared to when it was in Yuwen Xing’s hands, the light of the broken sword was more than twice as bright.","Slice!","This sword light tore apart the energy hand.","Everyone was shocked. Even though Hua Xianyuan had displayed such powerful strength, Chu Yunfan was still not at a disadvantage.","After tearing apart the giant hand, the sword light didn’t lose its momentum and fell on Hua Xianyuan.","‘What a great sword technique!’ Hua Xianyuan’s eyes widened. Although he had not expected Chu Yunfan to catch him so easily, he was not unprepared. His incomparably huge body used agility that was completely incompatible with his body to set up a barrier. After the sword light pierced through dozens of barriers, it was still unable to penetrate it completely.","The collision between the two sides overturned the entire arena. Even the elite disciples who were maintaining order felt a little strained. However, this was only the beginning of their fight.","“The two of them have special physiques. This is amazing!”","“It’s really terrifying. This kind of person’s cultivation progress is simply a thousand miles a day, especially Hua Xianyuan’s Wind Spirit Physique, which is simply terrifying. It represents the extreme of wind and has a strong natural ability to comprehend wind. As long as there is enough time in the future, his future is limitless.”","“But the truly terrifying one is still Chu Yunfan. What kind of physique does he have? His cultivation level is not as high as Hua Xianyuan’s, but he’s able to fight evenly with Hua Xianyuan.”","“These two are true freaks, true geniuses. I didn’t expect to see such a shocking scene in the inner sect competition!”","Everyone thought that the two of them had already used all their trump cards. Who knew that the two of them would repeatedly bring unexpected surprises?","“I didn’t come back from the outside in vain. I wanted to see Hua Xianyuan’s ability, but I didn’t expect to find an unexpected surprise.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, and the battle between the two people on the scene entered a white-hot stage.","“Stop!” Hua Xianyuan shouted, and Chu Yunfan instantly felt that the air around him seemed to be blocked as if he was stuck in a quagmire.","How could Chu Yunfan not know what was going on? There was no doubt that the air around him was being controlled by Hua Xianyuan. This was the ability of the Wind Spirit Physique.","Seeing this move, even many elite disciples showed some fear on their faces. This move was not only effective against Chu Yunfan, but if it were them, the result would not be much better. However, there was almost no way to guard against this move unless you were in a vacuum state without any gas. As long as it was not a vacuum state, this move could be used.","“It’s useless. No one has ever been able to escape from my Wind Prison.” Hua Xianyuan looked at Chu Yunfan indifferently.","At this moment, though he had already won. In such an environment, he had no opponent at all. Even if one’s cultivation level was higher than his, it would be difficult for them to resist, not to mention that Chu Yunfan’s realm was inferior to his.","“Imprison me? You’re too confident!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","The advantage of the Wind Spirit Physique was fully displayed. At this stage, it could be said to be one of the most difficult physiques. If it was an ordinary person, they would probably have no way out, but he just had to meet Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan shouted, and long hair grew out of his arms. Golden hair instantly covered his entire hands.","“Break!”","Chu Yunfan tore open the Wind Prison and shattered it. Then, he jumped up and rushed toward Hua Xianyuan like a bolt of lightning.","“Impossible!”","Hua Xianyuan couldn’t react in time. He didn’t expect that the Wind Prison, which he thought was impregnable, couldn’t even withstand one move from Chu Yunfan and was torn apart. He felt a terrifying aura from Chu Yunfan’s body as if he was being targeted by an ancient ferocious beast.","“What move is this?” Hua Xianyuan felt his hair stand on end as he gasped.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan rushed toward Hua Xianyuan. His fists were like two heavy hammers, directly hitting Hua Xianyuan’s chest.","Bam!","Hua Xianyuan was sent flying."]},{"number":1707,"title":"Chapter 1707 Becoming the Champion","paragraphs":["1707 Becoming the Champion","Hua Xianyuan flew like a kite with a broken string and crashed into the ground.","“What’s that? A monster transformation?” someone said in bewilderment.","The foundation that burst out from Chu Yunfan’s body was too strong, even surpassing the foundation of these high and mighty elite disciples. Even they didn’t have Chu Yunfan’s complicated methods and various trump cards.","However, before they could react, Chu Yunfan took advantage of the victory and chased after Hua Xianyuan. He flew into the sky and stomped down.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan’s stomp almost shattered the entire sky. Everyone could feel the supreme power of this attack. It was another shocking technique!","Moreover, this technique was not from the Flying Celestials. No one knew where Chu Yunfan had learned it. Its power was astonishing, and it was not inferior to the ultimate technique of the Flying Celestials.","Boom!","The ground of the entire arena exploded, kicking up a huge wave of dust. Although Hua Xianyuan tried his best to resist, he was severely injured. How could he resist?","In an instant, the Wind Spirit Physique that he had evolved dispersed. After suffering repeated heavy injuries, he could no longer maintain it.","Spurt!","Hua Xianyuan coughed up a mouthful of blood. He felt as if all the bones in his body were broken. It was difficult for him to move even a little. Although he had treated Chu Yunfan as an opponent from the beginning to the end, he had never thought that he would lose, and lose so badly.","Invincible among those of the same level. Now, it seemed a little ridiculous!","Chu Yunfan’s realm was much lower than his, so he couldn’t find an excuse. He was completely defeated by Chu Yunfan.","“Now, announce my victory,” Chu Yunfan said as he reigned in his aura.","He didn’t have a deep grudge against Hua Xianyuan, so he held back.","“I hereby announce that the champion of this year’s inner disciple competition is Chu Yunfan!” Fang Yu said.","The others had no objections. They could naturally see that Hua Xianyuan had already used all his trump cards, but he still could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. He was even seriously injured by Chu Yunfan. There was nothing to say. Hua Xianyuan was defeated by Chu Yunfan head-on. No matter how big their faces were, they had nothing to say.","Boom!","The entire arena was in an uproar. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with complicated feelings. They recalled that Chu Yunfan and Hua Xianyuan had announced that they would compete for first place in the inner sect competition. At that time, everyone thought that the two of them were crazy. They were just two newbies who had just entered the sect. They were really like toads yawning. Their tone was very arrogant!","What was even more unexpected was that the final winner was not Hua Xianyuan, whom everyone had high hopes for, but Chu Yunfan, who was only slightly famous before this. There wasn’t even a tragic victory. He had won through trickery. He had completely crushed Hua Xianyuan from the beginning to the end and had blown him up.","“I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to become the champion.”","“That’s right, but I have nothing to say about it. He relied on his strength to win.”","“Whether it’s Hua Xianyuan or Chu Yunfan, both of them are the geniuses of their generation. It’s rare to see such people, but there are two of them in this batch of newcomers. It seems that the quality of this batch of newcomers is pretty good.”","“However, there has to be a winner even among geniuses. Chu Yunfan is clearly much more powerful than Hua Xianyuan.”","Countless disciples were discussing, but no one thought that Hua Xianyuan was not good enough. After all, he had displayed his full combat strength, and he was not inferior to some elite disciples. However, in the end, he still failed to salvage the situation. One could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was. The elite disciples had to look at him in a new light. There was always someone stronger among the strong.","“Senior Wang Yifan is probably going to vomit blood from anger. He really has lost so much. He spent a lot of money to get the sect to increase the rewards for the competition and send out his capable underlings. He wanted to win in one fell swoop, but who knew that someone would come out of nowhere and kill Yuwen Xing.”","“I don’t think he’ll let this go.”","“The future of this new champion will definitely not be smooth.”","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Chu Yunfan. The other people’s matches did not seem so important at this time.","Fang Yu grabbed a spatial bag from the void and handed it to Chu Yunfan. “These are your rewards for being the champion. I hope you will continue to work hard in the future and make more contributions to the Flying Celestials.”","Chu Yunfan had just taken the spatial bag when suddenly, a spatial fluctuation appeared in the sky above the arena. Someone forcefully barged in from outside.","“Wait!” a thunder-loke shot rang out.","The crowd then saw a shocking sword light slash down from the sky, directly toward Chu Yunfan’s arm. He quickly took back the spatial bag and put it into the Mountain River Diagram. Then, he looked up and saw a figure pressing down on him, staring at him.","“It’s Senior Wang Yifan!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything, but many people instantly recognized Wang Yifan. After all, Wang Yifan was a true disciple. And a recently promoted one at that. Everyone had long heard of his great name.","Immediately after, everyone’s eyes fell on Chu Yunfan. Without a doubt, Wang Yifan had only one target for forcefully entering the arena, and that was Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1708,"title":"Chapter 1708 Using Others’ Power? Lawless","paragraphs":["1708 Using Others’ Power? Lawless","Wang Yifan’s sudden arrival froze the atmosphere. A pin drop could be heard as everyone held their breaths.","What was a true disciple? This was a true disciple!","Just one person had suppressed everyone into silence. Even Fang Yu, who was originally the strongest, was suppressed at this moment. Just based on his aura alone, Wang Yifan had the ability to lead heroes. This was a completely different level. This was also the reason why true disciples still had a high status even in a colossus like the Flying Celestials.","Step! Step!","Wang Yifan walked down from the sky. His speed wasn’t fast, and his footsteps weren’t loud, but it was as if he was stepping on everyone’s hearts. This feeling made everyone feel so uncomfortable that they wanted to vomit blood. It was as if someone was strangling their necks, making them unable to move.","“How dare you!” Wang Yifan said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. His eyes were filled with endless coldness.","Other people could feel such terrifying pressure, let alone Chu Yunfan. His breath hitched, the blood in his body stopped flowing, and he even felt the divine power in his body halt. A person could rely on their aura to suppress this much. The terror of a true disciple could be seen from this.","However, just as Wang Yifan felt that Chu Yunfan was doomed, he saw Chu Yunfan suddenly break free from his aura and regain control of his body. He completely ignored Wang Yifan’s aura suppression.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a cold smile. It should be known that he had even fought Li Qianyuan head-on and severely injured him. Although Wang Yifan was strong, the feeling he got from Li Qianyuan was still worlds apart. Compared to Wang Yifan, Chu Yunfan could feel how terrifying Li Qianyuan was. Li Qianyuan was known as the number one person among the younger generation of Grand Xia.","No matter how exaggerated his title was, there was no doubt that Li Qianyuan was one of the strongest, if not the strongest, to have such a title for so many years without being overturned. In terms of strength, Wang Yifan couldn’t be compared to him.","Even Li Qianyuan’s aura couldn’t suppress Chu Yunfan, let alone Wang Yifan’s aura. Such a large-scale aura only made Chu Yunfan pause for a moment. The godhead in his mind emitted a soft light, isolating this aura. Aura was a form of spiritual suppression. As long as one’s spirit was strong enough, they would not be affected.","“What?” Wang Yifan looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to break his aura.","“Senior Wang, this is against the rules!” Fang Yu said as he stood up. “Now that the victor has been decided, even a true disciple has no right to overturn that decision. Otherwise, the sect will lose all dignity.”","Fang Yu’s words immediately made many people look at him in a different light. They didn’t expect that under Wang Yifan’s threat, he would still dare to stand up for Chu Yunfan. This was completely unexpected.","“Rules? What rules? My words are the rules!” Wang Yifan sneered, unwilling to back down. “This brat killed my underling and stole my magic treasure. Now you want me to let it go? Fang Yu, I’m afraid you aren’t capable of such a thing. Do you think you can be on equal footing with me just because you’re about to become a true disciple? As long as you don’t become a true disciple, you’ll only be an elite disciple. This has nothing to do with you, so don’t meddle in this. You won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","Wang Yifan glared at Fang Yu, and Fang Yu immediately took a few steps back. He was intimidated by Wang Yifan’s aura, but he refused to give in.","Everyone understood why Fang Yu had stood up. It turned out that Fang Yu’s cultivation had already reached a bottom neck. It was likely that his next breakthrough was just around the corner. That was why the higher-ups of the sect had arranged for him to take charge of many of the assessments. This was not only because these matters were related to the foundation of the Flying Celestials, so they could not be careless. They needed a powerful expert to oversee them.","At the same time, Fang Yu’s mentors were probably accumulating prestige for him. To become a true disciple, other than absolute strength, one had to have sufficient achievements and prestige. One had to make a huge contribution to the sect. Otherwise, everyone would become selfish disciples who only knew how to cultivate in seclusion. They would only know how to take and not give. If that happened, the sect would never develop.","Therefore, although Wang Yifan didn’t seem to give him face, he didn’t send him flying as he did to others. Fang Yu had his dignity. How could a future true disciple be scared by Wang Yifan?","“Senior Wang, rules are rules. Aren’t you afraid that the higher-ups of the sect will pursue you for breaking the rules? Even if you’re a true disciple, you can’t be so domineering.”","Fang Yu wasn’t willing to be outdone. He had come to preside over these assessments to boost his reputation. Wang Yifan’s actions were equivalent to slapping him in the face a few times. How could he let this go? Moreover, in his opinion, he would become a true disciple sooner or later. He didn’t want to lose to Wang Yifan, so he couldn’t give in.","“Stop talking nonsense!” Wang Yifan sneered. With a wave of his hand, he restrained Fang Yu.","“The Flying Celestials is a sect that cultivates the dao, but unfortunately, there are a few thieves who are willing to kill their seniors. It’s fine if you kill the inner disciples, but Yuwen Xing is a genius of the sect.","“For someone like Chu Yunfan who has evil intentions and a good background, it’s already a good thing that you’re lucky enough to join the sect. However, you don’t know how to restrain yourself and have killed someone without a second thought. Did Yi Yunyao put you up to this?” Wang Yifan continued to berate Chu Yunfan, demoting him to a dog who relied on others’ power.","“Killing people and stealing treasures is lawless. Do you have any respect for the laws of our sect?”","Everyone looked at Wang Yifan with a strange look in their eyes as they cursed in their hearts. What was shameless? This was shameless.","Earlier, Wang Yifan had said that he was the law, and now he was asking Chu Yunfan if he cared about the laws of the Flying Celestials. Wang Yifan was simply lawless."]},{"number":1709,"title":"Chapter 1709 Close Call","paragraphs":["1709 Close Call","Everyone felt as if time and space had been thrown into chaos. It was Wang Yifan who was lawless, but he wanted to pin the blame on Chu Yunfan.","However, this was the first time many people knew that Chu Yunfan was in contact with Yi Yunyao. This genius had also become a true disciple, and everyone knew of her reputation. There were many true disciples from other sects who came to ask for her hand in marriage. One could imagine how famous she was.","Many people only found out that Chu Yunfan was related to Yi Yunyao after hearing Wang Yifan’s words. It was no wonder that Chu Yunfan was able to pass the Flying Celestials’ disciple recruitment test. Logically speaking, someone like Chu Yunfan, whose background was unknown, should not be qualified to join the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan looked coldly at Wang Yifan. He watched as Wang Yifan piled the blame on his head one by one. His expression became even colder and he laughed in anger. In terms of shamelessness, Wang Yifan was the most shameless. He relied on his tyrannical strength to project Chu Yunfan as a lawless dog.","“This is intolerable!” Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold. He immediately had the thought of using the Sword Light Talisman to kill Wang Yifan.","He had planned to use it to only deal with Li Qianyuan in the future, but now Wang Yifan was clearly coming for him and wanted to kill him. Who else could he rely on now? In this case, it was better to fight hard and pull this true disciple down.","Surrender without a fight was never Chu Yunfan’s style. At most, he would wander the world in the future and leave the Flying Celestials. What was there to be afraid of? He had the inheritance of the Alchemy Emperor, which was many times more powerful than any inheritance of the Flying Celestials. If he hadn’t wanted to find a way to integrate into Grand Xia and prepare to rescue Tang Siyu in the future, he wouldn’t have needed to join the Flying Celestials.","“You still dare to harbor evil intentions. You’re audacious!”","Wang Yifan instantly felt Chu Yunfan’s killing intent. In that instant, the killing intent that burst out made him feel a little creeped out. This feeling made him angry and annoyed. He was actually scared by a small inner disciple.","“If someone like you won the inner sect competition, wouldn’t everyone be disappointed? In that case, I’ll take your life on behalf of the Flying Celestials!”","Wang Yifan instantly attacked. At that moment, Chu Yunfan felt the Divinity Slicer behind him shake violently and fly into Wang Yifan’s hand. Although Chu Yunfan had completely refined the Divinity Slicer, Wang Yifan was still the one who forged it. In addition, his strength was much stronger than Chu Yunfan’s. He was almost about to take the Divinity Slicer from Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan silently circulated his divine power and suppressed the restless Divinity Slicer.","“You actually refined my Divinity Slicer in such a short time? However, do you think it worked? You’re too naive!” Wang Yifan sneered.","He decided not to grab the sword. Instead, he transformed into a large hand and grabbed at Chu Yunfan.","Clang!","The hand hit Chu Yunfan’s head, but it failed to hit him. Instead, it was blocked by a medicinal cauldron.","The hand hit the Mountain River Cauldron, but it couldn’t break through its defense. Chu Yunfan forcefully withstood Wang Yifan’s attack.","“Huh? Chu Yunfan was able to block Senior Wang’s attack?”","“Though Senior Wang didn’t use his full strength, Chu Yunfan shouldn’t be able to deal with it.”","“What is that cauldron? I’ve seen him use it against Yuwen Xing earlier, but I didn’t expect its power to be far more than that.”","When everyone saw that Chu Yunfan could easily block Wang Yifan’s attack, they were stunned. Everyone understood that this cauldron was extraordinary.","He was still looking down on Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, dealing with a mere Chu Yunfan could not be any easier.","“Go to hell!” Wang Yifan shouted.","Countless sword lights formed in his hand and shot toward Chu Yunfan like a rain of swords. Every sword light contained supreme power, even comparable to an elite disciple’s full-strength attack. Though he didn’t use his full strength, that kind of power wasn’t something that ordinary people could resist. Every sword light could severely injure or even kill Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes burst with a cold sword light as he stared at Wang Yifan. But just as he was about to use the Sword Light Talisman to kill Wang Yifan, a white light descended from the sky and formed a white light screen in front of Chu Yunfan, protecting him.","Boom!","Loud explosions sounded out as the sword lights landed on the white light screen, exploding with huge fluctuations. However, they were unable to break through the white light screen.","“Who is it? How dare you interfere in my matters!” Wang Yifan looked up at the sky and stared into the distance.","Someone had blocked his sword lights and saved Chu Yunfan. However, he didn’t know that even if someone hadn’t interfered, his attack wouldn’t have been able to deal with Chu Yunfan. Instead, he would have been killed by Chu Yunfan’s Sword Light Talisman.","Chu Yunfan also looked up and saw a figure stepping on a beam of light. It was a young woman dressed in white. Her facial features were exquisite, her skin was whiter than snow, and her long hair cascaded down her shoulders like a waterfall.","“It’s you, Yi Yunyao!” Wang Yifan gritted his teeth as he stared at the woman in front of him.","“Long time no see, Senior Wang,” the woman said.","She was Yi Yunyao, and at the critical moment, she had blocked Wang Yifan’s attack.","“I didn’t expect you to be so kind as to come and watch the inner disciple competition.”","Yi Yunyao’s voice was crisp and pleasant to the ear, and she had a faint smile on her face."]},{"number":1710,"title":"Chapter 1710 A Duel","paragraphs":["1710 A Duel","“Junior Yi, aren’t you asking the obvious?” Wang Yifan gritted his teeth and stared at Yi Yunyao.","She had ruined his plan again. He remembered that the last time he wanted to deal with Chu Yunfan, it was also ruined by Yi Yunyao. This time, it was the same.","Were they really destined to counter each other?","When Wang Yifan thought about how the two sides had been fighting for a long time, and how they had had many conflicts when they were still elite disciples, he felt even more furious.","“Junior Yi, Chu Yunfan killed my underling and stole my treasure in the course of the competition. He’s lawless. Are you trying to protect him?” Wang Yifan placed the crime of murder and robbery on Chu Yunfan, trying to make him guilty and speechless.","“Senior Wang, you being too serious. It’s normal for there to be casualties in competitions. The road of cultivation is incomparably long. This is a calamity in itself. To survive this or not is dependent on one’s fate,” Yi Yunyao said, “Besides, you gave the Divinity Slicer to Yuwen Xing, correct? In that case, it’s not yours anymore. It’s Chu Yunfan’s spoils of war, so you have no right to say anything, right?”","Yi Yunyao’s words immediately rendered Wang Yifan speechless. He had always been unreasonable. He had verbally assaulted Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had no way of refuting, but against Yi Yunyao, this did not make sense. After all, Yi Yunyao’s strength was not below his. It was not easy to deal with her with such unreasonable words.","“Junior Yi, are you saying that you’re determined to interfere in the matter?” Wang Yifan’s face was as dark as the deep ocean as he stared at Yi Yunyao.","“That’s right. I’ll take care of this matter. You said that dogs rely on others’ power, but I don’t agree with it. We’re all fellow disciples. Senior Wang, your words are unpleasant,” Yi Yunyao said calmly with a faint smile on her face.","No matter what Wang Yifan said, he couldn’t anger her or make her change her expression.","“It’s been a long time since we last met. Looks like your cultivation has increased, Junior Yi,” Wang Yifan said coldly.","“That’s right. The last time you bullied me was when I had just become a core disciple, Senior Wang. This time, let’s have a little duel. It’s useless to talk,” Yi Yunyao said, not denying anything. “But it’s not convenient here. Let’s go up and end this.”","As Yi Yunyao spoke, her body transformed into a beam of light and soared into the sky. After Wang Yifan gave Chu Yunfan a fierce look, he immediately followed. In a short while, the two of them disappeared into the sky.","The scene instantly became lively. When the two true disciples were present, their terrifying auras suppressed everyone until they could not breathe. It was even difficult for them to speak. Fortunately, the two of them had left, giving everyone a chance to breathe. Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan again, and their eyes flashed with understanding. So Chu Yunfan was really related to Senior Yi Yunyao.","Many people’s initial thoughts disappeared without a trace. They had originally coveted Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Cauldron. After all, it was a good treasure that could attack and defend at the same time. However, if Yi Yunyao was involved, they would need to think about it carefully. After all, they could not afford to offend a true disciple like Yi Yunyao.","However, no one knew that Yi Yunyao had not saved Chu Yunfan’s life, but Wang Yifan’s. At that moment, Chu Yunfan was ready to attack and kill Wang Yifan.","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief when Yi Yunyao stepped in. No matter what reason Yi Yunyao had for interfering, she had saved him from using the Sword Light Talisman. After all, the talisman was his trump card. He was going to use it to deal with Li Qianyuan and it would be a waste to use it against Wang Yifan.","However, he found it strange that Yi Yunyao would make a move at the last moment. Furthermore, she seemed to be even more powerful now. Although ordinary people might not be able to tell, how could she hide from Chu Yunfan’s eyes?","Rumble!","Deep in the sky, there was a thunderous sound. Everyone knew that it was Yi Yunyao and Wang Yifan attacking. The battle between two true disciples was a terrifying scene. No matter who won or lost, it would have a great impact on the entire sect.","However, their vision was restricted by the barrier, so they could not see the exact details of the battle. They could only vaguely see some of the aftershocks of the battle pouring down, which looked extremely terrifying.","Yi Yunyao and Wang Yifan’s battle was very far away from them, but they could still feel the aftershocks of their battle. It was easy to imagine how shocking the scale of the battle was.","“This is the power of a true disciple. It’s not something elite disciples like us can compare to.”","“That’s right. We have to cultivate as quickly as possible. Sooner or later, we have to become true disciples. We can’t let today’s incident repeat itself.”","“Only by becoming a true disciple can one become a true big shot!”","These elite disciples were discussing animatedly. They were very emotional. Among these people, Fang Yu’s face was as dark as water, and his fists were clenched tightly. He truly understood that his previous pride was not worth mentioning. Although he was about to become a true disciple, it was a completely different matter. Even if there was only a thin line between them, it was still a world of difference.","No matter how angry Wang Yifan was, he had to listen to Yi Yunyao’s words. However, Wang Yifan completely ignored what he said. It was a slap in the face. At the level of a true disciple, it was not good to borrow anyone’s power. Only when one was strong could one be truly powerful.","Thinking of this, Fang Yu looked at Chu Yunfan again. For some reason, he felt that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength. Although this was a feeling, just now, he even felt that Chu Yunfan was about to spit out a killing move. Although he found this ridiculous, he believed it without a doubt.","This was his sixth sense as a cultivator, but he did not know Chu Yunfan had planned to pull off such a thing. Chu Yunfan had only been in the Golden Core Stage for half a year, but he had already stepped into the Abstract Stage from the peak of the Golden Core Realm. This speed was too shocking.","Could he really be a monster?","Suddenly, just as everyone was letting their imagination run wild, the battle in the sky had already concluded. The two figures landed."]},{"number":1711,"title":"Chapter 1711 A Death Duel Pact in a Year","paragraphs":["1711 A Death Duel Pact in a Year","The outcome of the battle between the two had already been decided,","Yi Yunyao was graceful, and on the other side, Wang Yifan looked a little disheveled. He was no longer as domineering as before.","“Junior Yi, I will give you face today and not attack Chu Yunfan for the time being. However, that Divinity Slicer was originally mine, so I want it back,” Wang Yifan said.","Everyone knew that Wang Yifan was admitting defeat. Yi Yunyao was probably stronger than him. Many people who knew the inside story felt amazed. Yi Yunyao had been a true disciple for a much shorter than Wang Yifan, not even half as long. But now, it seemed that Yi Yunyao had the upper hand, forcing Wang Yifan to give in.","Yi Yunyao looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “The Divinity Slicer is Junior Chu’s spoils of war. I won’t make a decision for him.”","Everyone’s eyes were focused on Chu Yunfan, but then, something unexpected happened.","Chu Yunfan stepped forward and said, “This is my spoils of war. You can take it back if you want, but you have to defeat me first.”","“What?!” Wang Yifan was so angry that he laughed. Did Chu Yunfan really think that he was a stray dog that any random inner disciple dared to challenge him?","Chu Yunfan did not understand the immensity of heaven and earth.","“One year from now, in the Death Arena, if you win, you can take back the Divinity Slicer,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Everyone was shocked.","“Is he crazy? He’s challenging Senior Wang to a battle a year from now?”","“It’s only a year. How is that possible?”","“One year. Does he think he will gain enlightenment overnight?”","“I don’t think Senior Wang will pay any attention to him.”","“That’s true. What kind of person is Senior Wang? He’s a high and mighty true disciple, and Chu Yunfan is only an inner disciple. What qualifications does he have to challenge him? If Senior Wang accepts such challenges, he won’t be able to stop dealing with all kinds of challenges every day.”","“That’s right. I think Chu Yunfan just trying to whip up the crowd. With his cultivation, how can he be a match for Senior Wang? Even after a year, he’ll still be the same.”","“Even if Chu Yunfan relies on Senior Yi’s support, I’m afraid he won’t be able to protect himself.”","“I have a different opinion. Chu Yunfan is smart. If Senior Wang agrees, he won’t be able to find trouble with him openly for at least a year.”","“What’s the use of fighting in one year? There might be another chance in ten years!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but no one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan. When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, it was as if they were looking at a madman. Even Yi Yunyao frowned slightly, her eyes filled with astonishment. She never expected Chu Yunfan to make such a request.","“Of course, if you don’t have the guts, then pretend that I didn’t say anything. You can send people to kill me during the process. It doesn’t matter,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “I only need a year. After a year, I will definitely kill you.”","“What a good goading method!” Wang Yifan laughed in anger. “If I don’t agree, won’t people think I’m afraid of you? You want to kill me after a year? Who do you think you are? Alright, I’ll give you a year. After a year, I’ll kill you. At that time, I’m sure you’ll have nothing to say.”","As Wang Yifan spoke, he dusted off his sleeve and left angrily. Everyone looked in shock at the furious Wang Yifan. No one had expected him to agree. The Death Arena was a place used to settle the grudges of the disciples in the sect. Once they entered the Death Arena, it was a matter of life and death.","Many people immediately turned to look at Chu Yunfan. In a year’s time, how confident was Chu Yunfan that he would be able to defeat Wang Yifan? At the very least, he would be able to protect himself from Wang Yifan.","However, more people thought of the darker side.","“Don’t tell me he’s planning to stall for time and not appear after a year.”","“That’s right. That is possible. After all, with his cultivation, if he doesn’t get on stage, he’ll just at most lose some face.”","“How can it be that simple? Since he has already issued a challenge, how will Senior Wang let it go? When the time comes, it won’t be up to Chu Yunfan to decide if he doesn’t go on stage.”","Everyone was talking about it. Everyone looked forward to the match in a year’s time, but no one believed that Chu Yunfan really had the strength to defeat Wang Yifan.","The inner disciple competition had come to an end, but this battle had completely shaken the entire sect. Unless one had gone into seclusion, one would have heard of it.","A new disciple who had just entered the sect had defied the heavens and obtained first place. What shocked many even more was that this new disciple had issued a challenge to a true disciple, Wang Yifan. A year later, they would fight in the Death Arena, a to-the-death battle.","For a moment, everyone was in an uproar. At first, no one believed it. Just the first part was unbelievable enough, let alone the inner disciple who dared to challenge the true disciple, Wang Yifan. It was simply unbelievable.","For a time, it caused a huge uproar and even alarmed many true disciples. Even the true disciples showed interest in Chu Yunfan.","A year was neither too long nor too short. No one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s chances, but what everyone wanted to see more was how the battle would turn out after a year. Without a doubt, this new disciple became famous throughout the sect overnight.","In the East District, in the main hall of Moon Gazing Peak belonging to Yi Yunyao.","The hall was tall and majestic, with carved beams and painted pillars. There were pictures of fairies carved on it, and it looked a little otherworldly. Yi Yunyao sat on the main seat while Chu Yunfan sat below her.","“Thanks for all the help, Senior Yi. I’m eternally grateful,” Chu Yunfan said as he cupped his hands.","Yi Yunyao glanced at Chu Yunfan and pursed her red lips. “I recommended you. The reason Wang Yifan is finding trouble with you is because of me. The person he really wants to find trouble with is me.","“As for yourself, it’s only been half a year, and you’ve already cultivated to such a level.”","As Yi Yunyao spoke, her beautiful eyes flashed with amazement. When she learned of Chu Yunfan’s progress in just half a year, even with her mentality, she could not help but feel a little envious."]},{"number":1712,"title":"Chapter 1712 Who Will Kill Who Isn’t a Foregone Conclusion Yet","paragraphs":["1712 Who Will Kill Who Isn’t a Foregone Conclusion Yet","Yi Yunyao was also a genius. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been able to beat Wang Yifan when she had been only a true disciple half as long as him. However, even with her talent and knowledge, she had never heard of such an astonishing rate of improvement. In half a year, even an ordinary genius would at most advance by a small level. Chu Yunfan’s improvement speed, however, was simply leaps and bounds. This speed shocked her greatly.","“I just got lucky,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“Lucky? I don’t think this is luck.”","Yi Yunyao did not believe that Chu Yunfan was just lucky. There were indeed people who had been lucky enough to consume some kind of heavenly treasure and their cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds in just half a year. However, that was when they were in the lower levels, not now.","On top of that, she knew that Chu Yunfan’s foundation was extremely solid with just a glance. It didn’t seem like he had suddenly risen. On the contrary, it was more like he had cultivated step by step. Even she was a little surprised by this.","However, Yi Yunyao did not delve deeper into this because everyone had their own fortuitous encounters and secrets. Her relationship with Chu Yunfan was not that close to the point where she could casually ask about such things. This was a huge taboo for martial artists.","“But you really are bold. Although Wang Yifan has only become a true disciple not long ago, in terms of cultivation, he’s far above you.” Yi Yunyao looked at Chu Yunfan with a faint smile.","“I don’t care who he is. Even if Li Qianyuan came personally, I wouldn’t let myself be captured,” Chu Yunfan said firmly, “In my dictionary, there’s no such thing as surrender.”","“You’re so audacious, Chu Yunfan!” Yi Yunyao clapped her hands and laughed for Chu Yunfan. “What I admire about you isn’t your strength. Even now, your strength is still not worth mentioning in my eyes. The most important thing is that you dare to punch the strong.”","She finally understood why she had agreed to help Chu Yunfan back then. She was attracted by Chu Yunfan’s high and mighty attitude. Not everyone dared to issue a challenge when they knew that they would lose.","“Thank you for your praise, Senior Yi,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“But do you know why Wang Yifan agreed to your challenge?” Yi Yunyao asked.","“I have my guesses,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","Seeing his indifferent expression, Yi Yunyao said, “I’ve been enemies with him for many years, so of course I know what he’s thinking. He already has the intention to kill you. This is just pushing the boat with the current. He wants to kill you, and your suggestion just gave him a chance.”","“I know.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Of course, he could see this. Although Wang Yifan was rude and overbearing, he wasn’t stupid. He knew that Chu Yunfan was trying to goad him, but he still agreed to a duel a year from now. He was just waiting for an opportunity to kill him openly.","As for Chu Yunfan’s counterattack? Chu Yunfan was only an inner disciple. Even if he grew wings, he wouldn’t be that powerful within a year.","“I know that you’re still calm, but don’t underestimate true disciples. I know that you’re very strong, and I’m afraid that you still have a trump card that you haven’t used. Perhaps even ordinary elite disciples are no match for you. However, if you think that true disciples are only slightly stronger than elite disciples, then you’re very wrong.”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s nonchalant expression, Yi Yunyao frowned. “Ordinary peak Interpreters, even if there are more than a hundred of them gathered together, won’t be able to block my attacks. Though Wang Yifan’s strength is slightly weaker than mine, it’s not something you can imagine.”","“I understand. Thank you for the advice, Senior Yi.” Chu Yunfan nodded, cupped his hands, and sat up straight.","There was something he neglected to say. Yi Yunyao knew that Wang Yifan was taking the opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan. What she didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan was also using this opportunity to kill Wang Yifan. Compared to Li Qianyuan, Wang Yifan was just a stumbling block on the road. He was not on the same level as Li Qianyuan. However, Wang Yifan’s existence was a threat to Chu Yunfan’s survival. He had to find a way to get rid of Wang Yifan.","“But at least I managed to buy myself a year, didn’t I?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","A year later, it was uncertain who would win. He wasn’t confident that he could kill Li Qianyuan in a year, but if it was just Wang Yifan, that wouldn’t be a problem. His future was to climb to the peak of martial arts and even reach immortality. What was a mere Wang Yifan to him?","“A year? I know Wang Yifan well. He’s ruthless. Although he said he would give you a year, he probably won’t. He might suddenly make a move,” Yi Yunyao said, “Do you know the grudge between me and him? Back then, before I became a true disciple, he became a true disciple before me. Later on, I was chased by an unknown person and almost lost my life. If it wasn’t for the fact that I had some trump cards, I would’ve died. As for that person, although I haven’t found any evidence, I know they’re related to Wang Yifan. Back then, with my strength, ordinary peak Interpreters were no match for me.”","This was the first time Chu Yunfan was hearing the details of the grudge between Yi Yunyao and Wang Yifan.","“So, do not think that you really have a year,” Yi Yunyao warned.","“Many thanks, Senior Yi, but since I dared to say this, I’m naturally confident. Whether he comes here on his own or sends someone to kill me, I’m confident that I can escape unscathed. If he comes to kill me, that’s for the best. I won’t have to wait a year before I kill him.”","Chu Yunfan’s tone was sonorous and forceful, and his expression was resolute. Even Yi Yunyao was moved. She didn’t know what kind of trump cards Chu Yunfan had, but when she thought about how he looked like he was going all out before she intervened, she guessed that he had already planned to kill Wang Yifan then.","“No matter what methods you have, it’s best if you keep them for the very last second.” Yi Yunyao gave Chu Yunfan a meaningful look. “However, you have a problem right now. Your appointment letter will be coming soon.”"]},{"number":1713,"title":"Chapter 1713 Secluded Cultivation, Digesting the Gains","paragraphs":["1713 Secluded Cultivation, Digesting the Gains","“Are you talking about an appointment from the Imperial Court? Isn’t there only an appointment after one becomes an elite disciple?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Chu Yunfan originally thought that he would only receive an appointment from the Imperial Court after he broke through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. When he broke through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he would even dare to fight a true disciple. At that time, he would be able to easily accept any appointment from the Imperial Court.","However, now that he had been promoted to an elite disciple in advance, it could be said that he was a little caught off guard. However, he did not panic. After all, although he had been forcefully promoted, his combat strength was still comparable to an elite disciple.","“So now, you have to decide whether you want to be a military officer or a civil officer,” Yi Yunyao said, “You are free to choose in this aspect. However, most of the Flying Celestials’ disciples join the army or a law enforcement department. If you join the army, you might receive the Flying Celestials’ help. If you join the civil service, that will be the Virtuous Academy’s world. Although the Flying Celestials also have seniors who are officials in the court, the highest official is only an assistant minister.”","“I’ll join the army. I’ve already made plans,” Chu Yunfan said. He had already made up his mind. Choosing to join the army was not only because the Flying Celestials was more powerful in the military system, but more importantly, after joining the army, he could openly cultivate his power.","“Yes, but you have to be careful because Wang Yifan won’t let this go easily. When you leave the Flying Celestials, he’ll pull many tricks,” Yi Yunyao warned.","“Thank you for the advice, Senior Yi. I’m already prepared.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “I have to go back to seclusion and digest my gains. I won’t disturb you any longer. I’ll come to visit you again in the future.”","“All right.” Yi Yunyao nodded.","After bidding farewell to Yi Yunyao, Chu Yunfan returned to his residence. He hurriedly opened the spatial bag that held the competition rewards.","It was exactly as You Chuyun had said. Other than a million middle-grade spirit stones, there was also a Flying Celestial Fruit and a supreme-grade spirit weapon, the Bewitching Banner.","The Bewitching Banner was a silver-gray flag. It looked ancient and had some mysterious patterns on it. Other than that, it was not eye-catching. However, after Chu Yunfan used his divine sense to explore it, he quickly understood the function of the flag.","This item proved to be extremely rare. It was not used for offense or defense. On the contrary, it was a flag that could control people’s minds. If the user was strong enough, they could even hypnotize their opponents and make them their slaves. This was not a magic tool used by the righteous path, but a magic tool seized by the Flying Celestials when they attacked a demonic sect. It had been stored in the treasure vault.","Originally, such a magic tool wouldn’t be given to disciples because it didn’t conform to the style of righteous sects. However, this item had become a reward under Wang Yifan’s manipulation.","Chu Yunfan thought about it and understood. Wang Yifan probably had some plans with the Bewitching Banner. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have spent so much effort to obtain it. Unfortunately, Yuwen Xing was too disappointing and couldn’t become the winner. In the end, Chu Yunfan benefited.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan wanted to laugh. What did it mean to steal a chicken but fail and lose rice? This was stealing a chicken but failing and losing the rice.","“Since it has fallen into my hands, I’ll put it to good use.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Although this Bewitching Banner was not a magic tool that could be used for offense, if it was used well, it would be much more powerful than ordinary offensive magic tools.","However, the most important reward was the Flying Celestial Fruit. It was sealed in a jade box by a restriction to prevent spirit energy from leaking out. Chu Yunfan could sense that there was a huge amount of energy contained in the fruit. It was extremely terrifying.","“I’ll consume the Flying Celestial Fruit first and complete my transformation. At that time, I’ll be able to contend with elite disciples at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Even if I don’t take on the hou form, my battle prowess will undergo a tremendous change.” Chu Yunfan quickly made up his mind and stopped hesitating.","He entered the Mountain River Diagram and then hovered cross-legged in the air. In front of him was the Flying Celestial Fruit. He opened his mouth and swallowed it. The fruit turned into a vast clear stream that flowed into his limbs and bones. Chu Yunfan could feel that the fruit had spread into every cell in his body, tearing at every cell in his body crazily. Every time it tore, it brought him great pain, but it was immediately repaired by an even greater force.","In this process of continuous destruction and repair, Chu Yunfan’s body seemed to be undergoing a transformation. Ordinary people could not withstand the immense medicinal strength of the Flying Celestial Fruit, and even elite disciples at the Abstract Interpretation Stage were the same.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique. Both of them were not something that ordinary people could imagine. He could even fight against a spirit weapon with his bare hands. What a terrifying physical quality.","The remaining half was absorbed by Chu Yunfan’s body and turned into energy for his breakthrough. At this moment, he had reached the peak of the Abstract Stage, and now, under the impact of this enormous energy, he broke through to the Abstract Observance Stage.","At the same time, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind emitted a faint light, and countless memories and experiences regarding the Abstract Observance Stage in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories surfaced, and they were analyzed and fused by Chu Yunfan at an astonishing speed."]},{"number":1714,"title":"Chapter 1714 Breakthrough, Abstract Observance Stage","paragraphs":["1714 Breakthrough, Abstract Observance Stage","As the godhead circulated, the millions of middle-grade spirit stones in the spatial bag flew out, turning into a long river of spirit stones.","Ping!","Ping!","Ping!","The spirit stones shattered one by one, turning into pure spirit energy that filled the sky. It surged into Chu Yunfan’s brain and was absorbed by the godhead.","Chu Yunfan didn’t dare to relax. Even though his mind was extremely strong and he could do several things at the same time, each of these things was extremely dangerous. It was because of this that he did not dare to relax in the slightest. If he was not careful, he could collapse.","At the same time, his understanding of the Abstract Observance Stage was also improving at an astonishing speed. Originally, the Alchemy Emperor’s memories were just pieces of memories to him, and it was basically just like a video recording. But now, as the godhead continued to be analyzed, these memories turned into Chu Yunfan’s experience, and he was like a person who had already stepped into the Abstract Observance Stage for countless years.","He knew everything about the Abstract Observance Stage like the back of his hand!","As Chu Yunfan’s understanding of all the key points of the Abstract Observance Stage grew, he could sense that the godhead circulating faster and faster, and the speed of his breakthrough became faster and faster.","For a full three days, Chu Yunfan didn’t move and crazily absorbed the energy of the Flying Celestial Fruit, constantly breaking through to the Abstract Observance Stage. Suddenly, a terrifying energy was released from every pore in his body, forming a terrifying energy tide around his body.","Just a few moments later, these energy waves were absorbed into Chu Yunfan’s body again, and peace returned to the Mountain River Diagram. Chu Yunfan had the situation under control in an instant.","Slowly, he opened his eyes. “I’ve finally broken through!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was a little hoarse because he hadn’t spoken for a few days, but he couldn’t suppress the joy on his face. He had finally broken through to the Abstract Observance Stage, and his cultivation had undergone an earth-shattering change.","The difference between the Abstract Observance Stage and the Abstract Stage was great, and there was naturally no need to doubt it. Within the Abstract Stage, they couldn’t be considered weak existences.","In a short three days, his cultivation had broken through from the peak of the Abstract Stage to the peak of the fledgling Abstract Observance Stage. Although he had only absorbed a portion of the Flying Celestial Fruit’s medicinal strength, it was meant for true disciples and above to consume, so one could imagine how tremendous it was.","It pushed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to the peak of the fledgling Abstract Observance Stage, and his foundation was incomparably stable, and he could even charge to the intermediate Abstract Observance Stage. In reality, if it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan’s physique techniques absorbing the majority of the Flying Celestial Fruit’s medicinal strength, he might even be able to reach the late Abstract Observance Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan did not regret it because his Imperial Physique had made another huge breakthrough. Before this, he could fight against ordinary spirit weapons with his bare hands. Now, he could even destroy supreme-grade spirit weapons with his bare hands.","Unless it was a magic tool that surpassed the level of a spirit tool, ordinary spirit tools would not be able to cause him any harm. This was a fundamental increase in his combat strength, and it made Chu Yunfan feel more excited than just an increase in his cultivation level.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had risen to another level. Originally, he had to rely on the hou form to fight against Interpreters. But now, he could defeat fledgling Interpreters. Within this level, he was invincible. Even if he encountered intermediate Interpreters, he would not be afraid. If he took on the hou form, ordinary later Interpreter disciples would be destroyed. In terms of ferocity in combat strength, he was unprecedented among Observers.","“It’s about time now. After I consolidate my strength, I can make another breakthrough and consume the other Sky Demon Pill. My cultivation will advance even further. With the help of the Divinity Slicer, I won’t be afraid of any Interpreter.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","As long as his cultivation improved, he would be able to fight against peak Interpreters after taking on the hou form. At that time, he would not be afraid unless Wang Yifan personally chased after him. Even if he encountered Wang Yifan personally, he had the Mountain River Cauldron, so he wasn’t afraid. There was nothing to be afraid of.","Wang Yifan thought that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to grow to a level that could threaten him within a year, but he was wrong. It would be ridiculous for him to measure Chu Yunfan’s progress with the speed of an ordinary person.","After breaking through, Chu Yunfan didn’t continue his secluded cultivation because You Chuyun had come to visit.","In the pavilion in the backyard, Chu Yunfan sat on a stone bench while You Chuyun stood at the side with an extremely respectful expression.","“Senior Chu, because you became the winner of the inner sect competition, I’ve managed to recruit a lot of people for you. When you head out to work, you will need your own people. This is the list. Please take a look.” You Chuyun took out a jade slip.","Chu Yunfan took the jade slip and sent his divine will into it. He immediately understood that this was a list of the inner disciples of the Flying Celestials who had joined him. There were a total of ten people recorded on it. Other than their names, there was also a record of their cultivation level, character, background information, and so on. It was quite detailed. In just three days, You Chuyun had already collected so much. It could be seen that he had put in a lot of effort.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “Not bad, you did well.”","“Senior Chu, you are wise. I am mainly considering that our current recruitment is based on business management. We must have absolute elites. It’s better to have good-quality members than to have a lot. These people are considered the best among the inner disciples who have no faction,” You Chuyun said.","He looked at Chu Yunfan with gratitude. He had also received the reward for the inner sect competition. It was more generous than he had ever imagined. It had doubled his wealth. Chu Yunfan was the one who had brought all of this, so he naturally didn’t dare to not take things seriously.","You Chuyun had been extremely busy lately. Chu Yunfan was in the limelight because of the inner sect competition. Although many people were worried about Wang Yifan’s threat, there were still many inner and fringe disciples who came because of his fame. Just the screening alone was enough to tire You Chuyun out."]},{"number":1715,"title":"Chapter 1715 Undercurrent","paragraphs":["1715 Undercurrent","Although Wang Yifan was a threat, being the champion of the inner disciple competition was still very attractive. Countless people had the same idea as You Chuyun—to become Chu Yunfan’s follower.","However, they were all a step too late and could only submit to You Chuyun. There were hundreds of people who needed to be screened, which made You Chuyun extremely busy. Everything that You Chuyun had was given to him by Chu Yunfan. Of course, he did not dare to do things careless. However, he was an old disciple of the Flying Celestials. He usually did not show his strength, but he knew many things like the back of his hand.","After three days of screening, ten people were selected, and the weakest among these ten was an ordinary intermediate Observer. There were three powerful late Observers among these people. These disciples could be considered the best among the inner disciples. Their cultivation was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s. Of course, if they were to only calculate their combat strength, they could not be compared to Chu Yunfan.","“This is good.” Chu Yunfan looked at the information. Of course, these disciples were not the best, but the best disciples would never consider joining Chu Yunfan. However, this was enough for him.","“You’ve worked hard. Please help me hand out these pills to them as a greeting gift from me. Also, you have to train more. I’m going to be posted to work somewhere soon. At that time, I won’t be able to do without your help. Your current cultivation level is not enough,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said excitedly.","From Chu Yunfan’s words, it seemed like he was going to train You Chuyun to become an elite disciple. With his talent, he may never become an elite disciple in his lifetime. It seemed like there was only a layer of difference, but it was difficult for many people. It was not impossible for him to enter the Abstract Interpretation Stage, but after the age limit, he would be removed from the ranks of disciples and become a manager in the sect. These people were all older than a certain age and didn’t have much potential. The Flying Celestials naturally wouldn’t let them waste resources.","Originally, this was likely to be his ending, but with Chu Yunfan’s help, everything was completely different. He could break through before he reached the age limit and become an elite disciple. Then, his identity and status would be completely different.","However, You Chuyun realized that he was unable to see through Chu Yunfan. If he had felt that he could previously touch the edge of Chu Yunfan, then he felt that Chu Yunfan’s gaze was even more profound now. It was as profound as the universe.","He knew that his feeling was not wrong. There was only one possibility, and that was that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had improved again. However, he didn’t suspect anything. He was only happy for Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was now in the same boat as him. Chu Yunfan was the captain. Of course, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the better for him.","At the same time, he was amazed by Chu Yunfan’s improvement. It had only been a few days, but his cultivation had improved to such a level.","Chu Yunfan gave You Chuyun another ten of the pills that he had given him last time and asked him to give them to the inner disciples who were willing to rely on him. Chu Yunfan had never been stingy with his own people. Moreover, he needed these people to help him control the army in the future. Of course, he couldn’t make the horse run and not feed it.","After You Chuyun left, Chu Yunfan reported his wish to join the army to the sect. Then, he waited for the assignment from the Imperial Court. He entered the Mountain River Diagram again and waited while consolidating his current cultivation.","In the Imperial City of Grand Xia, in the reception room of Marquis Huntian’s residence, a young man in a purple robe sat on the main seat. His face was as dark as water, but he had a dignified aura that ordinary people could not reach.","Before him was a middle-aged man in official robes. He looked at the young man with a respectful expression. There was no other reason than that this young man in the purple robe was none other than Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian who had led the army to recover the Violet Thunder Prefecture.","Li Qianyuan was currently in the limelight in the Imperial Court of Grand Xia. It was said that he was deeply trusted by the king. He had been allowed to lead the army to seize the Violet Thunder Prefecture. This was clearly a matter of gilding and giving credit. Many people fought for it, but in the end, it fell into Li Qianyuan’s hands.","One could imagine how much he was doted on.","In particular, his cultivation was extremely powerful at such a young age. He might even have the chance to become a duke in the future. Right now, countless officials in the Imperial Court wanted to become his underling but could not find a way.","“Marquis, there’s news about Chu Yunfan whom you asked me to pay special attention to. The Flying Celestials has reported that he wishes to join the army. According to the usual practice, the elite disciples of the ten great sects can become a battalion commander and lead five hundred people,” the middle-aged official reported.","Generally speaking, such appointments were under the authority of the Ministry of War. Even these famous marquises had no way to interfere. However, this matter only involved an ordinary elite disciple of the Flying Celestials, so it was not a big deal. Such elite disciples came in countless numbers every year. They could be completely dealt with without anyone knowing.","He had been a martial arts prodigy since he was born. When he was very young, he had a fortuitous encounter and obtained an ancient inheritance. He entered the army at a young age and became the Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia in less than ten years. His life had been smooth sailing. The only time he had fallen was at the hands of Chu Yunfan. How could he not hate this Chu Yunfan who had humiliated him and forced him to return to the capital to recuperate for half a year?","“He sure is brave. I’ll find him a good position from which he’ll never come back from!”"]},{"number":1716,"title":"Chapter 1716 Kill Li Qianyuan Sooner or Later","paragraphs":["1716 Kill Li Qianyuan Sooner or Later","Soon, a letter of appointment from the Imperial Court was sent to the Flying Celestials. The contents of the letter were not a secret, and it quickly spread throughout the Flying Celestials.","“Baotai City? Isn’t that the city on the western border?” someone wondered aloud.","“It is. I heard that several captains have already died, and they were all veteran experts at the peak Abstract Interpretation Stage, and they all died for unknown reasons.”","“That’s right. The situation in Baotai City is too complicated. It faces the demon tribe in the west, the Hu tribe in the north, and the barbarian tribe in the south. Even I’ve heard of the border between the three tribes.”","“It seems that some people in the court aren’t too fond of Chu Yunfan’s arrogance.”","“It’s not surprising if he dies after a while.”","In a courtyard, Chu Yunfan was holding a letter of appointment from the Imperial Court. He was to be the lieutenant colonel of Baotai City. He thought about it for a moment. According to the military system of Grand Xia, garrison lieutenants colonel belonged to the local garrison of the second-line troops. A lieutenant colonel was usually in charge of a force of about 500 people. It was a normal appointment. The only thing unusual was the place he had been sent to guarding.","Baotai City, at the western border!","“Senior Chu, they’re clearly out to get us. Why would a newcomer be stationed at the border? They’re usually stationed at a county in the mainland,” You Chuyun said worriedly, “This must be Wang Yifan’s doing.”","“No, Wang Yifan isn’t capable of such a thing.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","During this period, Chu Yunfan gained an understanding of the various systems of Grand Xia. In Grand Xia, the Ministry of War was in charge of military affairs. Above the Ministry of War, there was a direct superior, the Grand Marshal’s Office.","The grand marshal was one of the three dukes and was one of the top martial artists in Grand Xia. He was also one of the top experts in all of Grand Xia. His cultivation was unfathomable and he was ranked among the top in the world. However, the Grand Marshall’s Office usually made all sorts of strategic plans and would not interfere with personnel appointments. Personnel appointments were assessed by the Ministry of War. This ministry was one of the six ministries of the country, and it had a high position and power. It was a first-class official of the Imperial Court, and they could even compare to the sect leader of the Flying Celestials.","What ability did Wang Yifan have to interfere with an appointment from the Ministry of War? That was impossible. Although he was a true disciple of the Flying Celestials and had a high status, he was nothing in front of a behemoth like the Ministry of War. The Ministry of War would never give him the time of day.","Chu Yunfan thought of another person, Li Qianyuan. If he had offended someone who was powerful enough to influence the Ministry of War to a certain extent, it would be Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian.","All sorts of rumors quickly spread throughout the Flying Celestials. In particular, the news that Chu Yunfan had offended a big shot in the court spread throughout the Flying Celestials. Soon, more accurate news came. The person who targeted Chu Yunfan and changed the location of Chu Yunfan’s garrison was none other than Li Qianyuan, who was now at the height of his power.","After hearing this news, many people sucked in a breath of cold air. They didn’t understand how Chu Yunfan could provoke Li Qianyuan. Although Chu Yunfan had offended Wang Yifan, compared to Li Qianyuan, Wang Yifan was nothing. He was not even on the same level.","Offending one Li Qianyuan was more serious than offending ten or a hundred Wang Yifans. He was the first marquis of the younger generation, and his cultivation was unfathomable. In the eyes of many people, the gap between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan should be like the gap between heaven and earth, the gap between a divine dragon in the sky and an ant on the ground.","Why would the divine dragon in the sky care about the clamor of the ants on the ground? But nevertheless, Li Qianyuan personally came forward to suppress Chu Yunfan. Li Qianyuan didn’t even intend to hide this from Chu Yunfan. He even intended to let others know. Everyone knew that Li Qianyuan was warning some people that Chu Yunfan was his enemy. Whoever dared to help Chu Yunfan would also become his enemy.","This blatant warning made many people’s backs turn cold. They didn’t understand how much Chu Yunfan had offended Li Qianyuan. A big shot like Li Qianyuan actually wanted to crush him.","“It really is Li Qianyuan.”","Li Qianyuan did not bother to hide his meddling. He wanted to warn those who intended to help Chu Yunfan that they would be his enemy.","He never thought that his boss would offend such a terrifying person. Compared to Li Qianyuan, Wang Yifan was nothing. No wonder Chu Yunfan didn’t even bat an eyelid in front of Wang Yifan. It was clear that Wang Yifan was nothing if he even dared to offend Li Qianyuan.","“Why? Are you afraid?” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at You Chuyun.","“Senior Chu, even a three-year-old child has heard of Marquis Huntian. However, I believe that you have a way out of this,” You Chuyun answered.","Chu Yunfan nodded. It was good that You Chuyun did not lie to him.","“Li Qianyuan is nothing. He has targeted me several times. Sooner or later, I will kill him.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “He got lucky last time and didn’t get killed. Next time, it’ll be his death.”","You Chuyun was stunned as if he had heard some shocking secret. It turned out that Chu Yunfan had not only offended Li Qianyuan, he had even seriously injured Li Qianyuan. And according to Chu Yunfan’s tone, it seemed that he had the ability to kill Li Qianyuan at that time.","You Chuyun finally understood why a big shot like Li Qianyuan had personally come out to target Chu Yunfan. Once this secret was spread, it would probably immediately cause a huge uproar. He didn’t dare to guess the truth of this matter. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, but this explanation was the only way to explain the problem that many people couldn’t understand.","Chu Yunfan restrained his killing intent. Li Qianyuan had targeted him several times and had long been regarded as his mortal enemy. Sooner or later, the two sides would have a battle."]},{"number":1717,"title":"Chapter 1717 Cosmos Realm; Set Off!","paragraphs":["1717 Cosmos Realm; Set Off!","Chu Yunfan had never doubted this.","“What kind of place is this Baotai City?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Senior Chu,” You Chuyun said, “According to the information I’ve found, Baotai is a strange place. It’s a city on the western border and is very close to the former battlefield between Grand Xia and the demons. In fact, it was invaded by the demons several decades ago and was destroyed several times. However, in recent years, after His Majesty ascended the throne, he reorganized the military affairs.”","You Chuyun continued, “Furthermore, the Hu Tribe is in the north of Baotai, the Barbarians are in the south, and the Demon Tribe is in the middle. It’s an extremely dangerous place. Moreover, the situation there is chaotic and unclear. The previous lieutenant colonels had also died there.”","You Chuyun had collected a lot of information, but from all the information, he could feel that Baotai was undoubtedly a dangerous place. It was a dragon’s pool and a tiger’s den.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “It is indeed a place of dragons and tigers. But if Li Qianyuan thinks that he can deal with me like this, then he is sorely mistaken.”","“Senior, what should we do? We can’t refuse the appointment of the Ministry of War,” You Chuyun said.","“Don’t worry, I’m confident. Besides, if the sky falls, I’ll hold it up. What are you afraid of?” Chu Yunfan said, “Pass down the order. Everyone is to prepare to set off.”","“Understood.” You Chuyun hurriedly nodded.","After sending You Chuyun away, Chu Yunfan immediately began to cultivate. Li Qianyuan had transferred him to Baotai. He didn’t believe that it was just a small trick. He was afraid that all kinds of methods would be used later. After leaving the Flying Celestials, the danger level would instantly increase countless times.","However, the documents from the Ministry of War were not to be challenged or negotiated. The most important thing now was undoubtedly to improve his strength. Only when his strength was strong enough could he avoid being killed by Li Qianyuan or Wang Yifan.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan suddenly felt a sense of urgency. “I have to break through to the Cosmos Stage as soon as possible...” he murmured.","In terms of cultivation level, he was merely an Observer. If he wanted to break through to the Abstract Stage and above, it would be difficult to do so in a short time. However, his battle prowess and cultivation level had never been equal and his battle prowess had always far exceeded his cultivation level.","Above the Abstract Stage, there was a higher realm, the Cosmos Stage. Cultivators went against heaven and earth, seizing fortune and opening up a path of life sublimation. After the Abstract Stage was the Cosmos Stage.","Before reaching the Cosmos Stage, they could only be considered Minor Divines. Although they had some divine abilities, they were all following the heavens and were nothing. However, once they broke through to the Cosmos Stage, they could be called Great Divines. At this stage, even the universe was reversed. Their strength would be beyond the imagination of an Abstract.","This was why the true disciples who had broken through to the Cosmos Stage had extremely high statuses. They were high and mighty. After breaking through to the Cosmos Stage, one’s entire life would undergo a huge transformation. Even a race like humans, which did not have long lifespans, could live for more than 1,000 years in one breath. From this, one could imagine how powerful the Cosmos Stage was.","Countless people desperately wanted to reach the Cosmos Stage and become true disciples. One of the main reasons was that their lifespan could be improved. Humans were not a race with long lifespans, so every increase in lifespan was crucial to cultivation. Compared to the lifespan of the demons, which could easily reach several thousand years, humans were terrifyingly short. However, the human race had its advantages. Once they cultivated fully, they would advance by leaps and bounds. They were many times faster than the group.","Only after reaching the Cosmos Stage would Chu Yunfan have the power to protect himself from Li Qianyuan and kill Wang Yifan. Fortunately, he still had one Sky Demon Pill on hand. It was enough to allow his cultivation to advance further. At that time, his cultivation would have another huge increase.","Everyone thought that he was a newly advanced elite disciple, and his cultivation was not even at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. However, no one knew that when his battle prowess truly erupted, even ordinary veteran elite disciples were no match for him. He could kill them with just a few strikes.","‘Time... What I lack now is time,’ Chu Yunfan thought, but then he was struck with a good idea.","At the same time, Wang Yifan also learned that Chu Yunfan was going to Baotai City to take up a post. In the main hall, Wang Yifan narrowed his eyes, and a cold light flickered in his eyes.","“I didn’t expect a lowly person like you to offend Li Qianyuan...” Wang Yifan muttered to himself.","Thinking of this name, he remembered that he had crossed paths with Li Qianyuan once. At that time, he was not even a true disciple, but Li Qianyuan was already famous all over the world. The invincible aura of a sovereign had been firmly imprinted in his mind. It could be said that Li Qianyuan was the benchmark of all the true disciples. However, there were not many who could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with Li Qianyuan. Regardless of whether he admitted defeat or not, he still recognized Li Qianyuan’s strength from the bottom of his heart.","“But so what if it’s Li Qianyuan? If I want to kill you, I don’t need the help of others.” Wang Yifan sneered. “A year? Haha!”","He didn’t care about the so-called one-year agreement. Chu Yunfan was just an ant. If he hadn’t been worried about Yi Yunyao, he wouldn’t have agreed to the one-year agreement. He would have just killed Chu Yunfan right then and there.","“Once you leave the sect compound, I’d like to see how Yi Yunyao protects you while you take up the post at Baotai. I don’t think it’s necessary. Many lieutenant colonels have died there. What’s the big deal if one more dies?”","Thinking of this, a cold smile appeared on Wang Yifan’s face. He called his confidant over and gave some instructions before leaving the main hall in satisfaction. He headed to the secluded cultivation training area.","Soon, Chu Yunfan and his 11 followers set off under everyone’s watchful eyes. However, to everyone’s surprise, they did not ride on light beams to Baotai City. Instead, they rode drakehorses.","Chu Yunfan and the others did not seem to be in a hurry. Many people could understand. They knew that Baotai was a dragon’s pool and a tiger’s den. Who would rush to their deaths?","However, no one knew that this departure was the real storm!"]},{"number":1718,"title":"Chapter 1718 Intermediate Abstract Observance Stage, a Powerful Enemy Attacks","paragraphs":["1718 Intermediate Abstract Observance Stage, a Powerful Enemy Attacks","There was an official road near the border of Grand Xia. The wide road could allow ten carriages to travel side by side. On this day, a group of people riding tall and mighty drakehorses traveled down this road, escorting a carriage as it slowly moved forward.","You Chuyun rode on a tall drakehorse, his gaze constantly sweeping into the distance, his expression vigilant. Behind him, there were ten others also riding drakehorses. Each of them was full of energy and carried a deep and valiant aura. They were all Chu Yunfan’s followers who were heading to Baotai.","They were mostly safe along the way. The rascals they passed didn’t dare to cause trouble when they saw the unfathomable aura of these people. Although they weren’t considered the top existences in the Flying Celestials, they were all experts in the outside world. Some of the elite experts of mid-tier sects were only at the same cultivation level as them.","However, You Chuyun didn’t dare to relax because he knew that the people Chu Yunfan had provoked weren’t ordinary people. They had been fine so far, but it didn’t mean that would be the case forever.","He didn’t understand why Chu Yunfan didn’t fly directly to Baotai. That way, the possibility of an accident would be much smaller. After leaving the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan changed to another carriage. The entire convoy slowly moved forward.","He didn’t seem to be in a hurry. Fortunately, the appointment letter from the Ministry of War had a relatively sufficient time limit for him to rush to his post. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have made it in time.","Although everyone had doubts in their hearts, no one dared to question Chu Yunfan. At this moment, there was no one in the carriage. Chu Yunfan was not in it. Instead, he entered the Mountain River Diagram and allowed You Chuyun and the others to lead the carriage forward.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged high in the sky. His body was emitting a faint light, and every pore was emitting a dense mist. Terrifying energy was constantly washing the cells in his body.","Cultivation knew no time. A month had already passed in the outside world. You Chuyun had deliberately controlled their travel speed. With the drakehorse’s physical strength, it would not be a problem for it to travel a thousand miles in a day and eight hundred miles in a night. In a month, they were approaching the border of Grand Xia. They were only a day’s journey away from Baotai.","The closer they got to the border, the more they could feel the austere aura. Each town was different from the hinterland. They were like fortresses and appeared to be heavily guarded. After all, this place was close to the border. Over the long years, it had often become a battlefield.","Boom!","A huge explosion erupted from Chu Yunfan’s body, turning into a torrent. Around him, the energy turned into a terrifying storm, and he became the center of the storm.","He could sense that the barrier of the intermediate Abstract Observance Stage that was blocking his advance was broken apart by this torrent. His cultivation charged into the intermediate Abstract Observance Stage.","In just a short month, he had improved again, and his combat strength had risen to another level. This speed was quite steady. At the same time, he had also used up all the pills he had at the moment. However, the effects were significant. In a short time, he had advanced two levels from the peak Abstract Stage. His strength had more than doubled.","Apart from that, he had also used up more than half of the million medium-grade spirit stones that he had received as a reward for winning the inner disciple competition. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed was extremely fast, but at the same time, the resources and wealth he had consumed were unimaginable to ordinary people.","This was the reason Chu Yunfan had chosen to join the Flying Celestials. Without the support of the sect, it would have been much more difficult for him to advance like this.","‘This level still isn’t enough. I have to take another step forward. It’s best if I can enter the Abstract Interpretation Stage.’ Chu Yunfan knew that if he could enter the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he would have the confidence to fight against even a Cosmic. At that time, he would truly have the power to protect himself.","Suddenly, he felt an extremely dangerous aura attacking him. He raised his head and opened his eyes. He looked at the sky and saw a terrifying hand descending from the sky, slamming down on the carriage.","Bam!","The carriage was instantly blasted into pieces, and the drakehorses pulling it were smashed into meat paste.","“Who is it?” You Chuyun was jolted awake almost instantly. He hurriedly shouted and looked up into the sky.","He saw that a group of black-robed figures had appeared in the sky. Each of these people had an extremely valiant aura. They covered the sky and earth, enveloping a radius of several miles. In an instant, they suppressed You Chuyun and the others with their auras until they could not move.","You Chuyun and the others revealed shocked expressions. Interpreters? This group of black-clothed men was in the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","One had to know that Interpreters were not cabbages. Although they were not like Cosmics who were high and mighty in the ruling class, the sect leaders of many small sects were only at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. In Grand Xia, a soldier could become a lieutenant colonel.","However, these people carried a dense bloody aura and a hint of evil. They were clearly not righteous people.","“What Chu Yunfan? He’s just so-so. We killed him with a slap,” the bandit leader of the masked men said. His words were filled with contempt.","Before they came, they had been warned that Chu Yunfan was extremely cunning and his cultivation was unfathomable. They had to be careful. However, from the looks of it now, Chu Yunfan did not live up to his reputation. Although he had the title of the champion of the Flying Celestials’ inner disciple competition, he was ultimately only an inner disciple at the Abstract Observance Stage. These Interpreters attacking together, besieging a mere Observer was simply a super luxurious lineup.","“According to the master’s orders, we are to kill the others as well. No one is to be spared!” the bandit leader roared.","Immediately, these men in black moved and attacked You Chuyun and the others from all directions.","“Fight with everything you have!” You Chuyun gritted his teeth.","It was too late to say anything now. However, these people were all outstanding disciples of the Flying Celestials. Even if they were faced with a desperate situation, they would not surrender without a fight.","“Hahaha, you overestimate yourselves!”","Among the black-clothed bandits, someone laughed sinisterly. However, just as he finished speaking, he suddenly felt a pain in his throat, and he was looking at his back.","‘Am I dead?’","He saw that his head had been cut off, so he could see his back.","That bandit had died."]},{"number":1719,"title":"Chapter 1719 A Massacre","paragraphs":["1719 A Massacre","“Who is it?”","Not only were these bandits all Interpreters, but each of them had also fought their way out of mountains of corpses and seas of blood. Their reactions were especially fast, and they reacted almost immediately, becoming vigilant. However, even so, it was useless. Two more sword lights appeared in the air and pierced through the bodies of two other bandits without any warning.","Stab!","Stab!","The two bandits’ eyes went wide. They never thought that they would be killed so easily. They did not even get to see the enemy.","Two more bodies fell from the sky.","These two people were killed, scaring the other bandits witless. They stopped in their tracks, how could they dare to continue chasing after You Chuyun and the others?","“We’re saved!”","You Chuyun and the others immediately heaved a sigh of relief. They felt as if they had just walked through the gates of hell.","“That sword light... Was it Senior Chu?” You Chuyun was the first to react because he had seen Chu Yunfan attack before. Those sword lights earlier were all too familiar.","“Who are you? Show yourself you coward!” the bandit leader roared as his eyes flickered with sharp killing intent.","These comrades of his had escaped countless sieges, and they had not died even after slaughtering their way through mountains of corpses and seas of blood. Now, they had inexplicably died here. How could he not be furious?","“You bunch of cowardly rats who hide your heads and show your tails, how dare you say that? What a joke!”","A clear voice was heard, and a figure appeared out of thin air. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","“It really was Senior Chu. I knew it. Senior Chu couldn’t have been killed so easily!” You Chuyun exclaimed in surprise and joy.","The others also revealed happy expressions. Chu Yunfan’s appearance instantly bolstered their confidence.","“So, you’re not dead yet!” The bandit leader stared at Chu Yunfan. He thought that he had done away with Chu Yunfan, but who knew that he was still alive and had even killed three of his comrades? “I underestimated you.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the bandit leader with contempt. There was no doubt that they had been instructed by someone to attack. He just didn’t know who this person was. But it didn’t matter, because it was either Wang Yifan or Li Qianyuan. There was no one else, and these two people were his life-and-death enemies. There was no need to confirm. Sooner or later, there would be a battle.","“But no matter how cunning you are, I will tear you into pieces, extract your soul, and feed it to the ghosts. Otherwise, it will be difficult to dispel the hatred in my heart!” the bandit leader roared.","When the bandits saw that Chu Yunfan was not nervous in the slightest and dared to speak arrogantly, they were instantly infuriated. The bandit leader shouted, “Kill him, then kill the others. Be careful, everyone. This beast is fierce and cunning!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. He moved and stepped on a bolt of lightning. In the next moment, he appeared right in front of one of the bandits.","Slash!","The black-robed bandit did not have time to react before his head was cut off.","“Die!”","When these black-robed bandits saw this, they all roared and attacked Chu Yunfan. Just then, they saw a medicinal cauldron appear above Chu Yunfan’s head, protecting him. All kinds of attacks were absorbed by the medicinal cauldron, unable to pose a threat to Chu Yunfan.","“Trach like you think you can take me down?” Chu Yunfan shouted and grabbed a corner of the Mountain River Cauldron with one hand. The huge cauldron started to dance, forming a terrifying tide.","Boom!","One of the black-robed bandits was unable to dodge in time and was hit by the cauldron. He spat out a mouthful of blood and was instantly sent flying. He crashed heavily onto the ground and stopped moving. An Interpreter was smashed to death by Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Cauldron!","After crushing an Interpreter bandit to death, Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He exerted force through his arm, and the entire cauldron swelled, instantly expanding to the size of a small mountain.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","In an instant, a few more bandits were smashed. Their brains were smashed and their bodies shattered.","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan had killed more than half of these bandits. Although they were Interpreters, they were only at the fledgling or intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage. They were not considered top-notch existences among Interpreters, so how could they withstand Chu Yunfan’s attack?","Chu Yunfan’s shocking massacre scared the bandits. It wasn’t that they hadn’t seen slaughter before. Even those who were much stronger than them had seen such a scene before. However, they had never seen Chu Yunfan use such a simple and crude method of killing. He smashed down the cauldron, and everything that was hit died. His monstrous strength was unleashed to the extreme with the support of the cauldron.","This was the first time they knew that a person’s innate divine strength could be so terrifying.","The cauldron was of an extremely high grade and indestructible. If they were hit, they would die on the spot. Even though they were fearless, they were still terrified by Chu Yunfan’s killing.","At this moment, the bandit leader of the bandits was furious. He roared and charged at Chu Yunfan. He had stood back for only a moment, but more than half of his subordinates had been killed and the remaining few were scared out of their wits."]},{"number":1720,"title":"Chapter 1720 Peerless Vicious Might, Tearing Apart a Supreme Spirit Weapon","paragraphs":["1720 Peerless Vicious Might, Tearing Apart a Supreme Spirit Weapon","“Chu Yunfan, no one can save you today!”","The bandit leader of the bandits roared angrily. His aura was instantly released and suppressed everyone’s aura.","You Chuyun and the others felt as if they were in a swamp, and even breathing was difficult. It was as if someone was strangling their necks. The bandit leader was much stronger than the other bandits.","“He’s a peak Interpreter!” You Chuyun’s eyes flashed with fear and despair.","One had to know that this was not an ordinary Interpreter. If they were facing an ordinary Interpreter, they might still have a chance of escaping. However, a peak Interpreter was the best among the many disciples, even in the Flying Celestials. It was only second to the true disciples. There was even a chance for them to break through to the Cosmic Stage and become legendary true disciples. Such a person was a big shot among the elite disciples.","Other than traveling the world, they were all famous figures. Their strength and status had long been different.","They had not expected that the expert who had come to kill Chu Yunfan would be a peak Interpreter. One could imagine how much the person behind him hated Chu Yunfan and refused to give him even the slightest chance to escape.","“What a pity.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. The bandit leader could scare others, but not him. The person behind this attack was extremely careful and took all kinds of situations into consideration. However, the only thing he did not expect was that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond their imagination.","“Go to hell!” the bandit leader roared.","Suddenly, the sound of ghost wails filled the sky. It was as if countless ghosts had appeared in the world in an instant. The world changed drastically. It was originally sunny, but in an instant, it had turned into a ghost domain.","Chu Yunfan looked up and saw a huge seal floating in the sky. This seal was different from ordinary seals. It was grayish-black in color and there were malicious ghosts carved on it, forming the painting of a hundred ghosts at night.","Now, countless malicious ghosts flew out of the painting, turning the area within a radius of dozens of miles into a ghost domain. Each of these malicious ghosts had a green face and fangs. Blood and tears flowed down their faces. They struggled but were unable to break free from their restraints. This resentment accumulated and became the source of the power of this seal.","“Hahaha! Now Chu Yunfan, let’s see how you die. No one can escape from my Night of a Hundred Ghosts. It just so happens that my painting is still lacking a ghost king. Well, I’ve changed my mind. I want to extract your soul and refine it into the ghost king of my weapon. From now on, not only can you not reincarnate, but you will also be used by me forever!”","The bandit leader of the black-robed bandits laughed, looking at Chu Yunfan as if he were looking at a dead man. To a warrior, this was the greatest punishment. Not only were they defeated and died tragically when they were alive, but their soul was also extracted to be used by the enemy after their death. There was no doubt about the ruthlessness of this method.","“I don’t know how many innocent people you’ve killed to be able to cultivate this Night of a Hundred Ghosts. Your sins are too great, so I will kill you today and let them reincarnate!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Although it was called the Night of a Hundred Ghosts, inside it were more than ten thousand ghosts. These bandits had extracted the souls of the people they had killed. These people had been killed innocently and cruelly. All the souls within held great resentment and this resentment was utilized by them. This method was extremely cruel.","This was the fundamental reason why even if the cultivation of the demonic path was quick, it was not welcomed by others.","“You will kill me?” the bandit leader of the black-robed bandits roared.","The Night of a Hundred Ghosts above Chu Yunfan’s head grew bigger and bigger, and countless ghosts flew toward Chu Yunfan. In the next moment, divine power surged around Chu Yunfan’s body, turning into the power of lightning that filled the sky. Instantly, a one-mile radius around him turned into a sea of lightning.","The malicious ghosts that had been charging at Chu Yunfan were instantly blown up, unable to get close to him. Chu Yunfan’s Thunderclap Physique released the power of thunder, which was the nemesis of these ghosts. In an instant, those malicious ghosts were completely wiped out.","“A special physique?” The bandit leader’s eyes went wide.","That majestic power was simply the greatest nemesis of his weapon. People with such special physiques would become rare experts when they grew up. Therefore, most people were unwilling to offend people with such special physiques, but he had no choice.","“Go to hell!” The bandit leader of the black-robed bandits gritted his teeth. Since he had already offended Chu Yunfan, he had to kill Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, if Chu Yunfan wanted to kill him in the future, he would definitely die.","At this moment, the incomparably huge painting in the sky barreled down. The terrifying pressure of a supreme-grade spirit weapon was instantly felt.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan roared.","Golden fur grew out of every pore of Chu Yunfan’s body. In an instant, he had turned into a monster the size of a small mountain.","A savage aura burst out, enveloping the area within a radius of several kilometers.","“What is happening?”","You Chuyun and the others were dumbfounded as they looked at Chu Yunfan, who had turned into a huge monster in the sky, especially You Chuyun. At this time, he seemed to understand why Chu Yunfan didn’t show weakness even when facing Wang Yifan and Li Qianyuan. Chu Yunfan had never used this trump card in front of him. He had never used it even in the inner disciple competition.","Once it was used, the entire world was enveloped in this fierce aura. Even the bandit leader of the bandits was stunned when he saw this scene. At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s hou punched the air with both fists, causing a large area of the air to collapse like a landslide. His huge body flashed and rushed up, colliding with the Night of a Hundred Ghosts.","Boom!","A loud explosion rang out. It sounded like two mountains colliding. Everyone saw the hou grab the painting with its claws. After an angry roar, the painting was torn apart.","Boom!","The huge seal was split in half. Countless ghosts that were bound to the painting finally broke free. They bowed to Chu Yunfan and disappeared."]},{"number":1721,"title":"Chapter 1721 I Can Kill Wang Yifan in a Single Breath","paragraphs":["1721 I Can Kill Wang Yifan in a Single Breath","With a loud bang, the Night of a Hundred Ghosts was torn apart by Chu Yunfan and exploded in the air.","Spurt!","The bandit leader spat out a mouthful of blood. He suffered a backlash and was severely injured. His eyes were filled with shock. He was scared to death by Chu Yunfan. He had fought countless people in his life, but he had never seen someone as fierce and unreasonable as Chu Yunfan. No matter what kind of enemy they were, they would all be killed with a single slap.","It was simple and crude, but it was effective to a terrifying extent.","“Sh*t!”","The bandit leader seemed to sense something. He suddenly fled for more than a thousand meters. His speed was very fast as if he had teleported. In the next moment, a huge claw descended from the sky and crushed the spot where the bandit leader had been.","“Trying to escape?” The hou opened its bloody mouth and let out a loud roar. Its body was extremely huge, but its speed was even faster than that of the bandit leader.","In an instant, the hou was right before the bandit leader. It opened its bloody mouth and spat out a terrifying flame, burning the bandit leader.","“Aaaaahhh!”","The bandit leader screamed as he fled. His entire body was covered in flames. Suddenly, a blood-red figure jumped out from the flames. The bandit leader had escaped, looking like a snake shedding its skin. He turned into a bloody light and fled into the distance. Chu Yunfan then sneered and slapped him.","Bam!","The bandit leader was hit. Like a meteor hitting the ground, he crashed into the ground. Countless bones in his body were broken, and he screamed continuously. A sword light descended from the sky and nailed him to the ground. It was the Divinity Slicer.","The bandit leader was dead!","You Chuyun and the others were dumbstruck by this scene. From the moment this group of men appeared, they thought that they were dead for sure. However, Chu Yunfan had managed to kill them all.","“Is this Senior Chu’s strength? He’s too strong!”","When the others saw Chu Yunfan transform into a hou, they were not afraid. Instead, they felt extremely happy. One had to know that they were now standing on Chu Yunfan’s boat. The stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more benefits they would naturally have.","Originally, they were all on tenterhooks, afraid that Chu Yunfan would die at the hands of Wang Yifan and the others. If that happened, their future would also be cut off. However, after Chu Yunfan displayed such amazing strength, they suddenly had endless confidence.","In the sky, the fur on the hou gradually receded and it turned into a human. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the Divinity Slicer turned into a stream of light and went to his hand. After a while, it disappeared into his body. This was a swordsman method. By storing the sword in one’s body and nourishing it with one’s own blood essence, the power of the sword would increase day by day and become extremely terrifying.","Although Chu Yunfan had used up a lot of his physical strength and magic power to transform into a hou, he had recovered most of it in a short while. The terrifying power of the Imperial Physique was shining at this moment.","In the same realm, Chu Yunfan’s endurance could make others doubt their lives.","When You Chuyun and the others saw this, they clicked their tongues in wonder. They had clearly seen Chu Yunfan panting a little when he returned to his human form, but in just a few moments, he had recovered completely. They increasingly felt that Chu Yunfan’s power was unfathomable. He was a terrifying monster!","“Cut off their heads and send them to the Ministry of War to verify their identities,” Chu Yunfan instructed.","He didn’t ask who they were because there was no need to. Anyway, with the existence of the Ministry of War, he could easily find out who these people were. Now Chu Yunfan had an official position, a lieutenant colonel of the Imperial Court.","These people had attacked a lieutenant colonel of the Imperial Court. Even if they were Li Qianyuan’s men, he would not dare to stick out his neck.","“Look into the rewards attached to them and collect them all.”","These people were clearly old criminals who had killed countless people. They definitely had criminal records in the Ministry of War. If they killed such people, the rewards would be very generous. After all, they were a group of Interpreters. Among the many criminals, they were considered outstanding.","When You Chuyun and the others heard this, they quickly cut off the heads and collected them. Then, they gathered them into a spatial bag. When they arrived at Baotai City, they would send the heads to the Ministry of War through official channels to verify their identities.","“Senior Chu, your martial arts are peerless. It won’t be long before Wang Yifan isn’t a match for you,” one of Chu Yunfan’s underlings said. His voice was filled with excitement. He felt extremely excited when he thought of how Chu Yunfan had easily killed these criminals.","“Why would I even care about Wang Yifan? It’s fine if he moves behind my back, but if he dares to appear in front of me, I won’t need even a breath to kill him.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The real enemy in his heart was Li Qianyuan. A mere Wang Yifan was nothing. With the Sword Light Talisman in his hand, killing Wang Yifan was as easy as blowing dust. Even Li Qianyuan had suffered a great loss from the Sword Light Talisman, let alone Wang Yifan.","Chu Yunfan was planning to use the Sword Light Talisman to deal with Li Qianyuan, so it would be best if he didn’t use it. But if Wang Yifan dared to make a move, Chu Yunfan would make sure he never recovered.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s expression, everyone knew that he wasn’t just spouting nonsense. They were all infected by Chu Yunfan’s confidence. They now understood that he was probably cultivating in the carriage. Now, he had clearly completed his cultivation and came out of seclusion.","“Let’s pack up and continue on to Baotai. I want to see what kind of dragon’s pool and tiger’s den it is,” Chu Yunfan said loudly with a cold smile on his face.","“Yes, Senior Chu!”","Everyone agreed and quickly packed up their things before getting back on their drakehorses. The mounts soared into the sky, riding on the clouds and mist, and flew in the direction of Baotai.","Soon, a city appeared in front of everyone."]},{"number":1722,"title":"Chapter 1722 Reorganizing the Garrison","paragraphs":["1722 Reorganizing the Garrison","This was a small border city, with faint traces of battle on the city walls. There were even some ancient bloodstains that had been left behind from an unknown era. They had not completely dried up until now, and the power in the blood had not dissipated. They were clearly left behind by many experts.","On this day, a group of people on drakehorses arrived in this small border city. The leader was wearing a moon-white martial arts suit and looked clean and neat. It was Chu Yunfan and his group.","‘So this is Baotai City. There are about 200,000 people in Baotai. Including the villages and towns under its jurisdiction, there are about 300,000.’ Chu Yunfan recalled some information about Baotai.","Among the many border cities, Baotai was not the largest, but it was the most special. Due to its geographical location, it faced the front line of the monsters in the early years. The north faced the territory of the Hu tribe, and the south was the barbarians. It could be said to be the intersection of the four forces. Although they were no longer at the front line, it was still chaotic because of the various forces.","Just by looking at the city wall, one could tell that it had not been repaired for many years. The enchantments and arrays on the city wall were full of loopholes. It was unknown whether it was because the higher-ups had not allocated funds to repair them over the years or because they had been annexed. After all, the previous lieutenant colonels had all died for unknown reasons. Many things were still in the fog.","‘No matter what, this is the starting point of my power in Grand Xia. Baotai is mine.’ Chu Yunfan gazed at the huge city in front of him and felt a sense of pride rise in his heart.","Although Li Qianyuan was the reason why he was transferred to Baotai, Li Qianyuan probably didn’t expect that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be afraid. On the contrary, he wanted to take this opportunity to do something big.","“Who goes there?” Chu Yunfan and the others were stopped by the soldiers guarding the city at the city gates.","“How dare you. Are you blind? This is the new lieutenant colonel. Where’s your captain? Tell them to come and welcome your new leader!”","Before Chu Yunfan could speak, You Chuyun stepped forward and berated the guard. When the guards heard this, they were instantly shocked. The lieutenant colonel was their immediate superior and the true master of the entire city. Especially in a border city like this, the lieutenant colonel was usually the most powerful person in the city.","Soon, a plump middle-aged man ran over. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he bowed and said, “Welcome, Colonel. My name is Chen Tai.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at the plump middle-aged man and frowned slightly. This was a mess. Although Baotai was not on the front line and the troops stationed there were also second-line garrison troops, they did not look like soldiers in the least.","Although it was Chu Yunfan’s first time joining the army in Grand Xia, he was once a high-ranking officer in the human army of the Federation. He had seen all kinds of situations. With one look, he knew that something was wrong with this army.","However, he restrained himself and said, “Where is the garrison of Baotai? Take me there.”","“Yes, sir,” Chen Tai responded.","Although he looked respectful, he had little hope for Chu Yunfan. Although the lieutenant colonel was their immediate superior, so what? The previous lieutenant colonel had died for no reason. This was probably no exception. They always did as they pleased.","He thought that he had concealed it well, but how could he hide it from Chu Yunfan? It was just that Chu Yunfan was too lazy to say anything right now.","With Chen Tai leading the way, Chu Yunfan came to a huge military camp in the east of the city. The camp had not been renovated for some time and looked quite old. Chu Yunfan was not met with any obstruction as the entered the camp. It could accommodate thousands of people, but it looked a little empty at the moment.","Along the way, he spotted some soldiers who were bent over and looked like they lacked training. Not only Chu Yunfan but You Chuyun and the others also frowned. They had not expected this place to be so dilapidated. Even second-line troops should not be in such bad shape.","Suddenly, there was a clamor and a few soldiers swaying toward them. Chu Yunfan noticed that these people were holding bottles of beer in their hands, looking as if they had just returned from drinking.","“Hahaha, that little girl from the Emerald Red Inn is the best!” The soldier who looked like the leader of the group laughed. “I’ll bring you guys to taste her next time!”","“What a foul atmosphere!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The sharp aura that Chu Yunfan emitted shocked Chen Tai, who quickly lowered his head. Although he was not optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s future, one person wouldn’t be transferred to be a lieutenant colonel without a deep background. He could not afford to offend Chu Yunfan.","“Men, hang these drunkards up and sober them up!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","You Chuyun and the others couldn’t hold it in any longer and flew out.","“What are you doing?! Do you know who I am?!”","The drunk soldiers started screaming. However, they were not even Golden Cores. How could they stop You Chuyun and the others who were like wolves and tigers?","You Chuyun and the others were previously beaten up by the black-clothed bandits and were filled with anger. They could not deal with those bandits, but they could handle these military ruffians. In just a moment, they had tied up these ruffians and hung them on the flagpole like a bunch of grasshoppers.","“Colonel, you can’t do this. That man is the brother-in-law of Deputy Colonel Ding Cheng!” Chen Tai’s face turned pale. He was even more afraid of this man than he was of Chu Yunfan. It was clear that Ding Cheng had accumulated a lot of power.","“I’m the lieutenant colonel of this camp. A mere deputy colonel can’t overturn the sky,” Chu Yunfan said, “This is a good thing. He hasn’t come to greet me, and I don’t believe that he won’t appear now.”","Chu Yunfan had been here for a long time, but none of the officers in the camp had come to pay their respects.","“Beat the drum and have everyone gather. Those above the rank of corporal are to report to the colonel’s office. Those who don’t make it within the time of one incense stick will be dismissed.”","Chu Yunfan passed down the order and strode into his office. This military camp had long been a place for evil to hide. It was impossible to deal with it without being ruthless.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The urgent drumbeats spread throughout the entire camp, causing a commotion. Everyone looked in the direction of the colonel’s office in puzzlement, wondering who dared to beat the drum to summon everyone."]},{"number":1723,"title":"Chapter 1723 Ruthless Clean Up, Rivers of Blood","paragraphs":["1723 Ruthless Clean Up, Rivers of Blood","After three rounds of drumming, only a dozen people were standing in front of Chu Yunfan’s office. These people were made up of corporals and only one captain.","These officers looked at Chu Yunfan with some apprehension. This new lieutenant colonel seemed to have come with ill intentions. From the previous few lieutenant colonels, these lieutenant colonels who had descended from the sky were all proud figures. It wasn’t that they hadn’t heard of this before. These people were all from various sects, and some of them even came from the major factions of the Imperial Court. They had come up to do something big.","“Very well.” Chu Yunfan sneered, “You Chuyun, how do we deal with those who don’t come after three rounds of the drums according to the rules?”","“Senior Chu, they are to be beheaded!” You Chuyun said loudly.","The officers turned pale. According to the military law, there were dozens of situations where they could be beheaded. One of them was that they could be beheaded if they failed to meet the deadline. However, these second-line troops had always been more lax, and the defenders of Baotai had been free and undisciplined for too long. Although they could protect themselves, they could only protect themselves. There was no way to stop others from falling.","“Colonel, should we inform the deputy colonel?” the only captain asked cautiously.","“In this camp, I am the lieutenant colonel. Pass down the order. All those who didn’t arrive are to be beheaded and their heads will be hung in front of the camp as a warning.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","In a chaotic world, severe laws should be used, especially in the army. Once there was mercy, these rotting soldiers would step all over them.","“You Chuyun, take your men with you and capture them all.”","“Yes, Senior Chu,” You Chuyun replied and led the ten Flying Celestial disciples out of the office like ferocious tigers descending a mountain.","In just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, all the officers in the camp who had not arrived were captured and brought to kneel before the colonel’s office. Although these officers were all the best in the army, their cultivation could not compare to You Chuyun and the others. Those who resisted were beaten half to death and dragged over like dead dogs.","“You can’t kill me! I’m an officer of the Imperial Court!”","“Don’t kill me! I’m a member of the Chen clan. If you dare to kill me, the Chens will never let you go!”","“Sir, please spare me!”","These people either cursed or begged for mercy, but they could not shake Chu Yunfan’s determination. With his order, these officers were beheaded. The heads, which their owners had died with grievous expressions, were hung on the flagpole so that all the soldiers in the camp could see them.","The entire camp was instantly shaken. Everyone knew that an iron-fisted lieutenant colonel had come this time. Although the previous lieutenant colonels were strong, none of them were like Chu Yunfan, who started a massacre without giving them any chance to argue. He simply cut off their heads on the grounds that they were late. No one dared to treat him as someone who was easy to bully anymore.","After killing all these officers, Chu Yunfan was still not satisfied. He asked You Chuyun and the others to take action. Under the guidance of the other officers, they dragged out the remaining dozens of soldiers from the brothels and gambling dens. They were captured and beheaded.","The storm that Chu Yunfan stirred up shocked not only the military camp but also the major forces in Baotai. Chu Yunfan had come in a low-key manner. After entering, he did not go to the lieutenant colonel’s residence but entered the military camp instead. Many people did not know that the new lieutenant colonel had arrived, but now Chu Yunfan had used extremely powerful methods to announce his arrival.","And the way to announce this was through rows of heads.","After beheading all these officers, Chu Yunfan arranged for the selection of low-level officers such as corporals and captains from the remaining soldiers. Chu Yunfan had led an army in the Federation, so he was no stranger to these things.","These officers were too low-level and could be arranged as Chu Yunfan pleases. The Ministry of War of Grand Xia was not interested in these things. They only had to prove their worth. A lieutenant colonel was only a small official in the eyes of Grand Xia’s Ministry of War. If it was not for Li Qianyuan, no one would care about him.","In the colonel’s office, Chu Yunfan sat in the main seat. You Chuyun and the others were sitting beside him.","“We found through the clean-up that the soldiers’ pay is being swallowed up by their commanding officers. There are only 300 soldiers in what should be a 500-strong garrison. 200 of them were unreported dismissals by the officers of various levels and the pay kept by the commanding officer. And the biggest perpetrator is the former deputy colonel, Ding Cheng, but he’s missing right now and we can’t find him,” You Chuyun reported.","“It’s fine. I’ll write a report to the Ministry of War later. I’ll report him as a deserter. He will no longer swallow up the pay of other men. It doesn’t matter if he shows up or not.” Chu Yunfan had no concern for Ding Cheng. He was just a deputy colonel, a small ant.","“The biggest problem right now is that there were only about three hundred people in the camp in the first place. More than a hundred people have been borrowed. All the major factions in the city have borrowed people from the army to do hard labor, and the Ding clan which Ding Cheng belongs to borrowed the most soldiers.” You Chuyun continued to report the information he had gathered. “The Ding clan has been rooted in Baotai for hundreds of years. Their roots run deep. The local soldiers have to take turns to do hard labor for their clan and be worked to death by them.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a cold light as he said, “How bold. These local tycoons are more daring than the last!”","Chu Yunfan thought that Grand Xia was tight on the outside but loose on the inside. The control of many places had long been lax."]},{"number":1724,"title":"Chapter 1724 The Various Forces’ Reaction","paragraphs":["1724 The Various Forces’ Reaction","If it was in the Federation, such a situation would never happen. Even the second and third-tier troops would definitely not be in such a state.","In many places, the power of the ten sects was much greater than that of Grand Xia. Although the empire was still the largest power around, there were too many places in the world that it couldn’t control.","Right now, Grand Xia seemed to be in a stable state. That was because the various major powers, including the Flying Celestials, needed such a power to unify the power of the humans. It would not allow the demons, barbarians, and Hus to take advantage of the situation.","Therefore, in an area like Baotai that was almost ungoverned by the three powers, Grand Xia had long lost its dignity. Otherwise, it would not have lost so many garrison officers in one fell swoop.","The local tycoons dared to pull the soldiers out of the army to be used as coolies. One could imagine how arrogant they were.","“What should we do with the soldiers who were dragged to do hard labor?” You Chuyun asked Chu Yunfan.","“There’s no hurry. You should first gather information about the various forces in Baotai. I want to know everything. As for the Ding clan, I’ll settle the score with them sooner or later,” Chu Yunfan said.","“The most important thing now is for you to improve your strength. I have some martial arts manuals here. You can take your pick and learn whatever you like. Also, choose a few confidants and teach them some martial arts. In the future, we’ll go to the battlefield.”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan waved, and dozens of jade slips appeared on the long table in front of him. They were all kinds of martial arts, including punch techniques, saber techniques, sword techniques, physique techniques, and so on. They included the cultivation methods of various mainstream martial arts.","They were all ordinary goods that he had collected from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. Though they were just ordinary goods in his impression, they were great things that could not be bought with money by You Chuyun and the others. Although they were from the Flying Celestials, the sect was a big place. They had to exchange points for anything they wanted. They were not like Chu Yunfan, who was a seed disciple that the sect’s higher-ups paid attention to. They were just ordinary disciples. It would take a long time to exchange for a reliable martial art.","Even in the Flying Celestials, the martial arts that Chu Yunfan had given them were considered first-class martial arts. Although they could not be compared to Chu Yunfan’s own Nine Netherworld Stomps and Eight Astonishing Punches, they were enough to surprise You Chuyun and the others.","You Chuyun and the others walked over. Their divine wills probed into the martial arts manuals, quickly assessing them. These techniques were all extremely profound, and they were instantly surprised and delighted. In the Flying Celestials, they had to be at least elite disciples to obtain martial arts of this level. But now, Chu Yunfan had taken out these martial arts and let them learn as they pleased. This made them shed tears of gratitude. They were very grateful that they had not backed the wrong person.","In Chu Yunfan’s opinion, You Chuyun and the others were still too weak. The strength that he had to rely on now was these people, but they were not of much use at the moment. They had to reach the Abstract Interpretation Stage at the very least to be able to help him.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan waved and a bottle of pills appeared in his hand. Then, he waved again and handed out 11 pills into the arms of his 11 underlings.","“Take these pills. They should be enough to improve your strength. For now, you have to think of ways to improve your strength and train your soldiers. Although the Baotai garrison is only a second-tier garrison, I will bring them to the battlefield in the future,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Thank you, Senior Chu!”","With Chu Yunfan’s help, their cultivation would soon have a huge breakthrough. Even breaking through to become an elite disciple in the future was just around the corner. This made them ecstatic.","Under Chu Yunfan’s orders, the entire camp was sealed off. Without his orders, no one was allowed to leave. The storm that he had stirred up began to cause a huge uproar in Baotai.","After Chu Yunfan took office, he did not hesitate to purge all the officers. These officers were all local people born and raised here, and more or less had some connections with the local forces. For a time, there were many pairs of hostile eyes outside the military camp.","At this moment, in the ancestral land of the Ding clan, the higher-ups of the clan had gathered.","“Everyone, this new garrison lieutenant doesn’t come with good intentions. He has no respect for our clan. What should we do?”","A middle-aged man in military armor standing next to him said with an ashen face, “Chu Yunfan is clearly here for me. He took advantage of my absence to kill all my trusted aides.”","But now, he could say that he had been beaten back to his original state overnight. His trusted aides had all been killed, but he did not dare to show his face. Chu Yunfan’s ruthless methods had cleared out the vermin.","However, his bottom was not clean either. Once he appeared, how could he escape?","“Then he shall die. In any case, a few garrison lieutenants have already died.”","“That’s right. He’s just a garrison lieutenant. There are thousands of them in Grand Xia. What does it matter if Chu Yunfan dies?”","“If he goes against our clan, we will kill him.”","The higher-ups of the clan clamored one after another as if they wanted blood."]},{"number":1725,"title":"Chapter 1725 If You’re Not a Fierce Dragon, You’ll Be Attacked","paragraphs":["1725 If You’re Not a Fierce Dragon, You’ll Be Attacked","“That’s right. If we don’t teach him a lesson, he’ll think that our clan is a pushover.”","The Ding clan elders said with ferocious expressions.","“Everyone, calm down. He killed so many people the moment he got here. He has offended many people, especially when he wants to reorganize military affairs and make a name for himself. The people he has offended are not only our clan,” Ding Feng said indifferently.","“Moreover, before this, I received the promise of a lord. The people he offended were not only the forces in Baotai but also the forces in the Imperial Court. Have you heard of Marquis Huntian?”","“Marquis Huntian? How did he get involved?!” Ding Cheng said in shock.","The others were not in the military system, so they might not know. But he was in the military system. Therefore, Li Qianyuan, who started his career with military merits, was a big figure for him.","Everyone knew that Li Qianyuan was one of the most outstanding figures among the younger generation of Grand Xia. He was the number one expert among the younger generation, the first to be conferred the title of marquis. His future was limitless.","Li Qianyuan was a big shot in all of Grand Xia, let alone Baotai. If he was willing, he could pacify Baotai with one hand, and no one would dare to argue with him.","“That’s right. I don’t know how Chu Yunfan offended Marquis Huntian. I received a message from Marquis Huntian, telling us to deal with Chu Yunfan and not to worry about the backlash from the Imperial Court. With his support, what can the Flying Celestials do? Will they fall out with the Marquis over a mere elite disciple?” Ding Cheng said with a smug look on his face. “When the matter is done, the Marquis will personally recommend you to be a lieutenant of Baotai.”","“Hmph, that would be for the best. I want to see Chu Yunfan die!” Ding Cheng said with a cold snort. When he thought of being promoted to lieutenant, a fiery streak flashed across his eyes.","Not everyone could be a lieutenant, especially someone like him who was born and raised here. Without a behemoth like the Flying Celestials backing him up, deputy lieutenant was the threshold that stopped many people.","Countless undercurrents surged in Baotai, but on the surface, they maintained an extremely strange balance. After wantonly cleaning up the camp, Chu Yunfan went into seclusion and sealed the camp. He was taking advantage of his position as the head of the camp.","Although the major factions had suffered losses, they were only some small officers. They would not fall out with each other over this. Most importantly, none of them wanted to be the first to stand out. They all wanted to be the last fisherman, so they maintained a strange calm.","At this time, when the military camp was sealed, Chu Yunfan did not stop. On the contrary, he used this opportunity to let You Chuyun and the others gather information about Baotai. Slowly, he figured out the current situation of the city.","There were three major clans and two major sects in Baotai. A total of five major forces controlled all matters in the city. The three great clans were the Ding clan, where Deputy Colonel Ding Cheng was from, the Chen clan, and the Wang clan. As for the two great sects, they were the Fusion and the Skyreach Sect.","These five forces represented all the forces in Baotai.","“This small city is so complicated!”","Facing these five forces, Chu Yunfan could only describe them in one sentence, which was that the temple was small, the pond was shallow, and there were many b*stards!","Other than these five forces, there was another force that was currently the greatest threat, and that was the Demon God Sect. This sect had existed since the establishment of Grand Xia. The people in the sect were all humans who fanatically worshipped the demon race. They believed that it was the right path for demons to rule the world.","There were countless experts in this sect. It could be said that there were as many experts as the clouds. At the same time, they were extremely cunning. There were even precedents of spies entering the higher-ups of Grand Xia to provide information to the demons. They were the archenemy of Grand Xia.","Moreover, unlike ordinary assassination organizations, the Demon God Sect’s actions were only to destroy the rule of Grand Xia, not for money. Even Grand Xia had a headache over them.","“It’s time to take action!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The major forces in Baotai wanted to restrict him with the so-called rules. During this period, he received many invitations to various banquets. However, how could he fall into their trap? He had no intention of wasting time on them. After all, he did not have much time. He was not in the mood to scheme against the Ding clan and the other five great factions.","If it wasn’t a fierce dragon, it wouldn’t cross the river!","Although he was a newly promoted elite disciple, his combat strength was not something that ordinary elite disciples could compare to. In front of a fierce dragon like him, even a local snake had to kneel.","The reason why he did not move was to reorganize the army and investigate the situation in Baotai.","“I don’t care what clan or sect you are from. All of you have to lower your heads and listen to me. Those who submit to me will prosper and those who resist will perish.” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back, looking at the endless night sky with a deep gaze.","Suddenly, a gust of wind came from the sky and turned into a blood-red claw. It appeared out of thin air and fell toward him.","“You d*mn crooked official! Give me your life!”","A shrill cry tore through the night sky, and the blood-red claw went for Chu Yunfan’s head.","“You’re courting death.” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the attack.","He grabbed the blood-red claw with one hand and caught it. A sound of metal clashing rang out. The claw couldn’t do anything to him. It couldn’t even break through his defense. All it could do was screech.","Chu Yunfan exerted his strength and pulled the blood-red claw. A blood-red figure was pulled out of the air."]},{"number":1726,"title":"Chapter 1726 I Call the Shots in Baotai City","paragraphs":["1726 I Call the Shots in Baotai City","A figure fell from the sky. It was a strange-looking person. His entire body was covered in blood-red energy. A pair of bat-like wings grew on his back, and he looked sinister and violent.","The strange man had a look of shock on his face. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to pull him down so easily. He was instantly pulled out of the sky by Chu Yunfan. His strength was so terrifying that he could not resist. He was pulled down instantly.","“D*mn you! Give me your life!” the strange man roared and followed Chu Yunfan’s strength. He flew over and grabbed Chu Yunfan with a bloody ghost claw.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan threw a punch.","Bam!","With a loud boom, the fist hit the bloody claw. The claw was broken by Chu Yunfan, followed by a scream.","What was simple and crude? This was simple and crude!","“Aaaahhhh!” the red monster screamed.","His entire arm was broken. He quickly broke free and wanted to escape, but it was too late. Chu Yunfan was still holding on to his other arm and was held back.","“Didn’t you want to kill me? Where are you going then?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “How dare you attack an official of the Imperial Court!”","The red monster couldn’t dodge. He immediately let out a loud roar and spat out a red energy as thick as a water tank from his throat. It pierced through the sky and earth and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look.","He crushed the red energy with a backhand. The terrifying energy couldn’t break through his defense.","“What kind of monster are you?!” the red monster roared in panic.","He had met many Grand Xia experts and killed them, but he had never met someone like Chu Yunfan, who did not take his attacks seriously at all. It was as if he was scratching an itch.","“Trying to leave?”","After Chu Yunfan crushed the red energy that the red monster spat out, he grabbed out with his other hand like an eagle’s claw and pierced through the red monster.","Stab!","The red monster screamed as Chu Yunfan pierced through his chest. He let out a blood-curdling scream and cut off its arm, escaping from Chu Yunfan’s grasp.","“He’s not dead?” Chu Yunfan was a little stunned.","If it were any other human martial artist, even a Cosmic would not be able to escape death if his heart was clawed out. However, the red monster was still alive and was only heavily injured. One could imagine how vigorous the monster’s vitality was.","“But it’s too late to leave now.”","Chu Yunfan made his move. Before this, he didn’t move at all. He just stood there and beat this bold red monster into a sorry state. Now, his body moved slightly. Like a bolt of lightning, the Divine Slicer appeared in his hand, and he slashed down.","Swish!","The red monster screamed. Before it could escape, it was cut into two by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","After Chu Yunfan killed this red monster with a single strike, he looked up at the sky. There were more than ten red monsters throughout the camp engaging You Chuyun and the others in battle. The monster that Chu Yunfan had killed was the strongest among them. He had been an Interpreter. As for the other dozen or so red freaks, they were only Observers, and they were currently entangled by You Chuyun and the others, so they wouldn’t be able to break through their defenses for a while.","“All of you must want to die really badly.” Chu Yunfan revealed a cold smile.","Then, he took out the token he had gotten when he became the garrison lieutenant. Immediately, he felt that the entire military camp had become one with him. In an instant, the array formation of the entire military camp was activated. A terrifying energy swept out and transformed into a huge golden dragon.","The giant golden dragon moved and instantly killed the dozen red monsters.","“You don’t know what’s good for you and dared to attack our camp.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In every military camp of Grand Xia, there were barriers and formations that had been set up many years ago. Over the years, the auras of every generation of soldiers had been integrated into them. However, they were usually activated but not released. Once they were activated, even an elite warrior at the Abstract Interpretation Stage could not escape.","This was only the encampment of a second-tier army. If it was a first-tier elite camp, even a Cosmic would be killed on the spot if they barged in. Although these troops could not compare to those martial arts experts alone, once they gathered together, the morale formed was very shocking.","The key to activating the array was in the hands of the commanders of the various armies. The strength of the military energy in the barracks was closely related to Grand Xia. The stronger Grand Xia was, the more powerful the golden dragons in the barracks would be.","By now, Chu Yunfan had recognized what these red monsters were. There were records of these monsters in the World Book distributed by the Flying Celestials.","These monsters came from the Demon God Sect. It was caused by cultivating a special cultivation technique in the Demon God Sect that transformed its disciples into monsters. Even in the entire Grand Xia, these monsters were notorious.","“The Demon God Sect reacted quickly. They sure are really bold!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Senior Chu!” When You Chuyun and the others saw these red monsters die tragically, they immediately gathered around him.","“We didn’t investigate, so these people from the Demon God Sect raided this place.”","You Chuyun and the others were very depressed. If Chu Yunfan had not intervened, they might not have been able to do anything to these monsters.","“It’s fine. It has nothing to do with you. I think someone just can’t hold it in anymore.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","He did not believe that the Demon God Sect would come at such an opportune moment. There was no doubt that someone had informed the Demon God Sect. Furthermore, they had colluded with the Demon God Sect.","“It’s time to act.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Didn’t those people see that we’re as unmoving as a mountain and want to use these demons to test us? We’ll make a move tomorrow and let them know what the wrath of thunder is.","“I have the final say in Baotai.”"]},{"number":1727,"title":"Chapter 1727 Killing the Ding Clan","paragraphs":["1727 Killing the Ding Clan","The news of the garrison being attacked quickly spread throughout Baotai overnight.","However, they saw the heads of more than ten Blood Devils hanging outside the military camp. Many people gasped. One had to know that the monsters of the Demon God Sect were not ordinary people. At the very least, they were above the Abstract Stage.","Abstracts were nothing in the Flying Celestials, but in this border area, Abstracts were considered experts. Now, more than ten of them had been killed in one go, and their heads were hung on poles outside the military camp. It was almost the same as the officers who were killed by Chu Yunfan for failing to meet the deadline.","Soon, all kinds of rumors about the new lieutenant colonel spread. Compared to the previous garrison lieutenant, Chu Yunfan was many times stronger. The deaths of the officers did not seem to affect him at all. On the contrary, it made him even more powerful.","On this day, the gates of the military camp were opened, and squads of soldiers trotted out of the camp. This instantly alarmed the various major factions.","During this period of time, Chu Yunfan was only tidying up his internal affairs and did not come out. From time to time, one would hear the sounds of training, but no one came out of the camp. This made many people unable to spy on them even if they wanted to.","It wasn’t that no one had thought of spying from the air, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so sneaky? He took out a few Divinity Breaker Crossbows from the armory in the military camp and shot down those who were spying from the air.","They didn’t even ask why or whose spy it was. They didn’t even bother to ask the reason. Anyone who got close was shot down with the crossbows. Divinity Breaker Crossbows were terrifying weapons that could pierce through an Abstract with a single arrow.","Now, everyone saw these soldiers coming out of the camp. However, they were surprised. Compared to the original soldiers, these soldiers who had been trained by Chu Yunfan for a period were clearly much stronger. Their spirits were completely different, and they looked like elites.","Many people remembered that a few days ago, these soldiers looked like ruffians. They couldn’t help but click their tongues in wonder. They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan actually had the ability to train soldiers.","In Grand Xia, the ability to lead troops in battle was passed down from generation to generation. It was not something that ordinary people could come into contact with. Little did they know that in the Federation, as long as they were willing, many people could come into contact with some knowledge of leading troops to war. After all, the Federation cultivated all-rounded talents in both civil and military affairs, not bookworms. Moreover, Chu Yunfan was one of the best among them, so this matter was naturally not difficult for him.","The leader was naturally Chu Yunfan and his underlings who were riding drakehorses.","“Isn’t that the direction of the Ding clan?” Someone figured out the direction Chu Yunfan and the others were heading in.","The five major forces in the city all had their own bases, each occupying a region. Therefore, they could easily determine that Chu Yunfan was leading his troops in the direction of the Ding clan.","“He can’t be planning to fall out with the Ding clan, right?”","“How dare he!” A scout from the Ding clan was shocked and angry. He quickly sent the news back.","Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to have any intention of hiding from the crowd. He swaggered through the city with his soldiers and headed in the direction of the Ding clan.","All of a sudden, the winds and clouds in Baotai began to gather in the direction of the Ding clan.","“Stop. do you know what this place is?”","Chu Yunfan led his troops to the entrance of the Ding clan’s ancestral land. Immediately, more than ten servants stopped Chu Yunfan at the gates.","On the contrary, these soldiers of the garrison army were supposed to work for the Ding clan. They were the high and mighty masters. As for these soldiers, they were just a group of slaves.","“Colonel Chu, do you know what you are doing? Don’t think that just because you’re an official of the Imperial Court, you can trespass into a private residence.” Ding Feng stared at Chu Yunfan.","He had not expected Chu Yunfan to target him directly, leaving him with no time to make a move. Last night, he had secretly contacted the red monsters of the Demon God Sect. No one should have discovered him.","Thinking of this, Ding Feng calmed down. No matter what, no one could have known what he had done, so Chu Yunfan could not have come for this matter. However, he never expected that even though Chu Yunfan didn’t know what he had done, it didn’t stop him from targeting the Ding clan.","What strong dragon does not suppress the local snakes? This rule did not exist here.","“Trespass?” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile. From atop his drakehorse, he stared down at Ding Cheng. “The Ding clan has been indebted to the king for a long time, but you don’t know how to repay His Majesty or the country. Not only did you take in the deserter, Ding Cheng, but you also dared to hold the Imperial Court’s army captives to be used as slaves. The evidence is conclusive and unpardonable.”","“What?” Ding Feng didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to casually put a big hat on him. Taking in deserters in Grand Xia was a major crime, but usually, there weren’t so many people who cared about such things.","However, once someone started to fuss about it, it would be a big deal. He could have said that he did not know about this matter, but using soldiers of the Imperial Court as slaves led to the unpardonable death penalty.","What did he mean by heinous? If he was caught, he would be beheaded or even exterminated.","The Ding clan treated the soldiers of the garrison army as slaves and ordered them around. This was of course something, but to talk about holding the soldiers captive was pure nonsense. This was because Ding Cheng held the power of the garrison army. With just a word, these soldiers would obediently work for the Ding clan.","“Y-You evil person! What vicious thoughts!” Ding Feng stared at Chu Yunfan as he trembled in anger."]},{"number":1728,"title":"Chapter 1728 The Ding Clan’s Defeat","paragraphs":["1728 The Ding Clan’s Defeat","It was just that no one had pursued the matter before. Grand Xia was too big. A mere city like Baotai was not enough to make the Ministry of War raise their eyebrows, which was why they had been so arrogant until now.","Ding Feng understood Chu Yunfan’s intention immediately. Chu Yunfan wanted to use the power of Grand Xia to flatten the entire Ding clan.","At this moment, he realized that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan had been extremely ruthless before, he had shut himself in, making many people mistakenly think that he was only here to build his reputation and was not interested in the affairs of Baotai.","After all, as an elite disciple of the Flying Celestials, Baotai was not enough to make them look askance. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was just biding his time? After he had sorted out the military affairs, he immediately attacked and caught everyone off guard.","“Ding Feng, it’s not that I didn’t want to take revenge, but the time wasn’t right yet,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Ding Feng. “The Ding clan using the Imperial Court’s army as slaves is tantamount to rebellion.”","Chu Yunfan then shouted, “Capture the entire Ding clan! If anyone dares to resist, kill them without mercy!”","The soldiers behind him responded and charged forward.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you use the Imperial Court’s orders! You’ll die a horrible death! Fight them to the death! Only by killing him can the Ding clan be saved!” Ding Feng roared angrily.","The higher-ups and servants of the Ding clan behind him attacked.","These Ding clan servants were even more elite than the garrison soldiers. Most of them were Golden Cores. Even many of the Ding clan’s higher-ups were Abstracts. However, even though the strength of the garrison army was slightly weaker, under the leadership of You Chuyun and the others, they didn’t show any signs of weakness and charged forward. Especially since You Chuyun and the others were Observers, they directly charged forward.","Boom!","The two sides collided like two torrents, and in an instant, shouts and killing sounds rose into the air.","Chu Yunfan watched this scene coldly as he sat on his drakehorse. He did not make a move. Although there would inevitably be casualties in the garrison, an army that did not see blood could never become a true army.","“If you want to destroy my clan, I’ll kill you first!”","Ding Feng finally couldn’t take it anymore. He rose from the ground and waved. A mountain-shaped magic tool flew out. It grew bigger and bigger, then fell toward Chu Yunfan with a bang.","“Attacking an official of the Imperial Court is an unforgivable crime!” Chu Yunfan shouted. Without even looking, he threw a punch.","Bam!","With an incomparably loud boom, the mountain-shaped magic tool was blasted into pieces.”","“Impossible!” Ding Feng was dumbstruck.","But now, it was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punch. What was Chu Yunfan’s body made of? Was he a monster?","“Damn it! How is he so powerful?”","Ding Feng mobilized all the divine power in his body to resist this terrifying aura with all his might. At this moment, his hidden cultivation was finally revealed. He was actually an intermediate Interpreter.","Ordinary garrison lieutenants who came to take office might not be his match, so he did not take these garrison lieutenants who came from the Imperial Court to heart at all.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was different from any of the garrison lieutenants he had met before? His strength was much more terrifying than any of the garrison lieutenants he knew.","“You want to kill an official and rebel?” Chu Yunfan sneered. With a slight movement, he flew into the sky and stomped down.","Pfft!","Ding Feng felt as if he had been severely injured. He flew away and crashed into the ground, creating a huge hole. His entire body seemed to have been shattered.","“My lord!”","Some of the Ding clan’s higher-ups and servants realized that their clan head had been seriously injured by Chu Yunfan in one move. They immediately rushed toward Chu Yunfan without fear of death, trying to buy time for Ding Feng.","“You overestimate yourself.” Chu Yunfan flicked his finger, and a stream of sword energy shot out from his fingertip. It turned into countless streams of sword energy in the air, nailing the servants and higher-ups of the Ding clan to the ground one by one.","The difference in strength between them and Chu Yunfan was too great. Chu Yunfan was like a high and mighty god. Any resistance in front of him would not be able to withstand a single blow.","Ding Feng coughed up blood when he saw the higher-ups and elites of the Ding clan being easily slaughtered by Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, I only hate that the Demon God Sect didn’t do a good job yesterday and failed to kill you!” Ding Feng spat out a mouthful of blood and looked at Chu Yunfan with hatred. He wanted to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“So the Demon God Sect incident yesterday is related to you. Then I’ll add another sentence—colluding with the Demon God Sect to murder an official of the Imperial Court!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Chu Yunfan, you will die a horrible death!” Ding Feng roared.","He felt a sweetness in his throat and spat out another mouthful of blood. He wanted to get up, but how could he escape from Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan stomped down again.","Bam!","Ding Feng’s chest was pierced through and he died instantly.","Seeing their clan head die so tragically, the higher-ups and elites of the Ding clan, who were not afraid of death, were all scared out of their wits. Even the strongest clan head of the Ding clan, Ding Feng, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The morale of the garrison soldiers who followed Chu Yunfan soared. It had to be known that since they became garrison soldiers, they had been bullied by others. There had never been a time when they could hold their heads high.","Now that they were with Chu Yunfan, in just a short time, they had undergone an earth-shattering change. So what if it was the powerful Ding clan? In an instant, they were all toppled.","For a moment, everyone felt their bodies were filled with strength. They surrounded the remaining forces of the Ding clan even more fiercely. In addition, You Chuyun and the others acted as arrows and defeated the remainders of the clan."]},{"number":1729,"title":"Chapter 1729 Made a Fortune","paragraphs":["1729 Made a Fortune","“The Ding clan is finished!”","When the scouts of the surrounding large factions saw this scene, they could not help but say one after another. At this point, the Ding clan was finished.","The Ding clan’s leader had died tragically, and the remaining higher-ups either died or surrendered. The remaining people, not to mention Chu Yunfan, even You Chuyun and the others could capture them in one fell swoop. They were not their opponents at all.","Seeing this scene, many people gasped when they saw Chu Yunfan floating in the sky like a god. Everyone’s previous guesses were completely wrong. When Chu Yunfan was in seclusion, everyone thought that he was a strong dragon that could not suppress a local snake and had no choice but to lower his head.","However, it was clear all their previous guesses were wrong. Chu Yunfan was clearly a fierce dragon that could not cross the river. Chu Yunfan was not afraid of these local tyrants. He just did not understand the situation previously. Once he figured it out, he struck with the might of lightning and uprooted the Ding clan, one of the five major forces in the city.","This power made many people gasp. Many people could even see a sense of contempt in Chu Yunfan’s actions. They thought that as one of the few major factions in Baotai, Chu Yunfan should be wary of the Ding Clan. However, Chu Yunfan did not act according to common sense. He immediately destroyed the Ding clan and uprooted them.","They thought that they could make Chu Yunfan afraid, but in fact, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about them at all. This contempt made them feel a chill that came from their bones. The others thought Chu Yunfan would sit down and have a good talk with them, but that possibility probably didn’t exist.","And things were no different from what many people had expected. Just as many people had initially expected, without Ding Feng leading the way, the entire Ding clan was no match for the garrison.","Soon, the Ding clan’s defense line was torn down. It could not stop Chu Yunfan’s advance. In just a moment, the garrison troops had already invaded the Ding clan.","The news quickly spread throughout Baotai. The city was shaken and everyone was in an uproar. This was especially true for the people who had long been accustomed to the five major forces of Baotai. They could not imagine how the Ding clan, which was simply a behemoth to them, could be uprooted just like that.","The details of the battle quickly spread.","“I didn’t expect a colossus like the Ding clan would be uprooted so easily.”","“Is this what ‘There’s always someone stronger among the strong’ means?”","“Is this the elite disciple of the ten great sects? Chu Yunfan’s is on a completely different level from the previous few garrison lieutenants.”","“Chu Yunfan is too powerful. I’m afraid storms are coming!”","Everyone discussed animatedly, but no one dared to complain about this matter.","The next day, in the colonel’s office of the garrison army camp, Chu Yunfan sat on the main seat. You Chuyun was giving him a report.","“Senior Chu, after working overtime for a night, we’ve finished counting. We found two million middle-grade spirit stones in the Ding clan’s ancestral land. There are also various medicinal herbs, refining materials, and other treasures worth more than one million middle-grade spirit stones. There are also countless martial arts manuals.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. Seizing the Ding clan’s assets just so happened to alleviate his urgent needs. His cultivation speed was much faster than ordinary people, and at the same time, the resources consumed were unimaginable.","“In addition, those soldiers who were captured to do hard labor have already returned to the military camp. However, we can’t find Ding Cheng. According to the information we received, he probably ran away through the back of the residence. Someone saw him running away.”","“Don’t be anxious over Ding Cheng. He’s just a clown.” Chu Yunfan waved.","He didn’t care about Ding Cheng in the slightest. Even if Ding Cheng wanted to cause trouble, he could kill him with one finger. Although Ding Cheng was also at the Abstract Interpretation Stage, or else he wouldn’t have been able to become the deputy colonel of the garrison army, his combat strength was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","“Besides, isn’t this a good opportunity? Yesterday, I uprooted the Ding clan to alert the enemy and see how many evil people are hiding in this small city.” Chu Yunfan sneered, his eyes flashing with a cold glint. “It was not easy to find them, but now that Ding Cheng is leading the way, everything is a breeze. Keep an eye on him. Whatever he tries to do will not escape our eyes. I want to see who will stick out their neck.","“It would be best to uproot these five major forces. These forces have controlled Baotai for too long and have long lost their sense of law. They’ve long become a scourge. They even dare to kill the garrison lieutenants sent by the Imperial Court. What else did they not dare to do?”","Before Chu Yunfan, several garrison officers had been killed, and he didn’t believe that they had all died at the hands of the Demon God Sect. It must have had a lot to do with these forces.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of them jumping out now but was afraid that they wouldn’t. When they jumped out, he could catch them all. If they didn’t do anything, it would be a little troublesome. He would have to think of another way to deal with them.","Chu Yunfan uprooted the Ding clan with great fanfare. Other than because the Ding clan had committed heinous crimes, he also wanted to alert the enemy. Only in this way could he force them into desperation. Only then could he wipe out these evil spirits and return Baotai to peace.","“According to the rules, half of the goods found in the Ding clan will be handed over to the Ministry of War. I will take half of the half, and half of a quarter will be split between the eleven of you. The last quarter will be given to everyone who participated in this operation.”","Chu Yunfan waved and distributed all the goods. Of course, the majority of the goods had to be handed over to the Ministry of War. After all, he had borrowed the power of the Ministry of War and the name of Grand Xia. Only in this way could he shut their mouths.","He gained 500,000 middle-grade spirit stones and more than 200,000 spirit stones worth of various medicinal herbs and refining materials. It could be said that he was a huge fortune.","It was even more than Chu Yunfan’s current net worth. As expected, a horse would not be fat without grass at night, and a man would not be rich without windfall.","The rest were naturally distributed to You Chuyun and the others, as well as the soldiers under them. This was to endear the hearts of the people below him."]},{"number":1730,"title":"Chapter 1730 Great Essence Cultivator Pill","paragraphs":["1730 Great Essence Cultivator Pill","“Senior Chu, besides these, we also found a secret correspondence in Ding Feng’s hidden room. It was a letter from Li Qianyuan to Ding Feng. Li Qianyuan asked Ding Feng to plot against you. Fortunately, you uprooted the Ding clan before Ding Feng could make a move,” You Chuyun said.","“I guessed as much.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to read the letter to guess how Li Qianyuan would bewitch Ding Feng. It was nothing more than coercion and bribery. Moreover, his strength after coming to Baotai probably made Ding Feng feel like a fishbone was stuck in his throat. Both sides basically hit it off. That was why the Demon God Sect had invaded the military camp.","However, whether it was Li Qianyuan or Ding Feng, they clearly underestimated Chu Yunfan’s strength. That was why Ding Feng suffered a huge loss.","“We also found something else in the hidden room. It was a thousand-year-old blood ginseng,” You Chuyun said, “We brought it over. Here.” He took out a spatial bag and handed it to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan opened the bag and saw a red-colored ginseng lying quietly inside. “It really is a blood ginseng!”","His eyes lit up. A thousand-year-old ginseng was already very precious, let alone a blood ginseng that was a rare variety.","The blood ginseng was a variant of ginseng. It could only grow in extreme environments. It was very difficult to grow, and after a thousand years, it had begun to have some spirituality. It could seek good fortune and avoid disaster. Before danger came, it could predict danger and use underground escape spells. Therefore, even if ordinary people saw the blood ginseng, they could not catch it. Unless one was a top martial arts expert who could completely hide their aura, it was possible to catch the blood ginseng while it was off-guard.","This was especially true for a master alchemist like Chu Yunfan who had inherited the memory of the Alchemy Emperor. He could make pills that could increase his strength and shorten the time he needed to cultivate.","This blood ginseng was something that Li Qianyuan used to lure Ding Feng. Who knew that before Ding Feng could use it, the entire Ding clan had been uprooted by Chu Yunfan, and now it all fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“It’s really God’s will that Li Qianyuan suffered a double loss.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","An ordinary alchemist might not be able to do anything about a thousand-year-old blood ginseng. They could only use it in the crudest way. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and was a master in alchemy. For him, there were many ways to use the blood ginseng.","“God is really helping me. I was worried that I didn’t have enough time. But now, Li Qianyuan has sent me a thousand-year-old blood ginseng! Hahahaha!” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter. “It can be used to make the Great Essence Cultivator Pill!”","This was one of the countless pill recipes in the Alchemy Emperor’s memory. It used blood ginseng as the main ingredient. Once this pill was successfully made, it could greatly increase one’s strength. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation would have another rapid improvement.","Chu Yunfan immediately announced that he was going into seclusion. This time, he had seized many precious medicinal herbs from the Ding clan. Other than a portion that was handed over to the Ministry of War and some that were distributed to the garrison soldiers who had been involved, the rest belonged to Chu Yunfan.","These materials could be used to refine the Great Essence Cultivator Pill. There was no need to purchase medicinal herbs from the outside. Just the medicinal herbs stored in the Ding clan were everything Chu Yunfan needed. One could imagine how wealthy the Ding clan was!","After announcing his seclusion, Chu Yunfan immediately entered the Mountain River Diagram. Only here was he absolutely safe and did not have to worry about anyone obstructing him.","Chu Yunfan immediately took out the Mountain River Cauldron and made a hand seal. He lit a fire and cut off a third of the blood ginseng that had already taken on a human form. He was ready to start making the pill.","The thousand-year-old blood ginseng was powerful. Even just one-third of its total strength was enough for Chu Yunfan at this time. The main reason was that although many of the supplementary medicinal herbs in the Great Essence Cultivator Pill were not as precious as the thousand-year-old blood ginseng, they were not easy to find. The Ding clan had collected medicinal herbs for many years, but it was only enough for Chu Yunfan to refine one Great Essence Cultivator Pill.","“After this matter is over, I’ll think of a way to gather two sets of supplementary herbs. At that time, with three Great Essence Cultivator Pills in hand, it won’t be a problem for my cultivation to advance.”","Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence in himself. Even if his opponent was Wang Yifan or Li Qianyuan, it was impossible for him to lower his head.","After Chu Yunfan announced his seclusion, the undercurrent in Baotai did not calm down. On the contrary, it intensified as time passed. Chu Yunfan’s ruthless method of uprooting the Ding clan undoubtedly hurt the nerves of the major forces in the city.","Late at night, in a secret chamber in the ancestral home of the Chen clan, one of the five major forces in Baotai.","A group of figures in luxurious robes had gathered. Each of them had a gloomy expression. If someone familiar with the situation in Baotai saw them, they would definitely be shocked. Each of these people was a famous figure in Baotai.","The four people in the lead were the leaders of the city’s forces.","The head of the Chen clan, Chen Taining, the head of the Wang clan, Wang Bin, the head of the Fusion Sect, Pan Bo, and the head of the Skyreach Sect, Jian Wen.","The rest of the people looked up to the four of them. Among these people, one of them was dressed in armor. He was quite eye-catching among the crowd, and everyone was familiar with him. It was Ding Cheng, who was originally a high-ranking official in the Ding clan and also the deputy colonel of the garrison army.","Different from the awe-inspiring and illustrious time before, the current Ding Cheng was undoubtedly a stray dog in everyone’s eyes. The entire Ding clan was uprooted, and Ding Cheng’s influence in the garrison army was completely purged by Chu Yunfan.","“Everyone, Chu Yunfan attacked my clan. If you don’t join forces to deal with him, I’m afraid it’ll be your turn next. This b*stard is vicious and cunning!”","Ding Cheng stood up and looked at everyone. His eyes flashed with grief and indignation. His entire clan had been uprooted by Chu Yunfan. If he had not escaped through the escape route in the ancestral mansion, he would have been caught by Chu Yunfan.","He couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan would dare to be so bold. His influence in the army was wiped out just like that, and the Ding clan was uprooted.","Chu Yunfan did not even hesitate!"]},{"number":1731,"title":"Chapter 1731 The Conspiracy","paragraphs":["1731 The Conspiracy","Ding Cheng had been in the garrison army for many years and had met many garrison lieutenants, including those who had died inexplicably. He had seen a lot of things, so he naturally knew that to these elite disciples from the various major forces, the garrison lieutenant was just one of the places to be gilded. It was rare for them to put in all their effort to rectify military affairs. Even if they had this determination, they would die quickly without knowing why.","Chu Yunfan did not hesitate at all. On the first day he got to the camp, he beheaded all of Ding Cheng’s aides for failing to respond to a summon. Even he was declared a deserter because he did not return to the camp.","This simple and crude method did not care about any means. Ding Cheng could see that Chu Yunfan did not have any intention of respecting them, so he did not care about any means.","To Chu Yunfan, compromise was meaningless. They were just a bunch of ignorant natives. This was the reason why he and the Ding clan had miscalculated and were easily eliminated by Chu Yunfan.","Of course, Ding Cheng did not think that it was because Chu Yunfan was strong. He was just a mere elite disciple of the Flying Celestials. Although he was not easy to deal with, it was not impossible to deal with him.","Ding Cheng’s words also made everyone fall silent. If they had thought that Chu Yunfan only wanted to take back his power in the army and not allow anyone to share it with him, then they would have thought that Chu Yunfan was a lucky man.","Now with the Ding clan uprooted, everyone naturally understood that Chu Yunfan had come with ill intentions. He did not intend to compromise with them. He did not intend to live out his term peacefully.","The five forces usually schemed against each other, but at this time, they were surprisingly united. Chu Yunfan was not a fierce dragon that could not cross the river, and this fierce dragon had clearly shown hostility. There were not many choices left for them.","“Everyone, when my clan was uprooted, you all stood by and watched. But now, no one knows who Chu Yunfan will attack next,” Ding Cheng said unhappily as he glanced at everyone. “Don’t forget how Chu Yunfan put a big label on my clan.”","He continued, “Speaking of which, I’m afraid that all of you aren’t very clean either. Today, Chu Yunfan found an excuse to exterminate my clan. Next time, he will find an excuse to destroy all of you one by one. The foundation left behind by our ancestors will all be ruined in your hands!”","“Ding Cheng, you’re saying this because you want us to fight Chu Yunfan to the death and reap the benefits,” the head of a small family said.","Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s terrifying power, the man felt a chill down his spine. If Chu Yunfan targeted him, he was afraid that he would have no chance of escaping.","“If I said that in the past, you can choose not to believe me. Now that my clan has been uprooted, he won’t give up until he finds me and kills me. I swear that when we surround Chu Yunfan in the future, I’ll be at the front lines and will not use you as a shield.”","As Ding Cheng spoke, his eyes were filled with terrifying killing intent. His face was ashen as he shouted, “Chu Yunfan uprooted my clan and announced the so-called evidence of our crimes to the world. I, Ding Cheng, am too ashamed to meet my ancestors. If I can’t sacrifice his head to the souls of my fallen clan, how will I ever continue in this life?”","Ding Cheng’s words and his killing intent shocked everyone. However, the Chen clan’s head, Chen Taining, said, “This b*stard is coming for us. Since he refuses to show us respect, we’ll just handle him like the previous few.”","Chen Taining’s words revealed that the deaths of the previous lieutenant colonels were inextricably related to them. However, the leaders of the various forces did not find it strange. Instead, they felt that it was very normal.","“It’s not that simple. He has the Flying Celestials behind him, and he’s the champion of the sect’s inner disciple competition. He’s a seed disciple in the Flying Celestials. If he dies here for no reason, we’ll be in big trouble,” the leader of Fusion, Pan Bo, said with a worried expression.","Everyone’s expression fell. They all knew how protective a behemoth like the Flying Celestials could be, and they knew how terrifying the Flying Celestials were. The thought of facing such a behemoth head-on sent chills down their spines even though they were experienced and knowledgeable.","“Don’t worry, everyone. Although he has the Flying Celestials backing him, there are people in the Flying Celestials who dislike him. We don’t have to worry about the pressure from that front. Moreover, my clan received a letter from Li Qianyuan previously. The person Chu Yunfan offended is Marquis Li Qianyuan. There’s no need to worry about the pressure from the Imperial Court,” Ding Cheng hurriedly explained.","“What? He offended so many people!”","“That’s right. If it weren’t for the pressure from the Flying Celestials and the Imperial Court, what would we have to worry about? We just have to let him die without a burial place,” everyone said indignantly.","“No problem, leave it to me. He’s just an elite disciple of the Flying Celestials. Does he really think that no one can deal with him?” Jian Wen responded.","“But Chu Yunfan almost never leaves the camp. We have to find a way to lure him out. We won’t attack the camp,” one of the small clan leaders said.","“Then let’s organize a banquet and invite Chu Yunfan there to discuss the major events of Baotai.”"]},{"number":1732,"title":"Chapter 1732 Each With Their Own Ulterior Motives","paragraphs":["1732 Each With Their Own Ulterior Motives","After Chu Yunfan uprooted the Ding clan, he announced that he would be in seclusion. However, the undercurrents that he had stirred did not end because of his seclusion. On the contrary, all kinds of undercurrents were surging in places that no one could see. Without a doubt, the military camp became the focus of countless people in Baotai.","However, after Chu Yunfan shot the scouts with the Divinity Breakers, no one dared to approach the camp. They only dared to watch from afar, but they were too far away, so these spies often had no way of getting any specific information.","However, half a month later, when an invitation was sent to the camp, all of this peace was broken. All the major forces in the city, including the Chen clan, the Wang clan, Fusion, and Skyreach, jointly set up a banquet and invited Chu Yunfan to attend to discuss the general situation in Baotai.","This made many people in the city look sideways. After Chu Yunfan uprooted the Ding clan, the other major forces in the city finally made their move.","“Is this a sincere invitation or is this a trap?”","Many people had all kinds of speculations, but everyone knew that after this banquet, no matter what the outcome was, it would completely change the situation in Baotai. Whether Chu Yunfan could completely control Baotai depended on this banquet.","At night, a figure quietly entered the camp. With the cover of the night, no one noticed his figure. At this moment, in the colonel’s office, Chu Yunfan sat on the main seat and looked at the middle-aged man in front of him with interest.","“They set up a trap to deal with me?” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“That’s right. Colonel, remember not to let your guard down. These people even invited foreign aid to deal with you,” the middle-aged man said, but he was a little puzzled because Chu Yunfan’s reaction was a little unexpected. He didn’t feel shocked as if those people’s actions were under Chu Yunfan’s control.","Could it be that he had been in control from the beginning to the end, or even indulged it?","Thinking of this, the middle-aged man felt a chill down his spine. Everyone had underestimated Chu Yunfan because of his age, but now it seemed that everyone had made a mistake. Chu Yunfan was much more cunning and difficult to deal with than everyone had imagined.","“Of course, I will pay attention to these things. However, I still don’t understand. Aren’t all the major forces in Baotai one? Why did you choose to help me, Master Xu?” Chu Yunfan questioned.","This middle-aged man was none other than the head of the Xu clan, a relatively large family in the city. But compared to the Ding clan, the Wang clan, and the Chen clan, the size of the Xu clan was still too small. It was not even half of the size of the three families. It could only be considered a medium-sized family.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had finally asked this question, Master Xu said, “Colonel, since you’ve asked, I have nothing to hide. The Xu clans’ real opponent isn’t you, sir, but the other major factions. As long as they are still around, the Xu clan will never be able to stand out.”","Chu Yunfan understood everything when he heard Master Xu say this. No wonder he chose to help Chu Yunfan. To Master Xu, the real enemy was the various major forces that suppressed them. As long as the various major factions were still around, this situation would not change for a day. The Xu clan would never have a day to stand out.","However, it would be different if he chose to help Chu Yunfan. Not only was Chu Yunfan more powerful, but even after he eradicated several major forces, he was only a passerby. Chu Yunfan would not stay in Baotai for ten, twenty, or thirty years.","Master Xu understood very well that a figure like Chu Yunfan was like a divine dragon in the sky. Why would he stay in Baotai for long?","Chu Yunfan would leave sooner or later, but the Wangs, Chens, Fusion, Skyreach, and others would stay for a long time. It was evident who would be the long-term enemy in the future.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised by this result. These forces seemed to be working together to deal with him, but in fact, they had their own ulterior motives.","Each of them had their own plans and demands.","The Wangs, Chens, Fusion, and Skyreach all hated Chu Yunfan to the bone, but the other small forces might not think so. They naturally had their own plans, but not everyone was as bold as the Xu clan, daring to bet on Chu Yunfan.","“You didn’t lie. Very good.” Chu Yunfan smiled. “I admire people who know how to adapt to the times. I planned to uproot all the major forces in Baotai, but since your Xu clan is willing to rely on me, there’s no need for me to go all out.","“After all, you can see that my future is not limited to a small pond like Baotai. However, while I’m here, I have the final say. As long as you are willing to cooperate, everything can be discussed,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“I’m willing to die for you, sir!” Master Xu answered.","He was shocked, especially when he heard Chu Yunfan’s plan to uproot all the major forces in Baotai. He immediately sucked in a breath of cold air. Everyone had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s situation and how ruthless he was.","According to Chu Yunfan’s plan, these disobedient forces were all on his list of targets. The Xu clan was also on his list of targets, but now he felt like he had escaped a disaster.","“Very good. After I eradicate all the dirt, I will submit a letter to the Ministry of War and recommend you to be the administrative officer of Baotai. As long as you cooperate with me, your future will naturally be yours.”","Chu Yunfan looked at Master Xu with satisfaction. The Xu clan was the first force to rely on him, so he naturally had to make a gesture.","“All right, it’s late. You can go, but don’t let anyone see you, lest they become suspicious.” Chu Yunfan waved, and Master Xu immediately left.","After Master Xu left, Chu Yunfan quickly found You Chuyun and told him about the matter. You Chuyun was shocked when he found out that the various factions had set up a trap to deal with Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1733,"title":"Chapter 1733 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Observance Stage!","paragraphs":["1733 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Observance Stage!","“These people are so cunning. I knew they had bad intentions!” You Chuyun said in shock.","He had already guessed that these people had ill intentions. Even if there was no direct evidence, he would not let his guard down easily on this issue. In fact, this was the reason why Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised when he heard about this matter. No matter what the other party’s plans were, at least Chu Yunfan had already prepared for the worst.","“It’s just a banquet. If it’s just them, it’s nothing. They’re just a group of straw huts. I only lack a reason to deal with them. Now, they’ve sent themselves to my doorstep,” Chu Yunfan said, ” However, the external help they’ve invited will be a little tricky. According to the head of the Xu clan, they plan to invite the sect leader of a minor demonic sect in the outer realm. That person is at least a Cosmic. That person will be the real threat to me.”","Chu Yunfan could understand their thoughts. He represented the Imperial Court and officials of the empire. They did not have the courage to attack the camp. Even ordinary evil sects did not dare to do such a thing. Only the Demon God Sect, which was born to oppose the human race, did not fear the deterrence of Grand Xia and dared to attack the camp. None of the other major powers dared to do so. The moment Grand Xia learned of the matter, they would be hunted down by countless people. This was something that had been proven throughout the history of Grand Xia.","That was why they had come up with such a trick. After they tricked Chu Yunfan into coming out, it would be easier for them to make a move. However, this was also an opportunity for Chu Yunfan to completely uproot these major forces.","“Then what should we do?” You Chuyun looked a little distressed.","A Cosmic was an extraordinary existence no matter where they were. If they were in the Flying Celestials, they would have the status of a true disciple. Those who were older could become elders in the Flying Celestials. Each of them was in charge of a region’s affairs and had high authority.","“It’s fine. Take advantage of the night to return to the Flying Celestials with this jade slip. Find Senior Yi Yunyao and give her the jade slip. She’ll know everything,” Chu Yunfan said and handed a jade slip to You Chuyun.","“Yes, Senior Chu.”","You Chuyun didn’t send his divine will into the jade slip, so he didn’t know what Chu Yunfan had told Yi Yunyao in the jade slip to be so confident. However, he didn’t dare to delay and quickly left the camp under the cover of the night. No one knew that he had left.","Chu Yunfan watched You Chuyun leave, and his expression immediately returned to calmness.","“A trap? You’re just a bunch of clowns. I’ll take this opportunity to capture you all in one fell swoop.” Chu Yunfan sneered and immediately broke the space and entered the Mountain River Diagram.","At this moment, in the Mountain River Diagram, the Mountain River Cauldron was letting out a faint rumbling sound. Then, the lid of the cauldron opened. Immediately, a shocking medicinal fragrance turned into white fog and spread out, filling every inch of space between heaven and earth.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath. The medicinal fragrance that had turned into white mist turned into two long dragons and was inhaled into his nose. Suddenly, he felt all the pores on his body open up. Although it was only the medicinal fragrance, it made him feel the motivation in his entire body to rush to a new realm.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the cauldron turned over. A red pill flew out from it. It was the Great Essence Cultivator Pill, made with blood ginseng as the main ingredient.","“The pill is finally complete. The banquet is in ten days. That gives me time to make another breakthrough in my cultivation.” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a hint of joy, but he quickly regained his calm appearance.","Chu Yunfan really had to thank Li Qianyuan for his assistance. If it weren’t for Li Qianyuan, he didn’t know how long it would take for him to make another breakthrough.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and circulated the Emperor Method. Then, he swallowed the Great Essence Cultivator Pill. He felt the pill turn into a blood-red flame and began to burn crazily.","In just a moment, this red flame had spread throughout Chu Yunfan’s entire body. He felt that every vein and every cell was burning crazily. If it was an ordinary person, they would have been burned to death by this flame, but Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person. He was prepared.","This blood ginseng was considered a special species, especially a thousand-year-old blood ginseng. It carried a hint of demonic energy. Pills made from blood ginseng were naturally not so easy to digest. It could be said to have some demonic energy.","Chu Yunfan quickly activated the Celestial Devouring Art and swallowed the red flame, turning it into his own power. A portion of it spread into his limbs and bones. It fused into every cell of his and transformed into a powerful force that nourished his body. The other portion transformed into a tremendous amount of energy that began to charge toward the late Abstract Observance Stage. If it was an ordinary person, they would have already collapsed. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could do two things at the same time.","At the same time, the mountain of middle-grade spirit stones in the Mountain River Diagram flew into the air and exploded. In just a moment, they had turned into countless spirit energy and then poured into Chu Yunfan’s mind like a long dragon. All of them were absorbed by the godhead.","Chu Yunfan felt that he had entered a state of enlightenment, and countless profound mysteries regarding the late Abstract Observance Stage were displayed in front of him, revealing every single detail without the slightest bit of secrets.","Along with Chu Yunfan’s comprehension becoming deeper and deeper, he could clearly sense that the barrier of the late Abstract Observance Stage crumbling bit by bit.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, Chu Yunfan felt a terrifying energy surge out of his body, filling the entire world. However, he immediately withdrew his divine power. He felt that along with that terrifying energy pouring out, the late Abstract Observance Stage barrier also collapsed with a loud bang, and he smoothly crossed over this realm that had troubled god knows how many people.","He was now a late Observer!"]},{"number":1734,"title":"Chapter 1734 Greatly Strengthened, Falling Out During the Banquet","paragraphs":["1734 Greatly Strengthened, Falling Out During the Banquet","Along with stepping into the late Abstract Observance Stage, Chu Yunfan clearly felt that his cultivation had more than doubled, his strength had skyrocketed, and even his battle prowess had followed suit to soar to a brand new realm.","Chu Yunfan felt that he could easily kill three to five of his original selves. He could already feel his combat strength soaring with just one increase in cultivation level. He was different from ordinary people. It was easy for ordinary people to break through, but the increase in combat strength after breaking through was limited. Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough was far more difficult than ordinary people’s, but once he broke through, his cultivation and combat strength would also undergo an earth-shattering change.","It was bitter first, then sweet. The more he went on, the greater Chu Yunfan’s cultivation advantage became. What was did it mean to be invincible within the same level? He was truly invincible within the same level. He could even go against the flow and defeat experts who were far higher than him.","“Coupled with my hou from, even an ordinary peak Interpreter wouldn’t be a match for me. Although it won’t be long, it’s enough for one battle.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “What trap? I’ll uproot all the parasites in their places.”","Chu Yunfan calculated the time. Today was already ten days later and was time for the banquet?","As the sun set, the night sky tore apart the last rays of the setting sun bit by bit, covering everything like a black cloth. A bright moon hung high in the sky, casting a cold moonlight on the ground. Although it was late at night, the ancestral land of the Chen clan was extremely lively.","Today, the head of the Chen clan had set up a banquet in the ancestral land to entertain Chu Yunfan and the leaders of the various major forces. All the influential figures in Baotai were in attendance. Even many people who had not participated in the battle between the two sides were at the banquet. It was as if this was really just a banquet to discuss the future of Baotai.","“Chu Yunfan hasn’t come yet. Don’t tell me he doesn’t dare to come.”","“Maybe. The situation at this banquet is still unclear. Chu Yunfan might not come in person. You know many people hate him so much that they’re gnashing their teeth.”","“That’s impossible. None of you are right. Don’t you know that Chu Yunfan has already sent a reply? He will personally attend today’s banquet.”","“He’s so arrogant. Everyone has arrived early and is waiting for him.”","“He is the garrison leader. According to the rules of Grand Xia, he has the final say in Baotai.”","The guests discussed animatedly. Although they were not invited to the inner hall, it did not prevent them from having all kinds of guesses. Many of them had their own channels of information, so it was difficult to tell whether it was true or not.","“Lieutenant Colonel Chu Yunfan has arrived!”","With the announcement of the servants, all the voices quieted down. Everyone eagerly turned their heads. This was the first time many people were laying eyes on him, and this was when they found out Chu Yunfan was so young.","He looked to be at most twenty years old. His lips were red and his teeth were white. He looked delicate, but his gaze carried a bit of power that could not be rejected. Dressed in a black robe, he looked very capable.","As Chu Yunfan walked in, everyone was silent, as if they had lost their voices under his light. Under the guidance of the servants, Chu Yunfan passed through the outer court and arrived at the inner court. Unlike the chaos in the outer court, the inner court was located in a relatively closed hall. The leaders of the various large factions were already sitting in the corners of the hall, exchanging drinks. This was also a rare opportunity for them to make friends.","The leaders of the four forces were the focus of everyone’s attention. However, as Chu Yunfan walked into the inner court, everyone’s eyes focused on him.","“Is that Chu Yunfan? He looks so young. Is he really as powerful as the rumors say?”","“Rumor has it that he is at least at the Abstract Interpretation Stage, but I can’t tell at all now. To my knowledge, he’s invincible. This is the first time I’ve encountered a person that even I can’t see through.”","The leaders of the various large factions began to discuss in private. However, their voices were very soft, and they even exchanged information with each other through their divine wills.","“You’re here, Colonel Chu. Please, take a seat,” Master Chen said as he hurriedly stood up and said. Usually, there was no one in Baotai who could make him so polite.","“No need, I won’t be sitting. It’s a waste of time,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What do you mean, sir?” Master Wang asked, his eyes incomparably gloomy.","At this moment, everyone became nervous, including Master Xu who was drinking in the corner. He almost spat out his wine because he didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so simple and violent.","Looks like Chu Yunfan was going to lay out all the cards on the table.","“I said, I won’t be sitting as it’s a waste of time. I don’t know if you poisoned the food,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile, “So, to be on the safe side, I won’t be sitting.”","“What jokes, sir. Why would we poison the food?” Fusion’s leader said.","He and the sect leader of Skyreach silently blocked Chu Yunfan’s escape route. Together with the head of the Wang and Chen clan, they formed an array to trap Chu Yunfan.","“I already know your plan. There’s no point in pretending. Why don’t we just save all of us some time?” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He glanced at everyone. He was not afraid of the faint encirclement."]},{"number":1735,"title":"Chapter 1735 Going to the Meeting Alone and Showing His Might","paragraphs":["1735 Going to the Meeting Alone and Showing His Might","For a moment, the joyous atmosphere of the banquet changed and everyone focused on Chu Yunfan. Most of the people present were familiar with the true purpose of today’s banquet and had long prepared to fall out with Chu Yunfan. However, they didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so arrogant.","What made many people even more surprised was that Chu Yunfan dared to attend the banquet alone even though he knew it was a trap.","‘He’s too bold!’ This thought appeared in everyone’s minds.","Chu Yunfan was extremely bold. He knew that there was an ambush, but he still dared to be so careless. What gave him the courage?","“You are besieging an official of the Imperial Court. Your crime is on the level of treason. Today, none of you will escape,” Chu Yunfan announced as his gaze swept over the crowd.","Everyone’s expression changed. One had to know that they were afraid of the wrath of Grand Xia, which was why they did not dare to attack the camp. This was the bottom line. Even though Grand Xia had turned a blind eye to these small border cities, the current situation of Grand Xia could be said to be divided by the vassals.","However, the Imperial Court was the largest of the vassals. If they invaded the camp, they would be openly opposing the Imperial Court. This was the bottom line that the Imperial Court absolutely could not tolerate. If they angered the Imperial Court, they could be crushed with just a finger. That was why they had set up such a grand banquet. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so skilled at labeling people, and he casually made a label on the spot?","However, what Chu Yunfan said was the truth. What was the difference between their actions and rebellion? It reminded them of the Ding clan that had been uprooted and died without a burial place.","“Because of this, you must die here today. You won’t escape!” Fusion’ leader said coldly.","Since things had already come to this point and they had completely shed all pretense of cordiality, they would be doomed if they hesitated for even the slightest bit. As long as Chu Yunfan died here today and they framed the Demon God Sect, what if the Imperial Court sent people to investigate? Moreover, there was a big shot like Li Qianyuan in the court to protect them, so they had nothing to be afraid of. In any case, the Demon God Sect could not be any darker. It was not a big deal for them to take the blame again.","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan. You won’t escape today. Do you think you can run away?” Master Wang also said coldly. He stared at Chu Yunfan as if he wanted to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“You think I’m going to run? Hahaha, if I wanted to run, I wouldn’t have come today,” Chu Yunfan said, “You are scheming to kill me, but I too am taking advantage of the situation to kill you. As long as you are here, Baotai will never develop.”","The leaders of these major forces finally heard Chu Yunfan’s words. It turned out that in his opinion, every one of them was a cyst, and they were all people who needed to be eliminated as soon as possible.","At the thought of this, they looked at Chu Yunfan with killing intent. The contradiction between the two sides was irreconcilable. They didn’t know why Chu Yunfan hated them so much, but they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan came from a unified society like the Federation. In his opinion, the situation of Grand Xia being divided by feudal lords was simply a mess. It scattered the power of the humans.","The Federation had been under pressure from the demons, the marine folks, and other forces all year round. They were always treading on thin ice. The Federation was committed to making use of every bit of human strength. The Federation had unified the Kunlun Realm, and that was deeply engraved in Chu Yunfan’s bones and could not be changed.","“In that case, we have nothing to say. Today, either you die or we die!” Master Chen glared at Chu Yunfan, gritting his teeth. His eyes were filled with killing intent.","“You’re going to kill me? Then I’ll start with you guys.”","Chu Yunfan instantly shot out like a thunderbolt. There was a terrifying explosion in the air. Everyone saw that he was like a thunderbolt. His entire body flashed slightly and he appeared in front of Master Chen.","“You’re too conceited!” Master Chen roared. He emitted waves of light, like a dense fog. An armor appeared in front of him, enveloping his entire body.","His cultivation base was stronger than Ding Feng’s, and he had already reached the late Abstract Interpretation Stage. With such a cultivation base, he could be considered an expert among the elite disciples of the Flying Celestials.","However, the next moment, everyone heard a huge explosion. They saw Chu Yunfan’s fist pierce through Master Chen’s chest. The armor was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s fist and exploded.","Master Chen clan did not even have time to react. He was too confident in his own strength. Even if he was very afraid of Chu Yunfan’s strength, it was just fear. Who would have thought that when he faced Chu Yunfan, he would be so weak that he would be killed by Chu Yunfan with a simple blow?","“Weakling.” Chu Yunfan sneered. Master Chen was strong, but he was still far from Chu Yunfan.","Before everyone could react, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the void. It turned into a big hand of spirit energy and lifted a figure into midair. Who else could it be but Ding Cheng?","“Ding Cheng, I’ve been looking for you. Looks like you’ve decided to take the path down to hell.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Ding Cheng thought that no one knew about his connections during this period of time. However, he did not know that everything was actually under Chu Yunfan’s control. He was just a clown.","“Impossible! How did you discover me?” Ding Cheng said in disbelief.","He clearly had an Invisibility Talisman from the Divine Talisman Sect. It was because of this Invisibility Talisman that he previously managed to escape from Chu Yunfan’s army that surrounded the Ding clan.","But now, Chu Yunfan had seen through it and grabbed him.","“With your inability to hide your aura, you still dare to appear in front of me? You really don’t know what’s good for you.”"]},{"number":1736,"title":"Chapter 1736 Killing Ding Cheng, Revealing Their Trump Cards","paragraphs":["1736 Killing Ding Cheng, Revealing Their Trump Cards","Ding Cheng relied on an Invisibility Talisman he had obtained from the Divine Talisman Sect. For ordinary people, it was indeed very difficult to discover someone who was using an Invisibility Talisman. However, Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person. Invisibility Talismans could not hide someone from Chu Yunfan, who had extraordinary perception.","“Do you really think you can escape? All your previous activities were under my control. If I didn’t need you to connect with these rebels, do you think I would have tolerated you until now?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“How dare you use me!” Ding Cheng’s face turned pale.","He suddenly understood that his escape was the result of Chu Yunfan’s non-intervention. He thought that he could rely on the strength of other forces to resist Chu Yunfan, but now it seemed that Chu Yunfan was simply using him to round up everyone.","Chu Yunfan was different from all the previous garrison leaders. His patience was neither enough nor insufficient because his patience was not used to deal with these things. He did not have the time to deal with these major forces entrenched in Baotai quietly. What he wanted was to wipe out all the major forces in Baotai. The reason why he had eradicated the Ding clan so quickly was to alert the enemy.","Chu Yunfan’s methods were not simple and crude. In fact, he was purposely trying to alarm the enemy.","“That’s right, I was using you. Now, your mission has come to an end.” A sword light appeared in his hand and slashed at Ding Cheng.","“Damn it! I can’t die yet. I want to watch you die first!” Ding Cheng roared crazily.","His eyes were bloodshot, and the divine power in his body boiled. In an instant, a defensive barrier was formed in front of him. However, this defensive barrier was instantly broken by Chu Yunfan’s sword. The power of the Divinity Slicer erupted. It was indeed Wang Yifan’s sword. It had long surpassed the scope of a spirit weapon. Now that it was in Chu Yunfan’s hand, its power increased explosively.","With just a single sword strike, Ding Cheng, who had already stepped into the Abstract Interpretation Stage, was cut into two halves, and fresh blood splattered out.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only been a few breaths. Chu Yunfan had killed two people in a row, one of whom was the head of the Chen clan. In just a short moment, Chu Yunfan had killed them. All of this happened too suddenly. No one had expected him to attack so directly and kill two people in a row. His strength was terrifying.","“D*mn it! How could this be?!”","When Master Wang saw this scene, he felt a chill run down his spine. Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst made him feel completely terrified. This was different from what he had predicted. His encirclement had not been completed, and the elite experts had not been mobilized yet. He had originally wanted to pretend to be polite with Chu Yunfan and delay him. Who knew that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t fall for it at all and would directly make things difficult?","“Fusion Leader, hurry up and attack!” Master Wang shouted.","A terrifying pressure instantly descended from the sky. It was a terrifying power that far surpassed the Abstract Interpretation Stage, and it landed on everyone’s bodies indiscriminately. Such a huge commotion immediately alarmed many of the prominent figures in Baotai.","Most of these people did not know that this banquet was a trap, nor did they know what had happened. They only felt a mighty demonic energy crushing down on them. Then, a middle-aged man in a blood-red robe appeared before them.","This middle-aged man had an imposing aura. His body emitted a faint bloody aura as if he had just returned from a battlefield.","“Isn’t that the sect leader of the Blood Demon Sect?”","Someone recognized the person who had come, and many people immediately fell silent out of fear as they recalled the legends of the Blood Demon Sect. It was said that the Blood Demon Sect leader had a mysterious background. No one knew where he came from. He just suddenly appeared at the border and killed countless enemies. After that, he established the Blood Demon Sect, which became one of the fiercest sects in the area.","In terms of strength, the Blood Demon Sect leader could not be considered top-notch, but in terms of fierceness, he was truly terrifying. Countless elite disciples of the righteous sects had died at his hands. Most importantly, it was rumored that he had entered the Cosmos Stage a long time ago.","What did a Cosmic mean? It could be said that he could escape unscathed from the siege of tens of thousands of soldiers single-handedly. Even among the behemoths of the top ten sects, Cosmics were high and mighty. They were either true disciples or elders.","“Why is the Blood Demon Sect leader here?”","Many people’s expressions changed. They didn’t know about the trap, but they felt like the end of the world was coming. The Blood Demon Sect leader had always been vicious. If he was in a bad mood, none of them could escape.","“Chu Yunfan, do you still think you can escape today?” Master Wang laughed out loud. Since the Blood Demon Sect leader was here, today was the day Chu Yunfan died. Even if there were 100 Chu Yunfans, he would still not be a match for the Cosmic Blood Demon Sect leader.","Moreover, the Blood Demon Sect leader was a top-notch expert who had entered the Cosmos Stage a long time ago. Even the true disciples of the ordinary top ten sects might not be his match.","“So this is your trump card!” Chu Yunfan sneered at the Blood Demon Sect leader and said, “Yuan Tianhua, your name is among the top of those wanted by Grand Xia. Instead of hiding away, you dare to appear in the territory of Grand Xia. You are really courting death. Don’t even think about leaving today. I will kill you as well.”","“What a sharp-tongued brat. I’d love to see who won’t escape today!” Yuan Tianhua laughed sinisterly and suddenly attacked.","A huge bloody palm slammed down on Chu Yunfan, almost shattering the world.","“Senior Yi, if you don’t attack now, when will you?”","Chu Yunfan was not afraid at all. Instead, he shouted loudly.","Just as he finished speaking, a big red ball fell from the sky.","Bam!","The blood-red palm print was shattered by the big red ball."]},{"number":1737,"title":"Chapter 1737 The Final Explosion, Killing in One Strike","paragraphs":["1737 The Final Explosion, Killing in One Strike","All of this happened too quickly. In just an instant, the big red embroidered ball swept down and shattered the red hand.","A beautiful woman dressed in white and holding a red embroidered ball descended like a goddess from the sky. Yuan Tianhua immediately felt threatened by her. She was also a Cosmic.","Coupled with the fact that Chu Yunfan had called her “senior” just now, the identity of the person who had come was obvious. She was a true disciple of the Flying Celestials. Only true disciples could have such strength.","Against the true disciples of the Flying Celestials, Yuan Tianhua had to be wary. Although his cultivation was slightly stronger than the true disciples of the ten great sects, it did not mean that he could definitely defeat the true disciples of the ten great sects.","He was just an itinerant cultivator who had a fortuitous encounter and accidentally broke through to the Cosmos Stage. Later on, he founded the Blood Demon Sect, which was not considered a big sect. In terms of inheritance, it was not worth mentioning.","However, the true disciples of these ten great sects were different. Each of them had an eye-catching inheritance, and each of their strength was extraordinary. At the same level, two or three itinerant cultivators would not be able to defeat these orthodox disciples. Even though he had the advantage in strength now, he did not dare to underestimate the person who came.","At this moment, everyone was stunned. Another Cosmic had appeared. For a small border city like Baotai, Cosmics were legendary experts who were rarely seen. Now that two of them had appeared in one breath, many people felt the air in their lungs freeze over.","Both sides began to reveal their trump cards. There was no doubt that both sides had hidden Cosmics as their trump cards. This made the faces of Master Wang, Fusion’s leader, and Skyreach’s leader turn ugly. They thought they would come out on top, but they did not expect Chu Yunfan to have such a trump card. He too had invited a Cosmic.","The balance between the two sides was pulled back to the same level. Even if they had a slight advantage, it was not as big as before.","“Blood Demon Sect. You dare to attack a disciple of my sect?” Yi Yunyao sneered.","Yuan Tianhua’s eyes were filled with cold killing intent. He could not let this matter rest. If the Flying Celestials took revenge on him after this, what would happen?","“Then we’ll have to see if you have the ability.” he laughed sinisterly. He looked at Yi Yunyao with a hint of lust in his eyes and said, “It just so happens that I lack a bed-warming maid. I think you’d be very suitable.”","Yi Yunyao’s brows furrowed slightly as a cold killing intent flashed through her eyes. “Chu Yunfan, I’ll kill him. You kill the others. These people colluded with an evil cult. They deserve to die!”","In Grand Xia, all the evil and demonic sects were labeled as heretical. These were sects that were not tolerated by the empire, and anyone who dared to collude with these sects would be sentenced to death.","This was especially so for the ten great sects. It was a life-or-death situation. To Grand Xia, it didn’t matter who they worked with. However, to the ten great sects, it was a battle of orthodoxy. Whether it was the Dao or the Devil, it was a single choice.","Even a woman like Yi Yunyao had experienced intense battles and slaughtered her way through mountains of corpses and seas of blood. On this issue, she was even more firm and unwavering.","“Hahaha, is this your trump card? I’m afraid it won’t work.” Chu Yunfan laughed.","These people wanted to collude with the Blood Demon Sect leader to deal with him, but they did not know that he had invited Yi Yunyao. The moment he figured out that this banquet was a trap, Chu Yunfan already had a plan. Even if he didn’t know, it was impossible for these people to kill him. Even Li Qianyuan couldn’t stop him, let alone a mere sect leader. He naturally had ways.","However, if he declined the banquet, his idea of capturing all the major factions in one fell swoop would be in vain. In the end, he decided to invite Yi Yunyao. Of course, as a price, he had given Yi Yunyao a martial art that was recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Although this martial art wasn’t the most eye-catching in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, it was still a king-level martial art in the outside world.","It was a martial art created by a former king. If it was placed in the Grand Xia Imperial Court, it would be a peerless martial art that only core royals could learn. If the technique spread, many people would fight over it.","Yi Yunyao immediately agreed to help. She traveled day and night and arrived at Baotai. However, she had been hiding in the dark and did not show herself. That was why Chu Yunfan had swaggered to the meeting alone. No matter what the other party did, he was fearless with Yi Yunyao supporting him.","The faces of the major leaders were extremely ugly. They did not expect that they would spend so much effort to let Chu Yunfan fall into their trap. However, it seemed that they had fallen into his trap, not the other way around.","“Go! Kill Chu Yunfan and all the danger will naturally be gone!” Master Wang roared.","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. A pair of thunder wings appeared on his back. His speed was so fast that he was like a bolt of lightning. In an instant, he had arrived in front of Master Wang.","In an instant, the Eight Astonishing Fists exploded. Eight groups of heavenly dragons appeared behind Chu Yunfan, and they transformed into huge mountains and rushed toward Master Wang.","Bam!","Master Wang grunted. He was slammed hard and he instantly flew out like a kite with a broken string. However, before he could land on the ground, he saw Chu Yunfan sweep out a sword light with lightning speed.","It was the Divinity Slicer.","The sword slashed down from the sky and cut Master Wang’s head in half.","Slice!","His head was cut into two, and blood splattered through the air."]},{"number":1738,"title":"Chapter 1738 Compared to Me, You’re Still Too Small","paragraphs":["1738 Compared to Me, You’re Still Too Small","It was just a simple sword strike, but it had instantly taken out Master Wang.","At this moment, Fusion and Skyreach’s leaders were shocked. Chu Yunfan’s reaction was too fast, and his combat strength was too terrifying.","Chu Yunfan and Master Wang’s cultivation was about the same, around the late Abstract Interpretation Stage. Even among the elite disciples of large sects, Master Wang was considered an expert. Who knew that when he faced Chu Yunfan, he could not withstand a single blow? In almost an instant, he was killed by Chu Yunfan. This made the two sect leaders feel extremely shocked.","When Chu Yunfan had killed Master Ding, they had not been present. They had only heard their spies’ report. At that time, they did not know that Chu Yunfan was so powerful. Experts like them were considered top-notch experts in Baotai. Even the previous garrison leaders were no match for them.","But Chu Yunfan was different!","This was completely different from what the intelligence had gathered. According to the information, Chu Yunfan had just become an elite disciple of the Flying Celestials. His cultivation should not even be at the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan could be so strong? It was practically a sweep!","They had never encountered such a terrifying garrison leader before.","“Elders, attack!” Fusion’s leader roared.","In the air, two figures appeared. These two people were exactly the same as Yuan Tianhua. Both of them had monstrous blood energy on their bodies. It was unknown how many people they had killed and what evil demonic techniques they had cultivated to create such a terrifying scene.","One of them was a middle-aged man with a cruel smile on his face, while the other was a skinny old man with a sinister expression. The two of them wore blood-red robes. They looked as if they had crawled out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","As soon as the two of them appeared, they released a terrifying aura and crushed Chu Yunfan in an overwhelming manner. It was as if they wanted to crush him to death.","“You want to suppress me with this level of aura? You think you can compete with me in killing people?” Chu Yunfan sneered and released his aura as well.","A powerful aura instantly broke through the aura of the Blood Demon Sect elders and transformed into a battlefield. Chu Yunfan’s killing intent was no longer hidden. This was his true strength, his true aura.","Everyone was stunned. The killing intent in Chu Yunfan’s aura was even more shocking than the elders of the Blood Demon Sect. Through this killing intent, they could even sense that it was a huge battlefield. Countless people had died, mountains of corpses and seas of blood. The roars of countless dead people rushed into their minds. Those who were slightly weaker instantly felt their faces turn pale, and their minds suffered a huge impact.","“He...He’s not a good person. How many people had he...” Fusion’s leader was scared to death. He could not imagine how many people Chu Yunfan had killed to have such a shocking killing intent.","This killing intent alone could drive ordinary people crazy when they approached. Compared to Chu Yunfan’s killing intent, which was like a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood, the killing intent released by the elders of the Blood Demon Sect was nothing. It was simply insignificant.","Even the elders of the Blood Demon Sect turned pale. Even they were affected by this aura. They had killed people like crushing paper cups. The number of people who had died in their hands was at least 100,000. However, compared to Chu Yunfan’s killing intent, this number paled in comparison.","According to the evolution of Chu Yunfan’s aura, he had killed at least tens of millions, or even hundreds of millions of people. They didn’t dare to imagine how Chu Yunfan had killed so many people. Under normal circumstances, if he killed more than 100,000 people, Grand Xia would be alerted immediately. Just like Gu Xingzi, he would be pursued by countless people.","Not to mention killing tens of millions of people. That was a huge number. Even if Grand Xia was in charge of the army, the supreme Grand Marshal, it was impossible for him to kill so many people in his lifetime.","“Compared to me, you guys are still small.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","These were all influencing Chu Yunfan subtly. It was just that he usually suppressed them and would not release them. Once they were released, no one in Grand Xia could compare to him.","The elders of the Blood Demon Sect looked at each other and immediately became angry. They both thought that Chu Yunfan was humiliating them. In an instant, the two of them released their most terrifying auras. Both of them were at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage. In the Blood Demon Sect, they were only second to Yuan Tianhua and were ranked as the left and right elders.","“Chu Yunfan is finally going to die!”","Fusion and Skyreach’s leader looked at each other and heaved a sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan was finally going to die. The pressure he gave them was so great that they almost couldn’t breathe.","However, judging from Chu Yunfan’s strength earlier, he was probably still a little weaker than a peak Interpreter, let alone two peak Interpreters joining forces.","This time, Chu Yunfan couldn’t escape!","“Good timing. I’ll kill all of you and claim the reward.”","Chu Yunfan was not afraid in the slightest and just laughed. In an instant, golden hair grew on his body and he transformed into a hou.","“Rrrraaaggh!”","The hou let out a loud roar, and its mountain-like body appeared, shaking the entire area. All the guests inside and outside the venue were dumbfounded.","First, the two Cosmics fought in the sky without a word. Immediately after, another extremely terrifying behemoth appeared at the banquet.","“Wh-What is that thing?”","Everyone felt a ferocious aura that seemed to come from the primordial era crushing their hearts."]},{"number":1739,"title":"Chapter 1739 Killing Two Peak Interpreters Consecutively","paragraphs":["1739 Killing Two Peak Interpreters Consecutively","It was as if a prehistoric beast had woken up from a long slumber. The oppressive feeling that came from the bloodline even made some people with weaker cultivation lay the ground. That terrifying and fierce aura made people feel terrified.","This was especially so when this kind of demon had other forces. It was impossible for any demon to sneak into the Flying Celestials. That was simply impossible. This was a powerful divine power that could transform one into an ancient ferocious beast and obtain a portion of the ancient ferocious beast’s ability.","Fusion’s leader had only heard of this technique as a legend by chance. He had never expected to see it here. He didn’t know that Chu Yunfan knew this technique. He felt that the Flying Celestials was worthy of being one of the top ten sects in the world. The depth of their heritage was not something that ordinary people could imagine.","However, after Chu Yunfan transformed into a hou, the terrifying aura he released was obvious. In an instant, it swept across everything. Even the elders of the Blood Demon Sect who were about to attack were sent flying by the ferocious aura released by Chu Yunfan.","“Kill this beast!” the left elder roared.","A hammer appeared in his hand. The huge copper hammer swelled up. In an instant, it burst out with a burst of light and then smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s hou opened its huge claws and hit the hammer.","Clang!","With a sound that sounded like metal clashing, the left elder felt his hand go numb. Then, a terrifying force swept over and almost sent him flying.","Spurt!","However, this power was like a wave, stacking up layer by layer. Finally, he could not hold back from spitting out a mouthful of blood. When he looked at Chu Yunfan’s huge body again, he was dumbfounded as if he had seen a ghost. How could someone be so powerful?!","After transforming into a beast, Chu Yunfan’s strength had risen to a whole new level, a level that made everyone feel extremely terrified. As someone at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he was actually blasted to the point of vomiting blood by a single strike.","“You b*stard! Go to hell!” the right elder roared angrily.","A blood-colored saber light slashed out from his hand. It slashed down, turning into countless crying sounds. It was the miserable cries of the malicious ghosts. The light went for Chu Yunfan and landed on him.","Bam!","It was as if the blade had struck a large piece of metal. It could not do anything to Chu Yufan.","“Impossible!” The right-hand elder was dumbfounded. He couldn’t believe that his deliberate attack couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan and shattered in an instant.","Chu Yunfan’s physical body had truly reached a shocking level. Even if it was his original body, he could destroy a supreme-grade hallowed weapon with his bare hands. After transforming into the hou, the defensive power of his body did not decrease. It even rose to a whole new level. An attack of this level was just a tickle to him.","“You guys have already used your full strength, but I haven’t. It’s my turn next!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He made his move, and his huge body brought a gust of wind. In the blink of an eye, he arrived in front of the left elder. The huge claw slapped down at the left elder with a thunderous force.","Bam!","Boom!","The left elder crashed into the ground, smashing a huge hole in the banquet hall. After twitching a few times, he died.","He was killed by Chu Yunfan’s claw swipe.","Everyone was scared silly. The scene was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop. At the banquet, everyone had a dumbfounded expression. Even the most imaginative person among them could not imagine what kind of scene it would be if a peak Interpreter could not even block Chu Yunfan’s claw.","Was Chu Yunfan’s strength really that terrifying? Was this divine ability really so shocking?","“Sh*t! Run!”","The right elder came to his senses. When he saw Chu Yunfan kill the left elder, he was scared out of his wits. How could he dare to stay? He quickly turned into a bloody light and tried to escape from Chu Yunfan.","“Trying to leave? Will you make it in time?”","Chu Yunfan opened his jaws and spat out a terrifying flame. The fire of the drought demon was able to create a terrifying flame that could burn a thousand miles of barren land. At this moment, it displayed its terrifying power!","In an instant, it swept across the sky and swept toward the right elder.","“Aaaahhhh!”","The right elder screamed as he was instantly swallowed by the terrifying flames. He tried to use the divine power in his body to resist, but he was unable to.","In an instant, the right elder was ignited, and his entire body burned fiercely. In an instant, he was burned into a pile of black charcoal and fell to the ground.","He died instantly!","Another elite warrior at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands!","In the air, Chu Yunfan had already returned to his human form. His combat strength would undergo a drastic change when he transformed into a hou, but the consumption of his physical strength and divine power would also reach a peak.","Therefore, even he could not maintain his hou form for a long time.","However, this was enough. In just a moment, he had killed two peak Interpreters. One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan was now."]},{"number":1740,"title":"Chapter 1740 Complete Annihilation, Exterminating Everything","paragraphs":["1740 Complete Annihilation, Exterminating Everything","Compared to his first transformation, Chu Yunfan was more than ten times stronger. His cultivation had undergone a world-shaking change.","When Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over, Fusion and Skyreach’s leader felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave. They instantly felt incomparably cold. They were absolutely regretful. One had to know that before this, they would never have thought that the final outcome would be like this.","Their plan was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan. The helpers they invited were useless. Today’s banquet was indeed a trap, but it was not targeted at Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, it was targeted at them.","Chu Yunfan pointed the Divinity Slice at the sect leaders and said, “It’s your turn next.”","“Colonel Chu, we’re willing to surrender. From now on, we’ll follow your lead and go through fire and water without hesitation!” Fusion’s leader quickly said.","His first reaction was to admit defeat when faced with Chu Yunfan, who was almost invincible. He no longer had the high-spirited look from before, where he thought nothing of Chu Yunfan.","At that time, he had victory in his hands. However, now, he had no chance of winning. Unless he could drag it out until the Blood Demon Sect leader defeated Yi Yunyao and returned, he would not have a chance of turning the tables. Before that, he could not die no matter what.","“It’s too late to surrender now.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He had no intention of letting go of these people who had plotted against him. Apart from Master Xu, everyone present had participated in the plot against him. He had long received detailed information from Master Xu.","Now was the perfect time to take care of everything. If these people wanted to live, they still had something to rely on him. On the contrary, he had nothing to rely on them for.","“Mountain Wrap Seal!”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan made a hand seal. Countless spirit energy gathered in the air and condensed into a small mountain. The small mountain became more and more solid. It looked like a real mountain.","Boom!","The mountain crashed down. Although it was condensed from spirit energy, it weighed more than a thousand pounds and instantly hit Fusion’s leader.","Bam!","Fusion’s leader was furious. Chu Yunfan did not give him any chance to delay. He wanted to resist, but all kinds of attacks landed on the Mountain Wrap Seal. However, how could he stop Chu Yunfan’s speed?","In just an instant, the mountain hit his body, and his head exploded like a watermelon.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve gone too far!”","Seeing this, Skyreach’s leader was furious. Looking at Chu Yunfan’s appearance, it was impossible for him to let them go, and he was not willing to give them a way out.","The Skyreach’s leader was no longer wearing a long robe. It had transformed into an armor. He was like a golden-armored general. He held a treasure saber in his hand and instantly pounced over. Chu Yunfan wouldn’t let him go anyway, so he might as well go all out.","A saber light slashed down from the sky, splitting the air into two halves. Like a tidal wave, it spread in all directions. But then, a shocking scene happened. Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the saber light and grabbed it with his bare hand.","Chu Yunfan tore the saber light into pieces. When it dissipated, it was the treasured saber in the hands of Skyreach’s leader that had been torn into pieces by Chu Yunfan.","“Go!” Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and the fragments of the saber light flew toward Skyreach’s leader.","“Sh*t!”","Skyreach’s leader reacted immediately. He knew that things were not good and repeatedly formed seals to form a defensive barrier in front of him. However, this defensive barrier was useless in front of these saber light fragments. It was easily torn apart like paper.","Swish!","The saber light fragments easily tore through the defensive barrier, tore through the golden armor, and pierced through Skyreach’s leader.","“I can’t believe I’m going to die like this!”","Skyreach’s leader screamed in pain. His eyes were wide open as he collapsed. On his head, there was a saber light fragment that had minced his brain.","After killing Fusion and Skyreach’s leader in succession, the remaining leaders of the small forces finally reacted. It was not that their reactions were too slow, but Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. In just an instant, he had already killed these powerful enemies as if they were cutting melons and vegetables.","They fled in all directions, trying to escape. The hall had long become a hell in their eyes.","“Trying to leave? Blossom Storm!”","Of course, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t give them a chance to escape. He waved his hand, and the Divinity Slicer flew up into the sky. It spun in the air and released countless sword lights, shooting out in all directions like a storm.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The leaders could not escape. They were stabbed by these sword lights and exploded, turning into a rain of blood that filled the sky. The entire venue was stained with blood. At this moment, the only person who was still alive, other than Chu Yunfan, was the head of the Xu clan.","Master Xu’s face was pale, and his back was a little cold. It was as if he had been fished out of an ice cave. Although he had known that Chu Yunfan was very strong and had the intention of relying on him, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so powerful.","Regardless of whether it was the four major forces in the city or the left and right elders of the Blood Demon Sect, they were killed as easily as chopping melons and vegetables.","What a shocking scene!","However, Master Xu revealed a pleasantly surprised expression. These forces would be uprooted by Chu Yunfan, and his clan would also take advantage of the situation to rise and become the number one figure in the city.","All this was brought about by this man who was as powerful as a demon god."]},{"number":1741,"title":"Chapter 1741 Blood Demon Sect’s Leader? Knocked Out by a Cauldron!","paragraphs":["1741 Blood Demon Sect’s Leader? Knocked Out by a Cauldron!","Without Chu Yunfan’s arrival, the situation of Baotai would never have changed. The five major forces had deep foundations. Unless there was a major opportunity, it was impossible for small forces to overtake them.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was such an opportunity, so when Master Xu realized it, he made this decision immediately. This was also a gamble with his entire clan. If Chu Yunfan was defeated, then the Xu clan might face a catastrophe. After all, no matter how clean he was, as long as the major forces wanted to investigate, they could still find out that there was a mole between them. Under such circumstances, he was also very nervous as he welcomed today’s banquet.","This battle was full of twists and turns, at least for him. Seeing Chu Yunfan go to the battle alone without any preparation, even he was shocked. He even began to regret it. Wasn’t this Chu Yunfan a little too fierce? Would the Xu clan really have a way out by following such a person?","However, what happened next completely proved that he was wrong. Chu Yunfan wasn’t too fierce. On the contrary, he was bold. With absolute strength and absolute confidence, this was naturally possible.","Even now, Master Xu was still in a state of shock. It seemed that he could not accept how Chu Yunfan had easily killed all the big shots he had looked up to.","“Congratulations on wiping out the rebellion, Colonel Chu!”","After being stunned for a moment, the head of the Xu clan quickly stepped forward and bowed.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Master Xu and said, “You’ve done well. You didn’t betray me.”","“I wouldn’t dare, sir.”","Master Xu suddenly felt a cold sweat on his back. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so intimidating, but when he thought of how Chu Yunfan had killed those experts like chopping melons and vegetables, he suddenly broke out in cold sweat.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Master Xu. He said, “Don’t be nervous. I’m not someone who likes to kill.”","Master Xu was speechless. If he hadn’t seen Chu Yunfan’s great display of power today, he might have believed such words. But after seeing how Chu Yunfan killed, how could he still believe such nonsense?","“Now that the leaders of the rebels have been killed, all that’s left is to encircle and annihilate the various large factions. I’ve already given the order to close the city gates and open the barrier,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly as if he wasn’t the one who had started the massacre like a demon.","“However, I still need the cooperation of the Xu clan. Remember not to let any of them escape. I won’t care if they do. To me, they are just a group of clowns, but to your clan, they may be a disaster.”","When Master Xu heard this, he was instantly shocked and quickly said, “I understand and will do my best. Now that all the elites of my clan have come out to cooperate with you to eliminate the rebels, they will definitely not let these rebels have a place to hide.”","After hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Master Xu did not dare to let his guard down. Indeed, Chu Yunfan did not care about any fish that escaped. Even if the elites of the four families gathered, he could kill them all single-handedly.","However, for the Xu clan, it would be a disaster. Since he had already done it, he would completely exterminate the few major factions. Thinking of this, Master Xu had made up his mind.","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. With the cooperation of the Xu clan, the number of fish that escaped the net would be greatly reduced. From now on, he could truly have the final say in Baotai.","With the destruction of the five major factions, the other small factions that followed the five major factions were also destroyed. In Baotai, only small factions like the Xu clan that had joined Chu Yunfan or some neutral factions were left. They could not compete with the garrison army. They were completely on a different level.","“Go and prepare. Today, I will capture all these traitors.” Chu Yunfan waved and asked Master Xu to mobilize the Xu clan’s forces to cooperate with the garrison’s attack.","At this moment, a burst of shouting came from outside. It was You Chuyun who had received Chu Yunfan’s notice and led the garrison troops to attack. Now that the leaders of the various large factions had been killed, how could they organize a resistance? They were defeated and forced to retreat. The remaining people were not a match for You Chuyun and the army.","Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. His eyes were deep as he looked at the sky. At this moment, the battle up in the sky had already concluded. Yi Yunyao’s embroidered ball kept bouncing around. It looked light, but every move was heavy. It was as if a mountain was falling. It was extremely terrifying.","The ball continuously bombarded the Blood Demon Sect leader. Blood waves surged around the sect leader. Countless blood formed a blood wave that covered the sky, causing people to feel terrified.","The sect leader’s cultivation was even above Yi Yunyao’s. He was a veteran Cosmic, but Yi Yunyao was not afraid. She continuously emitted a strong light, like a fairy in the sky.","“Hahahaha! So what if you’re a true disciple of the Flying Celestials? Come back with me and warm my bed!” The sect leader laughed strangely as countless waves of blood surged toward Yi Yunyao.","Her nose wrinkled slightly as killing intent burst out from her eyes. Suddenly, a mirror rose up behind her. The mirror was simple and unadorned, with complex arrays and enchantments carved on it.","As soon as she attacked, a strong light swept out. The blood wave that was illuminated by this strong light was captured. The light emitted by this mirror became stronger and stronger. It was as dazzling as a sun. The light tore through the night and destroyed all the filth under the night.","A terrifying beam of light was released from the ancient mirror. It swept across and pierced through the blood wave, hitting the sect leader.","Bam!","The sect leader was struck, leaving him screaming in pain. His entire body was sent flying like a kite with a broken string. All his defensive measures and the blood waves were completely useless in front of this pillar of light. They were pierced through. It was truly terrifying to the extreme.","The sect leader’s eyes revealed a look of shock. He could not believe that Yi Yunyao had such a tool that could completely restrain him.","‘I have to get out of here!’","How could he dare to stay any longer? He hurriedly turned into a red light and tried to escape. However, at this critical moment, an incomparably huge medicinal cauldron appeared out of thin air. It swelled up with the wind and smashed down.","Bam!","The dignified Blood Demon Sect leader was directly hit. His body crashed to the ground like a meteor, and it was unknown whether he was dead or alive."]},{"number":1742,"title":"Chapter 1742 Killing Yuan Tianhua, Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1742 Killing Yuan Tianhua, Everyone Was Shocked","The cauldron swelled up and smashed into Yuan Tianhua. He realized that he had no way of breaking the cauldron. Even with his cultivation, he was still hit head-on without being able to fight back.","The cauldron weighed more than a thousand pounds. Under the circumstances where Yuan Tianhua was already heavily injured, it injured him even further and slammed him to the ground.","All of this happened too quickly and too suddenly. Yuan Tianhua did not expect another attack to suddenly appear. He was fully focused on guarding against Yi Yunyao’s possible surprise attack, and the angle of the attack this time was too tricky. He did not expect it at all. Most importantly, he had never expected that someone would dare to attack a Cosmic.","“Aaaagggghhh!”","Yuan Tianhua roared furiously as he struggled to get up. He wanted to see who had ambushed him but the only thing he saw was a figure holding a cauldron and smashing it down. It was as if he was holding a small mountain and smashing it onto him.","Bam!","With a loud explosion, Yuan Tianhua’s head was smashed into the ground. Even though he was a Cosmic that had undergone a complete transformation and his physical cultivation had reached an extremely terrifying realm, he still felt dizzy after being smashed by the cauldron. His entire head was almost smashed into pieces. However, the attack this time was just a mere observation. Whenever he struggled to get up, the cauldron smashed down again.","He kept struggling, but he was constantly smashed to the ground by the cauldron. His divine power was unable to condense and was smashed by the cauldron. One had to know that with his cultivation, even if he was directly attacked by a supreme-grade spirit weapon, it would be very difficult to cause direct damage to him.","However, when faced with this cauldron, he did not have the strength to fight back at all. It was as if there was some array or barrier carved on this cauldron that could continuously disperse his divine power.","Gradually, Yuan Tianhua lost consciousness and became motionless. The Blood Demon Sect leader was dead!","Everyone in the banquet hall was silent. Everyone was dumbfounded. What had they just seen?","Yuan Tianhua, a notorious figure in the border area, was smashed to death.","And the person holding the cauldron was none other than Chu Yunfan!","Most of the banquet attendees outside the hall didn’t know that this banquet was a trap, but those who knew revealed extreme fear. It was even a feeling of fear that reached deep into their bones.","Chu Yunfan had started a massacre and killed the leaders of the Chen clan, the Wang clan, Fusion, and Skyreach. Even the leaders of the other small forces that were dependent on these four forces could not escape death.","Their only hope was for Yuan Tianhua to defeat or even kill Yi Yunyao, and then kill Chu Yunfan. That way, they would still have a chance to turn the tables. But now, they saw Chu Yunfan smashing Yuan Tianhua into the floor of the banquet hall. They were almost scared to death.","Every time Chu Yunfan smashed down with the Moutain River Cauldron, he lifted it as if it were light. It looked as if it was as light as a feather. Every time he smashed down, the entire banquet hall shook. That terrifying power was imprinted in their minds. Even now, they still felt that it was completely unbelievable as if they had seen a ghost.","It was a terrifying force!","After confirming that Yuan Tianhua was dead, the cauldron floating above Chu Yunfan’s head spun and became smaller and smaller. In a moment, it entered his body. Then, Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and transformed it into a large energy hand. He grabbed Yuan Tianhua’s corpse and placed it into his Mountain River Diagram.","A hint of joy appeared on his face. Killing a Cosmic was not enough to make him ecstatic, although it was an incredible feat in the eyes of ordinary people. For Chu Yunfan, even against Li Qianyuan, he did not surrender. Instead, he took the opportunity to seriously injure Li Qianyuan. He had even killed Lone Star.","Yuan Tianhua’s strength was far above Lone Star’s. Although Lone Star had been severely injured at that time and his strength had long fallen to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, Chu Yunfan could tell that even if Lone Star had recovered to his peak, he was still not a match for Yuan Tianhua.","This was a great harvest. With Yuan Tianhua’s blood, it was enough for the Brahma Tree to bear another fruit. Of course, a large amount of spirit energy was needed to water the Brahma Tree for it to bear fruit faster. However, this was not a problem for Chu Yunfan.","This gave him a chance to quickly improve his strength. If he could quickly break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he could even fight against a Cosmic. Even when facing Wang Yifan, he wouldn’t show any fear.","Yi Yunyao watched Chu Yunfan’s actions but did not stop him. This was part of the deal. She had come to help Chu Yunfan kill Yuan Tianhua and the gains were for Chu Yunfan to keep. It seemed unfair to her, but only she knew that she had made a killing.","A king-level martial art was considered a supreme skill even in the Flying Celestials. Ordinary people had no chance to learn it. Even a core disciple like her, who was valued by the Flying Celestials and nurtured with great importance, had to make a lot of contributions to get this technique.","Yi Yunyao didn’t know how long that process would take, but now Chu Yunfan had given her a king-level martial art. It was a supreme technique created by a king. With such a technique, her battle strength would undergo an earth-shattering change. She was able to compete with Yuan Tianhua and not fall into a disadvantage because of this technique.","However, she still looked at Chu Yunfan with a bit of shock in her eyes. It had only been a short time, but Chu Yunfan was at least several times stronger than he was during the inner disciple competition. His improvement speed was like a rocket. Even she was amazed when she saw it.","And then there was the hou form and the cauldron that could attack and defend at the same time. Each of them was shocking and had a great origin. It was clear that Chu Yunfan had more than one inheritance on him. It was unknown where he had obtained them. It seemed to be inconsistent with the speculation that he had obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","However, Yi Yunyao didn’t pursue the matter. After all, she had many secrets. The ancient mirror that severely injured Yuan Tianhua was one of her trump cards. No one knew about it."]},{"number":1743,"title":"Chapter 1743 I Look Forward to Your Battle With Wang Yifan","paragraphs":["1743 I Look Forward to Your Battle With Wang Yifan","For those who could cultivate to her level, none of them had followed the sect’s cultivation method step by step. Everyone had many inheritances and many fortuitous encounters. Otherwise, they would not have such a shocking cultivation at such a young age.","Sects and forces that had king techniques like this would treat them like treasures. If one wasn’t a direct descendant, they wouldn’t be able to learn it without going through many trials and tests.","However, Chu Yunfan took it out without a care. This made her a little confused. Did Chu Yunfan really not know the value of this ultimate art, was he that ambitious, or was he unscrupulous in order to achieve great things?","She would never know that Chu Yunfan had a copy of the Mighty Emperor Battle Book in his mind. There were countless techniques recorded in it, and king martial arts were nothing. There were many more martial arts at the emperor level!","Just as Yi Yunyao was lost in her thoughts, Chu Yunfan flew up to her and said, “Thank you for your help, Senior Yi. If it weren’t for you, the consequences would be unimaginable. These people dared to collude with a demonic sect. Their crimes are simply unforgivable.”","“It was nothing. Just a piece of cake.”","Of course, Yi Yunyao would not take credit. She had originally thought highly of Chu Yunfan and wanted to rope him in. But now, she had completely extinguished such thoughts. She knew that it was impossible.","If it was just an ordinary elite or genius, they would definitely be willing to join her, but Chu Yunfan seemed to be born to not be inferior to others. If such a person was forced to join a force, it would only offend him, and that would be the real loss.","Yi Yunyao didn’t know when it started, but she had already started to look at Chu Yunfan in a new light. She no longer treated him as a simple elite disciple. In her heart, she did not think that Chu Yunfan would have any difficulty in becoming a true disciple in the future. Even Wang Yifan would find it difficult to stop Chu Yunfan. Perhaps only Li Qianyuan had the chance to stop Chu Yunfan.","“These people colluded with a demonic sect and went against Grand Xia’s Imperial Court. We have to uproot them as a warning to others,” Yi Yunyao said straightforwardly.","She would not be soft-hearted in this aspect either. She too was a member of the Imperial Court’s Ministry of War. She was an awe-inspiring female general, and in terms of official position, she was even higher than Chu Yunfan. She was a true general.","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","These local forces were lawless and colluded with evil for their own selfish reasons. The death of the previous garrison leaders was probably related to them. Now that Chu Yunfan had uprooted the five major forces of Baotai, it would probably cause some criticism. The more crimes convicted and the more evidence found, the more those people would have nothing to say.","“When the time comes, I will report to the Imperial Court. You don’t have to worry. Wang Yifan won’t be able to change the narrative,” Yi Yunyao said in high spirits.","Her cultivation level was already above Wang Yifan, and now that she had received a king martial art from Chu Yunfan, Wang Yifan was nothing. As long as she was given some time to comprehend, the Wang Yifan who could suppress and compete with her back then would be easily killed by her. A king martial art was just that awesome.","“But you should be careful of Li Qianyuan. I’ve heard some things about him. Although he’s supposed to be the noble Marquis Huntian, he’s not a broad-minded person. Since you have offended him, you have to be careful of his underhanded methods.” Yi Yunyao decided to advise Chu Yunfan after some thought.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He had never let down his guard against Li Qianyuan. He knew Li Qianyuan’s strength and power. This time, the Ding clan had targeted him, and it was Li Qianyuan who had instigated it.","However, Li Qianyuan probably didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so decisive and kill the Ding clan. His plan was completely ruined by Chu Yunfan before it could work. Chu Yunfan had even stolen the thousand-year-old blood ginseng. It could be said that Li Qianyuan had suffered a double loss.","However, this did not mean that he would give up. After this series of events, he would quickly adjust his evaluation of his strength. At that time, there would be a more powerful attack.","“I know, but I’m not too worried about him. He just started cultivating earlier than me. I can crush him with one finger if he were at the same level as me,” Chu Yunfan said smilingly.","“I can see that you chose to join the Flying Celestials because of Li Qianyuan. I have to say that this is a very smart decision. With the sect’s protection, even if he wants to target you, he can only attack within the rules. However, if you’re alone and he has the intention to kill you, you will not be able to escape.”","Of course, he knew that a person like Li Qianyuan would be a hero in troubled times. This kind of person would naturally not follow the rules. However, now that Chu Yunfan was using the Flying Celestials as cover, Li Qianyuan could not act recklessly. Otherwise, he would not have bribed the Ding clan to target Chu Yunfan but personally come to attack him.","What Chu Yunfan lacked the most now was time. As long as he had time, his strength would increase rapidly. It would not be long before he could be on equal footing with Li Qianyuan. There was no need to be afraid of him.","“No matter what, I owe you a favor. Although I helped you kill Yuan Tianhua, it can’t compare to the king martial arts you gave me. I’ll hold Wang Yifan back, so don’t worry about him,” Yi Yunyao said, “I should head back and start comprehending the martial arts. With this king martial arts, not only will my combat strength increase, but my cultivation level will also increase greatly. The rest is up to you. I look forward to your battle with Wang Yifan.”","“Take care, Senior Yi.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Yi Yunyao nodded and turned into a beam of light, disappearing from Baotai."]},{"number":1744,"title":"Chapter 1744 Getting Rich","paragraphs":["1744 Getting Rich","After sending Yi Yunyao off, all that was left was to clean up the mess.","The leaders of the various families had been captured by Chu Yunfan. He had also killed the leader and elders of the Blood Demon Sect. The remaining people had long since become useless. It didn’t take long for the Chen clan’s ancestral land to be broken through by You Chuyun’s troops.","As for the remaining disciples of the Wang clan, Fusion, Skyreach, and the other factions, they either fled or hid. Even if they wanted to resist, they had no ability to do so.","After a series of manhunts, the main members were all captured. Chu Yunfan didn’t show any mercy to the members of these forces because he knew that this was a matter of life and death, and it was not something that could be held back. Although many of these forces were considered branch members and did not have deep connections, it was better to cry along the way than to cry alone. Those who achieved great things had to make sacrifices. Moreover, these people had also obtained a lot of benefits from relying on these forces, so they could not be considered completely innocent.","Carriages of gold, silver, treasures, medicinal herbs, and all kinds of priceless items were transported into Baotai’s military camp. Chu Yunfan had completely taken control of the city. At this moment, no one in Baotai dared to oppose him. They could only watch helplessly as he uprooted all the forces in Baotai.","During this process, besides Chu Yunfan quickly taking over all kinds of affairs in Baotai, the Xu clan also took advantage of the situation to rise up. Apart from gold, silver, treasures, herbs, and various materials, the wealth of the various large factions also included many shops, fields, and so on.","Chu Yunfan didn’t need these things. Just as Master Xu had thought, Baotai was undoubtedly a footnote in Chu Yunfan’s life. It was impossible for him to take root here. Therefore, these things were meaningless to him and he quickly decided to sell them all.","In the colonel’s office of the camp, You Chuyun was reporting to Chu Yunfan about the gains.","“Senior Chu, we obtained a total of 10 million middle-grade spirit stones for the auction house and the land it’s on. We also obtained more than 5 million middle-grade spirit stones from the other medicinal herbs and some natural treasures.”","As You Chuyun reported, he was secretly speechless. The middle-grade spirit stones were worth tens of millions. If they were exchanged for the low-grade spirit stones one typically used for cultivation, the price would be simply astronomical.","All the forces in the city were uprooted by Chu Yunfan, and all the wealth accumulated over the years fell into his hands.","“Most of the shops and fields were bought by the Xu clan,” You Chuyun said, “Now, the Xu clan is the greatest force in the city. The others are simply unable to resist. Are we not to worry about the Xus rising up against us?”","The vast majority of the shops and fields that were auctioned off had been obtained by the Xu clan. There was no doubt that after a period of consumption, the Xu clan would become a giant in Baotai. This caused You Chuyun to be worried.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “You think too highly of them. In this world, strength speaks for itself. The Xus would never go against us. If I can destroy the five major factions, destroying the Xu clan will be nothing.”","No matter how powerful a faction was, they would not be able to withstand a single blow in the face of true absolute strength. Chu Yunfan was the one who raised the Xu clan, so there was no need for him to be afraid that he would not be able to get rid of the Xu clan.","There were too many things in Baotai, big and small. In theory, they were all managed by him, the garrison leader. How could he have so much time to deal with them one by one? You Chuyun and the others were the foundation that he had painstakingly nurtured. Naturally, he could not waste time on these trivial matters. That was why Chu Yunfan had recruited the Xu clan. Since he wanted the Xu clan to do things, he naturally could not let the horse run and not let the horse eat grass.","However, Chu Yunfan was still excited when he heard about this sum. As expected, a horse would not get fat without grass at night, and a man would not get rich without windfall. To him, ten million medium-grade spirit stones were an astronomical figure.","“As for the specific ratio, we’ll handle it according to how we dealt with the Ding clan’s finances. Half of it will be handed over to the Ministry of War, and I’ll take a quarter. The remaining quarter will be used to purchase armaments and various cultivation resources. I want to build Baotai’s garrison into an absolute elite force as quickly as possible,” Chu Yunfan said, “All the martial arts manuals that we collected will be kept in the army as rewards. Whoever performs well will be rewarded.”","In Grand Xia, though cultivation was widespread, it was only superficial cultivation methods. Advanced cultivation techniques were all hidden in the various powers and could not be seen by outsiders.","If Baotai’s garrison were a true elite army, they might be able to obtain all kinds of elite martial arts from Grand Xia’s collection. However, as they were just a second-tier army, there was no such opportunity.","Not only were they lacking in cultivation resources, but they also lacked cultivation methods. Chu Yunfan knew many top cultivation methods, but they were not suitable for these people. Although the martial arts books collected from the hands of the major forces were far inferior to what Chu Yunfan had mastered, they were most suitable for these ordinary soldiers to cultivate.","Cultivation was very particular about techniques and resources, and Chu Yunfan could provide both now. As long as they trained hard, it would not be difficult for them to become elite troops.","However, Chu Yunfan did not have that much time. He wanted to improve the strength of the entire army in the shortest time possible. This required a large number of pills, and this involved a large number of medicinal herbs.","And now, it was time for him to lay low and accumulate strength.","“Senior Chu, someone from the Thousand Treasures Pavilion is here to see you,” You Chuyun said.","“Thousand Treasures Pavilion? The world’s largest merchant association?” Chu Yunfan’s eyebrows went up. He remembered the description of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion in the “World” book of the Flying Celestials.","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion had an extremely long history, and it wasn’t any weaker than the ten great sects. It was unknown when it started, but the Thousand Treasures Pavilion had businesses all throughout the entire Grand Xia Empire. Although it was a merchant association, its strength was extremely shocking. It was widely believed that it wasn’t inferior to the ten great sects.","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion was deeply rooted in Grand Xia, and its influence was extremely vast. They had relationships with many major characters and were definitely not ordinary."]},{"number":1745,"title":"Chapter 1745 Thousand Treasures Pavilion","paragraphs":["1745 Thousand Treasures Pavilion","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion had a vast business scope, and even had business dealings with the Imperial Court. Among the many merchant associations, it was the largest one. Its network was densely intertwined, and it was unknown how many experts it had recruited.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and decided to meet the Thousand Treasures Pavilion messenger. “Invite him in.”","Soon, a middle-aged man in a luxurious robe strode in and came to Chu Yunfan.","‘An Interpreter.’ Chu Yunfan’s eyes narrowed. Although the middle-aged man hid himself well, he couldn’t hide from Chu Yunfan’s perception. He was seen through instantly.","This random envoy was an Interpreter. The strength of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion could be seen from this. It was truly terrifying.","“I am Wan Sanqian, the Black Iron Emissary of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Greetings, Colonel Chu,” the middle-aged man said as he bowed.","‘So it’s the Black Iron Emissary,’ Chu Yunfan thought. It was recorded in “The World” that within the Thousand Treasures Pavilion, other than the large number of fringe and bottom-level members, the ones who really had a certain status were the envoys of different levels. They were divided into different levels such as black iron, bronze, silver, gold, and platinum.","Although the Black Iron Emissary was considered the lowest level of existence in the Thousand Treasures Pavilion’s management, they were considered people with proper rank and were in charge of certain branches.","“Why have you come looking for me, Mr. Wan?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Since you’ve asked, I won’t hide anything and get straight to the point. We hope to reach a cooperative relationship with you, Colonel Chu,” Wan Sanqian revealed, his eyes flashing with surprise because Chu Yunfan had appeared very late compared to others.","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion’s tentacles were spread all over Grand Xia, and even in the wilderness, there were people from the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Usually, the disciples with promising prospects in the various sects would enter the Thousand Treasures Pavilion’s line of sight long ago, and they would pull strings early on. But for someone like Chu Yunfan, who had already become an elite disciple and a garrison leader, the Thousand Treasures Pavilion actually did not have any communication channels. This was extremely rare.","However, when they thought about Chu Yunfan’s background, they understood. After all, he wasn’t a native of Grand Xia, but a genius from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. However, what really shocked Wan Sanqian was that, according to the information, Chu Yunfan quickly climbed up after leaving the Violet Thunder Prefecture. He rose to fame and entered the Flying Celestials, becoming one of the top ten seed disciples and won the inner disciple competition within half a year.","This series of achievements were shocking, and Chu Yunfan’s actions after becoming the guardian of Baotai made Wan Sanqian feel even more surprised.","The five major forces that had occupied Baotai for many years had been uprooted by Chu Yunfan, along with the other forces that were dependent on the five major forces in the city. From all the information, Chu Yunfan was definitely not an ordinary person. He could be described as a statecraft. In the past few days, he had been in charge of Baotai. Whether it was military or civil affairs, he had managed them in an orderly manner. He was not as flustered as many disciples of the major sects who were focused on cultivation.","All of this made Wan Sanqian decide to end the observation period early and get in touch with Chu Yunfan as soon as possible.","“What kind of cooperation does the Thousand Treasures Pavilion wish to reach with me?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Our association has all kinds of commercial channels throughout Grand Xia. I’m sure you’ve heard of these things, Colonel Chu. The Thousand Treasures Pavilion sells and buys all kinds of goods. As long as you need them, we can send them over as soon as possible,” Wan Sanqian said.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. Coming from the Federation, he was most unaccustomed to the fact that Grand Xia was relatively backward in some aspects. If he was in the Federation, he would be able to get his hands on any item he wanted as soon as he placed an order. This saved him a lot of time.","In the past, many cultivators still had to travel through mountains and rivers to find various medicinal herbs. This would delay a lot of time and things. But if he had the Thousand Treasures Pavilion as a medium, it could be said that it solved Chu Yunfan’s urgent need, especially when he wanted to make pills to increase the strength of the army on a large scale. He needed a large number of medicinal herbs.","“Other than that, we also buy all kinds of medicinal herbs, treasures, martial arts manuals, and so on. As long as there’s something valuable, we’ll buy it,” Wan Sanqian continued, “As of date, you’ve uprooted all the major forces in Baotai, and I believe there are many things that you won’t be able to use for the time being. Instead of keeping them, you might as well sell them to our association. As for the price, we’ll definitely satisfy you and won’t let you suffer a loss.”","Wan Sanqian didn’t show any strange expressions when he stated that Chu Yunfan had uprooted the five major forces. To the Thousand Treasures Pavilion, the five major forces of Baotai were not even worth of a glance. In thai entire city, only Chu Yunfan had the qualifications for such an honor.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He did have a lot of resources that he didn’t need. Although they might be important to a force, they were useless to him personally. If he handed them all over to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion to deal with, it could save him a lot of effort.","“In our opinion, you have a bright future, Colonel Chu. Of course, it can’t be just this. We hope to establish a long-term relationship with you,” Wan Sanqian said bluntly.","Chu Yunfan could understand this. His future was limitless, and many more forces surely would want to cooperate with him in the future.","“In addition, here’s an invitation letter from our association. In ten days, our branch here will be holding an auction. Only guests that our association values will receive an invitation. Although we have not cooperated before, you are already a distinguished guest to us. Therefore, we hope you will take the time to come.” Wan Sanqian took out an invitation from the void and handed it to Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1746,"title":"Chapter 1746 Reborn After Ten Days","paragraphs":["1746 Reborn After Ten Days","Chu Yunfan took the invitation letter and saw that it was a gold-black card. On it were three large words, Thousand Treasures Pavilion, which were quite eye-catching. It was written that in ten days, the Thousand Treasures Pavilion would hold an auction, and the location was a town not far from Baotai.","“Okay, I understand. I’ll go if I have time. But next, we should discuss our cooperation. The things that I’ve collect and don’t need for the time being can be handed over to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion to deal with. However, I need yoru association to help me collect some medicinal herbs as well.”","Chu Yunfan made a list, most of which were pills used to improve the strength of the army. These herbs were not difficult to find, but the amount required was very large. There were 500 people in the garrison. If Chu Yunfan wanted to increase the strength of the entire army, he needed a lot of resources. In this aspect, Grand Xia’s Imperial Court could not be relied on. Chu Yunfan could only rely on himself.","Fortunately, after seizing the houses of the major forces, about a quarter of the assets was to be distributed to the soldiers, so Chu Yunfan did not need to fork out extra money.","Wan Sanqian took a look and frowned. “The latter items here are nothing. Although the number is a little big, the herbs themselves aren’t rare. We can find them. The real problem is the Tiny Violet Grass. But, there will be Tiny Violet Grass at the upcoming auction. You should come a take a look at them in person.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up. Tiny Violet Grass was the supplementary herb he needed to make the Great Essence Cultivator Pill. When he uprooted the Ding clan, he had got a portion of them. After some though, Chu Yunfan figured they were probably sent by Li Qianyuan.","After that, although the various large factions were uprooted, they were unable to find the many herbs to make the Great Essence Cultivator Pill. Fortunately, there was the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan alone would have taken a long time to find these herbs.","“Other than the Tiny Violet Grass, the other medicinal herbs should cost about three million middle-grade spirit stones. As long as the funds are in place, we can send them all to you tomorrow,” Wan Sanqian said after some calculations.","Appraisal was as simple as eating and drinking for a person like Wan Sanqian.","“That amount is fine.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“As for the herbs that you have no need for, I will send someone to count and assess them. All right, I shall take my leave now.”","Wan Sanqian left to discuss the details with You Chuyun. After a night of intense negotiations, they came to an agreement. All the unwanted treasures were sold to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Other than gathering enough resources for cultivation, there were still many left.","Chu Yunfan had become rich overnight. All kinds of useless natural treasures had been converted into medium-grade spirit stones and he now had a total of five million medium-grade spirit stones. He had never had so many middle-grade spirit stones in his possession.","With enough of them, Chu Yunfan could carry out all kinds of actions. Millions of middle-grade spirit stones were poured into the Brahma Tree without hesitation. With enough spirit energy, the Brahma Tree grew at an amazing speed. Coupled with the blood of the Blood Demon Sect’s leader, another Brahma Fruit was born.","In addition, two million middle-grade spirit stones were absorbed by the herb mountain. At this moment, it was filled with all kinds of medicinal herbs that Chu Yunfan had brought in. The mountain could evolve into the most suitable environment for these medicinal herbs to grow. However, relied on spirit energy to support its operations. As for the remaining 2 million medium-grade spirit stones, Chu Yunfan would use them to cultivate and buy the Tiny Violet Grass at the auction.","After making all these arrangements, Chu Yunfan realized that he had just made a windfall, but he had spent it all in an instant. He smiled bitterly. Cultivation was really too exhausting, especially when he wanted to improve his strength by leaps and bounds in a short time. Naturally, he could not do without the accumulation of various resources.","However, the improvement in his cultivation base was clear. It was like he was riding a rocket. It had not even been a year since he joined the Flying Celestials, but his strength had already changed drastically.","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion acted quickly. By noon the next day, all the herbs that Chu Yunfan had ordered were delivered. Chu Yunfan didn’t delay and started making pills in the camp. With the Mountain River Cauldron in hand, he no longer had to make pills one by one like before. He could make hundreds in one furnace.","After a few days, thousands of pills for cultivation were complete. The atmosphere in the camp had also undergone a drastic change. The soldiers of the garrison were just making a living in the army and could not be compared to the elite troops. However, with Chu Yunfan in charge, everything seemed to be completely different.","It was clear that they had a bright future ahead of them, especially when Chu Yunfan provided them with all kinds of pills, martial arts, and divine ability manuals. Everyone entered the stage of crazy training and cultivation to improve their strength.","Although these soldiers were not considered to be the most talented, they had accumulated a lot of power after years of cultivation. Now that they had all unleashed their power, their cultivation advanced by leaps and bounds.","In the blink of an eye, ten days past and it was the day for the Thousand Treasures Pavilion auction. Chu Yunfan put away the Mountain River Cauldron and headed out of the camp to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","However, as soon as Chu Yunfan left Baotai, he immediately felt that he was being watched."]},{"number":1747,"title":"Chapter 1747 A Cosmic Attacks","paragraphs":["1747 A Cosmic Attacks","The moment he left Baotai, he was targeted. This feeling made Chu Yunfan’s nerves instantly tighten. With his current cultivation, no one except a Cosmic could make him feel so pressured.","Chu Yunfan instantly reacted. He had planned to head to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch at a normal speed, but now he changed his wind. A pair of lightning wings grew on his back. He then turned into a stream of light and headed toward the branch of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had discovered him, the figure behind Chu Yunfan did not hesitate. He appeared and charged toward Chu Yunfan. In just a few moments, he was in front of Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally saw who it was. It was a high-spirited young man who looked to be about twenty-seven or twenty-eight. He was dressed in a luxurious robe.","“I didn’t expect you to run so quickly. I almost let you escape.” The young man sneered and locked his divine will on Chu Yunfan. It was clear that he wanted to prevent Chu Yunfan from escaping.","“What a big show. Someone sent a Cosmic to kill me. Let me guess. Wang Yifan? Li Qianyuan?”","When Chu Yunfan spoke, his eyes fell on the young man. When he mentioned Wang Yifan, the young man’s expression showed a hint of disdain, but when he mentioned Li Qianyuan, the young man showed a bit of fanaticism.","Chu Yunfan immediately made discerned that this man was Li Qianyuan’s follower. What surprised him was that this Cosmic was Li Qianyuan’s follower. In the Flying Celestials, a Cosmic would be a high and mighty true disciple with almost the same status as an elder. Withing a small sect, even the sect leader’s cultivation would not be so high.","To be able to cultivate to such a level at such a young age, which young man was not an arrogant existence? But Li Qianyuan had managed to convince this Cosmic to be his follower.","“Wang Yifan is an ant. Is he worthy of ordering me around?” The young man sneered. “Chu Yunfan, I heard that you are very arrogant, but you are just a frog at the bottom of a well. You’ve never seen a truly powerful person. Today, I will let you die with an understanding. I, Gongsun Liang of the Iron Spear Gang, will kill you!”","This young man, Gongsun Liang, was extremely proud. He didn’t even bother to hide anything from Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan, who had yet to enter the Cosmos Stage, was just an ant. There was no need to care about him.","“The Iron Spear Gang?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. It was a big gang that dominated Grand Xia. Although there was a big gap between them and a behemoth like the Flying Celestials, there was no doubt that the Iron Spears was extremely powerful. Furthermore, many members of the Iron Spears served in Grand Xia’s army. It could be said that they had an astonishing network of connections in the army. Among them, Cosmics were the best in the Iron Spears.","“That’s right. It’s your honor to die under my spear. I don’t have time to waste with you. I’ll take your head and report to Lord Huntian.” Gongsun Liang sneered.","“Hahahahaha!” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter.","“What are you laughing at?” Gongsun Liang asked doubtfully.","“I’m laughing at you. You may have reached the Cosmic Stage, but you don’t understand the true meaning of cultivation, which is to reverse the universe, seize the fortune, and be lawless. You’re just Li Qianyuan’s dog!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","“What do you know? A frog at the bottom of a well like you will never understand Lord Huntian’s greatness. Compared to him, I’m just a flickering flame.”","Gongsun Liang wasn’t angered by Chu Yunfan’s words. On the contrary, he didn’t feel ashamed. Instead, he felt proud.","However, in the next moment, Gongsun Liang’s face turned extremely ferocious as he shouted, “Cut the crap. I’ll kill you, then your Evolution Pill will be mine!”","Thinking of the Evolution Pill on Chu Yunfan, Gongsun Liang’s eyes could not help but flash with greed. That pill was a great item. It was extremely important even for a Cosmic. It could help him improve his cultivation.","“I thought you were some powerful person. You must have arrived long ago, but you didn’t have the guts to come out. You only dared to appear after Senior Yi left,” Chu Yunfan scolded after realizing this.","Gongsun Liang’s face fell slightly, and the muscles on his face twitched. Chu Yunfan was right. Li Qianyuan was meticulous in his work, and of course, he would not only use such a simple method to win over the Ding clan.","Gongsun Liang was the trump card he had arranged. At that time, he did not make a move because he thought that Yuan Tianhua would be enough to kill Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Yuan Tianhua would be killed by Chu Yunfan?","With Yi Yunyao, a Cosmic who was even stronger than him, keeping watch, Gongsun Liang had not dared to appear. Even among Cosmics, there were differences in strength. It was only now that he had 100% confidence that he dared to show himself.","“You’re courting death!”","Gongsun Liang was enraged. With a roar, a bright silver spear appeared in his hand. The spear stabbed out, splitting into countless spear shadows in the sky. The spear shadows were densely packed and fell like a storm of pear blossoms. In an instant, they were about to pierce through Chu Yunfan.","A ferocious expression appeared on Gongsun Liang’s face. He had blocked all of Chu Yunfan’s escape routes, leaving him with nowhere to retreat. One shot could kill Chu Yunfan.","However, what he did not expect was that Chu Yunfan was not afraid of these spear shadows in the least.","A cauldron appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head. It spun and released countless rainbow lights. The spear shadows fell on the cauldron, but they failed to move the cauldron even an inch.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","Countless spear shadows exploded in Chu Yunfan’s direction, creating countless explosions. Immediately after, a figure rushed out of the area of the explosion and disappeared into the sky.","“D*mn it. I was too careless.” Gongsun Liang realized. He was too confident that he could kill Chu Yunfan with one attack, so he was not prepared. Chu Yunfan managed to take advantage of this gap and broke through from the front.","Seeing Chu Yunfan transform into a bolt of lightning and fly away, Gongsun Liang was furious. He immediately chased after Chu Yunfan on a beam of light.","In the sky, two streaks of light were chasing each other as fast as lightning. They were not far from the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch from Baotai. In a moment, they had arrived.","Chu Yunfan rushed into the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch."]},{"number":1748,"title":"Chapter 1748 The Thousand Treasures Pavilion Auction","paragraphs":["1748 The Thousand Treasures Pavilion Auction","After Chu Yunfan entered the small town where the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch was located, Gongsun Liang also rushed into the small town.","“Chu Yunfan, where are you going?” Gongsun Liang pointed his silver spear at Chu Yunfan.","“Honored guest, no matter what kind of grudge you have, you can’t make a move here. Otherwise, you’ll be making an enemy of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. You can’t afford that price.”","At this moment, an old voice came from the sky, accompanied by a terrifying pressure that stopped Gongsun Liang, whose expression quickly fell. He could feel that the old voice came from a Cosmic who was even stronger than him.","Moreover, just as the old voice said, he really could not afford to offend the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Not to mention him, even the gang he was in couldn’t afford to offend the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","Everyone knew that although the Thousand Treasures Pavilion was focused on doing business, it was impossible to say that there were no top-notch experts when they had that much wealth. It was likely that it had long been swallowed up by many forces that were eyeing them covetously.","Not to mention, the number of experts who had received favors from the Thousand Treasures Pavilion over the years was unknown. These people had connections all over Grand Xia. How could the Iron Spears afford to offend them?","Even someone as arrogant as him knew when to restrain himself and when to be impudent. He even had a feeling that if he dared to make a move, he might be beaten and kicked out.","“I am from the Iron Spear Gang, Gongsun Liang. I was being too rash.” Gongsun Liang cupped his hands.","The pressure brought by the old voice disappeared. Gongsun Liang then realized that Chu Yunfan, who had been in front of him just a moment ago, had disappeared without a trace.","He finally understood Chu Yunfan’s intention. Chu Yunfan had clearly done this on purpose. Chu Yunfan knew that he wouldn’t dare to make a move here.","“Hmph, the auction has a time limit. It’ll just be a few days at most. I don’t believe that after the auction ends, you’ll stick around,” Gongsun Liang muttered through gritted teeth.","***","The auction of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch was held by a Cosmic. Such a configuration was no doubt luxurious. Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder.","In a few flashes, he left Gongsun Liang behind. His ears were filled with chatter. The entire town had already become a large-scale trade fair. All kinds of itinerant martial artists or martial artists from small sects were hawking all kinds of pills, medicinal herbs, natural treasures, magic treasures, and so on.","However, Chu Yunfan was not interested in these. Basically, it was just some Core Formers hawking their wares. Occasionally, there would be a few Golden Cores selling goods, but Chu Yunfan was also not interested in them. Right now, his only goal was to get the Tiny Violet Grass from the auction.","He knew that Gongsun Liang was waiting for him outside. Once the auction ended, he would be greeted with Gongsun Liang’s storm-like attacks. However, Chu Yunfan did not panic. He had his ways to protect himself.","With his current strength, after transforming into a hou, even a few peak Interpreters would be no match for him. However, his combat strength was still unable to break through to the Cosmos Stage. At most, he could only be considered a half-step Cosmic.","If he waited for his cultivation to advance a step further and reach the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage, his battle prowess would be able to break through to the Cosmos Stage when he took on the hou form. Although it wouldn’t be for long, it would be long enough. At that time, he would have the ability to arm wrestle with Cosmics.","Although Gongsun Liang was aggressive, Chu Yunfan could see that his cultivation was far inferior to the Blood Demon Sect’s leader and the others. He had probably just entered the Cosmos Stage not long ago. And Chu Yunfan was not afraid of such a Cosmic.","“After I make the remaining two Great Essence Cultivator Pills and break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, it’s still uncertain who will kill who.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","When his cultivation broke through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he would have the ability to kill a Cosmic even without transforming into a hou. Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan no longer hesitated and immediately went to find Wan Sanqian.","“Welcome, Colonel Chu!” Wan Sanqian greeted Chu Yunfan with a warm smile. “You must be here for the Tiny Violet Grass. It just so happens that the next auction item is just that. Our branch is divided into two parts. The first part is a trading meeting, and the second part is an auction in the auction house.”","Under Wan Sanqian’s lead, Chu Yunfan quickly arrived at a building in the middle of the town. This building looked ordinary. If one only looked at the outside, no one would know that there was an auction house inside. The place was very special. It was actually built into the underground.","When Chu Yunfan walked into the auction house and found that it was already in an uproar.","“100,000 middle-grade spirit stones going once! 100,000 middle-grade spirit stones going twice!” the auctioneer shouted.","“150,000 middle-grade spirit stones!”","As expected, someone couldn’t help but shout. Then, all kinds of bids rose and fell.","Chu Yunfan followed Wan Sanqian to a VIP room. The room was decorated in an extremely simple and elegant manner. As it was located underground, there was no natural lighting. However, there were many oil lamps around. When these oil lamps burned, they were as bright as day and emitted a faint fragrance. It was not ordinary oil, but oil extracted from some demon beasts and specially processed. If an ordinary person lit this lamp while cultivating, they could easily enter a meditative state and increase their cultivation speed.","Generally speaking, only the higher-ups of some families and sects could use these oils all year round. The extravagance of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion could not help but make Chu Yunfan click his tongue in wonder.","Chu Yunfan sat down and left immediately after Wan Sanqian explained some details. He wasn’t very interested in the items being auctioned, but soon, the one he was really interested in, the Tiny Violet Grass, finally appeared.","“Everyone, next up, we will be auctioning five stalks of the rarely seen Tiny Violet Grass!” the auctioneer announced.","“Tiny Violet Grass is neutral and mild in nature. It can combine the medicinal properties of many medicinal herbs and is an indispensable supplementary medicine for making many medicinal pills. However, it’s a very rare item. Today, the Thousand Treasures Pavilion has five stalks to auction off!”"]},{"number":1749,"title":"Chapter 1749 Entering Seclusion to Make Pills","paragraphs":["1749 Entering Seclusion to Make Pills","The Tiny Violet Grass could be used as a supplementary medicine in many pills. Alchemy was about the monarch being supported by the minister, assistant, and envoy. The main medicine was the monarch ingredient, and the Tiny Violet Grass was a very important minister ingredient.","“110,000!”","“120,000!”","“150,000!”","The bids kept coming one after another, but they were not too intense. After all, this was only a supplementary medicine.","“200,000!” Chu Yunfan bid without hesitation.","For others, this was just an important supplementary medicine, but for Chu Yunfan, this was the key to his next breakthrough.","“210,000!” someone shouted after a moment.","“250,000!” Chu Yunfan raised the price again without hesitation.","Everyone could see he was determined to obtain the item and could only give up.","Soon, five stalks of Tiny Violet Grass were delivered to Chu Yunfan.","“Congratulations on winning the Tiny Violet Grass, Colonel Chu,” Wan Sanqian congratulated Chu Yunfan as he personally delivered the Tiny Violet Grass to him.","Chu Yunfan did not bother with fanfare. After paying 250,000 medium-grade spirit stones, he immediately put away the Tiny Violet Grass. Although the price of these five stalks was ridiculously expensive, it was not worth mentioning for Chu Yunfan’s strength.","After obtaining the five stalks of Tiny Violet Grass, Chu Yunfan was completely confident. He slowly looked at the items being auctioned here. However, other than the Tiny Violet Grass, the rest of the things were not very useful to him, and their value was limited.","However, Chu Yunfan remembered that this was only a branch of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Its level was not high, so it was difficult to see anything that would make his eyes light up. However, just this Tiny Violet Grass alone was enough to make him feel that this trip was not in vain.","After taking the Tiny Violet Grass, Chu Yunfan left the auction house. The auction was still going on, but the remaining items were not enough to attract his attention.","Chu Yunfan inquired with Wan Sanqian and found a secret room for secluded cultivation. There was such a place in the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Now that Chu Yunfan was an honored guest, this request was naturally not a problem.","However, Wan Sanqian didn’t know that Chu Yunfan’s search for such a secret room was just a pretense. The real location Chu Yunfan went to was the Mountain River Diagram. He was just using the secret room as a cover.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan opened the Mountain River Cauldron and began to make pills. With the Tiny Violet Grass, he could finally start making the remaining two Great Essence Cultivator Pills. With his previous experience, Chu Yunfan once again made the Great Essence Cultivator Pills. He was familiar with them and encountered no difficulty.","Chu Yunfan made a hand seal and lit up the alchemic fire. At the same time, he grabbed at the void and took out a jade box. In the jade box, there were only two-thirds of the thousand-year-old blood ginseng left. After splitting the blood ginseng into two, he threw them into the Mountain River Cauldron and began to make the pills.","“Old Li, how’s the situation with Gongsun Liang?” Wan Sanqian asked.","Although this man did not leave the house, his divine will had long locked onto Gongsun Liang. Gongsun Liang’s every move was under his surveillance. After all, although Gongsun Liang’s cultivation had only just entered the Cosmos Stage, he was still a Cosmic. Once such a person started to cause trouble, it would be a disaster. Old Li had no choice but to be nervous and pay attention.","“That’s good,” Wan Sanqian said.","“However, Gongsun Liang is here for Chu Yunfan. Should we chase Chu Yunfan out as well? The Thousand Treasures Pavilion has always been neutral in doing business and does not participate in the competition between various forces,” Old Li said.","“That’s unnecessary. Chu Yunfan is here as our distinguished guest. If we chase him away, what will others think? In the eyes of others, we’d be labeled as afraid of the Iron Spears.” Wan Sanqian waved. “We can ignore their grudges, but while in the Thousand Treasures Pavilion, even a dragon has to lie down. Everyone has to follow our rules. As long as Chu Yunfan and Gongsun Liang don’t break our rules, we don’t have to care about them.”","Wan Sanqian was full of confidence, and his every move was filled with disdain. He didn’t put Chu Yunfan or Gongsun Liang in his eyes.","“But why do you think so highly of Chu Yunfan? He’s only in the Abstract Stage,” Old Li asked, “According to the information I just received, Gongsun Liang is probably related to Li Qianyuan. He seems to be Li Qianyuan’s follower. I’m afraid it’s not appropriate to offend Li Qianyuan for Chu Yunfan.”","Old Li was a Cosmic, but he was respectful to Wan Sanqian. However, there was nothing between the two of them.","“Although Li Qianyuan is powerful, he can’t control the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. I’m very optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s future prospects. Moreover, this is not considered to have offended Li Qianyuan. Now that we have shown mercy to Chu Yunfan, there may be unexpected gains in the future,” Wan Sanqian said.","“Since that’s the case, then I will do as you say, sir. I will continue to monitor Gongsun Liang,” Old Li said.","Wan Sanqian left the chamber and touched the jade pendant on his waist. “Chu Yunfan... Interesting. I hope you won’t disappoint me.”","Half a day passed in the blink of an eye. Under Chu Yunfan’s constant activation of the pill-making chant and increased alchemic fire, in just half a day, the Great Essence Cultivator Pills were complete.","Chu Yunfan casually flipped the lid of the Mountain River Cauldron open, and a wave of medicinal fragrance assailed his nostrils. With a wave of his hand, two Great Essence Cultivator Pills flew out. Chu Yunfan immediately took out a jade box and put one of the pills into the box. As for the remaining Great Essence Cultivator Pill, he immediately consumed it.","Boom!","The Great Essence Cultivator Pill turned into a powerful energy torrent and spread into Chu Yufan’s body. The huge energy caused the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body to start circulating unconsciously.","Chu Yunfan hurriedly circulated the Emperor Method and began to charge at the peak Abstract Observance Stage barrier."]},{"number":1750,"title":"Chapter 1750 Breakthrough to the Peak Abstract Observance Stage","paragraphs":["1750 Breakthrough to the Peak Abstract Observance Stage","The divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body was cleansing his cells. With the support of the Great Essence Cultivator Pill, his divine power soared crazily. It kept rising as if it was endless, almost bursting his body.","If he were an ordinary person, his body would have exploded long ago, but Chu Yunfan was different. His body was extremely strong and could even destroy supreme-grade spirit weapons with his bare hands. In terms of physical strength, he had long reached a peak.","An ordinary peak Interpreter would be killed in two or three moves by a Cosmic, but Chu Yunfan was different. He even dared to fight a Cosmic. Even if he couldn’t win, he wouldn’t die. The difference between them couldn’t be calculated with reason.","Circle after circle of mana washed the ground, and charged at the peak Abstract Observance Stage barrier. The air that Chu Yunfan kept exhaling from the tip of his nose was like two air dragons, baring their fangs and brandishing their claws. The movement was shocking.","At the same time, the middle-grade spirit stones turned into ashes. The spirit energy contained in them seemed to be attracted by a terrifying force and kept flowing into his body.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye. Chu Yunfan had cultivated in the Mountain River Diagram for a long time. Suddenly, he opened his eyes, and there was a flash of light in his eyes. Slowly, the light in his eyes slowly converged, and he was no different from usual. Only he himself knew that in three days, he completed his breakthrough and reached the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage. His cultivation had improved, and his battle prowess had advanced by leaps and bounds. It was completely different from before.","Now, Chu Yunfan dared to say that he was the best among the elite disciples of the Flying Celestials. It was impossible for anyone to be more powerful than him. Previously, even though Chu Yunfan could transform into a hou, he was still unable to break through the limit of the Abstract Stage. However, it was different now. His strength had undergone a world-shaking change. He was at least several times stronger than before.","With this foundation, Chu Yunfan took on the hou form. This was the first time he had truly possessed the power to match a Cosmic. In the blink of an eye, his entire body was covered in dense golden scales. In an instant, he had transformed into a golden hou.","However, this golden hou was different from the original one. Its body was not as huge as a small mountain, but the terrifying pressure it brought was even more shocking than when it was the size of a small mountain. When he stood up, he looked like a humanoid hou. Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan could truly display his martial arts.","His battle prowess had truly improved.","A fierce aura was released crazily, and the Mountain River Diagram was shook and twisted. Chu Yunfan could feel the terrifying power constantly surging out of his body. He felt that he could punch through the entire world.","“Is this the power of the Cosmos Stage, which is above the Abstract Stage?” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself.","Although he was no stranger to this kind of power as he had seen power a hundred times stronger than this in the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, this was the first time he had such power. It was completely different from the feeling in his memories.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan retracted the hou form in his body and transformed back into a human. ‘Such power is indeed powerful!’ Chu Yunfan thought.","With his current strength, he was no longer afraid of Wang Yifan. However, the hou form was indeed very draining of divine power. It could only be used as a trump card and not as a regular combat strength. If he wanted to possess the power to match a Cosmic, it would only be possible if he stepped into the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan was not disappointed, because that was not far away. He had one more Great Essence Cultivator Pill on hand, which was enough for him to advance further.","“Gongsun Liang, I want to see who will kill who!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","During this period, he could feel Gongsun Liang’s divine will constantly trying to penetrate in and touch the barrier that Chu Yunfan had left outside. He was clearly determined to get Chu Yunfan. Gongsun Liang didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had undergone a complete transformation in just three days.","However, before Chu Yunfan could think further, there was a knock on the door. He walked out of the Mountain River Diagram and opened the door. He saw that it was Wan Sanqian.","“Colonel Chu, the auction has ended,” Wan Sanqian said.","“All right, sorry for intruding on your hopitality. I shall go now. In the future, if there’s any transaction, I’ll give you and your organization priority.”","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he bid farewell to Wan Sanqian and turned into a stream of light, disappearing from where he was. Wan Sanqian watched Chu Yunfan’s disappearing figure, and his eyes revealed a sharp light. In just four short days, Chu Yunfan had made a faint breakthrough in strength.","What a terrifying thing!","Although Chu Yunfan hid it very well, Wan Sanqian still sensed it. He believed in his judgment. In a few days, Chu Yunfan had become stronger.","“Interesting. I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be more powerful than I thought. But wait, how is he going to face Gongsun Liang? Don’t die, or it would be a pity.” Wan Sanqian narrowed his eyes and turned to leave.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already arrived outside the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch. From afar, he could see light streaking across the sky like meteors. They were the people who left the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch after the auction ended.","“Hahaha! You’re finally out!”","At this moment, a series of strange laughter came from behind Chu Yunfan. At the same time, a huge spear light appeared in the air and shot toward Chu Yunfan. The speed of this spear was fast and swift. In an instant, it was about to tear him apart and pierce through him.","The person who attacked was none other than Gongsun Liang. After holding it in for several days, he attacked again, not giving Chu Yunfan any chance to retaliate.","Chu Yunfan instantly reacted and disappeared from where he stood.","Boom!","The spear light landed on the ground and blasted out a huge hole.","“What?” Gongsun Liang revealed a puzzled expression. Chu Yunfan had managed to dodge his attack. His speed was even faster than a few days ago."]},{"number":1751,"title":"Chapter 1751 Everyone Was Shocked by the Fight","paragraphs":["1751 Everyone Was Shocked by the Fight","Gongsun Liang immediately chased this ridiculous thought out of his mind. It had only been a few days. For an expert, a single secluded cultivation session was far from enough. How could Chu Yunfan have such a drastic change in just a few days?","This was simply a joke. He must have sensed wrongly!","Thinking of this, Gongsun Liang’s eyes flashed with a terrifying light. He remembered that he had wanted to kill Chu Yunfan a few days ago, but was stopped by the mysterious expert of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","As Old Li had guessed, no matter how loyal Gongsun Liang was to Li Qianyuan, he was not crazy. Of course, he understood that he could not afford to offend the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Even the Iron Spears behind him could not afford to offend the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Compared to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion, the Iron Spears were nothing. Even Li Qianyuan, who he followed, was not a match for the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","The merchant association was an extremely powerful behemoth.","“I will kill you today. Let’s see whyo will save you!”","Gongsun Liang attacked again.","“Iron Spear Across the Sky!”","He struck out with his spear, and the spear light streaked through the sky. It was like a mountain range crossing the sky, stabbing at Chu Yunfan.","What surprised him was that Chu Yunfan didn’t even try to dodge. Instead, he threw a punch at the spear.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the spear light and the fist force collided, almost shattering the entire world. The resulting huge wave instantly caused a frenzy.","In the face of Gongsun Liang’s attack, Chu Yunfan only took two steps back before managing to stabilize himself.","“Impossible!” Gongsun Liang said in surprise. He had never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to receive his attack so easily. Logically speaking, an ordinary Abstract, even an Interpreter, would be killed on the spot. There were no exceptions!","“How did your combat strength increase so much?” Gongsun Liang narrowed his eyes. “Did you take the Evolution Pill?”","This was the only possibility Gongsun Liang could think of. After all, Chu Yunfan was under his threat. If he wasn’t stupid, he would definitely think of a way to increase his strength. The only way he knew was to consume the Evolution Pill.","It was because of this that a burst of anger rose in his heart. He had long regarded Chu Yunfan’s Evolution Pill as his own, and now Chu Yunfan dared to cosume what was his. Since this concerned his hopes of advancing further, it simply made the anger in his heart erupt.","“D*mn you... You ate the Evolution Pill! This is an unforgivable crime. I will treat you as human medicine and extract the medicinal properties from your body!”","A sharp killing intent erupted in Gongsun Liang’s eyes.","When Chu Yunfan heard Gongsun Liang’s words, he sneered and said, “You want to turn me into human medicine? I’m afraid that you don’t have the ability. Just based on this point, you’ll definitely die at my hands!”","Chu Yunfan had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, so of course, he knew what human medicine was. It was a crooked way of alchemy. In ancient times, many alchemy masters ground up people into human medicine and made them into pills. This method was cruel, but many people enjoyed it. Although it was a crooked method, it was very effective for many people.","And Gongsun Liang wanted to make him into human medicine. How could Chu Yunfan let this go?","“Hahaha! So what if you swallowed the Evolution Pill? You dare to go against me when you’re just an Abstract!”","Gongsun Liang didn’t think that he would fail. Chu Yunfan was just a trifling person, yet he dared to be so arrogant. He was simply lawless.","In the next moment, Gongsun Liang attacked again. A bright silver spear appeared in his hand. It pierced through the sky like a swimming dragon. The spear pierced through the sky, and a series of violent friction sounds erupted. It was as if the entire world was burning violently.","Chu Yunfan remained fearless.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan called upon the Eight Heavenly Dragons. Countless figures swept out in the sky and collided with Gongsun Liang’s silver spear.","Boom!","A huge explosion sounded out as the two sides once again collided. However, before the explosion could spread, Chu Yunfan and Gongsun Liang attacked each other at the same time.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In the sky, shocking collisions erupted again and again. This alarmed the guests of the Thousand Treasures Pavilion.","“What’s that? A fight between two Cosmics?”","Many people were familiar with this level of confrontation and sensed it immediately. However, many people did not understand why there were two Cosmics fighting here.","“I think I know that person. He’s the genius of the Iron Spear Gang, Gongsun Liang. I heard that he just entered the Cosmos Stage.”","“That’s right, it’s him. I know that silver spear. I’ve seen him fight before.”","“Then who’s the other person? He looks pretty young, so how is he evenly matched with Gongsun Liang?”","“No, to be precise, it seems that person is at a slight disadvantage. But that’s shocking enough!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. They could see that the two parties fighting in the sky had surpassed ordinary Abstracts. Gongsun Liang was clearly an expert in the Cosmos Stage. This was something that many people knew. As for Chu Yunfan, although no one knew about him, he was able to fight with Gongsun Liang for so many moves without being defeated. This was already very shocking.","There were simply too many geniuses in Grand Xia and even in the outer realms. Among them, there were countless Abstract Stage geniuses. Those who stepped into the Cosmos Stage could be remembered by everyone. Only by becoming a Cosmic could one be considered a truly high and mighty figure in Grand Xia."]},{"number":1752,"title":"Chapter 1752 Watch Me as I Kill You","paragraphs":["1752 Watch Me as I Kill You","There was a saying among the cultivators of Grand Xia that existed since ancient times—those who had not reached the Cosmos Stage were ultimately just ants. However, some of them were slightly stronger ants, while others were just ants.","“Although I don’t know where that person came from, he’s going to cause a sensation just from today’s battle.”","“Th-That guy is in the Abstract Stage!” someone exclaimed. He was horrified to find that the person fighting Gongsun Liang was an Abstract.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was extremely violent and terrifying. However, the Abstract Stage was still the Abstract Stage, and those who had not entered the Cosmos Stage were still those who had not entered the Cosmos Stage. There was a huge difference between them.","Although none of the experts in the crowd was in the Cosmos Stage, they had seen the real Cosmos Stage. They were not in the Cosmos Stage, but they knew what it was like to be in the Cosmos Stage.","This made many people feel like fainting. Everything in front of them must be an illusion. If Chu Yunfan was also an expert in the Cosmos Stage, they would not have felt so intense. However, Chu Yunfan was only in the Abstract Stage.","It was simply a fantasy for an Abstract to contend against a Cosmic!","However, Chu Yunfan had managed such a ridiculous thing. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed such a ridiculous thing.","“How is this possible? Where did this person come from? An Abstract fighting against a Cosmic? He might be the rumored king talents!” someone said shakily.","In this world, there were countless geniuses, but among these geniuses, there were many levels. Among them, those who could be conferred the rank of ,arquis, which meant that they would become the big figures of Grand Xia in the future, were already very talented. They could be said to be one in a hundred thousand, just like Li Qianyuan. Even the sect leaders of the ten great sects were only at this level.","However, above the official level were king-level talent. Such a person might even become a king in the future. In the countless years of Grand Xia, there weren’t many people like this. Every single one of them represented the arrival of a new era.","As for the talent of the higher level, the emperor, that had only happened during ancient times. At least until now, no one had heard of it. Thus, to be a king-level talent was already considered a top talent of the world.","Many people were also reminded by this voice and fell silent. If that was really the case, then this person was really extraordinary. Many people immediately began to draw pictures and recorded the image of Chu Yunfan fighting with Gongsun Liang. They quickly spread the news and asked their respective forces to investigate everything about Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, in the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch, Wan Sanqian and Old Li stood with their hands behind their backs, watching Chu Yunfan and Gongsun Liang who were fighting fiercely in the distance.","“Gongsun Liang is indeed worthy of being the peerless genius nurtured by the Iron Spears. Although the Iron Spears’ strength is not comparable to our association, it is still a first-rate force.” Old Li nodded. “The truly shocking one is Chu Yunfan. As expected of the person you have chosen, sir. Chu Yunfan can fight Gongsun Liang to such an extent with his Abstract Stage cultivation.”","However, Old Li frowned and added, “However, if this is the only way, Chu Yunfan will probably be defeated. He might even be beaten to death by Gongsun Liang. He has only barely managed to hold on. There is a world of difference between the Abstract Stage and the Cosmos Stage.”","“That’s right, a prolonged battle is not good for Chu Yunfan, but this doesn’t mean that Chu Yunfan has no way out,” Wan Sanqian said, “Chu Yunfan is quite mysterious. I have collected detailed information about him in the past few days. According to reliable sources, he even managed to injure Li Qianyuan. He also has a cauldron that can attack and defend, but none of these have appeared yet. My guess is that Chu Yunfan has not used his full strength yet. I’m afraid he’s waiting for something. In my opinion, the outcome is unknown.”","Wan Sanqian looked at Chu Yunfan, who was fighting in the sky, and his eyes flashed with anticipation. He wanted to know what kind of method Chu Yunfan had to turn the situation around.","While everyone was discussing, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Gongsun Liang reached a white-hot stage. Chu Yunfan seemed to have been forced into a corner by Gongsun Liang and kept retreating.","“You’ve reached your limit, but I haven’t done anything yet. Chu Yunfan, today is the day you die!”","Thinking of this, Gongsun Liang’s depressed mood was swept away.","Clang!","The scene of Chu Yunfan’s blood splattering on the spot did not happen. However, a cauldron had appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head. The cauldron spun and blocked the fatal spear strike.","“That’s enough. Even if you’re in the Cosmos Stage, you’re only so-so. Watch me as I kill you.”","Chu Yunfan’s face was no longer as flustered as before. On the contrary, there was only confidence on his face. Earlier, he was simply deceiving Gongsun Liang. Where was the dispirited appearance from before?","In the next moment, the Divinity Slicer appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand. Every pore on his body opened up, and dense golden hairs grew out. In the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already transformed into a golden humanoid hou.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, Gongsun Liang noticed the danger. However, a sword light slashed down. His bright silver spear had already been released and he could not defend. It was slashed by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","Spurt!","Gongsun Liang spat out a mouthful of blood and was instantly sent flying."]},{"number":1753,"title":"Chapter 1753 Killing Gongsun Liang","paragraphs":["1753 Killing Gongsun Liang","Chu Yunfan’s sudden outburst caught Gongsun Liang off guard.","Gongsun Liang had never expected Chu Yunfan to suddenly burst out with strength comparable to the Cosmos Stage. Before this, he thought nothing of Chu Yunfan. A mere Chu Yunfan was not enough to make him look sideways. He only felt that Chu Yunfan was very difficult to deal with, but that was all.","In his opinion, as long as he was careful, he could kill Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan had hidden his strength just to trick him?!","Chu Yunfan knew very well that with his strength, if he went head-on with Gongsun Liang, he might not be able to take him down in a short time. After all, the time Chu Yunfan could maintain his hou form was limited. That was why he needed to use this method. However, just as Chu Yunfan had expected, Gongsun Liang was not prepared and was heavily injured by Chu Yunfan’s sneak attack.","Gongsun Liang wasn’t the only one who didn’t expect Chu Yunfan’s attack. Even the other experts watching from afar didn’t expect it either. Everyone was dumbfounded. They had thought that Chu Yunfan’s ability to fight Gongsun Liang with his Abstract Stage cultivation was already very impressive.","However, who would have thought that Chu Yunfan could actually unleash such a divine ability and severely injure Gongsun Liang in an instant?","“As expected, he still has some tricks up his sleeve. Impressive!” Wan Sanqian’s eyes lit up.","He had long guessed that Chu Yunfan had some trump cards up his sleeve. At the very least, he could escape from the pursuit. However, he did not expect Chu Yunfan to have such a method.","Wan Sanqian sucked in a breath of cold air as if he had thought of something. ‘Maybe he never planned to escape from Gongsun Liang. He wanted to kill Gongsun Liang in one fell swoop!’","If that was the case, then many of Chu Yunfan’s unreasonable points seemed to have a reasonable explanation now. From the very beginning, Chu Yunfan was different from what everyone had imagined. In everyone’s imagination, it was already very difficult for him to fight against a Cosmic and escape.","However, Chu Yunfan’s thoughts were clearly different from everyone else. He probably had the idea of killing Gongsun Liang from the beginning.","Even after seeing Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength, Wan Sanqian was still shocked by Chu Yunfan’s boldness. Even Old Li’s expression changed drastically as he had also thought of this.","If that was really the case, then Chu Yunfan was truly audacious.","Even in a behemoth like the Flying Celestials, Cosmics were considered to be the mainstays of the sect. Not to mention in ordinary sects, that was basically only possible for sect leaders or even grand elders. An ordinary Abstract would not dare to have such a thought. It would take a lot of courage to confront an expert of such a level.","“Chu Yunfan is indeed extraordinary. Now I know why you have high hopes for him,” Old Li said.","However, he didn’t know that even Wan Sanqian was shocked. He had seen all kinds of peerless geniuses, but compared to Chu Yunfan, they seemed to be much dimmer.","“Inform Headquarters to raise Chu Yunfan’s VIP status by another level. If he doesn’t die young, he might become a marquis in the future. If we don’t support him now, we might not have a chance in the future,” Wan Sanqian said.","Old Li nodded. As a place where the Thousand Treasures Pavilion did business, they naturally understood the principle that it was better to send charcoal in the snow than to add icing on the cake. If they didn’t help such a person when they were in the dust, it would be much more difficult to recruit such a person in the future.","At this moment, after being sent flying by Chu Yunfan, Gongsun Liang felt as if his entire body was about to be split into two. The intense pain stimulated his nerves, causing his entire face to twist in agony.","“I’m going to kill you... I’m going to kill you!”","Gongsun Liang was assaulted by intense pain and anger.","“Kill me? I’m afraid you won’t have the chance to do so. Nine Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan shouted!","Gongsun Liang saw a furry claw fall from the sky and stomp a hole in the sky, causing the air to explode. Countless streams of netherworld water spread out in all directions with this claw as the center.","The netherworld world weighing more than a thousand catties formed a monstrous force. In an instant, it landed on Gongsun Liang’s body ruthlessly.","Bam!","Gongsun Liang crashed into the ground like a comet, tearing a huge hole in the ground. With his body as the center, cracks spread out like a spider web. At the same time, a dust wave that was hundreds of feet high was set off. This attack made countless experts who were watching feel their throats go dry as if they had witnessed a world-destroying attack.","“What a terrifying attack. Is this the full strength of a Cosmic?” someone said with his mouth agape.","It was as if all their previous guesses about the Cosmos Stage had disappeared at this moment. It was even more shocking than they had imagined!","Gongsun Liang felt that all the bones in his body were about to collapse. This foot had broken all the bones in his body. As a Cosmic, there was no doubt that his body was strong. His bones were harder than a spirit tool, but now, he had been broken by Chu Yunfan’s foot. Even if he was struck by a supreme-grade spirit weapon, it was impossible for one strike to injure him to such an extent.","The intense pain almost made Gongsun Liang faint!","“Aaaarrrrgggh!” Gongsun Liang roared angrily. His entire body seemed to be boiling. His divine power continuously surged out in an attempt to resist.","However, at this point, how could Chu Yunfan let him go?","“Still trying to resist?”","Chu Yunfan shouted, and the mana in his body boiled. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and his fist force overflowed, producing the Eight Heavenly Dragons. The eight figures condensed into one, forming a whistling force and smashing down fiercely.","Boom!","A mushroom cloud rose into the sky. The powerful fist force crushed everything and destroyed everything.","After a long time, the smoke and dust dispersed. In an incomparably huge pit, Gongsun Liang’s body lay in it. He was a bloody mess and was motionless.","“Gongsun Liang is dead...” someone mumbled."]},{"number":1754,"title":"Chapter 1754 Everyone Was Shocked!","paragraphs":["1754 Everyone Was Shocked!","When the dust settled, everyone was dumbfounded. Before this, the best situation that everyone could think of was that Chu Yunfan would run away after Gongsun Liang’s continuous attacks. It was already not easy for an Abstract to escape from a Cosmic. If it were an ordinary Abstract, this would be enough to brag.","However, Chu Yunfan seemed borned to break the understanding of ordinary people. He was not satisfied with escaping from a Cosmic. Instead, he wanted to kill a Cosmic!","“He did it...” Wan Sanqian was dumbfounded.","No matter what trump card Chu Yunfan had used, he was able to do it. But if he did it, it meant that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength could be compared to this circle. This was very impressive.","From the information Wan Sanqian had gathered, Chu Yunfan just joined the Flying Celestials not long ago. He was only an inner disciple of the sect. Now, in less than a year, even a Cosmic had died in at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Thinking of this, Wan Sanqian was shocked. He had already thought highly of Chu Yunfan before this and even planned to ask the headquarters to raise the evaluation of Chu Yunfan, but now it seemed that he had completely underestimated Chu Yunfan.","If he had valued Chu Yunfan before because he had potential, then it was completely different now. Chu Yunfan had the strength to kill a Cosmic. This was not just potential, but true strength.","Potential was potential. It was just an indicator was was level the person could reach in the future. Strength was different, and Chu Yunfan had strength.","This made Wan Sanqian decide that he had to raise Chu Yunfan’s status by another level.","“Although it’s a little difficult, I think that if the headquarters knew about this battle, they wouldn’t object to raising Chu Yunfan’s status to the same level as those Cosmics from the ten great sects,” Old Li said.","He was also a little shocked. Although Gongsun Liang was nothing in his eyes, he was still a little shocked. Chu Yunfan’s killing of Gongsun Liang with his Abstract Stage cultivation was too shocking. Although he was not at the Cosmos Stage, it did not matter. Having the combat strength of a Cosmic was no different from being a Cosmic.","“Not bad.” Wan Sanqian nodded. “I will put Chu Yunfan’s intelligence collection on a higher level.”","At this moment, in the sky outside the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch, Chu Yunfan returned to his human form. He was expressionless at this moment. He formed a large hand and grabbed Gongsun Liang’s corpse and put it into the Mountain River Diagram. He crushed it into a lump of flesh and blood and poured it into the Brahma Tree.","The others were shocked that Chu Yunfan could kill a Cosmic. However, this was already the third Cosmic that Chu Yunfan had killed. There was Lone Star and the Blood Demon Sect’s leader. Gongsun Liang was the third Cosmic.","To others, the high and mighty Cosmos Stage was not a threat to Chu Yunfan.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, countless middle-grade spirit stones shattered and turned into endless spirit energy that surged into the Brahma Tree. Chu Yunfan could see with his divine will that the Brahma Tree was growing at an astonishing speed, growing bigger and bigger.","Most of the middle-grade spirit stones that he had plundered had been fed to the Brahma Tree, but this was something that he had no choice but to do. He knew that as long as the Brahma Fruit could ripen, his cultivation would advance. When he stepped into the Cosmos Stage, his strength would undergo another earth-shattering change. He wouldn’t need to bat an eyelash at Wang Yifan.","If Wang Yifan wanted to kill him, he wouldn’t be able to. He would only die at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Even if it was Li Qianyuan who attacked, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He had injured Li Qianyuan before, so he was naturally not afraid.","‘I’m coming, Siyu.’ Chu Yunfan clenched his fists.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan departed from the Thousand Treasures Pavilion branch and returned to Baotai.","At this time, they city was still immersed in the shock of Chu Yunfan uprooting all the local major forces. No one knew that such a big thing had happened after Chu Yunfan left the camp. No one knew that Chu Yunfan had just killed a Cosmic.","Upon returning to the military camp in Baotai, Chu Yunfan summoned You Chuyun.","“Senior Chu.” You Chuyun saluted.","“I’m sure you must’ve had it difficult during this time.”","“It wasn’t difficult at all,” You Chuyun answered, “If it weren’t for you, I don’t know when we would have had a breakthrough.”","As You Chuyun spoke, an excited expression appeared on his face. This was because he had broken through to the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage in just this time, and he was only half a step away from stepping into the Void Interpretation Stage.","Previously, he was able to get into the top ten of the inner disciple competition because of Chu Yunfan. He won by simply lying down, but it was different now. He had stepped into the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage, and could be considered worthy of his name.","The other ten of Chu Yunfan’s followers had also stepped into the late Abstract Observance Stage, and their strength increased by quite a bit after following him. It had only been a short time, and all of this had been brought about by Chu Yunfan.","In the Flying Celestials, these people were only considered fringe disciples. Of course, they were not lacking in basic cultivation resources. However, they were not entitled to enjoy the truly top-notch resources. Even a behemoth like the Flying Celestials could not let every disciple enjoy endless resources.","After following Chu Yunfan and uprooting all the major forces in Baotai, they had received a lot of resources. Under the accumulation of many resources, their cultivation naturally advanced by leaps and bounds.","“That’s right. As long as you work for me honestly, you’ll receive benefits,” Chu Yunfan said, “However, your current cultivation is far from enough. Only when you reach the Abstract Interpretation Stage can you help me.”","You Chuyun was startled, and then a look of surprise and joy appeared on his face. “Senior Chu... Are you saying...”","“That’s right. I want to help you break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage in the shortest time possible,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Thank you, Senior Chu!” You Chuyun was overjoyed."]},{"number":1755,"title":"Chapter 1755 Enlightenment Technique, Everyone’s Strength Soars","paragraphs":["1755 Enlightenment Technique, Everyone’s Strength Soars","You Chuyun was surprised and delighted. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to help him break through. Before he followed Chu Yunfan, he imagined that it would take at least 20 to 30 years to reach the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Although he was praised as a genius by many people before he entered the Flying Celestials, his talent had been exhausted to reach this stage. The rest depended on continuous accumulation of effort.","In Grand Xia, whether there was a Cosmic in charge was basically the biggest difference between a high-level family and a low-level family. If he could enter the Cosmos Stage, the You clan he belonged to would benefit greatly.","He had been right to take the risk and rely on Chu Yunfan.","“No need to thank me. I want you to work for me, so of course, I won’t forget to nurture you,” Chu Yunfan said.","He knew that these people who joined him were not bowing down to him because they were convinced by his domineering aura. They were here to pursue their own interests. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t reject such a situation. No one could live without desires.","“This time, I’ll use an enlightenment method to raise your cultivation. At the same time, I’ll impart the comprehension of the Abstract Interpretation Stage to you. After you break through, you need to spend your time consolidating your new power,” Chu Yunfan explained.","The method he was about to use was one of the methods recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. This method could raise a person’s cultivation to a higher level. However, this method could not be used often, or it would affect the foundation and make it impossible to reach the peak of martial arts.","Chu Yunfan would never use such an enlightenment method to increase his strength, but it was fine for You Chuyun because without Chu Yunfan, he had no hope of reaching the peak of martial arts. Therefore, this enlightenment method had its pros and cons. The key was to see who it was used on.","“Thank you, Senior Chu!”","You Chuyun understood that there was no such thing as a free lunch in this world. This enlightenment method definitely had some flaws, but compared to the increase in strength, it was not worth mentioning. Just the time saved was enough for him to try.","Chu Yunfan had You Chuyun sit cross-legged and placed his hand onto You Chuyun’s head. Because of his absolute trust in Chu Yunfan, You Chuyun did not resist. He allowed Chu Yunfan’s divine power to flow into his body through the hand.","Under the guidance of Chu Yunfan’s vast divine power, the divine power in You Chuyun’s body crazily charged toward the Abstract Interpretation Stage. The entire process took half a day.","Suddenly, You Chuyun opened his eyes, and a violent magic power boiled from his body. He clenched his fists as if he still couldn’t believe that he possessed such shocking strength. Compared to half a day ago, he could feel that his strength was at least several times stronger.","He finally understood why the elite disciples of the Flying Celestials were all so high and mighty, completely ignoring inner sect disciples like him. The difference between the two sides was too great and could not be calculated with reason.","With his current cultivation, You Chuyun could easily beat up several of his previous selves. No wonder elite disciples looked down on inner disciples. If it were him now, he would probably look down on his previous self and not take inner disciples seriously.","“This is the power of the Abstract Interpretation Stage!”","He felt the surging divine power in his body, but he could sense it was a little unstable. He understood that this was because the increase in his cultivation level was not smooth and flawless. On the contrary, it was forced by Chu Yunfan.","But thankfully, he was originally at the peak of the Abstract Observance Stage, and only forcefully raising his cultivation by one realm wasn’t too exaggerated. If he continued to improve, he would be able to control this power. For now, he was afraid of failing and collapsing on the spot.","You Chuyun then knelt down. “Thank you for your help, Senior Chu. From now on, if you need anything, I will go through hell fire and high water for you.”","Chu Yunfan looked at You Chuyun and smiled with satisfaction. “There’s no need for that. You just have to do as I tell you to. Go and call the others over.”","Chu Yunfan calmed the boiling divine power in his body. The consumption of his divine power was comparable to fighting a big battle. Fortunately, his recovery ability was shocking and it did not take long for him to recover.","Right now, he just wanted to raise the strength of You Chuyun and the others. Even if it was a little bit of pulling the seedlings to help them grow, he did not care. After all, compared to others, their foundation was too weak. They could not be mentioned in the same breath. He had to use all kinds of methods to improve them.","Soon, You Chuyun brought Chu Yunfan’s followers, who were wearing surprised smiles, to the office. Chu Yunfan then raised their strength one by one, but the difficulty was different from raising You Chuyun’s strength. The others were only raised from the late Abstract Observance Stage to the peak Abstract Observance Stage, and didn’t need to cross a major cultivation level.","Therefore, the time needed was much less than You Chuyun’s. Even with ten people, it only took one day to complete everything.","“Thank you for helping us improve our cultivation, Senior Chu.”","After Chu Yunfan helped them improve their cultivation, the ten of them bowed to Chu Yunfan.","“For the upcoming period, I will be entering seclusion to cultivate and strive to improve. I will leave the camp to you,” Chu Yunfan announced, “I raised your strength in the hopes that you will be of great use in the future. I hope that when I come out of seclusion, all the troops will have reached the Golden Core Stage and above.”","“Understood, Senior Chu.” Everyone quickly agreed."]},{"number":1756,"title":"Chapter 1756 Three Month Seclusion, Reborn","paragraphs":["1756 Three Month Seclusion, Reborn","After giving instructions to the garrison, Chu Yunfan entered seclusion. This time, he was going to break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. With this breakthrough, his combat power would undergo a tremendous change. He could then truly fight against Cosmics.","Although he would not be able to enter the Cosmos Stage by then, his combat strength would be comparable to an expert of that level. This was the most important thing.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and gathered all his divine power, forming a huge vortex in his body. It slowly got bigger and bigger and finally became a huge storm. At the same time, countless middle-grade spirit stones around Chu Yunfan exploded, turning into countless spirit energy that surged into Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan swallowed the last Great Essence Cultivator Pill, and countless medicinal effects were released. He released all of this power and directed it as it began to charge toward the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","With the experience of helping You Chuyun break through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage, Chu Yunfan was not completely ignorant about the Abstract Interpretation Stage. On the contrary, he had experience in breaking through to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Although the difficulty of You Chuyun’s breakthrough and Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough were simply heaven and earth, it was still an experience to learn from. With this experience, it was much easier for Chu Yunfan to break through. Now that he had a direction, he followed its path.","Time passed as Chu Yunfan remained in seclusion, and three months passed in the blink of an eye.","For Baotai, these three months were probably the most intense three months in thousands of years. The original forces of the city had been completely wiped out, and the only ones left were those loyal to Chu Yunfan. At least on the surface, they had joined Chu Yunfan’s forces.","All the forces that opposed Chu Yunfan were wiped out by the garrison army, and the person himself had disappeared during these three months. It was rumored that he had gone into seclusion. However, the garrison did not become idle and continued to train day and night.","Among the many armies of Grand Xia, the defenders of Baotai were not even considered a second-tier army. They could only be considered a third-tier local garrison. The frequency of normal training was quite limited, but ever since Chu Yunfan took over the place, he began to train the troops here day and night. Fortunately, these soldiers were martial artists, and none of them were weak.","During these three months, the locals listened to the sounds of training coming from inside the camp with trepidation. Everyone knew what would be the results of such rigorous training. Although they could not see the exact situation, many people could seen the energy rising from the camp.","They were all terrified to find that the military energy above the camp was continuously condensing. Originally, the military energy above the camp was very scattered. It was a complete mess and could barely be condensed. However, it was different now.","After months of high-intensity training, the military energy became denser and stronger. Some people could even see the military energy when they looked closely. This was clearly something that only the front-line army of Grand Xia could do. It was difficult for a second-tier troop to condense a solid military spirit, let alone a third-tier local garrison troop.","It was an almost impossible miracle. The true elites had long been transferred to the frontline army. One could imagine how much the defenders of Baotai had changed in the past three months.","Many people were shocked because they understood that if an army was to be reborn in three months, it would be next to impossible it. It was simply impossible to raise a local garrison to the elite level in three months. Even if the soldiers were warriors and cultivators, it was impossible for them to reach this stage. They had to train day and night to squeeze out their potential, and without enough resources to support them, they would only be trained to death.","In other words, in the past three months of practice, the strength of Baotai’s garrison had undergone earth-shaking changes. It was unknown how many resources had been invested in it. However, when they thought about how Chu Yunfan had just uprooted all the major forces and exterminated their families, there was a reasonable source for the resources used by these garrison troops for training.","But even so, many people still felt speechless. Although it was not their family’s assets, Chu Yunfan’s generosity still made many people incredulous. The amount invested in this was an astronomical figure. If they were his personal troops or followers, they might understand. However, this local garrison was ultimately part of Grand Xia’s army. Many people could not understand why Chu Yunfan was so generous.","However, some smart people guessed Chu Yunfan’s thoughts.","“He’s a divine dragon soaring in the sky. How can he be willing to waste his time in Baotai? It’s not worth it because his horizons and heights are completely different.”","Someone revealed Chu Yunfan’s true purpose and thoughts, which were completely different from what these people thought, because their levels were completely different.","Although the garrison troops were in the midst of intense training, they did not completely disappear. On the contrary, to pursue the remnants of the previously major factions in Baotai, the garrison troops attacked many times. Under You Chuyun’s leadership, they crushed the counterattack of these forces. The old forces were no match for the troops.","This made many people who knew about it dumbfounded. The speed at which the strength of the troops increased shocked everyone. They had all stepped into the Golden Core Stage. The officers among them had stepped into the Abstract Stage. In Grand Xia, this was the strength of the elite troops.","However, the remnants of the major forces in Baotai, who were being hunted down everywhere, never stopped their counterattack. On this day, a group of strange people in blood-red robes, led by a group of experts in luxurious robes, rushed toward the camp.","In an instant, the military energy of Baotai’s troops evolved and transformed into the phantom of a soldier. This phantom had a spear in its hand and instantly slashed at the intruders."]},{"number":1757,"title":"Chapter 1757 The Attack of a Cosmic","paragraphs":["1757 The Attack of a Cosmic","The concentration of military energy in the Baotai garrison was the densest in the entire city. Especially after three months of training, only a portion of the soldiers were Core Formers. Most of them had stepped into the Golden Core Stage.","The increase in strength was extremely fast. The strength and morale of the soldiers grew at an astonishing speed, and all of this was reflected in the phantom soldier. This soldier was the projection of the Baotai’s garrison army. Coupled with Grand Xia’s might, it was truly terrifying.","Slash!","A few of the strange people in red robes who could not react in time were slashed, and their bodies exploded in mid-air. Their robes were torn apart, and everyone finally saw their identities. They were the Blood Demons of the Demon God Sect.","“Enemies attacking!”","Everyone in the camp sensed something and immediately reacted. There was an enemy attack. You Chuyun took the lead and leaped into the air. Behind him, the Flying Celestials experts followed closely behind.","You Chuyun looked up at the majestic line-up of at least ten Blood Demons in the sky. In addition to the experts leading them, each of them was an expert above the Abstract Stage. These people added up to a hundred.","Baotai’s garrison only had the strength of 500 people. If these intruders were allowed to charge in and break through the army formation, the entire camp would be massacred.","You Chuyun instantly recognized the figures in luxurious robes. They were all the remnants of the major forces in Baotai. He had been hunting these remnants for the last few months. He had not expected them to collude with the Demon God Sect and attack the Baotai garrison.","“You dared to collude with the Demon God Sect? You’re dead!” You Chuyun shouted.","“At this point, do we still want to live? After we kill Chu Yunfan’s lackeys and Chu Yunfan himself, we’ll immediately flee to the Hu tribe. Do you think you can go deep into the Hu tribe to kill us? That’s just ridiculous!”","The leader of the group, a middle-aged man, laughed. His eyes were filled with killing intent and hatred. He was an elder of the Ding clan. If Chu Yunfan had not uprooted the Ding clan, he would still be a high and mighty figure in Baotai. Although they could escape to the Hu tribe now, who would be willing to flee to the outer realms if they had no other choice?","After all, barbarians were no different from beasts. Now that they were going to associate with beasts, it was all Chu Yunfan’s fault. How could they not resent him?","“Those who betray Grand Xia will die. None of you will escape!” You Chuyun shouted, “Get into formation and kill the enemy!”","The troops behind him got into formation. The three months of hellish cultivation were now fully displayed. In just a moment, these soldiers had formed a battle formation. With the support of the soldiers’ morale, the phantom soldier above the camp became even more solid. It once again waved the iron spear in its hand and slashed down at the enemy.","Boom!","However, this attack did not land on these powerful enemies. Instead, it landed on a blood-red barrier. A massive explosion erupted and the entire world trembled.","“How is this possible?” You Chuyun was bewildered. The morale of Baotai’s soldiers had condensed into a phantom. Even Abstracts that came here would die, and even several of them would be killed in one attack. Although the soldiers in the army were not worth mentioning compared to these martial arts experts, one or two, or even ten or eight, would be easily slaughtered if the troops formed a battle formation. If the number of people reached a certain level, the outcome would be completely reversed.","In the beginning, You Chuyun had not thought much of these remnants. Mere Abstracts daring to attack the military camp was simply courting death. For the past few years, Grand Xia was able to suppress the world. Regardless of whether it was the ten great sects of the righteous path or the demonic path, they were no match for Grand Xia. A large part of the reason was because of this huge army. Of course, it was not that there were no top experts who could deal with such an army, but they were definitely not Abstracts.","Who knew that this attack would be blocked?","A figure appeared in the sky. It was a monster with a pair of wings, a blood-red body, a red face, and fangs. It was more than twice as tall as an ordinary Blood Demon.","“Tsk, tsk. Leave this to me. No lowly garrison is a match for me. I’ll leave the rest to you. Kill all these people and leave no one alive.” The monster laughed strangely. His voice was hoarse and unpleasant like a night owl.","Immediately after, countless blood-red lights appeared on the monster’s body. These blood-red lights turned into chains, locking the phantom soldier in the sky. The phantom roared angrily and tried to struggle free, but it could not escape.","“A Cosmic Blood Demon!” You Chuyun’s pupils dilated.","No wonder these remnants had the guts to attack the camp. It turned out that there was a Cosmic Blood Demon guarding them.","Throughout Grand Xia, Cosmics were high and mighty figures. They had separated themselves from ordinary living beings, and the appearance of every such expert was tantamount to a disaster for the enemy.","“Kill them and avenge our relatives. Let these people pay with their blood!” the Ding clan leader shouted.","“D*mn you traitors!” You Chuyun gritted his teeth. His first reaction was to call on Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan was still in seclusion at the moment, so he could not be counted on.","“Use the Divinity Breakers and shoot them all to death!” You Chuyun ordered.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Two long arrows flew through the sky. One Blood Demon and one major force remnant were shot through and nailed to the ground. The Divinity Breaker Crossbows appeared, but before You Chuyun could rejoice, two loud explosions were heard, and the crossbows were shattered."]},{"number":1758,"title":"Chapter 1758 What a Terrifying Arrow! What a Terrifying Chu Yunfan!","paragraphs":["1758 What a Terrifying Arrow! What a Terrifying Chu Yunfan!","The Divinity Breaker Crossbows were shattered!","Though most of the soldiers were in the Golden Core Stage, it was impossible for them to break through even if there were a hundred Abstracts. In fact, they would be slaughtered if this went on. This was the reason why ordinary martial arts experts found it difficult to break through the army formation. Those who could charge through thousands of troops must be top-notch experts. And without a doubt, experts in the Cosmos Stage had such strength.","Even when facing such an elite army, Cosmics were not afraid.","“Go! Kill them!”","The faction remnants and the Demon God Sect experts charged forward.","“D*mn it!” You Chuyun was enraged.","With the Divinity Breakers, as long as he had enough time, these invaders would not be able to escape. One arrow could kill one. These crossbows were specially developed to deal with Abstracts. It was even rumored that the imperial guards of Grand Xia had a Super Divinity Breaker Crossbow that was specially designed for Cosmics. It was truly a national weapon, and one arrow could kill a Cosmic. However, that was the greatest weapon of Grand Xia. Ordinary people would not even be able to see it.","Now that the Divinity Breakers had been destroyed, there weren’t many methods left for You Chuyun. “Get into formation and kill the enemy!” he shouted as the divine power in his body surged. He activated the power of the entire garrison army to resist the hundreds of experts.","The entire army was in danger because there were too many experts on the enemy’s side. There were more than a hundred of them, and the Baotai garrison only had 500 people. For a moment, the army was forced to retreat. At the same time, the phantom soldier was being suppressed by the Blood Demon leader. They could not free their hands to kill the enemy.","“Hahahaha! I want your garrison to be wiped out!” the Ding clan remnant laughed, his expression incomparably ferocious.","Boom!","The army’s formation was broken by all kinds of attacks. In an instant, the entire garrison took a few steps back and spat out a mouthful of blood. They were heavily injured.","“Where’s Chu Yunfan? I want to personally kill him as a sacrifice for the vengeful souls of my clan!” the Ding clan remnant said as he laughed wildly.","“Looking for me?”","A clear voice came from the colonel’s office in the camp. Then, a large hand condensed out of thin air and slapped down.","Bam!","The Ding clan remnant didn’t even have time to react before he was struck. He seemed to suffer a heavy blow as he exploded into a mass of flesh and blood.","All of a sudden, there was silence. Even the faction remnants and the Blood Demons who had been shouting and killing just now were stunned. They felt a chill down their backs. What kind of shocking strength was this? They knew that the Ding clan remnant managed to become their leader because of his strength. He was one of the best among them and was an Interpreter.","However, this Interpreter had been slapped into a pile of flesh and blood. What a terrifying scene this was. What did this mean? This meant that the strength of the person who attacked had really reached a shocking level!","In the next moment, a figure appeared in midair. That person was wearing a moon-white robe and looked valiant, like a banished immortal.","Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at the Blood Demons’ leader. Suddenly, the leader felt goosebumps on his back as if he were being stared at by an ancient vicious beast.","“A puny Cosmic?”","When many people heard this, they could not accept it. To them, what was a Cosmic? They were like immortals who were high above the masses. The appearance of every Cosmic was extremely terrifying to them.","“Stupid human. Do you think hiding in the camp is of any use?” the Blood Demon leader looked at Chu Yunfan with a sinister smile. He could already tell that Chu Yunfan was only at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. After all, there was a huge difference between the mana on one’s body and that of a Cosmic.","The Abstract Stage was just the Abstract Stage, while the Cosmos Stage was the Cosmos Stage. They were completely different.","The Blood Demon leader thought that Chu Yunfan was just talking nonsense because he had the protection of the camp’s military formation. A mere Interpreter dared to clamor in front of him? Wasn’t that courting death?","The Blood Demon leader shot out an arrow with his bow.","Whoosh!","The long arrow tore through the sky like a rocket. In an instant, it was already heading toward Chu Yunfan’s face.","“Watch out!”","You Chuyun was instantly shocked. He had already witnessed the power of the Blood Demon leader’s arrows. Two had destroyed the Divinity Breakers.","Those crossbows were developed by Grand Xia. It was specially used to deal with martial arts experts. How could they be so easily destroyed? However, they failed to withstand those arrow shots. One could imagine how powerful the bow of the Blood Demon leader was.","However, it was too late. The arrow turned into a blood-red light and went straight for Chu Yunfan’s face. But to everyone’s surprise, Chu Yunfan managed to catch the arrow in his hand with a loud boom.","Everyone could see that the arrow was only an inch away from Chu Yunfan’s forehead. After he grabbed the arrow, the tail of the arrow shook violently. One could imagine how terrifying the power of this arrow was. It could even pierce through a mountain, but Chu Yunfan managed to block such an arrow so easily.","Everyone was shocked.","“What a terrifying arrow! And what an even more terrifying Chu Yunfan!”","At this moment, many warriors of the city had surrounded the camp from afar. They were all alarmed by this sudden attack, but they did not dare to approach. The battlefield where the two sides were fighting was no different from hell to them. They only saw a blur in front of their eyes, and then Chu Yunfan caught the arrow.","This scene was too shocking."]},{"number":1759,"title":"Chapter 1759 Insta-Killing the Blood Demon Leader","paragraphs":["1759 Insta-Killing the Blood Demon Leader","The more terrifying the arrow was, the more shocked they were when Chu Yunfan caught it.","Although Chu Yunfan had uprooted many large factions, including the Ding clan, in reality, he was at most at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. They thought he was not much different from them, and there was still a possibility of him being killed.","After all, Chu Yunfan had just become an elite disciple of the Flying Celestials and was assigned here. Everyone knew a little about the elite disciples of the Flying Celestials. However, he was only an Interpreter. Although he was powerful, he was not invincible.","But now, it seemed that the situation was completely different from what they had expected. Chu Yunfan was more than twice as strong as they had expected.","“Beasts will always be beasts.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. Then, he made his move and threw the arrow.","Whoosh!","The arrow was sent flying back at a speed faster than it had come, creating a terrifying storm. In the blink of an eye, it split into more than ten arrow lights in the sky.","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Wherever the arrow light passed, it was simply invincible. More than ten experts were nailed to the ground and died instantly. The remaining faction remnants and Blood Demons were slaughtered by Chu Yunfan in an instant.","“The colonel is mighty!” someone shouted, and the morale of the garrison soldiers soared.","When they were panicking, Chu Yunfan’s appearance was like dew after a long drought, saving them from an extreme crisis. The Interpreter enemies who were originally the strongest and acted as the vanguard were killed by a casual blow.","What kind of shocking strength was this?!","Everyone’s morale soared, and their confidence increased greatly. In contrast, the illusory image formed by the originally dim military energy instantly solidified again. The phantom formed by the military energy was closely related to the morale of the garrison troops. The higher the morale of the garrison troops, the more powerful the phantom was. It began to break free from the blood-red chains.","“I’ll deal with that beast and leave the rest to you. Kill them all and leave no one alive,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Of course, he could have killed all the invading enemies by himself, but he did not choose to do so. He wanted to leave them for the garrison to practice. All talk and no action, without going through the baptism of wind and rain, could only be considered a flower that grew up in a greenhouse.","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of the Blood Demon leader in a flash. He casually grabbed the chains that bound the phantom soldier and crushed them into pieces.","“It’s your turn. Tell me, how do you want to die?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","The Blood Demon leader was furious. Chu Yunfan was looking down on him, and the anger in his heart instantly erupted.","The Blood Demon leader finally couldn’t help but attack. Blood energy spread out and condensed into a terrifying blood-red figure in the sky. It condensed into a blood-red palm and covered Chu Yunfan. This attack was a top-notch martial arts technique. It landed on the spot, leaving Chu Yunfan with no way to escape or dodge.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and a shocking sword appeared on his palm, condensing into a sword light. This sword light was surrounded by layers of purple lightning. With a swing of the sword, the blood-red hand was cut off.","Boom!","The blood-red hand fell to the ground and dissipated into blood energy that filled the sky.","“What the...” The Blood Demon leader immediately became wary. He could feel the power that could pose a fatal threat to him from Chu Yunfan’s sword.","“Seven Violet Thunder Swords!” Chu Yunfan said.","At the same time, six swords appeared behind Chu Yunfan, forming a sword array with the sword in his hand. They spun around him, protecting him.","The Blood Demon leader could feel that the lightning energy contained in the sword light was restraining him.","“So, you have an ultimate technique. No wonder you’re so arrogant!” The Blood Demon leader snorted.","The demonic energy in his body gathered again and formed a blood-red horn on his head. With the support of this blood-red horn, his aura became even more powerful. He rushed toward Chu Yunfan and slapped him again. The terrifying blood energy was like a sea of blood as it pressed down on Chu Yunfan. He looked like a demon.","“You are nothing.”","This shocking scene was nothing in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. He threw out a punch.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Eight terrifying figures condensed into the fist force and instantly blasted out.","Bam!","An earth-shattering collision was heard. Then, a scene that left everyone dumbstruck appeared. Chu Yunfan’s punch caused one of the Blood Demon leader’s arms to explode and evaporate.","“Impossible!” The Blood Demon leader screamed and retreated. His full-powered attack failed to block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“Weakling. A beast will always be a beast.”","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar. The Blood Demon leader looked strong, but he was a level lower than Gongsun Liang.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. Behind him, seven swords flew out and gathered into a shocking sword light, which swept across.","Stab!","The Blood Demon leader screamed as his chest was pierced through. His limbs and head were cut off at the same time.","He died instantly!"]},{"number":1760,"title":"Chapter 1760 The Whole City Surrenders","paragraphs":["1760 The Whole City Surrenders","There was no earth-shattering battle. For a battle at the Cosmos Stage, this could only be described as an instant kill. It was completely different from what many people had imagined. Chu Yunfan had killed the leader of the Blood Demons in a few moves.","In the eyes of the garrison soldiers, such a straightforward style naturally boosted their morale. It was the courage of the army. The more powerful a general was, the more the army could be united. No one understood better than them, the third-line garrison troops, how useful it was to have a powerful general.","It didn’t matter to them who the garrison leader was because they were still at the lowest level. Each of these garrison leaders treated the experience of guarding a region as a gilded experience.","In fact, there were many who did not even want to enter Grand Xia and only wanted to cultivate to the peak of the martial path. These people did not care about the garrisons stationed in various places. There were not many who could cultivate according to the code every day.","Not to mention people like Chu Yunfan, who plundered all kinds of resources to provide for their cultivation, unless they were descendants of military families. It was because of this that they had made a comeback in just a few months.","At this moment, their morale soared. One could imagine that Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless. And as the foundation that Chu Yunfan had carefully nurtured, their future was also limitless. In fact, he could even gain wealth and become one of the rulers of Grand Xia in the future.","After their morale was boosted, the entire army formation became even more terrifying. They began to surround and kill the experts who were attacking.","On the other hand, the experts who were attacking felt like their guts were about to break. Without the support of the Blood Demon leader, they had no way of fighting Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was flying high in the air, looking down at them like a god. It felt as if a ferocious beast from ancient times had its eyes on them.","These people were a motley crew. They had gathered from all directions. As soon as the Blood Demon leader was killed, they began to flee in all directions. However, how could they escape? The 500 garrison soldiers flew into the air and formed a huge army formation, surrounding them.","If it was said that they were the ones who charged at the army formation before, then the situation was completely opposite now. They were surrounded by the army formation. Without Cosmics, they had no chance of successfully charging into the military camp.","After all, the garrison had undergone such a long period of training and had been reborn. They were completely different from before.","The soldiers in the battle formation attacked directly. Every time they waved their iron spears, they could kill a few Abstracts. At this moment, the true terror of a regular army was truly displayed.","It did not take long for these experts to be slaughtered by the garrison army. Some of them even panicked. They wanted to escape, but they could not cause any casualties to the garrison of Baotai. Even if some of them hardened their hearts and wanted to counterattack, they could not do anything against the soldiers who had formed a formation. If it were just hundreds of ordinary Golden Cores, they would probably be killed in an instant when faced with these experts. But now, it had become their death wish.","Seeing this scene, the remaining neutral forces in Baotai were shocked. After today’s battle, how could they not understand that from now on, Baotai would be Chu Yunfan’s territory?","There was no chance of turning the tables.","Even if all of them joined forces, they would not be able to resist Chu Yunfan’s finger. From now on, Chu Yunfan’s words in Baotai were equivalent to an imperial edict. Many people felt that it was extremely ridiculous. It was simply unbelievable that a Cosmic had appeared in a small border city like Baotai. Even in Grand Xia, an expert of that level could be considered an expert. They could be a general in any army.","However, no matter what they thought, they could not change the final outcome. After fifteen minutes, the hundreds of experts who attacked the military camp were all killed. Although some of the garrison troops were heavily injured, no one died. The army formation protected them well.","Chu Yunfan looked at the garrison army half-kneeling in front of him with satisfaction. After this bloody battle, this garrison army could be considered to be almost elite. If one wanted to become a true elite, it was not just about being strong. One must have the spirit to draw their swords even when facing a strong enemy that they could not defeat. Otherwise, they could not be considered elites.","After this battle, there were some signs of elite soldiers in the city’s garrison. This was Chu Yunfan’s basic plan. When the time came, as long as he expanded the defense of Baotai, it would be a large army.","“Clean up the battlefield and return to the camp to continue training.”","Under Chu Yunfan’s command, the troops began to clean up the battlefield in small teams. The corpses of these experts were naturally precious resources. However, for the current Chu Yunfan, only the Cosmic Blood Demon leaders could make him look at them. He grabbed them into the Mountain River Diagram and watered the Brahma Tree. As for the rest, they were handed over to You Chuyun to deal with, to strengthen the strength of Baotai’s garrison.","Chu Yunfan saw that in the Mountain River Diagram, on the herb mountain, the Brahma Tree was growing more and more majestic. On the branches, the Brahma Fruit was also maturing. When this Brahma Fruit ripens, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation will definitely improve.","The result of this battle was spreading at an astonishing speed, spreading to the entire Baotai. For a moment, everyone was at a loss for words. It had been many years since Baotai had seen a garrison leader who could kill a Cosmic.","For a time, the situation in Baotai, which had been turbulent, disappeared without a trace overnight. It was as if those who opposed Chu Yunfan had disappeared. The powerful Chu Yunfan had taken control of the entire Baotai overnight.","However, at this moment, a transfer order from the Ministry of War was sent to the garrison."]},{"number":1761,"title":"Chapter 1761 Even in a Battlefield of a Million, I Can Move Unhindered","paragraphs":["1761 Even in a Battlefield of a Million, I Can Move Unhindered","In the colonel’s office of the garrison, Chu Yunfan was sitting on a chair, holding a transfer order from the Ministry of War. He had just sent off the envoy from the Ministry of War, and his eyes flickered with a sharp light.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold because this transfer order was to mobilize the guards of Baotai to participate in the mopping up of the demons.","To prevent the surrounding enemies from becoming stronger, Grand Xia would carry out a large-scale clean-up operation every once in a while. Especially against the demons, which were the greatest enemy of the human race, this was even more important.","Every three years, there would be a spring sweep. A million troops would enter the demon region. Wherever they swept through, all the demon tribes would be uprooted. If they encountered a demon army, they would be wiped out. It was a large operation. Other than a few fixed troops that could not be mobilized to prevent the Hu tribe, Barbarian tribe, and other foreign tribes from causing trouble, almost all the elites of Grand Xia had to be mobilized. From this, it could be seen that Grand Xia was many times stronger than Great Wei.","Back then, Great Wei had no way to deal with the Ultimate West Demon League. They could only take a beating passively. At most, they could only gather the strength of the humans to resist.","However, Grand Xia was completely different. It could retaliate and launch a powerful sweep. An army of a million, especially an army that contained experts at least at the Golden Core Stage, would consume an astronomical amount of resources. Even the Federation, which was extremely rich in resources, could not organize such an army. It was estimated that if they mobilized 100,000 people, the entire Federation would be completely bankrupt.","It was impossible to raise a true dragon in the water. It was also because of this that only Grand Xia had the ability to produce experts. There were almost countless experts supporting the powerful national strength of Grand Xia.","However, what Chu Yunfan saw was naturally different from what ordinary people saw. Grand Xia often mobilized millions of troops to wipe out the demons, but they did not force the demons into a life-and-death struggle. Instead, the purpose of Grand Xia leading their troops into the demon region, other than weakening the strength of the demons, was to train the soldiers.","It wasn’t strange for Chu Yunfan to understand this. He was once a general of the Federation, so he understood the thoughts of the higher-ups. To gather such a large army, the amount of resources required was simply astronomical. Under such circumstances, they had to fight steadily and would not advance rashly. They would even retreat after clearing the area. If there was no other strategic purpose, it would be a waste of manpower and money.","However, generally speaking, only the most elite first-line troops would be mobilized to participate in the clean-up work. Even the second-line troops were only auxiliaries. As for the local garrison troops, they would not be mobilized at all.","These troops were more than enough to maintain the peace of one side, but if they joined the battle of a million soldiers, they would be courting death. Even if there were hundreds of thousands of ordinary garrison troops, they would be easily killed by a few Cosmics. They would not be able to fight back. It was because of this that the transfer order from the Ministry of War was clearly strange.","However, Chu Yunfan was not surprised, because even if he did not have conclusive evidence, he could guess that it was mostly related to Li Qianyuan. He had a lot of enemies, but who else could have the power to influence the transfer order of the Ministry of War except Li Qianyuan?","“No, I’m going to write a letter to the Ministry of War and ask them to withdraw this ridiculous transfer order,” You Chuyun said gloomily.","After several months, the Flying Celestials promoted him to an elite disciple. His official status was second only to Chu Yunfan’s. In terms of the system, even a vice-captain had the right to submit a petition to the Ministry of War.","However, Chu Yunfan waved and said, “It’s no use. Just give the order. Even if it’s a mountain of blades or a sea of flames, we have to go. Otherwise, we’ll be disobeying military orders. Don’t you know the consequences of disobeying military orders?”","You Chuyun’s expression suddenly froze. Of course, he knew the consequences of disobeying military orders. Chu Yunfan had previously wantonly uprooted the nails of the various large factions in the garrison army, using the reason of disobeying military orders. Disobeying military orders was a capital offense. There was even the so-called Hundred Execution Order in Grand Xia’s army. In other words, there were hundreds of rules. As long as one violated them, one would die.","This was Chu Yunfan’s method to clean up dissidents, but now it was used by Li Qianyuan. Unless Chu Yunfan could also make a great contribution and be conferred the title of marquis, he would not be able to resist Li Qianyuan’s petty tricks.","“Besides, how can we see a rainbow without experiencing the wind and rain? Without experiencing these things, when will the garrison grow into a true elite army? Since we can’t avoid it, then let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan was not afraid. Although this transfer order was very sudden, with his current strength, he was not afraid of Li Qianyuan’s tricks. He could even kill a Cosmic. Even on a battlefield of this level, he could dominate.","However, he was only at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Such a cultivation was probably too confusing. If an ordinary Cosmic was not careful, they might be instantly killed by him.","You Chuyun suddenly reacted. The current garrison army was completely different from the inside out. Compared to the first-line elites of Grand Xia, they were only stronger and not weaker.","It was simply a super luxurious configuration.","“That’s right. Since they want us to go to the battlefield, there’s nothing to be afraid of. I think this is still a place where we can get military merits!” You Chuyun grew excited as he spoke.","“But we still have to be careful. In a battlefield of this level, our priority is to protect ourselves,” Chu Yunfan said.","He was not so arrogant as to think that the garrison could do whatever they wanted. In a battle of a million people, Cosmics were usually enough to protect themselves. That was a true war that could destroy a country."]},{"number":1762,"title":"Chapter 1762 The Human-Demon Battlefield, Pingyao City","paragraphs":["1762 The Human-Demon Battlefield, Pingyao City","“Prepare yourselves. In ten days, we’ll rush to the human-demon battlefield.”","With Chu Yunfan’s order, the entire garrison began to prepare.","This news also spread throughout Baotai. Many people were talking about it. There were many people who could understand this matter. Although they didn’t know who was causing trouble for Chu Yunfan, they knew that the third-line troops such as Baotai’s garrison had been transferred to the front line. There was clearly something going on.","If the demons invaded the border, it would have been fine. But now that it was Grand Xia that wanted to mobilize a local garrison troop. This kind of third-tier troops didn’t even have the qualifications to transport military rations in the Grand Xia army.","However, they only dared to discuss it in private and did not dare to speak recklessly. Chu Yunfan had just uprooted all the major forces and slaughtered a Cosmic in front of many people. How could they dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan?","Ten days passed quickly amid the chaos.","Ten days later, in the cold wind and early spring, the defenders of Baotai embarked on their journey to the human-demon battlefield. After a day and a night of marching, the garrison of Baotai was close to the border of the human-demon battlefield.","As expected, it was completely different from a small border city like Baotai. The cities were far away and stood in the depths of the horizon. This was the place where the entire human-demon battlefield really erupted.","Further west was the Hundred Thousand Mountains in the demon region. There were countless poisonous insects and miasma in the Hundred Thousand Mountains that blocked the advance of the human army. After so many years of sweeping, they had only swept to the edge of the Hundred Thousand Mountains.","The real demons were in the depths of the Hundred Thousand Mountains. That was the paradise of the demons and not a place where humans could live. It was impossible to estimate how many terrifying demons were lurking there.","Chu Yunfan followed the guards of Baotai. From afar, he saw an extremely desolate and ancient aura. The Hundred Thousand Mountains was like a ferocious beast from the primordial era that was lurking. It gave people the illusion that it could pounce on them at any time.","This reminded Chu Yunfan of the records of the Hundred Thousand Mountains in “The World” book written by the Flying Celestials. It was rumored that the Hundred Thousand Mountains had already existed in the distant past. It was even rumored that the Hundred Thousand Mountains had evolved from the body of a demon emperor after his death in the primordial era.","What surprised Chu Yunfan even more was that he found similar records in the memory of the Alchemy Emperor. However, the era of the Alchemy Emperor should be the ancient times, and the Hundred Thousand Mountains seemed to have existed even longer than that ancient time. If that was really the case, then the Hundred Thousand Mountains was truly extraordinary.","Chu Yunfan immediately threw these distracting thoughts out of his mind and flew up. He opened his eyes and could see countless powerful auras traversing the sky from afar. The essence, qi, and spirit of countless demons and humans were too condensed and pierced through the sky like terrifying pillars of qi.","These auras were dense and endless. From afar, they stirred up the wind and clouds on the entire battlefield. Even Chu Yunfan was shocked. He came from the Federation. Although he knew about it long ago, he had only seen the tip of the iceberg of Grand Xia now.","“With such terrifying strength, any random army stationed in it can probably sweep through the entire Federation.”","Even Chu Yunfan had to admit that not to mention these first-line elites, even the guards of Baotai that he led were enough to wipe out the Federation on their own. Though the Federation had nuclear bombs, it would be useless. Hundreds of Golden Cores were simply invincible. Not to mention, there were also Abstracts among them. Even the nuclear bombs of the Federation could not hurt many Abstracts. Unless it was a nuclear bomb with a large yield, it was possible to kill them in one fell swoop before they could react.","However, Chu Yunfan estimated that the nuclear bomb would have lost its effect when it came to Cosmics. It would be difficult for it to pose any threat to these Cosmics.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan saw a huge city standing in the middle of the mountains. It was the headquarters of Grand Xia in the Hundred Thousand Mountains. It was Pingyao City. It was a huge city that could accommodate tens of millions of people.","Countless experts were stationed there, and powerful auras covered the sky. Any scouting methods would be useless under the shielding of these auras. Detection methods such as Divine Telekinesis would be vaporized by the powerful blood essence of countless experts the moment they approached.","Other than these martial arts experts, there were also 200,000 soldiers stationed in the city all year round. These 200,000 soldiers did not seem like a lot, but if the weakest among them was an existence above the Abstract Stage, then these 200,000 soldiers would be extremely terrifying. Other than the Imperial Guards, this was one of the most terrifying armies of Grand Xia. Just these 200,000 troops were comparable to an army of millions. Killing ordinary demon troops was as terrifying as chopping melons and vegetables. Abstracts who were regarded as geniuses in the outside world or even pillars of a region were just ordinary soldiers here.","Although he had done a lot of research before coming here, Chu Yunfan still gasped when he saw it. Just this army alone had stopped countless counterattacks from the demons, firmly blocking the demons’ power in the Hundred Thousand Mountains. Otherwise, how could Grand Xia’s homeland be peaceful and prosperous?","Even if they were as powerful as the demons, they could only nurture evil sects like the Demon God Sect to infiltrate Grand Xia. They were unable to break through the defenses of Pingyao with their armies.","The location of Pingyao was ideal. It was firmly locked at the exit of the Hundred Thousand Mountains. To reach this place, countless martyrs had sacrificed their lives and blood. Countless casualties had pushed the battle line to this place. It could be considered as isolating the demons’ forces.","Soon, the person who was in charge of scouting, came forward to confirm the identity of the troop. After confirming the identity of Baotai’s troop, although he was a little puzzled as to why a local garrison troop would be mobilized, he quickly returned to the camp to report. Someone came and led Chu Yunfan and the others to the military camp on the battlefield."]},{"number":1763,"title":"Chapter 1763 The Conspiracy Continues, Fearless","paragraphs":["1763 The Conspiracy Continues, Fearless","There were more than ten thousand people, and they covered the mountains and plains, not to mention the million-strong army stationed in one place. It was truly endless, and the tents were lined up like a long dragon. Grand Xia was very generous this time around. A million elite troops gathered in the Hundred Thousand Mountains could be described as Mount Tai bearing down. As the only garrison force that had been mobilized, the soldiers of Baotai were not treated much better in their tents. Basically, the civilian camp was next to them.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t care. After settling down the troops, he left the tent and flew into the sky. He looked down at the entire battlefield. At this time, the entire battlefield was already filled with flames. The situation on the battlefield was chaotic.","The army of Grand Xia understood that they were only here to wipe out some of the demon tribes and reduce the potential of the demons’ starting an uprising. Therefore, they did not advance rashly, so the speed of the army’s advancement was not fast.","On the battlefield, elite troops were fighting one after another. Many incomparably powerful monsters were rampaging on the battlefield. However, what made Chu Yunfan feel a little eye-opening was that these monsters had their own way of advancing and retreating. They were like an army and were very impressive. These monsters were an army, just not in human form.","Behind these monster armies were also humanoid demon experts. However, they had yet to make a move. Up until now, the experts of Grand Xia and the demons could only be considered to be testing each other. The real battle had yet to erupt.","At the same time, at the core of the endless Grand Xia army camp.","Li Qianyuan, who was wearing bright silver armor, sat on the armchair. Below him, several figures had already gathered. These people were also wearing armor, and each of them had a fierce aura.","“My lord, we’ve received news that Chu Yunfan has arrived with the Baotai garrison,” one of them said.","Li Qianyuan supported his chin with one hand and tapped the armrest of the armchair rhythmically with the other.","“That b*stard is still alive. That means Gongsun Liang really failed!” someone said in surprise.","When they first received the news, they were almost in disbelief. Although Gongsun Liang had just joined them not long ago, he was still a genuine Cosmic. How could he be killed by Chu Yunfan just like that? If it weren’t for the fact that they had solid intelligence to support them, they would have dismissed it as ridiculous. This made them feel shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength.","“I don’t know how that b*stard did this. My lord, please let the Iron Spears take action. Chu Yunfan dared to kill one of our disciples, so I will spill his blood in return!” a middle-aged man in armor said as his eyes flashed with fierce killing intent.","Like Gongsun Liang, this man was a disciple of the Iron Spear Gang, and they had a good relationship. Even Gongsun Liang joining Li Qianyuan was related to him.","In this man’s opinion, Gongsun Liang was sent to complete a simple mission. A mere Interpreter. How difficult could this be considered?","Who knew that a simple mission that was not worth mentioning in their eyes made Gongsun Liang suffer a crushing defeat?","“No, Li Yu. You’ve long been recorded in the army of Grand Xia. If someone sees you, it’ll immediately implicate, Marquis Huntian,” someone immediately objected.","“I won’t have to do it myself. The Iron Spears has a martial uncle named Luo Zhao. He has been in seclusion for many years. Everyone thinks he’s dead. No one knows he’s still alive. I’ve already sent him a message and he’s on his way. When martial uncle Luo takes action, that b*stard won’t be able to escape!” Li Yu said through gritted teeth.","“Senior Luo Zhao is still alive. It’s widely rumored that he had already passed away,” someone exclaimed. He clearly knew who Luo Zhao was. “Senior Luo is a veteran Cosmic. Chu Yunfan won’t be able to escape this time!”","Everyone looked at Li Qianyuan and lowered their heads. Outside, they were all high and mighty masters, but when facing Li Qianyuan, they did not dare to show any disrespect.","After a long time, Li Qianyuan opened his eyes and said, “Li Yu, I’ll leave this matter to you. I want Chu Yunfan dead before the end of the spring sweep. I’ll be heading to Pingyao to attend the sweep meeting organized by the Grand Commandant. However, I’ll have someone transfer Chu Yunfan to the most dangerous place. If he dies in the hands of the demons, that’ll be for the best.","“I want his head, Li Yu. Once your martial uncle finishes the task, I will reward him with a Longevity Pill that can extend his life by ten years. Don’t disappoint me.”","Upon hearing Li Qianyuan’s words, everyone began to breathe rapidly. They were cultivators who cultivated day and night. In addition to obtaining powerful strength, increasing their lifespan was also their pursuit. Even so, they often felt that time was not enough. Although it was only ten years of life extension, which was not considered long compared to their lifespan, they might make another breakthrough in these ten years, and their lifespan would greatly improve. Not to mention Luo Zhao, an old fellow that everyone thought had passed away. Ten years of lifespan was enough to make him go crazy.","In the Baotai camp, a messenger rode in on a warhorse.","“Where is the garrison leader of Baotai?”","Chu Yunfan flew down from the sky. “Reporting for duty.”","“These are your military orders. Lead the Baotai troop to the northwest of the army and serve as the scouts. Investigate the situation and kill all the demons you find.”","After the messenger gave the order, he immediately turned his horse around and went elsewhere to deliver orders.","“This truly is Li Qianyuan’s doing. He intends to send us, a third-line troop, to be scouts. He’s using public tools for private use. His intentions are sinister!” You Chuyun said fiercely.","Everyone knew Li Qianyuan’s sinister intentions. Usually, those who would be transferred to be scouts must be the elites of the elites. Otherwise, if they encountered the enemy scouts, they would definitely be defeated.","Furthermore, the scouts were far away from the Grand Xia army and were prone to mishaps. It’d be difficult to predict what would happen when the time came, so the scouts usually suffered the greatest losses.","“It’s fine. He wants us to die, but do you think we will do as he wishes?” Chu Yunfan said."]},{"number":1764,"title":"Chapter 1764 A Cosmic? I’ll Beat Him Up!","paragraphs":["1764 A Cosmic? I’ll Beat Him Up!","As the cold wind of early spring blew, the Baotai garrison set out. It was just a small mobilization of 500 people and did not attract much attention.","On the battlefield, countless monsters were rampaging. There were many small mountain-like monsters everywhere. As soon as the Baotai garrison stepped onto the battlefield, they immediately attracted the attention of some monsters.","In just a moment, hundreds of monsters had surrounded them. Among these hundreds of monsters, there were Snow Mountain Leopards, Trihead Spiders, and many other powerful monsters recorded in the Flying Celestials’ “The World.” If an ordinary person encountered a monster of this level, it would be a dead end for them.","“Get into formation!” You Chuyun roared and began to organize the garrison to form a battle formation to resist these monsters that were charging over.","“Transcendent Flying Celestial!”","You Chuyun took the lead and rose from the ground. He held a long sword in his hand and rushed out. He stabbed out a shocking figure, a celestial phantom, and stabbed a monster to death. Although his cultivation was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, the Abstract Interpretation Stage could be considered an expert anywhere.","Chu Yunfan quietly sat in the middle of the formation. He crossed his arms and watched the scene before him. He had no intention of interfering in a battle of this level. He wanted to use these monsters to train the troops. Although their strength had been improved by Chu Yunfan’s pills, their combat experience was far from enough.","Fortunately, after the initial panic, the troops calmed down. The effect of their training was undoubtedly reflected at this time. Chu Yunfan could clearly see that the morale of the troops was rising. The army phantom was slowly taking shape. This was the army phantom that had been formed from the original garrison army camp.","In the military camp, it was easy to condense the army phantom while in the camp. It was many times more difficult to condense the army phantom now that they were outside.","And now, the army phantom was slowly forming.","Hundreds of monsters were enough to pose a fatal threat to the 500-man Baotai garrison. Chu Yunfan looked at these monsters and didn’t even have the desire to attack. They were just used to train these troops.","“This human army belongs to me!”","Suddenly, a loud roar came from afar, and a huge figure that was like a small hill appeared. A demon made entirely of stone pounced over. His aura was like a rainbow as he smashed down with a punch.","Boom!","This punch smashed into the army phantom that was forming, smashing this newly formed army phantom into pieces.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","Many soldiers spat out a mouthful of blood and retreated. The army formation shook violently. The threat that these hundreds of monsters posed to the army was not as serious as the threat posed by this one stone demon.","“Oh no! It’s a Cosmic monster!” You Chuyun shouted.","If his attack landed again, the entire army formation would break.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan leaped into action. In a flash, he appeared in front of the stone demon and threw a punch.","“You want to fight me?!” the stone demon roared and punched down.","In an instant, martial intent was released, and countless stone energy was released. It was as if the entire world was dyed into a world of stone energy. This stone demon clearly had high intelligence, not even inferior to a human. The moves he displayed were not inferior. It was clear that there was a profound martial arts contained within his attacks.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, Chu Yunfan’s fist collided with the stone demon’s fist, which was almost as big as his own body.","The stone demon was sent flying. The terrifying power released a wave of energy that spread in all directions.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, didn’t move and simply allowed the shockwave to blow over him.","“Impossible!”","The stone demon was in complete disbelief. He was very clear about his strength, especially his powerful physical body. Even if a human with a higher cultivation than him wanted to blast him away, it would be impossible. His incomparably powerful physical body was the greatest guarantee for him to dominate the demons.","However, he had finally met his match. Chu Yunfan was clearly much more difficult to deal with than any other human he had ever met.","“A special physique? I’ve long heard that there are some special physiques among humans. I never expected to encounter someone who possesses this ability. Well, I shall devour you then. You’ll make a great tonic!”","The stone demon’s huge eyes erupted with a ferocious aura. With a loud roar, he charged once again and punched down. Countless stone energy directly turned the world into a domain of stone energy. In an instant, the entire battlefield seemed to freeze.","On the battlefield, whether it was the monsters or the soldiers of Baotai, they were all suppressed by this terrifying aura and could not move. At this moment, the strength of a Cosmic was finally fully unleashed.","“You want to eat me? Are your teeth sharp enough?” Chu Yunfan sneered and punched out. “Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Chu Yunfan’s punch was launched, and eight terrifying phantoms condensed into the fist force, instantly smashing into the huge fist that was crushing down.","Bam!","What happened next stunned everyone. The stone demon’s entire arm was torn apart on the spot, turning into shattered rocks that filled the sky. The stone demon, who had always thought that his body was strong, had finally met his nemesis.","Chu Yunfan had shattered one of his arms with a single punch!","“Impossible!” The stone demon grimaced in pain as a hint of fear appeared in his eyes.","He instantly stepped on a gust of demonic wind and fled into the distance. He flew across the sky and wanted to escape."]},{"number":1765,"title":"Chapter 1765 Slaying the Stone Demon, Will Be Promoted Soon","paragraphs":["1765 Slaying the Stone Demon, Will Be Promoted Soon","“You’re not going anywhere.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The stone demon trying to escape from him was undoubtedly showing off in front of an expert. It was simply ridiculous.","Chu Yunfan stepped on a bolt of lightning and caught up with the stone demon in the blink of an eye. The stone demon was fast. As a demon in the Cosmos Stage, his speed was naturally not slow. However, Chu Yunfan’s speed was even faster. In just a moment, he had already caught up with this Cosmic stone demon.","Seeing Chu Yunfan chasing after him, the stone demon roared, “Don’t push your luck, human!”","“Push my luck?” Chu Yunfan sneered. To him, dealing with this stone demon was not going too far.","The stone demon roared repeatedly. With his only remaining hand, he punched at the sky and directed it toward Chu Yunfan. The terrifying fist force brought with it a torrent of stone energy, sweeping directly toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. He swept out his hand, and the stone energy disappeared completely.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and stomped down. In an instant, he landed on the stone demon.","Bam!","The stone demon’s attack was crushed by Chu Yunfan’s stomp, and then his entire body was stepped on.","“Argh!”","The stone demon let out a blood-curdling scream as his mountain-like body fell to the ground, creating a huge hole in the ground. The ground trembled, and a thousand feet of dust was stirred up. The stone demon tried to struggle to move, but he quickly laid down and ceased moving. His chest had been crushed by Chu Yunfan’s foot.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only happened in a moment. A powerful Cosmic stone demon was killed by Chu Yunfan just like that. For a moment, this shook the battlefield.","When the monsters that were rushing over saw this scene, they were scared to death. In their hearts, that stone demon was an invincible existence. Even Cosmics would find it very difficult to defeat or kill this stone demon. After all, the stone demon’s body was made of the hardest stone. Ordinary attacks would be like a drizzle when they landed on his body. There was no way to shake the stone demon.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had cleanly dealt with the stone demon, they did not dare to stay any longer and hurriedly fled. However, at this moment, the Baotai garrison, whose morale had soared, was not willing to let them go. This was a proper military merit.","Chu Yunfan carried the stone demon’s huge body back to the battlefield. He then used a divine ability to shrink the demon’s body to the size of an ordinary person. This was an extremely profound divine ability. It was not a martial art, but one of the divine abilities. Only the core disciples of some top-notch sects would be taught this technique.","But for Chu Yunfan, there was naturally no problem. The Mighty Emperor Battle Book had recorded this divine ability. It was an acquired ability. As long as one is willing to train hard, one will be able to achieve something. It was unlike some abilities that came from one’s natural bloodline talent, which others could not learn at all.","“All hail, Colonel Chu!” You Chuyun shouted, and the morale of the Baotai garrison soared. The army phantom above their heads solidified, continuously killing the monsters that could usually pose a fatal threat to them.","After a full hour of killing, the Baotai garrison finally killed all the monsters. Chu Yunfan did not interfere. He simply allowed the troops to form a battle formation and kill the monsters. In the process, more than a dozen people died tragically, and there was no time to rescue them. However, such a bloody battle had greatly trained this small army of 500 people.","This small army had undergone a complete transformation. They now had the shadow of an elite army. They were no longer just well-trained troops like before. The killing intent on their bodies was extremely dense. This was also the beginning of becoming an elite army.","After killing all these beasts, the soldiers began to clean up the battlefield without a word. The corpses of these beasts were excellent materials for refining weapons and making elixirs. Although these beasts were all Abstracts and were nothing to Chu Yunfan, they were very precious to ordinary people. Moreover, they needed some key parts for the military officer to record their battle achievements.","Many of the soldiers revealed unconcealable smiles on their faces. After this battle, even if their positions could not be promoted immediately, their titles could be promoted by one level.","Grand Xia had never been stingy in this aspect, especially the demons, which were the mortal enemy of humans. Killing Abstract monsters was a huge contribution. It would be difficult for all 500 of these soldiers to be promoted, but this didn’t mean that they wouldn’t receive any benefits. On the contrary, they would receive some low-level titles as rewards. With these titles, they would be able to enjoy all kinds of benefits as well as rewards from Grand Xia. They had gained a lot from this battle. It was not difficult for everyone to advance by one rank.","However, it was not easy to obtain the title of nobility in Grand Xia. On the contrary, it was very difficult to survive in Grand Xia. These monsters were defeated by the Baotai garrison and were quickly killed. However, they all understood that the real key was Chu Yunfan. He had nurtured them regardless of the cost. Later, he had personally killed the strongest Cosmic stone demon.","If it was an ordinary army, it would be difficult to escape the fate of being completely wiped out if they encountered these powerful monsters. Even if they managed to escape through a bloody battle, they would probably suffer heavy casualties. It was hard to say how many of them could escape in the end. Not to mention that they had sacrificed a dozen lives to kill these monsters. To them, this was like a dream. Although more than a dozen of their comrades had died, they all understood that this was a real war.","“Senior Chu, I’m so happy!” You Chuyun said smilingly to Chu Yunfan after cleaning up the battlefield.","“Hahaha, that was a Cosmic monster. In addition to the Blood Demon from before, once we report our military achievements, you will definitely be promoted to general, Senior Chu.”"]},{"number":1766,"title":"Chapter 1766 The Assault of the Iron Spears’ Ascetic Cultivator","paragraphs":["1766 The Assault of the Iron Spears’ Ascetic Cultivator","You Chuyun looked very excited. Adding the Cosmic Blood Demon that had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, there were now two Cosmic demons.","In Grand Xia, the fastest way to get promoted was through military merits. If one were to walk the path of a civil servant, they would have to rely on experience. Even if they had a powerful method to manage a place well, it would take some time for the effect to show. If there was a big war, one could easily get promoted.","Of course, the requirement on one’s strength during a war was very high. When soldiers went to the battlefield, they would pray to survive. When officers went to the battlefield, the result was not much better. Only when they reached the Cosmos Stage could they have the strength to dominate the battlefield and consider building military achievements.","Even so, Chu Yunfan killing two Cosmic monsters in a row was no easy feat. After all, Cosmics had strong survivability. Even if something went wrong, they could still break out of the encirclement. It was very difficult to hold down such experts even if they were surrounded by an army. It was because of this that people like Chu Yunfan seemed like monsters.","In the military system of Grand Xia, the rank above the lieutenant colonel was the commandant, and the rank above the commandant was the general. Now that Chu Yunfan had killed two Cosmic demons in a row, once he reported it to the Ministry of War and these military achievements were confirmed, he would be promoted to general immediately. He would then truly step into the middle and upper echelons of Grand Xia’s army. As for officers like lieutenants, they were considered basic officers at most and were completely incomparable. Cosmic demons were extremely difficult to kill. Killing one was a huge battle merit.","Chu Yunfan nodded. This was the reason he had not reported the killing of the Cosmic Blood Devil leader earlier. He did not want to alert the enemy. Now, he would report two battle merits in one go. Once the Ministry of War confirmed his battle merits, he would be promoted to general.","Even though he would only be a low-ranking general, he would still be a member of the upper echelons of Grand Xia’s army. He was already an officer under the Grand Commandant’s Office. Even the Ministry of War would find it difficult to interfere with the mobilization of such a high-ranking officer. When the time came, it would be impossible for Li Qianyuan to use his influence to mobilize Chu Yunfan to join the battlefield.","The Grand Commandant’s Office was different from the Ministry of War. It was the true core authority of Grand Xia’s military affairs. All officers above the rank of general had to accept the leadership of the Grand Commandant’s Office.","The grand commandant of the Grand Commandant’s Office was one of the three dukes of Grand Xia and was one of the most powerful people in the empire. There were countless nobles under the Grand Commandant’s Office. Even if Li Qianyuan had great means, it was unlikely that he could influence the actions of the Grand Commandant’s Office.","This was Chu Yunfan’s true goal.","“When I’m promoted, everyone will naturally benefit. At that time, the Grand Commandant’s Office will probably order me to form a new army, and when that happens, I will make you all officers of the new army,” Chu Yunfan said generously.","You Chuyun was very excited. If Chu Yunfan became a general, he would at least be able to become a commandant under Chu Yunfan. He would become a truly powerful figure. The Baotai soldiers were excited when they heard this. Even the lowest level of soldiers had the opportunity to become officers in the future and leave the civilian class. This was an excellent opportunity for them to rise.","“We are willing to die for you, Colonel Chu!” Everyone half-knelt and bowed their heads.","Chu Yunfan then cut off the stone demon’s head and handed it to You Chuyun. He instructed, “Take the stone demon’s head to the Ministry of War and report on everyone’s military merits.”","“Colonel, what will you be doing?” You Chuyun changed the way he addressed Chu Yunfan and looked at him strangely.","“I’m going to leave the battlefield for some time. Bring the troops back to the camp. No matter who comes and asks you to go to the battlefield, you will reject them. Just say that we’ve suffered heavy casualties and need time to recover. With the credit from killing this stone demon, no one should dare to transfer you away by force,” Chu Yunfan said","With the credit from killing the stone demon, the Baotai garrison could take a step back. After all, for a third-line troop like them, it was already shocking enough to be able to kill a Cosmic monster. It was reasonable to say that there were heavy casualties.","Besides Li Qianyuan, who else could forcefully mobilize the Baotai garrison? As long as Li Qianyuan didn’t interfere, it didn’t matter.","“Yes, Colonel.” Although You Chuyun didn’t know what Chu Yunfan was up to, he immediately agreed.","Chu Yunfan nodded, stepped on a beam of light, and disappeared into the distance.","“Return to camp!” You Chuyun waved and led the troops back to the camp. They had gained a lot from this battle, and the Baotai garrison needed time to digest their gains.","After leaving the troops, Chu Yunfan sped up and flew into the distance. Suddenly, a figure appeared in front of him, and Chu Yunfan’s expression turned serious. It was an old man dressed in simple linen clothes. His long hair was tied casually behind his back. He held an iron spear and looked like a cultivator.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was slightly solemn. Among the many cultivators, there was a type that was not to be trifled with—the ascetic cultivators. These people were different from ordinary cultivators. They paid attention to hardship to temper themselves. They were often willing to be dull and used many hardships to temper themselves. They did not care about the glory and wealth. They would usually be in seclusion, even living in remote mountains and forests.","These people were not to be provoked. There was a saying that it was better to provoke the king of hell than to provoke an ascetic cultivator.","Among experts of the same level, ascetics were often the best. These people had suffered a lot, but they were willing to be dull. Their deep understanding of the Great Dao was unimaginable to ordinary people.","“The Iron Spears!”","Chu Yunfan spat out these words. He had once seen the same symbol on Gongsun Liang’s spear. It was the symbol of the Iron Spear Gang.","There was no doubt that this old man was an ascetic cultivator of the Iron Spears, and he was clearly here with ill intentions. His purpose was obvious. He was here regarding Gongsun Liang."]},{"number":1767,"title":"Chapter 1767 Killing Luo Zhao With a Single Strike","paragraphs":["1767 Killing Luo Zhao With a Single Strike","“Not bad. You recognize our association,” the old man said, “I saw you kill that stone demon without any hesitation earlier. I didn’t interfere, but you shouldn’t have killed Gongsun Liang. Today, you won’t be able to escape.”","This old man clearly didn’t like demons and even hated them. Therefore, when he saw Chu Yunfan kill the stone demon, he didn’t take the opportunity to attack. Instead, he waited until Chu Yunfan was done.","However, the man had absolute confidence in himself. With his strength, killing a junior was as easy as lifting a finger.","“So you’re here for Gongsun Liang. However, Gongsun Liang killed me for Li Qianyuan. It was Gongsun Liang’s fate to die at my hands,” Chu Yunfan said solemnly.","The pressure this old man gave him was extraordinary. Besides Li Qianyuan, this old man was the strongest among all the people he had encountered. However, the gap between his cultivation and Li Qianyuan’s was too big.","Li Qianyuan gave him an unfathomable feeling. With his cultivation, it was impossible to know the bottom line of Li Qianyuan’s strength. He only felt a pressure as great as Mount Tai.","This old man was different. Although Chu Yunfan could not fully grasp his cultivation, he could estimate that he was not as good as Li Qianyuan.","Chu Yunfan was not surprised. Li Qianyuan was known as the peerless genius of the century, having come across a miraculous encounter when he was only a few years old. At a young age, he was already a genius who was famous all over the world. He was even known as the number one expert of the younger generation in Grand Xia. Such a person, of course, was not someone just anyone could match.","Though this old man was not as good as Li Qianyuan, he was still the most terrifying existence Chu Yunfan had ever encountered. Even the Blood Demon leader was not as good as him.","“Fate?” the old man said coldly, “I, Luo Zhao, have traveled the world for so many years, and I have never heard of such a saying. If that’s the case, if you die by my hands today, it’s your fate.”","Luo Zhao looked at Chu Yunfan with killing intent in his eyes. Although he was an ascetic cultivator who used intense pain to stimulate and train his soul to achieve enlightenment, he was not really without desire. The price Li Qianyuan offered him tempted him very much.","A pill that could extend one’s lifespan by ten years was extremely precious. It was precious even in Grand Xia. To Luo Zhao, nothing else was important. The most important thing was to have a long enough lifespan to allow him to take another step forward and reach enlightenment.","“You wish to kill me? Gongsun Liang said that he too, but he died by my hands in the end.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","It would have been fine if Chu Yunfan didn’t mention Gongsun Liang, but now that he had, a terrifying killing intent erupted from Luo Zhao’s body. Gongsun Liang was a junior he thought most highly of. Gongsun Liang could have taken over these old guys in the future and brought the Iron Spears to greater heights. Who knew that he would be killed by Chu Yunfan before he could even grow up?","How could Luo Zhao not hate Chu Yunfan?","“You’re courting death!” Luo Zhao said coldly. However, his gaze swept to the left and right as his divine will enveloped the entire battlefield.","After all, this was not a safe place. It was a human-demon battlefield. A terrifying greater demon could suddenly appear at any moment. Even with his cultivation, he did not dare to say he was absolutely safe on this human-demon battlefield.","“You allowed your subordinates to escape first because you didn’t want me to kill them. Unfortunately, they will all die. Not a single one of them will escape,” Luo Zhao said coldly.","He had seen through Chu Yunfan’s intention of suddenly instructing You Chuyun to lead the Baotai garrison back to camp, but he saw it as a futile struggle.","A set of bronze armor appeared on Luo Zhao’s body. He seemed to transform into a different person when he wore it, turning into a terrifying asura on the battlefield. The Iron Spears was an association that had developed on the battlefield. All their martial arts were more or less related to the way of war. Therefore, on this human-demon battlefield, others might be worried, but to him, it was like a fish in water.","This battlefield had been bloody for countless years, and countless experts from both sides had been killed or injured. Countless grievances gathered and did not dissipate. In some places, the powerful grievances even covered the sky, forming an extremely terrifying death zone.","This shocking resentment and killing intent on the battlefield became Luo Zhao’s power, making him even more terrifying. Chu Yunfan now knew that Luo Zhao was not much weaker than Li Qianyuan. Luo Zhao was like a fish in water on this battlefield.","“Little b*stard... You’re courting death!”","As soon as Luo Zhao finished speaking, the silver spear in his hand shot out a terrifying white streak. Wherever the white streak passed, it seemed to freeze the surrounding space.","“World Setter!” Luo Zhao shouted and used his true technique. Although he didn’t think much of Chu Yunfan, he knew that even a lion would use its full strength to hunt a rabbit.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing rang out. What Luo Zhao didn’t expect was that his terrifying spear couldn’t pierce through Chu Yunfan and turn him into a BBQ skewer. On the contrary, a cauldron appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head, and that terrifying spear attack was blocked by this cauldron. He did not know where this cauldron originated from, but it was able to block his full-powered attack. Even an expert at the same level as him would be pierced by the spear.","And Chu Yunfan’s counterattack came as quickly as a shadow.","“Luo Zhao, today is the day you die!”","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar, and a terrifying sword light burst out from his hand. This terrifying sword light swept across the sky like a waterfall and cut the sky into two halves.","Bam!","The bronze armor on Luo Zhao’s body was smashed into pieces by the sword light. The remaining sword light pierced through his body at lightning speed.","Spurt!","Luo Zhao’s eyes widened. He couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had such a method. It was just a sword light, but it pierced through him in an instant.","Luo Zhao was dead!"]},{"number":1768,"title":"Chapter 1768 Making a Fortune, Hiding and Waiting","paragraphs":["1768 Making a Fortune, Hiding and Waiting","Chu Yunfan’s expression didn’t change after killing Luo Zhao with a single strike, but he was a little regretful. The Sword Light Talisman in his hand could only emit one more sword light at most. This was supposed to be his trump card. If Luo Zhao wasn’t so strong, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have to use it.","Of course, although Luo Zhao’s strength was about the same as Li Qianyuan’s, the threat of both sides was completely different. After all, Luo Zhao’s cultivation had already reached a point, while Li Qianyuan’s road of cultivation had just begun. One of them was like the setting sun while the other was like the rising sun. They naturally could not be mentioned in the same breath.","However, compared to before, Chu Yunfan was at least dozens of times stronger now. At that time, he had tried his best and plotted against Li Qianyuan, but he could only severely injure Li Qianyuan. But now, after he used the Sword Light Talisman, he could kill Luo Zhao with one strike.","Previously the gap between him and Li Qianyuan was like that of an ocean, but now the gap between him and Luo Zhao was the size of a lake.","“It’s a pity I can’t claim credit for killing Luo Zhao. It would’ve been enough for me to obtain a noble title.”","Chu Yunfan felt a little regretful, but he quickly put it away. He picked up Luo Zhao’s body and squeezed it into blood essence to pour onto the Brahma Tree. Immediately after, he stepped into the Mountain River Diagram and began to count his gains. He held a spatial bag in his hand. It was Luo Zhao’s bag.","Ordinary people wouldn’t be able to open someone else’s spatial bag, but Chu Yunfan wasn’t an ordinary person. There was a method of forcefully opening someone else’s spatial bag recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book.","After 15 minutes, Chu Yunfan broke the restriction on Luo Zhao’s spatial bag. When he opened it, his eyes lit up. Luo Zhao was worthy of being a top-notch master who could almost stand shoulder-to-shoulder with Li Qianyuan. He had a mountain of wealth.","Just the middle-grade spirit stones alone amounted to tens of millions. This was more than what Chu Yunfan had obtained when he uprooted all the major forces in Baotai. This alleviated Chu Yunfan’s lack of middle-grade spirit stones and made him rich overnight.","Other than these middle-grade spirit stones, there were also many other treasures and medicinal herbs that Luo Zhao had collected. In total, they were worth more than ten million middle-grade spirit stones. Moreover, it was different from the treasures and medicinal herbs collected by the major forces in Baotai. Chu Yunfan didn’t care about those, but Luo Zhao’s collection was precious even to a Cosmic.","Among them, there was a heavenly treasure called the Earth Fiend Origin Crystal that made Chu Yunfan’s eyes light up. This crystal was an important material used to refine artifacts used by Cosmics.","Every Cosmic’s hallowed weapon was different. Everyone added different heavenly materials and earthly treasures to the Earth Fiend Original Crystal foundation, which resulted in deviations. But no matter what, the Earth Fiend Original Crystal was the foundation of everything. Even those who had passed the Cosmic Stage would use hallowed weapons, and they needed a large number of Earth Fiend Original Crystals. Each Earth Fiend Origin Crystal was worth more than 100,000 middle-grade spirit stones, and there were over 300 crystals in the spatial bag. This was truly priceless.","Chu Yunfan guessed that Luo Zhao had collected these to improve the quality of his hallowed spear. If he could advance further in the future and surpass the Cosmos Stage, it would come in handy. But now, Chu Yunfan has benefitted from this.","Among the herbs in the bag, Chu Yunfan was pleasantly surprised to find a few that could be used to make a Six-Stripe Gold Pill. Previously, Chu Yunfan had consumed a One-Stripe Purple-gold Pill and a Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill, but he had never been able to find the medicinal herbs that could be made into a Six-Stripe Gold Pill. The value of the medicinal herbs for the Six-Stripe Gold Pill was not something that the One-Stripe Purple-gold Pill and the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill could compare to.","Chu Yunfan was most surprised. These herbs could serve as main ingredients, but ordinary people didn’t know its effect and couldn’t unleash its true power. Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. This was because the Six-Stripe Gold Pill was different from ordinary medicinal herbs that could increase one’s cultivation. Not only could it improve one’s cultivation, but most importantly, it could also increase one’s combat strength to the peak in a short time. In other words, at the critical moment, it could greatly increase Chu Yunfan’s strength and become his trump card.","He could now plan out his time to make the Six-Stripe Gold Pill. This was important for him at the moment. Although he did not have time to look around, through the Thousand Treasures Pavilion’s connections, as long as he had enough money, he would be able to buy the other ingredients he needed.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan understood how the Thousand Treasures Pavilion had developed to its current height. It was not without reason. It was because many people needed the Thousand Treasures Pavilion to help them collect heavenly treasures that would have taken a lot of time and effort to find.","In addition to all these items, Chu Yunfan also found the Iron Spear Gang’s martial arts manuals. Because Luo Zhao was confident in his strength, he didn’t guard himself and simply kept them in his spatial bag. Now, all of them benefited Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t care about these martial arts, the Iron Spears seemed destined to become his enemy, and knowing the enemy was knowing oneself. He naturally had no reason to let them go.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had other plans. He was sure that Luo Zhao was found by Li Qianyuan, but only he knew that Luo Zhao had died at his hands. Others surely would never believe it. There were some things that he couldn’t do, but he could use Luo Zhao’s identity to do them.","Beside Chu Yunfan, Luo Zhao’s hallowed spear was struggling, constantly releasing light in an attempt to escape Chu Yunfan’s seal. But without the support of its master, how could it resist Chu Yunfan’s refinement?","Not long after, the light went completely silent. Chu Yunfan had completely erased Luo Zhao’s mark and imprinted his own mark onto the weapon. Only then did Chu Yunfan realize that Luo Zhao’s hallowed spear was much more powerful than Wang Yifan’s Divity Slicer. Although they were both hallowed weapons, they were not on the same level.","After refining this hallowed spear, Chu Yunfan calmed down and comprehended the Iron Spears’s martial arts. At the same time, he quietly waited for the Brahma Fruit to ripen."]},{"number":1769,"title":"Chapter 1769 Peak of Intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage","paragraphs":["1769 Peak of Intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage","Three days passed.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan’s figure shook, and the long spear in his hand was thrown out. He had obtained this hallowed spear from Luo Zhao. It was called the Silver Dragon Spear, and when it was wielded, it produced a dragon’s roar.","Unfortunately, he didn’t have time to display his true power in Luo Zhao’s hands before he died. It could be said that Luo Zhao had died the most aggrieved death of a Cosmic.","“Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear!”","Chu Yunfan swept out with the spear. The Silver Dragon Spear turned into a huge tiger and suddenly opened its bloody mouth. The tiger looked down on the world and shook the entire sky.","In the next moment, the Silver Dragon Spear swept out at an even faster speed. In an instant, the spear’s radiance turned into a silver dragon that streaked across the sky.","The martial will condensed and transformed into a dragon and a tiger, protecting Chu Yunfan. If an expert of the Iron Spears saw this scene, their glasses would definitely fall off.","This set of Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear technique was the Iron Spears’ ultimate technique. Only top-notch experts who had reached the Cosmos Stage and above were qualified to cultivate this technique.","And now, the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear that Chu Yunfan displayed had clearly reached the realm of perfection. In just three days, he had completely mastered the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear. In his eyes, learning this technique was not difficult. In just three days, he had completely analyzed the supreme technique of the Iron Spears and quickly mastered it. There was no difficulty at all.","Coupled with the Silver Dragon Spear, Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased.","For three whole days, Chu Yunfan stayed close to the Mountain River Diagram, cultivating the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear technique. Now, he had finally completed the cultivation of the technique.","It was not difficult for him to go out and display the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear Technique to impersonate a disciple of the Iron Spears. These martial arts that were almost impossible to learn in the eyes of ordinary people were as easy as flipping his hand.","A strange fragrance spread from the herb mountain. It was the Brahma Tree that had ripened. To forcefully ripen the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan had spent three million middle-grade spirit stones. If it weren’t for the tens of millions of middle-grade spirit stones he had obtained from Luo Zhao, he wouldn’t have been able to do this. Not to mention that he had ripened the Brahma Fruit in three days.","On the Brahma Tree, two fist-sized Brahma Fruits grew on the branches. They were bright and beautiful, looking like two huge rubies. Chu Yunfan reached out and plucked one of them. Immediately, a strange fragrance assailed his nose, making him feel as if all the pores on his body were about to open up violently.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and swallowed the Brahma Fruit. In an instant, the Brahma Fruit turned into a torrent of energy that spread directly into his limbs and bones. Soon, it all turned into Chu Yunfan’s power.","Driven by this energy torrent, the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body circulated crazily in his meridians. With every circulation, Chu Yunfan could feel that his strength would increase by a bit. It was very shocking.","The energy contained in the Brahma Fruit was unprecedentedly powerful. It was formed by absorbing the spirit energy of countless middle-grade spirit stones and the blood essence of several Cosmics.","For an entire day, Chu Yunfan didn’t move and continued to absorb this energy. Finally, he opened his eyes and let out a long cry. The divine power in his body swept out.","In just a short day, he had already reached the peak fledgling Abstract Interpretation Stage. It was as if he had already stayed in this realm for several decades, and had long polished all his skills to perfection. However, this was only him. If it was an ordinary person, they would have long exploded from this energy. Even if they could barely withstand it, it would still take one or two years to completely refine it. Only Chu Yunfan could absorb this energy while circulating the Celestial Devouring Art. Only then could he almost simultaneously refine this energy.","However, Chu Yunfan felt that it was far from enough. He had only absorbed a small portion of the energy formed by the Brahma Fruit, and there was still a large portion that he had not absorbed.","“I can take advantage of this opportunity to break through to the intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage. At that time, my battle prowess will undergo an earth-shattering change.”","Chu Yunfan closed his eyes and began to mobilize his divine power once again, trying to break through to the intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage. This divine power was like a tidal wave, constantly sweeping out and attacking Chu Yunfan’s cultivation barrier.","Another ten days passed, and the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body was almost depleted. When he was about to give up, the divine power in his body suddenly surged out like a spring, bringing his divine power to finally break through the barrier of the intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Boom!","After Chu Yunfan’s divine power broke through the barrier, it was like a dragon leaping into the nine heavens. It grew crazily and swallowed all the spirit energy.","Countless middle-grade spirit stones flew up and turned into powder, directly entering Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan absorbed all the spirit energy in these middle-grade spirit stones, allowing his divine power to be endless and not be blocked by the barrier of the intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage.","After another three days, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. He slowly opened his eyes. He had made a lot of breakthroughs. He broke through from the fledgling Abstract Interpretation Stage to the peak intermediate Abstract Interpretation Stage. Just the increase in his combat strength alone was at least several times stronger.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was already very strong, and now it had increased by several times. One could imagine how shocking his combat strength was. For an ordinary person, it was not a good thing to have a sudden increase in strength because it was often difficult to control this power. However, for Chu Yunfan, such a problem did not exist. With the memory of the Alchemy Emperor and the super powerful analysis ability of the godhead, the various Abstract Stages were no secret to him. To him, the levels were far beneath his current cultivation. He had even begun to further analyze many secrets about the Cosmos Stage.","Although his current cultivation level was far inferior to Li Qianyuan’s, he dared to bet that his understanding of the Cosmos Stage would not be below Li Qianyuan’s."]},{"number":1770,"title":"Chapter 1770 The Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave","paragraphs":["1770 The Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave","His comprehension of this cultivation level was so deep that he could say that all of them were trash. His strength had always grown much faster than his cultivation level. With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan understood more than many people that cultivation was the principle of cultivating the mind.","The mind was the source of all power. In fact, the mind was the source of the power of divine arts. Only those with a strong spirit were truly strong.","After breaking through, Chu Yunfan didn’t continue to stay and cultivate. Instead, he chose to leave the Mountain River Diagram. He wanted to go back and see how the Baotai garrison was doing.","However, just as he exited the Mountain River Diagram, he discovered light beams streaking across the vast sky in the distance, heading toward the depths of the Hundred Thousand Mountains.","He felt this a little strange. He had come all the way here to avoid Luo Zhao, but that didn’t mean that this place was completely out of the battlefield. In fact, this place was still on the periphery of the battlefield.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan could still see countless pillars of air rising up. They were the souls of countless soldiers condensed from their essence, qi, and spirit.","Even Chu Yunfan had to retreat in front of such a powerful army phantom. If a Cosmic was targeted, they would be instantly killed.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan didn’t just see one light beam. From time to time, there were dozens of light beams passing by. Some of them were clearly evil demons, stepping on black light beams. There were the experts of the demons. Some of them were ferocious beasts, some of them were in human form, and some were riding on demonic winds. Chu Yunfan also saw some disciples of the righteous path.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan was slightly stunned. He immediately decided to follow and see what was going on. His figure flashed and he turned into Luo Zhao. He flew into the air with the Silver Dragon Spear in his hand, but he didn’t reveal himself. Instead, he followed a group of people.","Chu Yunfan looked at their clothes. Who else could they be but disciples of the Divine Star Sect? Moreover, one of them was even a Cosmic. Such an expert must be a true disciple of the Divine Stars. Now that he had appeared here, it could be said that he had entered the hinterland of the demons. No one knew what their purpose was.","Chu Yunfan was focused on hiding and following behind them. Naturally, these people did not know that there was another person hanging far behind them.","“Senior, will we be too late?” a Divine Stars disciple asked.","In front of the crowd was a woman in a robe and a purple gold crown. She was a Cosmic true disciple of the Divine Stars and the leader of these people.","“Even if we don’t get there in time, we have to go. The Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave is about to open. It’s said that something shocking will be inside,” the woman wearing the purple gold crown said and she frowned slightly.","This matter had nothing to do with her, but the chief disciple of the Divine Stars had personally issued a summoning order. All the disciples of the Divine Stars within a thousand miles had to rush over and gather here. No one could refuse. After all, the chief disciple of the Divine Stars was the same as the crown prince. He was almost the future sect leader. Although she was a true disciple, the gap between her and the chief disciple was too big.","“Who knew that the Imperial Court would be conducting a spring sweep right now? The battlefield is too large. To avoid the battlefield, we had no choice but to take a detour.”","The woman with the purple gold crown was a little depressed. How could she dare to get close to a super battlefield with a million soldiers? If she was hit by the intense blood essence, she might be seriously injured. This would happen even though the Divine Stars cultivated the orthodox dharmic formulations. If it was an evil or heretical dao, it would almost collapse at a moment’s notice. There was no way to resist. If they approached the battlefield, they would be killed by the powerful blood essence of the million-man army.","“The Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave?” Chu Yunfan was slightly stunned.","Of course, he knew about the legend of the Ten Ferocities. Even in ancient times to the Alchemy Emperor belonged, the Ten Ferocities were a terrifying legend.","It was a legend from the immemorial era, which was even more distant than the ancient times. In those legends, the Ten Ferocities represented the ten most terrifying ferocious beasts of ancient times. Any one of them was above the emperors. It was not strange for them to kill emperors.","However, in the Alchemy Emperor’s era, the Ten Ferocities had already fallen. What still existed in the world were only the bloodlines of the Ten Ferocities. These could not be said to be the authentic Ten Ferocities.","However, even if it was just the bloodline of the Ten Ferocities, it was still extremely ferocious. It was almost impossible to find a match for them at the same cultivation level. One could completely imagine how terrifying the Ten Ferocities were.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan suppressed his thoughts. He wasn’t interested in ordinary things, but the Ten Ferocities were different. Once he could obtain some of the inheritance of the Ten Ferocities, his cultivation would probably soar immediately.","However, this Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave was well-known. It had even attracted the chief disciple of the Divine Stars. The Divine Stars and the Flying Celestials were among the top ten sects. To be able to become the chief disciple of one of them meant that he was the leader of countless disciples, including true disciples. Such a person was definitely an outstanding person.","For example, Meng Tianren was the chief disciple of the Virtuous Academy. Such a figure had an unfathomable cultivation, even higher than the cultivation of many first-class sect leaders. Even in the top ten sects, most elders were certainly not a match for such a figure.","As a Cosmic, Lone Star was arrogant and despotic. He slaughtered cities to cultivate demonic techniques. How arrogant was he? However, he couldn’t even withstand a single blow from Meng Tianren and fled with serious injuries. Even his cultivation fell to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Only then could Chu Yunfan take advantage of him.","From Meng Tianren’s strength, Chu Yunfan could deduce some information about the strength of the chief disciple of the Divine Stars. For an expert of such a level to need to use their authority as the chief disciple to gather disciples from all over the Divine Stars to help, he must have encountered a powerful opponent. Otherwise, it would definitely not be like this.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan smiled.","“Interesting, looks like it’s going to be a big show. However, I’m also interested in the things that come out of the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave. Even the chief disciple of the Divine Stars can’t stop me.”","Chu Yunfan knew that Li Qianyuan’s strength was extremely terrifying. Even people like Meng Tianren could not suppress Li Qianyuan, which made him the number one master of the younger generation in Grand Xia.","Even if this was just a rumor, Li Qianyuan might not have the strength to crush them, but at least he was not inferior to Meng Tianren.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to contend with such a figure, he had to improve his strength by leaps and bounds in a short time."]},{"number":1771,"title":"Chapter 1771 The Immemorial Dark Phoenix","paragraphs":["1771 The Immemorial Dark Phoenix","Therefore, he needed more fortuitous encounters to buy him more time.","He and Li Qianyuan were already mortal enemies, and it was impossible for them to resolve their grudges. Once a battle broke out, it would definitely be a life-and-death battle.","This was what he had always cared about. Although Wang Yifan was also a true disciple, he had never taken him to heart. True disciples were not his match.","Chu Yunfan followed the Divine Stars disciples all the way into the depths of the Hundred Thousand Mountains. In just a moment, he was far away from the human-demon battlefield. The deeper they went, the more they could feel the miasma. It was impossible for ordinary people to survive in such a place. Only Abstracts could barely survive, but it was just barely.","In front of them, the woman wearing the purple-gold crown spread her divine power and protected the Abstract Divine Stars disciples behind her so that they would not be affected by the miasma.","Behind her, Chu Yunfan was silent. He did not feel the effects of this poisonous miasma. The terrifying power of the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique was vividly displayed at this time. Even if he breathed in the miasma, it would not affect him at all.","Soon, a huge, ancient mountain range appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. This mountain range that stretched for an unknown distance came into view. From afar, it looked like an ancient ferocious beast opening its bloody mouth and biting at people.","This scene was extremely terrifying.","This mountain range had a terrifying aura. It was as if a ferocious beast was hibernating in it, or as if an archaic ferocious beast had died here and turned into this mountain range. This was different from the Hundred Thousand Mountains. It was not as powerful as the Hundred Thousand Mountains, but it was more ferocious. Chu Yunfan now somewhat believed that the inheritance of the Ten Ferocities was buried in this cave.","In front of Chu Yunfan, countless figures appeared in the air. These figures included powerful demons, cultivators of the demonic path, and even experts from the Central Plains and Grand Xia. They stood in different places according to their different camps.","Other than these, there were also a large number of itinerant cultivators standing on the periphery. These itinerant cultivators did not have a clear camp and were just bystanders, but their numbers were extremely large.","“Senior, how should I address you?","Just as Chu Yunfan was in shock, a middle-sized, smiling itinerant cultivator walked up and addressed Chu Yunfan.","“I am Luo Zhao of the Iron Spear Gang,” Chu Yunfan said lightly. At this moment, he was in Luo Zhao’s appearance.","The itinerant cultivator thought for a moment and didn’t seem to know who Luo Zhao was. However, this was normal. Luo Zhao had been in seclusion for many years and it was rumored that he had passed away a long time ago. Many younger warriors didn’t know who Luo Zhao was.","However, they knew about the Iron Spears’ fearsome reputation. Although the Iron Spears wasn’t a behemoth like the top ten sects, it was still a first-rate sect under the top ten sects. It was very powerful.","“Ah, so you are from the Iron Spears.” This medium-sized itinerant cultivator revealed a somewhat envious expression on his face. Generally, unless itinerant cultivators had reached a shocking cultivation base, they would still envy those experts from large sects.","He then asked, “May I know why you are here?”","“Does it make any difference why I’m here?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Of course, it does. It seems that you are usually in seclusion all year round and don’t know!”","This medium-sized itinerant cultivator immediately found the answer that he thought was correct. Otherwise, he would not have rushed over without knowing anything.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He was happy that this person had such a misunderstanding.","“I am Xie Han, a itinerant cultivator. However, I know more about the Ancient Ten Ferocities Caves than ordinary people,” Xie Han said, “What would you like to know, senior?”","“This is said to be the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave, but there are Ten Ferocities. Which one is inside? Could it really be the cave abode of the Ten Ferocities?” Chu Yunfan inquired.","“You must be joking, senior. If it was really the cave of the Ten Ancient Vicious Beasts, how could we come here to search for treasures? I’m afraid those high and mighty experts would have already fought to the death,” Xie Han said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. This was true. What level of existence were the Ten Ferocities? In ancient times, there was once a tomb of the Ten Ferocities. Many emperors charged in and fought until the sky collapsed and the earth cracked. The sun and moon lost their light, and in the end, there were heavy casualties.","“The Ten Ferocities exist, but this is only a descendant of the Ten Ferocities,” Xie Han said, “It’s one of the descendants of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. Tsk, tsk. Everyone knows that the phoenix never lands in a place without treasures. Although the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a mutant, it was still a phoenix. That’s why it attracted so many people.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that it was the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. In fact, in the immemorial era, there were many divine beasts and monsters. They were all extremely powerful, but the reason why the Ten Ferocities were listed separately was because the ferocity of these beasts was unprecedented. No one could compare to them. Each of them had slaughtered countless creatures and caused disasters in the world.","The Immemorial Dark Phoenix was one of them. According to rumors, the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a special species of phoenixes. Phoenixes were famous for their power of life. Their rebirth was a divine power that evolved after studying the laws of life to the extreme.","However, the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was different. It was born with the laws of death and was born to be at odds with regular phoenixes. Later on, it became independent and caused endless slaughter. It was ranked as one of the ten ancient ferocious beasts.","Chu Yunfan only knew this from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. However, the Alchemy Emperor’s era was very far away from the era of the Ten Ferocities, so he only vaguely knew a little about these things.","“According to rumors, a descendant of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was buried here. Although it wasn’t a pure-blooded descendant, it was still very powerful. When it was still alive, it was a tyrant of the many demon mountains. After it died, this place became its tomb. However, the creature itself was exiled to another dimension. Many people knew about it but didn’t have any other means,” Xie Han said emotionally, “Actually, for most people, what they are looking for isn’t necessarily the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, but the many divine weapons and secret manuals inside.”"]},{"number":1772,"title":"Chapter 1772 The World’s Top Expert","paragraphs":["1772 The World’s Top Expert","“It’s said that the descendants of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix were extremely ferocious. Many sects in the outer realms were robbed, and many were even destroyed. Their manuals and protective artifacts were taken away. Many people came for this,” Xie Han continued.","Chu Yunfan realized that many people did not have such high expectations. They only wanted to obtain some divine martial arts manuals or some heavenly treasures. It was already a very impressive harvest.","“This place is a godsend opportunity. Normally, this is the central region of the demons, and there is no room for us to interfere. However, now that the Grand Xia army is conducting a spring sweep, the elite demon army has been mobilized to confront them. Otherwise, if any of the troops come here, we will all die,” Xie Han said. He felt a little emotional in his heart. This was indeed a heaven-sent opportunity.","“Right now, experts from all over the world have gathered, and the demons are being restrained by the Grand Xia army. They don’t dare to leave casually, or else, this spring sweep could turn into a true war of extermination at any time.” Xie Han chuckled.","Chu Yunfan nodded. Although some martial artists could be said to be bold and talented, and indeed did not put the demon army in their eyes, they were definitely not these people.","His gaze swept over the area. The entire cave was densely packed. There were at least ten thousand people. There were tens of thousands of people, and there was no end to them. Among these people, the weakest was an Interpreter. There were many experts at the Cosmos Stage. These Cosmics released extremely terrifying auras, which rushed into the sky like pillars of air, breaking through the miasma that filled the sky.","Chu Yunfan was secretly speechless. A Cosmic was considered a tyrant anywhere. After Chu Yunfan killed a Cosmic, all of Baotai completely surrendered because no one could resist Chu Yunfan. However, there were so many Cosmics here.","With just a glance, he saw that there were at least 2,000 Cosmics present. They were the main force in this competition. As for the Interpreters, they were just pawns waving flags and shouting. In the Flying Celestials, Interpreters were considered elite disciples, but here, they became mere pawns. From this, one could see how attractive the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave was.","This was because the demons and Grand Xia were restraining each other’s top experts. Otherwise, it was almost unimaginable what kind of existence would be attracted to this place.","Chu Yunfan even saw some barbarians and Hus among them. They were all Cosmics. Even the overlord of a powerful clan had appeared here. The experts of the few major forces that dominated the world had all appeared here.","“Your information has been helpful. Here, these are for you.” Chu Yunfan casually took out 100 middle-grade spirit stones and gave them to Xie Han.","Xie Han hurriedly thanked Chu Yunfan. These 100 middle-grade spirit stones were quite a fortune for an Interpreter. It was not bad to be able to get such a harvest just by explaining things.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a few tall figures among these experts. They were faintly above the crowd, and their auras were oppressive. Compared to ordinary Cosmics, they were unimaginably powerful.","One of them was wearing the robes of the Divine Star Sect. He was surrounded by many Divine Star disciples, including the female Cosmic wearing the purple gold crown.","This person’s identity was obvious. He was the chief disciple of the Divine Stars, Zi Buyu.","Although Chu Yunfan had never seen Zi Buyu before, he had read about him in “The World.” He was a top genius in the Divine Stars. He had cultivated in the sect since he was young and had easily broken many of the cultivation records in the sect. He had never met a match among his peers and became the chief disciple of the Divine Stars. There was no one in the same generation as him in the Divine Stars who could match him.","Zi Buyu’s body emitted a faint layer of starlight that blocked the miasma and enveloped the Divine Star disciples.","Not far away from the Divine Stars, another group of people stood alone. These people were all dressed in scholarly robes. They were slender, but their eyes were full of spirit and their thoughts were extremely powerful. Their bodies faintly emitted a sense of righteousness, rejecting all the filthy miasma.","In the middle of these people, there was one person who was particularly eye-catching. He was dressed as a scholar, with a long sword hanging at his waist. He was dressed in white, and he was handsome and regal as if he was the embodiment of a scholar from the scholarly faction. It was what everyone imagined a scholar should look like.","He was also holding an emerald brush in his hand, which was faintly emitting a layer of divine light. This person’s cultivation was not inferior to Zi Buyu’s. Without a doubt, their identities were obvious.","The second-ranked sect in the world, and also the sect closest to Grand Xia, was the Virtuous Academy. There was no doubt about the identity of the leading disciple. He was the chief disciple of Virtuous Academy, Meng Tianren.","The cultivation of these two people was extremely powerful. In Chu Yunfan’s opinion, they might not be inferior to Li Qianyuan.","Beside Meng Tianren, Chu Yunfan saw a figure surrounded by countless evil demons. It was a young man in a black robe with a wicked smile on his face. It was not difficult to guess the identity of this person from the core disciples who surrounded him.","“The Astral Demonites!”","The number one sect of the demonic path, the Astral Demonites, was extremely perverse in its conduct, even daring to charge into the Central Plains and start a massacre. Lone Star was a classic example of this.","Besides Huangfu Li, the chief disciple of Astral Demonites, there was no one else who could make these unruly disciples of Astral Demonites submit willingly.","Huangfu Li was also a powerful figure. His demonic skills were shocking, and he even had the reputation of being the number one of the younger generation of the Astral Demonites. It was rumored that he had fought with Li Qianyuan before, and even Li Qianyuan could only watch him retreat in one piece.","Other than the experts of the Astral Demonites, there were also the experts of the local demons. Surrounded by countless monsters in human or human forms, a barefooted woman in red stood proudly in the sky.","‘She wears red clothes and walks barefoot. She’s the tenth princess of the Heavenly Foxes, Hu Qingxuan!’ Chu Yunfan instantly figured out her identity."]},{"number":1773,"title":"Chapter 1773 The Confrontation Between Geniuses, the Cave Opens","paragraphs":["1773 The Confrontation Between Geniuses, the Cave Opens","These four people emitted a pressure that made the sky tremble. Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder. They were big shots on the Prodigy List recorded in “The World.”","The Prodigy List wasn’t created by the Flying Celestials. Instead, it was created by an even more mysterious sect. It was a sect that had been looming since ancient times but rarely appeared. It was created by the Mysteries Pavilion, and it would be updated every once in a while.","The ultimate goal of every Cosmic true disciple was to get on the Prodigy List. As for those below the Cosmos Stage, they were not within the scope of consideration. They did not even dare to think about it.","Every single person on the Prodigy List was hailed as the hope of this generation. Everyone could say that as long as they didn’t die, they would definitely become great figures who dominated the world in the future.","Each of these four people was ranked at the top of the Prodigy List. Even the most unknown tenth princess of the Heavenly Foxes, Hu Qingxuan, was a famous prodigy among the demons.","It was just that they weren’t very famous in Grand Xia. However, on the Prodigy List, there were records of all of them. Every existence that could make it onto the Prodigy List was a benchmark and a monument at the end of the cultivation path of the younger generation.","This made Chu Yunfan somewhat interested in this Mysteries Pavilion. It was actually able to record so many geniuses. It seemed that this sect knew many secrets about these geniuses like the back of their hand. The Mysteries Pavilion seemed to be extraordinary.","This Mysteries Pavilion seemed to be related to the Mysteries Pavilion in the Violet Thunder Prefecture. To be more precise, the Mysteries Pavilion in the Violet Thunder Prefecture was originally a subordinate organization of this Mysteries Pavilion. Later, the Violet Thunder Prefecture was separated by the barrier of the Violet Thunder Swords, and they lost contact with each other.","Just as Chu Yunfan was lost in his thoughts, the chief disciple of the Astral Demonites, Huangfu Li, stepped in front of Meng Tianren. He pointed at Meng Tianren and said, “Meng Tianren, we have a score to settle. Previously, Lone Star of my sect was severely injured by you and then died. Although he didn’t die at your hands, you were involved.”","Huangfu Li had a devilish smile on his face, and his body carried a terrifying aura. Just by standing there, he felt like a demon god had descended.","Meng Tianren had a faint smile on his face. His body emitted a righteous aura to resist this demonic aura. He said, “That’s fine. You’ve done a lot of evil. Who knows how many people in Grand Xia have died in your hands? People like you who disrupt the order of the world are on my must-kill list.”","For scholars who entered the secular world, maintaining the stability of an empire and the peace of the people was the most important thing. Scholars emphasized the cultivation of the family, the rule of the country, and the peace of the world. Almost all the disciples of the Virtuous Academy took it as their duty to pacify the world.","These heretics were eyeing Grand Xia day and night. To the Virtuous Academy, they were their mortal enemies. There was no possibility of easing up. Therefore, Meng Tianren had a must-kill list in his heart. By killing people, he was saving people. He was very clear about this principle and had a firm belief.","“Hahaha! Meng Tianren, I’ve long heard that you’re very arrogant. Today, I’ve seen it for myself. I wonder if your principal will be furious if I kill you.”","Huangfu Li laughed, and his aura became even more powerful. It was surging with demonic flames. However, the righteous energy emitted by Meng Tianren was not inferior in the slightest. It even faintly suppressed Huangfu Li’s surging demonic flames. Righteous energy had a natural restraining effect on evil spirits.","The confrontation between the two attracted everyone’s attention. That terrifying aura suppressed the tens of thousands of people in the field. The tens of thousands of martial arts experts were suppressed by the aura of the two.","‘The gap between them can’t be calculated!’","This sentence appeared in everyone’s mind. The gap between those top figures and them was simply not a small problem.","With their auras being so tyrannical, they were definitely peerless talents.","Many people looked at Zi Buyu and Hu Qingxuan, both of whom had yet to make a move. Just Meng Tianren and Huangfu Li alone were already so shocking. Then how powerful would the remaining two, who were also on the Prodigy List, be?","However, before he could do so, he saw a figure blocking his way. It was Hu Qingxuan who had blocked him.","“Hu Qingxuan, are you trying to stop me?” Zi Buyu frowned.","“I can’t say that I’m stopping you, but I’m quite interested in you, Brother Zi.” Hu Qingxuan laughed coquettishly but did not give in in the slightest.","Zi Buyu and said, “Hu Qingxuan, I know some things about you. When you were young, you disguised yourself as a human and sneaked into Grand Xia. You traveled around the Central Plains and made a wide network of friends, but no one could tell that you were a demon and a prestigious figure. Back then, among your peers, you couldn’t find a match. However, I don’t think so. It’s just that there’s no tiger in the mountain, and the monkey calls itself the king.”","Zi Buyu looked at Hu Qingxuan. He admitted that Hu Qingxuan was indeed a character, but that was all.","“Oh? In that case, let’s spar, Brother Zi!” A sharp light flashed in Hu Qingxuan’s eyes, and then she laughed again and again.","“Put away your seduction technique. You can fool others, but you can’t do anything to me,” Zi Buyu said.","While the two of them were talking, Meng Tianren and Huangfu Li, who could not wait any longer, had already started fighting. The two of them rose into the sky, and a terrifying battle fluctuation instantly erupted.","Zi Buyu and Hu Qingxuan began to attack each other.","Right at this moment, after a huge explosion, the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave opened!"]},{"number":1774,"title":"Chapter 1774 A Great Harvest","paragraphs":["1774 A Great Harvest","The Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave opened without any warning. Although everyone knew that the cave would open, this speed was beyond everyone’s expectations.","With a loud bang, tens of thousands of people began to rush toward the cave. Tens of thousands of experts turned into flowing lights and streaked across the sky like meteors.","Chu Yunfan followed closely behind the crowd and entered the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave. The moment he entered the cave, he felt a terrifying and fierce aura burst out as if there was a terrifying beast hidden inside. The pressure caused the expressions of the Interpreters among the crowd to change drastically. With their cultivation, just resisting this pressure was extremely difficult. They activated their divine power to protect their surroundings, isolating themselves from this pressure. The spiritual cultivation of many Cosmics was stronger, so they were not affected too much by this fierce aura.","Chu Yunfan’s body shook slightly, and the pressure instantly disappeared without a trace.","After entering the cave, Chu Yunfan found that the outer area of the cave was filled with the bones of fierce beasts. Some of these bones were as big as a small mountain, while others were the size of an ordinary person. Many of them emitted layers of pressure even after death, making people feel a chill.","They were at least at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. There were even skeletons of ferocious beasts in the Cosmos Stage and even beyond. Most importantly, these ferocious beasts did not die of natural causes when they were alive. They were eaten by someone or something. Other than the bones, everything else was eaten.","Without a doubt, the one who did all this was the descendant of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix.","As soon as they entered, countless Interpreters began to fight for these skeletons. Although these skeletons were only the bones of powerful ferocious beasts, they were important components in refining weapons and making pills. These were important gains for them, especially since they knew that the real good things had little to do with them. Just these small gains were enough to make them feel that their trip was not in vain.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan blended into the crowd. There were many Cosmics like him, so it was not rare. There were many lone wolves that scattered and searched for what they wanted. It was basically a race against time because they all understood that with so many people here, there was no time for them to slowly search.","At this time, Huangfu Li, Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, and Zi Buyu, who had originally fallen behind because of the fight, rushed in. The four of them arrived and overtook everyone at an extremely fast speed. Everyone followed them all the way in. The deeper they went, the bigger the space of this cave became. It even far exceeded the size they saw outside.","‘It’s a spatial barrier!’ Chu Yunfan immediately realized it. There had to be a spatial barrier set up here to create such a shocking effect.","Soon, they encountered the first layer of obstruction, and many puppets blocked their way. In the blink of an eye, the puppets had rushed into the crowd. These thousands of puppets were almost as strong as Cosmics. Now, they were lined up like an army, looking extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan thought to himself that this Immemorial Dark Phoenix was indeed extremely terrifying. Although it couldn’t be compared to the first Immemorial Dark Phoenix, it was still an overlord in the distant past. It would have taken an unknown amount of wealth to produce these puppets that were comparable to the Cosmos Stage.","Even the Cosmics stopped in their tracks when they saw so many Cosmic puppets. They did not dare to move forward. On the contrary, Huangfu Li took a step forward and crushed a Cosmic puppet that was charging at him.","“A mere puppet dares to block my way?”","Huangfu Li was like a demon god in the world, running amok all the way. These Cosmic puppets might be able to fight against ordinary Cosmics but they were utterly powerless against a figure like Huangfu Li. They were instantly defeated. In a moment, Huangfu Li had carved a way out and left in a flash.","Soon, Hu Qingxuan, Meng Tianren, and Zi Buyu caught up to Huangfu Li. Their cultivation bases were not inferior to Huangfu Li’s. How could these puppets stop them? The puppets were chiseled open and the experts charged out.","“Hurry up and follow them!” someone shouted, and more than 2,000 Cosmics charged forward again. Some of them were Cosmics with extremely profound cultivation. In just a moment, they had already rushed over and passed through the exit that Huangfu Li and the other three had dug.","Chu Yunfan’s feet emitted a sharp light as he rushed out.","In the distance, the voices of Huangfu Li and the others had already become softer and softer. They had already entered the depths of the cave. Chu Yunfan chased after them. There were hundreds of Cosmics beside him. They were all the best among the remaining people. They did not want to be outdone and rushed over. The remaining people were not so lucky and were blocked by the puppets.","Soon, Chu Yunfan saw the many traces left behind by Huangfu Li and the others. From afar, he could see that puppets had been smashed into pieces and fell to the ground. There were also countless ferocious beasts that had survived. They were all killed by Huangfu Li and the others.","It was a clean sweep.","It was impossible for an ordinary person to escape from such an obstruction. However, when facing Huangfu Li and the rest, as well as the hundreds of Cosmics behind them, they were practically swept away. They could not even block them.","Chu Yunfan immediately followed them in, collecting the remains of the puppets and the corpses of the fierce beasts along the way. He collected the corpses of the fierce beasts because almost all of them were above the Cosmos Stage. Although they were clearly abnormal and were produced by some secret method, they did not have the cultivation of the Cosmos Stage, but they had the power of a Cosmic.","Their blood essence was genuine. There were so many of them that Chu Yunfan took away hundreds of corpses in a moment and poured them all onto the Brahma Tree in the Mountain River Diagram."]},{"number":1775,"title":"Chapter 1775 The Seven Cosmos Levels","paragraphs":["1775 The Seven Cosmos Levels","Seeing so many corpses being collected and watered on the Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan grinned.","It was a huge harvest. For ordinary Cosmics, these ferocious beasts were raised with special secret methods. They did not possess some of the essence of real Cosmic ferocious beasts.","However, it was different for Chu Yunfan. Through the Brahma Tree, all of them could be transformed into the Brahma Fruit, completely increasing Chu Yunfan’s strength. The already ripe Brahma Fruit underwent a faint transformation, and the fragrance of the fruit assailed his nose.","Chu Yunfan also collected the fallen puppets. For the victims, puppets that had been destroyed basically had no value, but for Chu Yunfan, it was different. There were many methods of making puppets recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, but he had never tried it before because it would take a long time to collect all the materials. But now, it was completely different. He could extract the materials he needed from these remains. In time, he could make an army of puppets.","The puppet path was not a small path. On the contrary, it was also one of the great paths, containing many mysteries that ordinary people could not imagine. Without a complete inheritance, it was impossible to dabble with puppets.","As he collected the corpses of the beasts and puppets, Chu Yunfan slowly fell behind everyone. They looked at Chu Yunfan with disdain. He was just a country bumpkin who didn’t know what real wealth was. These things were nothing to Cosmics like them. The real good things were still in the depths of the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave. Now, they were only concerned about collecting these scraps, and they were not even qualified to fight for the last good things.","However, because of this, many people’s hostile gazes toward him were much more restrained. In their eyes, this was just a country bumpkin who had not seen the world. They would let him collect trash here.","Chu Yunfan turned a blind eye to these gazes. He was happy that everyone misunderstood him. As long as he could greatly increase his strength, picking up trash was no big deal.","Chu Yunfan continued to search as he flew toward the depths of the cave. At the same time, he clicked his tongue in wonder. The speed of the group of people in front of him was too fast. If it were him, there was no such possibility. With his current cultivation, there was still a huge gap between him and these people.","These people were the real top experts in the Cosmos Stage.","Unlike the Abstract Interpretation Stage, the Cosmos Stage was divided into seven levels, known as the seven Cosmos levels. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was about the same as a second-level Cosmic. Although his combat strength could easily sweep past that level, he was stuck here.","Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, Huangfu Li, and Zi Buyu were the best among them. Their cultivation had already reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage. According to the experience of the Alchemy Emperor’s memory in Chu Yunfan’s mind, these four people were probably one step away from surpassing the Cosmos Stage.","At that point, they would be true big shots. Not only would they be the king of the younger generation, but they would also be comparable to the experts of the older generation. Though they had not taken that step, their terror was far from what Chu Yunfan could hope to catch up to. Those who followed closely behind them were probably at sixth or seventh-level Cosmics. They were all outstanding experts in the Cosmos Stage. Their cultivation was about the same as Luo Zhao, who was killed by Chu Yunfan.","Then, there was the group that Chu Yunfan was in. The experts in that group were fourth or fifth-level Cosmics. Even though they were not as powerful as the first two batches, they were still on a whole new level compared to the ordinary Cosmics who were below the third level and were stopped by the puppets.","After all, although those puppets were comparable to the Cosmos Stage, they were at most comparable to first or second-level Cosmics. Therefore, they could not even withstand one move from Huangfu Li.","This made Chu Yunfan feel anxious. Huangfu Li and the others were already so powerful, not to mention Li Qianyuan was even stronger than them. He was known as the top master of the younger generation, so he was at least at the peak of the Cosmos Stage.","With such a strong enemy, Chu Yunfan had no choice but to do his best to increase his cultivation. Although it would be dangerous to continue following them, Chu Yunfan was not afraid.","Soon, Chu Yunfan caught up with the crowd again because he found that they were blocked by a huge barrier. Chu Yunfan understood that the real good stuff was probably on the other side of the barrier.","Everyone was a little depressed. Were they really going to be stopped on this side?","They had already tried to attack, but they could not break through this barrier. Their attacks landed on this barrier, but they could only leave behind traces of ripples. They could not shake this barrier.","“I don’t believe that a barrier left behind by an old man who has been dead for countless years can stop us!” Huangfu Li roared as terrifying magic power fluctuations erupted from his body. Demonic flames surged and bombarded the barrier. He was born in a demonic sect and only believed in strength. He did not have much respect for ancient experts.","Behind him, whether it was Hu Qingxuan, who was faintly allied with him, or Meng Tianren and Zi Buyu, who followed closely behind, they all began to attack. Even the terrifying experts of the second batch of sixth and seventh-level Cosmics also attacked.","No one was willing to be blocked by the barrier just like that.","Soon, even the third batch of Cosmics joined in the bombardment. However, the barrier did not budge in the slightest. It was terrifyingly strong. Everyone’s attacks only produced some ripples, but they could not penetrate it.","Chu Yunfan looked around and realized that at this rate, they wouldn’t be able to break the barrier for a while.","‘I might as well take this opportunity to cultivate and increase my cultivation. Only then will I have a better chance of winning in the upcoming competition,’ Chu Yunfan thought."]},{"number":1776,"title":"Chapter 1776 The Immemorial, Ancient, Modern, and Present Eras","paragraphs":["1776 The Immemorial, Ancient, Modern, and Present Eras","No matter what was hidden inside, there was no doubt that it would be an earth-shattering battle. Although Chu Yunfan had a certain degree of confidence, in the end, absolute strength was the guarantee of everything.","In the past, Chu Yunfan was not interested in these relatively low-level corpses because he had no use for them. Keeping them would only take up space. However, it was different now. He was leading an army, so the low-level Brahma Fruits were not of much use to him. However, he could leave them for the Baotai soldiers to use.","He had elevated them to the Abstract Stage in one go. Although it was only the lowest level of the Abstract Stage, it was still very shocking. After all, it was an entire army. If it was the usual training method, it would require an unknown amount of resources and heavenly treasures to train them. Even among the many armies of Grand Xia, only a very small number of ace elites could reach the Abstract Stage. However, Chu Yunfan actually wanted to cultivate them to such a level by himself. One could imagine how ambitious he was.","After swallowing the Brahma Fruit, Chu Yunfan felt all the mana in his body begin to roll, forming a frightening scene around him. If Chu Yunfan was not in the Mountain River Diagram now, it would definitely cause a huge commotion.","The divine power in his body began to rotate at an even more astonishing speed. As the divine power rotated, it turned as it pleased. Soon, it led Chu Yunfan to break through to the late stage of the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, the whole world seemed to be different from before. There were thin threads winding around his body, making him different from before. Those in the Abstract Stage could faintly sense the existence nature’s laws. However, it was only able to sense their existence. Slowly, one could perceive the laws, then explore the rules within the laws, and use the laws to strengthen one’s body. This was the cultivation of the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could see the existence of these laws. They were densely packed around him. How shocking was this existence?","In terms of cultivation level, Chu Yunfan had already advanced from the three major levels, where mountains were mountains and water was water, to another level, where mountains were not mountains and water was not water.","The last level was naturally to look at the mountain as a mountain and the water as water.","Chu Yunfan knew about the last realm. After all, the Alchemy Emperor was a top expert in that realm. However, knowing it was just knowing. To truly understand it was another matter.","But now, Chu Yunfan had used the power of the godhead to see that the mountain was not a mountain, and the water was not water. This was a new ability developed by the godhead after it had devoured almost all of the middle-grade spirit stones he had obtained recently. Together with the original godhead’s ability to analyze all Great Dao, this allowed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation and comprehension ability to reach a level of rapid progress. It could be said that it was like adding wings to a tiger.","Entering such a state allowed him to look down on many problems in cultivation. He could see these laws with his naked eye. He could see the laws that were blurry to ordinary people. Just because of this, even if his cultivation aptitude was ordinary, his cultivation speed was many times faster than ordinary so-called geniuses.","Through the surface of things, one could see the essence. This was the most powerful aspect of the godhead. It seemed that all laws were no secret in front of Chu Yunfan.","It was no wonder that in the distant past, during the glorious era when the emperors stood side by side, there were countless emperors who fought for the godhead, leading to the end of an era.","During this period, Chu Yunfan looked up a lot of information. The Flying Celestials was one of the top ten sects in the world. The information they had could be said to be as vast as dust.","There were no real secrets regarding the matters of the distant past. All the major sects knew about it, so this information was open to the public to increase the knowledge of the disciples.","The path of cultivation itself was not something that could be achieved by closing one’s doors. Every cultivator who had achieved success in cultivation was bound to be knowledgeable, far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","From this information, Chu Yunfan inferred a lot of things. Although many historical materials were vague, they roughly divided the past into the immemorial, ancient, modern, and present eras.","During the immemorial era, when the world had just been created, all kinds of ferocious beasts ran amok. Innate lifeforms ran amok all over the world. The spirit energy of nature was incomparably violent. It was simply not something that the current cultivators could imagine.","The Ten Ferocities came from that era and were the best of the best in that era.","Up until now, only a few descendants of the bloodline remained, but their strength was still not to be underestimated. Any one of them was extremely terrifying, and no one on the same level could match them.","Because it wasn’t far from the Immemorial Era, the bloodline of all living beings hadn’t deteriorated. Countless experts, countless sects, and countless paths appeared, and it was said that all emperors stood side by side.","Most of the cultivation methods today were passed down from that era.","The talents of the people of that era were terrifyingly strong, and it was simply unimaginable to people today. For example, Hua Xianyuan had a special physique and received much attention in the Flying Celestials.","However, in that era, such physiques were as common as the hair on an ox. There were countless of them, and they were not considered extraordinary physiques. Only emperor physiques could be considered a true top-notch physique, but even so, it was nothing in that era.","That was a terrifying era where there were many true Innate lifeforms. For experts such as the Emperor Supreme and the Alchemy Emperor to become top experts in a short few decades was simply an unbelievable miracle in this era."]},{"number":1777,"title":"Chapter 1777 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Interpretation Stage","paragraphs":["1777 Breakthrough, Late Abstract Interpretation Stage","In this era, there were many people who had reached the Cosmos Stage at a young age. There were even some who had surpassed the Cosmos Stage. They were the true geniuses of the generation. However, reaching the status of an emperor at such an age was undoubtedly a miracle. It should even be said that it was a legend. It was something that could not be done at all.","However, in the ancient era, becoming an emperor was very common. This was because the supreme experts of that era were either Innate lifeforms themselves or the direct descendants of Innate lifeforms. Compared to the immemorial era, they were already one of the weaker Innate lifeforms.","However, they were Innate lifeforms, and the current Acquired lifeforms of the current era could not compare.","The innate talents of these people were all extremely powerful. The Alchemy Emperor was an Innate lifeform and his background was extremely impressive. Even the Alchemy Emperor knew from his memories that he came from a clan of Innate lifeforms. It was an Innate clan and his bloodline was extraordinary.","Thus, they were completely different. Although they weren’t as powerful as the Innate lifeforms of the immemorial era, through the cultivation techniques they had created, they had developed a powerful strength and civilization that wasn’t inferior to the immemorial era. In fact, they were even stronger.","In terms of civilization, it was the most glorious period in countless years of history. It conquered the myriad worlds and made the myriad worlds praise the strength of the ancient civilization.","According to the ancient records, the ancient era collapsed because of a great war. For some unknown reason, many emperors fought and countless emperors died. Blood flowed like rivers, the world collapsed, and spirit energy flowed out. Countless living beings suffered heavy casualties.","This was not recorded in the books of the Flying Celestials. He did not know if it was because they did not know or because they did not announce it to the public. However, Chu Yunfan had his speculations. It was very likely that this was related to the battle when the godhead descended into the world and many emperors fought for it.","The Alchemy Emperor also perished in that battle.","Ever since then, history entered another era. The modern era was a truly chaotic era. Without the suppression of many emperors, various forces erupted in shocking wars, especially after the world was torn apart by many emperors. The environment became worse and worse, and cultivation resources became scarce. This also caused the competition between various forces to become more intense.","That was the true Dark Age. Countless people were killed like ants. The demonic path grew like a snowball in that chaotic era, as if it had received the blessing of heaven. The world was almost ruled by the demonic path. The righteous path was forced to retreat, and it was difficult for them to even protect themselves.","At the end of the modern era, a true emperor rose up and suppressed the dark chaos with an unimaginably powerful attitude. Those powerful demonic experts who caused trouble for a while, even those at the king level, were defeated by this emperor.","Ever since the emperor was born, he was invincible, defeating all enemies and completely pacifying the dark chaos. He established a dynasty with the ten great sects that followed him in battle, which was the current Grand Xia Dynasty.","The history from then up to this day was known as the present era.","Reading the history, Chu Yunfan was impressed by the elegance. From the rise of the emperor to the end of the chaos and the establishment of Grand Xia, it had only taken twenty years to drive the evil out of the Central Plains.","After that, the emperor of Grand Xia successively defeated the Hus, the barbarian, monster, sea tribes, demons, and many other foreign races that had wreaked havoc on the Central Plains. Only then did the Central Plains finally welcome an era of peace.","The emperor was the first and only emperor of Grand Xia. From then on, the ruler of Grand Xia could only be called king, not emperor. Not everyone’s achievements and strengths were worthy of being called emperor by the people.","As for the emperor of Grand Xia, it was as if he had jumped out of a crack in the rock. He had no history of growth, and when he came out, he was already in the invincible realm of emperors. As soon as he was born, he immediately threw himself into the battle to quell the dark turmoil.","Fifty years after he ascended the throne, he calmed the turmoil in Grand Xia. After passing the throne to his eldest son, he disappeared without a trace. Some people said that it was because he had been severely injured when he had been pacifying the dark turmoil. He had used up his energy and passed away after that. Others said that it was because the emperor had entered a state of eternal sleep.","There were even rumors that the emperor was not an expert of the modern era. After the ancient era, it had been many years since the last emperor was seen. The emperor of Grand Xia might have been an emperor from the ancient era who had fallen into a deep slumber. Therefore, he was invincible when he was born and could crush all enemies.","However, there were people who disagreed. It was unknown how many years had passed since the ancient era. Even emperors could not live for so long. They had a limit to their lifespan too. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many emperors fighting over the godhead. The fundamental reason was to attain immortality and live forever.","The emperor of Grand Xia had always been hidden in a fog, and no one had truly understood him. The Flying Celestials only recorded some of these rumors as interesting news and did not really record any important information. If Chu Yunfan wanted to know the truth, he would have to ask the current imperial family.","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and began to analyze the laws around him that could be seen with the naked eye. He felt that his comprehension of the realm was constantly increasing, and the divine power in his body was also increasing at an amazing speed. The originally sturdy realm barrier was now crumbling at an astonishing speed. With the help of the godhead, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed increased by another level.","Seconds and minutes passed by, and no one knew how much time had passed. The aura around Chu Yunfan’s body grew stronger and stronger. In a moment, it filled the entire world and suddenly exploded.","Boom!","The divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly exploded, turning into a violent wind that raged. However, in the next moment, this divine power was absorbed into his body.","Chu Yunfan let out a long breath. This breath turned into an energy dragon that swept out. He felt the bursting divine power in his body. He had finally broken through. Compared to before, he was more than twice as powerful. This was just the beginning. If he continued to strengthen himself, his strength could continue to increase.","After passing that checkpoint, his cultivation would increase and he would be able to reach the peak."]},{"number":1778,"title":"Chapter 1778 Slaughtering Cosmics Like Grass","paragraphs":["1778 Slaughtering Cosmics Like Grass","With his current combat strength, Chu Yunfan had broken through the second-level Cosmos Stage and rushed into the third level. He was able to sweep away the third-level Cosmics.","It was far more difficult for Chu Yunfan to break through compared to ordinary people. However, once he broke through, his combat strength would often be shocking and no one could compare to him.","Suddenly, at this time, a change occurred outside the Mountain River Diagram. After a crazy bombardment for more than half a day, many experts, including Huangfu Li, Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, Zi Buyu, and the other four experts, attacked at the same time.","Finally, a hole was created in the barrier.","When everyone saw this, they were instantly overjoyed. They practically swarmed forward and charged straight in. Chu Yunfan had just come out of the Mountain River Diagram. At this time, everyone had already rushed in for some time, and Chu Yunfan had just broken through, so he didn’t catch up with this wave.","At this moment, the third batch of Cosmics, who had been blocked by the puppets, had already broken through the puppet blockade and rushed over. Their numbers were greater than those puppets, and their strength was not bad either. In fact, they were even stronger than the puppets. It was just that they were entangled for a while and couldn’t break through. Now, they were all around Chu Yunfan.","“There’s actually someone here?”","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan emerge from the Mountain River Diagram, and greed flashed across their eyes. They did not lack spatial artifacts, but one could hold people was another matter.","“Old man, hand over your spatial artifact, or don’t blame us for being rude,” a middle-aged cultivator with a medium build stepped forward and said with a sinister smile.","Behind him, hundreds of Cosmics surrounded him.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light.","These people were like bugs. Now, they actually dared to intercept and kill him. They really had a death wish.","When the middle-aged cultivator saw Chu Yunfan’s expressionless face, he thought that Chu Yunfan was frightened. His face revealed a somewhat smug expression.","“Although I don’t know how you did it, since you arrived so long before us, you should have collected quite a lot of good things just now. Hand them over obediently.” A smug smile appeared on his face. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan should obediently hand over his harvest.","Stab!","Just as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan attacked. A terrifying spear light pierced through the middle-aged cultivator like a swimming dragon.","The middle-aged cultivator had an incredulous look on his face. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to attack him like this. What was even more unexpected was that he was an expert who had entered the Cosmos Stage. How could he be so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan? He was killed in an instant.","“You’re courting death. You dare to rob me? Luo Zhao of the Iron Spears?” Chu Yunfan laughed sinisterly.","Of course, he said Luo Zhao’s name. Since Luo Zhao was already dead, he wouldn’t come looking for trouble because of this name.","Chu Yunfan’s attitude immediately angered the Cosmics around him. His strength shocked them a little, but it was quickly replaced by anger.","“The Iron Spears are nothing. You actually killed someone. It seems that you don’t want to live anymore!”","Many of the people present were from the top ten sects or the top sects of the demonic sects. Some of them were even famous among the demon clans. Which one of them was not stronger than the Iron Spears? Even though the Iron Spears were a first-rate power in Grand Xia, they had no advantage compared to these powers. In fact, they were at a disadvantage.","A mere old fellow of the Iron Spears dared to make a fuss in front of them. He was simply defying the heavens.","“Go ahead and try me then.” Chu Yunfan sneered. A sharp light flashed through his eyes as he put away the middle-aged cultivator’s body.","These people were after him, and he wanted to catch them all in one fell swoop. It would take him a long time to encounter hundreds of Cosmics. It just so happened that he could use all of them to water the Brahma Tree and increase his strength. He had long regarded these people as cultivation resources, but they did not know it.","“Everyone, attack together and kill him. As for his magic treasures and wealth, we can split them later!” someone shouted.","Upon hearing this, the hundreds of Cosmics were tempted. They were even fearless. They were not kind people to begin with. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan was doomed to die in the face of the siege of hundreds of Cosmics. The only difference was how he died.","In the blink of an eye, hundreds of Cosmics pounced over.","Although they were all cultivators from the first to the third level of the Cosmos Stage, it was still an earth-shaking scene when hundreds of them attacked together. Hundreds of torrents condensed into a terrifying pillar of light that instantly blasted toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t anxious in the slightest. He just sneered and said, “When you die and go underground, the King of Hell will ask for a name. Don’t forget that the one who killed you is Luo Zhao of the Iron Spears!”","Chu Yunfan attacked. The Silver Dragon Spear flipped and stabbed out. The spear light turned into a huge dragon. The dragon’s claws tore the torrent into light spots. Then, it hit the dozens of Cosmics closest to it at an even more shocking speed.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The Cosmics screamed and spat out a mouthful of blood. Their bodies flew backward as if they had been hit by a hammer. Immediately after, countless spear lights descended from the sky and landed on them. These Cosmics were nailed to the ground.","In just a short exchange of blows, more than ten Cosmics had died tragically. This sudden turn of events shocked everyone. It should even be said that they were frightened.","Chu Yunfan didn’t stop. He waved the Silver Dragon Spear in his hand. The Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear, the most terrifying spear technique of the Iron Spears, was displayed in his hand.","It could be said that a Cosmic would be pierced to death with just one thrust of the spear. No matter what kind of defense one had, it was as weak as paper in the face of this demon-like spear.","In a moment, there were already many casualties."]},{"number":1779,"title":"Chapter 1779 The Immemorial Dark Phoenix Egg","paragraphs":["1779 The Immemorial Dark Phoenix Egg","The Iron Spears’ Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear, in Chu Yunfan’s hands, exploded with shocking power. In just a short time, it had killed and injured the Cosmics who had surrounded them.","Luo Zhao was a little too arrogant. Could it be that the Iron Spears actually dared to provoke the various major powers collectively?","“Hurry up and get lost!” Chu Yunfan sneered as if he had no intention of killing them.","The remaining experts glanced at each other and left one after another. Chu Yunfan had killed more than half of them with one burst of power. This terrifying cultivation made them tremble in fear.","This kind of lethality was too terrifying. Of course, the most important thing was that Chu Yunfan did not seem to fear them or the forces behind them. He killed them without any scruples. This was the most terrifying thing. As the saying goes, the arrogant was afraid of the foolish, the foolish was afraid of the reckless, and the reckless was afraid of the crazy.","In their eyes, Luo Zhao of the Iron Spears was crazy.","Many people secretly remembered this name. Though they were not Chu Yunfan’s match for the time being, they would find trouble with the Iron Spears when they returned. They would not let the Iron Spears have an easy time.","However, they didn’t know that they were following Chu Yunfan’s intention. He wanted to divert the trouble. Since the Iron Spears sent people to kill him continuously, it was obvious that they were on Li Qianyuan’s side. Then, they couldn’t don’t blame Chu Yunfan for being ruthless.","Moreover, he had transformed into Luo Zhao, and his cultivation of the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear was also very profound. The Iron Spears were truly unable to defend themselves.","After everyone left, Chu Yunfan sneered. He had collected more than 50 corpses of Cosmics in one go. Although it couldn’t be compared to Luo Zhao’s corpse, it was still a great harvest. It was enough to produce the Brahma Fruit that would allow Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to advance.","Chu Yunfan laughed. Indeed, a man would not be rich without a windfall, and a horse would not be fat without grass at night. If he were to slowly accumulate it himself, how long would it take for him to accumulate it?","As his thoughts drifted away, Chu Yunfan spread his lightning wings and chased after him. Among the many Cosmics, he had fallen to last place. As for the Interpreters, they had no ability to escape from the pursuit of the Cosmics puppets. It was impossible for them to break through.","The deeper he went, the more Chu Yunfan felt a heavy pressure sweeping over him like a tidal wave.","“Thump, thump, thump!”","Chu Yunfan suspected that he had heard wrongly. He heard the sound of a heartbeat. That’s right, it was the sound of a heartbeat. It was as if a terrifying beast was lurking in the depths of the cave. He could actually hear the heartbeat of this ferocious beast.","Soon, he caught up with everyone. He saw that everyone was advancing crazily, but they slowly stopped. They seemed to be blocked by an invisible force. Even Huangfu Li, Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, and Zi Buyu, who had the deepest cultivation, found it very difficult to advance under the pressure of this invisible pressure.","It was extremely difficult. Waves of treasure light continuously erupted from their bodies, and they had treasures on their bodies to block this terrifying pressure. The other Cosmics did the same. They used defensive magical treasures to protect themselves. In an instant, countless lights of all kinds flickered in the center of the cave, illuminating the dark surroundings. However, their strength was a level lower. They had no way to get close and could only circle around the outer area.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a giant egg about the size of a human in the deepest part of the cave. This giant egg faintly released a terrifying pressure, blocking everyone’s advance. The terrifying heartbeat that Chu Yunfan heard came from this giant egg.","‘What kind of ferocious beast’s egg is that? It’s able to stop a group of Cosmics even before it’s born!’","Chu Yunfan was very surprised. This was clearly the egg of a ferocious beast. He just didn’t know what kind of ferocious beast’s egg it was. It was already so powerful before it was even born. According to this, it was likely that it would be at least a Cosmic when it was born, or even an existence that surpassed the Cosmos Stage. There were many ferocious beasts, but those that were born so powerful were rare.","He learned from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that the eggs of ordinary monsters would also have faint patterns on them, but they were usually very simple. These patterns often represented the bloodline that these monsters inherited.","An egg that was densely engraved with all kinds of laws was extremely rare. It was almost as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. This also meant that this egg was nurturing something extraordinary.","“Could it be the Immemorial Dark Phoenix?” Chu Yunfan gasped. He saw traces of death on these densely packed patterns. The dense aura of death made people feel suffocated at a glance.","In the cave of the descendant of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, there was such an obvious law of death, so it was not difficult to guess. It was very likely that it was an egg left behind by the descendant of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix.","“No wonder!” Chu Yunfan saw that everyone’s eyes revealed a bit of greed. He was afraid that they had already guessed what this egg was.","If he could obtain an egg of an Immemorial Dark Phoenix and tame it with a secret technique, his future would be limitless.","The Immemorial Dark Phoenix was one of the Ten Ferocities. It was the top ferocious beast of that era. Even if its descendants could not compare to the first Immemorial Dark Phoenix, they were not comparable to ordinary monsters.","At the very least, he could be comparable to a king. If he could obtain the loyalty of an Immemorial Dark Phoenix, he could at least dominate a region and become a King.","Such temptation was enough to make everyone go all out."]},{"number":1780,"title":"Chapter 1780 Over 1,000 Cosmics Exterminated","paragraphs":["1780 Over 1,000 Cosmics Exterminated","Everyone was enduring the terrifying pressure and trying to get close to the egg. Huangfu Li, Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, and Zi Buyu’s progress was the fastest, approaching step by step.","Not far away from him, Huangfu Li held a demonic blade in his hand. The demonic flames from the blade surged into the sky. These demonic flames fused with his body, making him seem like a demonic blade that was invincible, cutting apart all the pressure that approached.","Zi Buyu was wearing a treasure robe that was faintly emitting starlight. It was the most defensive type of magic treasure, and it was the easiest among these people. It was the famous magic treasure in the Divine Stars, the Divine Star Robe.","Many people in the Divine Stars would refine such a Divine Star Robe. However, according to the difference in cultivation and wealth, the Divine Star Robe refined by the disciples of the Divine Stars would have completely different power.","Without a doubt, the Divine Star Robe on Zi Buyu was the best among them. He was the number one among the disciples.","But Hu Qingxuan was completely different. Her body faintly emitted a green light, and around her body, a layer of divine power condensed into a divine power coat evolved, expelling the pressure outside.","These four people were the strongest, and their magic treasures were also the most impressive. As they moved forward, they quickly approached the egg of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix.","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure caught up to the four of them as if he were taking a leisurely stroll. The four of them turned their heads with difficulty and saw an old man holding a Silver Dragon Spear.","“The Iron Spears?”","The four of them were not ignorant and incompetent people. Naturally, they immediately recognized the symbol on this man’s clothes. It was the robe of the Iron Spears. However, they didn’t expect that the old man from the Iron Spears would be able to walk here so casually, completely ignoring the pressure. They could only do this much even if they tried their best. However, this old man had done it easily.","‘Just how strong is he?’","Many people couldn’t help but have this thought in their minds. This thought even made them feel afraid. This old man could easily ignore the pressure. He had at least reached a realm above the Cosmos Stage.","Although it couldn’t be seen from the outside, it was impossible to judge a true top-notch expert based on their appearance. That would be too superficial.","They could only watch as the old man approached the egg as if he were strolling in a courtyard. It was as if the egg did not release any pressure at all. The four of them looked at each other in disbelief. When did such a terrifying existence appear in the Iron Spears?","This person was none other than Chu Yunfan. Of course, he did not rely on his strength to isolate the pressure, but on the godhead. Ever since he had the godhead, this kind of spiritual pressure could not cause any harm to him.","“No wonder there are no guards here. Ordinary guards can’t withstand the pressure released by the egg.”","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to approach, he suddenly felt a terrifying mental power sweep over and enter his mind. It was about to kill Chu Yunfan’s consciousness and take over his body.","“How dare you!” Chu Yunfan roared.","The godhead in his mind suddenly burst out with a burst of rainbow light, turning into a dense fog that filled the sky. In an instant, the invading mental power was shattered into pieces.","The terrifying mental power was left in Chu Yunfan’s mind. He only heard a scream, and the remaining mental power was like a tide, frantically withdrawing.","The amount of spirit energy was unimaginable. It was three times more than Chu Yunfan’s current spirit energy. If it wasn’t for the godhead, Chu Yunfan would have been possessed in an instant. His primordial spirit would have been destroyed, and he would have been turned into an idiot.","He had been too smooth sailing so far. Who knew that such a thing would happen when he had just approached the egg? If he didn’t have the godhead, he would have died here. Without a doubt, this was definitely the egg of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. That mental power came from it.","Chu Yunfan pretended to spit out a mouthful of blood, pretending to be seriously injured. This alerted Huangfu Li and the others. They thought that they had no chance. The egg of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was going to be snatched by Chu Yunfan. Who knew that there would be such a chance after a twist of events?","They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would come again after recovering from his injuries, so they didn’t care how much risk there was. They quickened their pace and continuously erupted with powerful divine power to resist this pressure.","The other ordinary Cosmics all rushed over as well. In a short time, everyone had already arrived around the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg.","However, at this moment, countless talismans engraved with the death law on the egg flashed. A terrifying mental power spread in all directions like a tsunami.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","Spurt, spurt, spurt!","In an instant, these Cosmics seemed to have suffered a heavy blow as if they had been struck by a terrifying force. They flew backward one after another, and those with weaker cultivations spat out blood. Then, something even more ominous happened. The Cosmics with weaker cultivations turned into dried corpses. The blood in their bodies was sucked dry, and in the air, it turned into a huge blood river that surged into the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg.","Just like that, thousands of Cosmics suffered. Their blood was all fed to the egg."]},{"number":1781,"title":"Chapter 1781 Threefold Mental Power and the Immemorial Dark Fire","paragraphs":["1781 Threefold Mental Power and the Immemorial Dark Fire","All of the Cosmics who had been wiped out were at the first to third-level Cosmics. They were all at the bottom of the Cosmos Stage. Even so, they were still thousands of Cosmics. If it were outside, the death of over a thousand Cosmics would have shaken the entire world.","This was a war of extermination. Now, they were wiped out in an instant.","The rest of the Cosmics were also injured and not in a good condition. Even the powerful Huangfu Li, Zi Buyu, Meng Tianren, and Hu Qingxuan spat out a mouthful of blood from the impact and were heavily injured. They finally understood why Chu Yunfan had been severely injured when he had just come into contact with the egg.","They subconsciously thought that Chu Yunfan, who could ignore the pressure of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg, was much more powerful than them. After all, Chu Yunfan looked like an old man who was about to die. He looked like an old monster who was cultivating bitterly in the deep mountains and forests. Although they didn’t look down on others based on their appearances, they were more or less affected at this time.","Even Chu Yunfan was forced to spit out a mouthful of blood, so it was normal for them to be like this. It was just that everyone was blinded by the temptation of taming the Immemorial Abyss Phoenix and did not think so much. Now, they realized that something was wrong. They could clearly feel that after absorbing the blood of thousands of Cosmics, the aura of the creature in the egg was getting stronger and stronger. Even its heartbeat was getting stronger and stronger.","No one who could cultivate to the Cosmos Stage and become a big shot would be a fool. Even if they were blinded by benefits before, they would probably have reacted now. There was a problem from the start. Some people even thought of an even more terrifying possibility.","Was the opening of this Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave a conspiracy from the beginning?","Otherwise, why did the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave had been sealed for so many years and no one had been able to find would suddenly open at this time? The news quickly spread all over the world and attracted so many experts. They hadn’t thought so much before, but now they felt that something was wrong.","From the very beginning, this matter might have been a trap to attract them to come and die. Thousands of Cosmics were killed in a single strike. Their blood turned into a terrifying torrent and was absorbed by the egg.","What if they were intentionally lured here to become food?","Thinking of this, everyone felt a chill down their spines. If that was really the case, it would be too terrifying. In other words, they had fallen into someone’s trap from the beginning. They were unaware of this. They thought that they could become the final hunters, but they did not expect to become the prey instead.","At the thought of this, some immediately fled with fear on their faces.","At this moment, the crowd realized that some of them had a sudden change in their eyes. Their eyes, which were originally full of vigor, turned gray. Then, in an instant, they began to attack the people around them.","There were 1,000 Cosmics left, and suddenly, one-third of them had become like this.","“Run! This is too strange. They are under some sort of control. If we don’t run, we’ll probably be controlled too!” someone shouted.","No matter how unwilling everyone was, they understood that this Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave was inexplicably dangerous. It was not a pleasant treasure hunt like they had imagined. On the contrary, it became their path to hell.","Many people reacted and frantically fled. It was not easy for them to advance under the pressure of the egg, but it was very easy for them to escape in the opposite direction.","Even Huangfu Li, Meng Tianren, Hu Qingxuan, and Zi Buyu, who were the strongest among them, could only give up. In the impact just now, they were heavily injured and were now unable to fight.","Moreover, the strange situation here also made them feel scared. This egg was really too strange. From the beginning, this matter had revealed a strange and ominous feeling.","The few of them looked at each other and quickly rushed out.","Only Chu Yunfan was left behind. Immediately, the experts who had their minds controlled chased after him, leaving only a portion of them to surround Chu Yunfan, who was cultivating cross-legged.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. A terrifying light burst out from his eyes. It was as if his entire person had undergone a complete transformation. In that short period, he had absorbed the mental power left in his mind by the Immemorial Dark Phoenix Egg and transformed it into his own mental power.","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s mental power had increased by three times.","This was of course very important to cultivators. The higher the mental power, the higher the cultivation level. The easier it was to comprehend the Heavenly Dao, and the easier it was to comprehend the Great Dao. With just this, Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of the realm had increased by a level.","Some pitch-black flames appeared around Chu Yunfan’s body. They were the flames of death. When he was refining the mental power, Chu Yunfan used his godhead to sort out some bits and pieces of information and deduced a kind of flame from it.","This flame was the Immemorial Dark Fire.","In the past, the Immemorial Dark Phoenix had relied on this flame to dominate the world. Anyone touched by it would die. Even experts stronger than Chu Yunfan would be severely injured.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have a lot of Immemorial Dark Fire in his body, but only a small portion was needed to slowly nurtured it. When he nurtured enough Immemorial Dark Fire, it would be another powerful trump card.","Even Cosmics would die if they were hit by a sufficient amount of Immemorial Dark Fire. They would not be able to escape. Once they were touched, it would be impossible to extinguish them unless the other party died.","Chu Yunfan’s face was filled with surprise and joy. This was clearly a special innate ability. He didn’t expect that his godhead could deduce it from these mental power fragments. Although it was only a beginner Immemorial Dark Fire, its power was beyond doubt.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the Cosmics who were charging at him. He grabbed at air and took out the Mountain River Cauldron. Then, he smashed it fiercely at the egg.","All of this was caused by the egg. As long as this egg was destroyed, there was nothing to worry about."]},{"number":1782,"title":"Chapter 1782 The Greatest Harvest","paragraphs":["1782 The Greatest Harvest","“Ah!”","“Wait!”","After the egg disappeared, the people controlled by the egg also started to flee in all directions. Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but feel extremely regretful. Among these people, there were many Cosmics with profound cultivation. There were hundreds of them. Even if Chu Yunfan tried his best to intercept them, he could only intercept and kill a dozen people. Their corpses could have been used to water the Brahma Tree.","At this moment, the Brahma Tree was densely covered with Brahma Fruits. However, ordinary Brahma Fruits were relatively small. Clearly, the medicinal effects were also different.","However, on the Brahma Tree, there was one beautiful and alluring Brahma Fruit. It had just begun to take shape, but it was already several times larger than an ordinary Brahma Fruit.","This was the Brahma Fruit that was watered with the blood essence of dozens of Cosmics.","A faint medicinal fragrance began to spread out, and it was maturing at an astonishing speed. However, at the same time, the middle-grade spirit stones in Chu Yunfan’s possession were exhausted.","Fortunately, these Cosmics all had quite a number of middle-grade spirit stones on them. The smallest number was hundreds of thousands, and the largest number was millions. Dozens of them added up to more than 20 million middle-grade spirit stones. It was a huge sum of money.","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief. He had finally scared off this scourge. In fact, although he had easily scared off the egg, only Chu Yunfan could do that. The egg itself was not that sturdy, which was why it was afraid of being smashed by Chu Yunfan. The life inside had probably already taken shape and had consciousness.","According to the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan knew that after many primordial beasts laid eggs, this situation would usually occur. The offspring of the eggs would have intelligence early on, but they would not be born. They would still have to absorb the essence of the world, the sun, and the moon, and absorb all kinds of natural treasures prepared by their elders to reach the realm of perfection.","Such creatures were rare, but each of them was one of the top ferocious beasts in the immemorial era. Once they were born, they would possess extremely high cultivation.","For example, once the Immemorial Dark Phoenix in this egg was born, its cultivation would at least surpass the Cosmos Stage. It would be a true peerless great calamity. However, it had yet to be born, so it could not use many of its methods. It could only use its powerful mental power to control these experts and use them for itself.","Even Cosmics would not be able to escape the fate of being controlled by such a surprise attack. At that time, they would be dominated by the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg. The weaker ones would directly become food, while the stronger ones would become its slaves and guards. Only a freak like Chu Yunfan, with the protection of the godhead, could ignore its mental attack and pressure and attack its main body.","That was why it was scared away!","Chu Yunfan was sure that this Immemorial Dark Phoenix would not hatch just like that. Otherwise, it would not be complete. Its future achievements and future Great Dao would not be complete. It might not even reach the level that it could reach before.","Therefore, rather than saying that Chu Yunfan had forced the egg back, it was more accurate to say that he had scared it away. In any case, Chu Yunfan was not afraid of those who had shoes on. If the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was forced to come into the world early, then he would be the real loser.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan discovered that there was a faint trace of divine will between his eyebrows. He immediately thought about it and understood that it was the divine will left behind by the Immemorial Dark Phoenix to locate him.","In the future, after the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was born, it would have to come and take revenge. This was a curse that ordinary people could not do anything about or remove.","“This creature takes revenge for the smallest grievance!” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","Although the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was scared away by him, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan had ruined its plan.","As expected of the descendant of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix, who was already famous in the immemorial era.","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to get rid of the curse, he suddenly saw a translucent phoenix appear in the sky where the egg had disappeared. This phoenix was about the size of a palm. The phoenix flapped its wings and wanted to fly away.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up and he laughed. “It’s really easy to find it without any effort. This is the biggest harvest this time!”","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan moved like lightning and caught the phoenix in his hand. The phoenix wanted to escape, but it couldn’t. Chu Yunfan casually wrote the word “seal” and caught the phoenix in his hand.","“Hahahaha!” Chu Yunfan laughed uproariously. Even with his profound state of mind, he could not help but reveal an ecstatic expression.","He recognized what this translucent phoenix was. It was a ball of life force. He understood why the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg did not die because after not being able to absorb nutrients after being sealed in the cave for so many years. On the contrary, it became stronger and stronger, and even the Cosmics who came had suffered.","It turned out that there was such a factor behind it.","Life force was a type of energy that only some experts with extremely high cultivation bases condensed from their own life force. To condense life force, one had to drain the life force of a person. In other words, that person was dead.","Therefore, in such a situation, only a few rare, or even peerless ferocious beasts that had been passed down from generation to generation would extract their life force in this way and pass it on to their descendants."]},{"number":1783,"title":"Chapter 1783 Devouring the Phoenix Life Force","paragraphs":["1783 Devouring the Phoenix Life Force","This kind of pure life force was not mixed with any impurities. To cultivators, it was simply a supreme tonic. It could even strengthen their life essence and raise it to another level.","There was no doubt that this ball of pure phoenix life force was left behind by the previous generation Immemorial Dark Phoenix. As long as the Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg continued to absorb this phoenix life force, when it was born in the future, its life essence would be complete. The moment it was born, it would be earth-shattering. In the future, its growth speed would be even more shocking.","In terms of life essence, this creature was completely different from humans. It was a higher level of life. These were Innate lifeforms, but humans were completely different. Humans were born extremely weak, but through continuous cultivation and continuous transformation of life essence, they were not inferior to Innate lifeforms. There were even some who were even stronger. These were two completely different paths, but they ultimately led to the end of the path of cultivation.","But now, the egg obviously hadn’t absorbed all of the phoenix life force. In the end, although it had absorbed the blood of thousands of Cosmics, it was a double loss. This ball of phoenix life force ended up in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This was much more precious than the blood of many Cosmics. It was a good thing that could improve the essence of one’s life. This was related to the future development prospects. Could the development prospects of an ant be compared to that of a human?","Rumble!","The entire cave suddenly began to shake, and countless dust began to fall from the ceiling.","“Oh no, the cave is going to collapse!” Chu Yunfan immediately realized.","This cave was probably built with the egg as a core structure of the trap. Now that the egg had left this place, this cave naturally collapsed.","Chu Yunfan immediately stepped out and disappeared. A moment later, he had left the cave, and soon, the entire cave collapsed.","There were still countless experts hiding in the dark around the cave. Many people were sighing regretfully. Fortunately, they had recovered quickly. Otherwise, they would have been completely buried in the cave.","When the Interpreters saw the Cosmics escaping from it in a sorry state, they felt a little pleased in their hearts. Although they were blocked at the periphery and could not enter, they had avoided the fate of being slaughtered.","However, more Interpreters looked at each other with fear on their faces when they saw this scene. This was because some of the Cosmics who came with them had died. Some sects even lost several of their experts. Such a huge loss would probably cause a huge uproar when news of it spread to the sects.","Amid the uproar, no one noticed that Chu Yunfan had quietly appeared. This time, he was in his original appearance. He clearly noticed that at the entrance of the cave, many eyes were constantly sweeping around, and many of them were looking at him. After confirming that he was not the person they were looking for, the wondering eyes quickly turned away. Chu Yunfan only had the aura of an ordinary Interpreter. No one had expected an Interpreter to be able to unleash strength comparable to a Cosmic.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood that these people were probably waiting for Luo Zhao to appear. They waited until the end, but Luo Zhao did not appear.","Chu Yunfan quickly left the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave and plunged into the Mountain River Diagram. He sat down cross-legged. In front of him was none other than the phoenix life force. He opened his mouth and circulated the Celestial Devouring Art. He swallowed the ball of phoenix life force and refined it with the Emperor Method.","Boom!","An unprecedented energy exploded in Chu Yunfan’s body. This feeling was like the big bang of the universe. It instantly exploded in Chu Yunfan’s body.","Rumble!","He could feel that his entire body was about to be torn apart by this terrifying power. Of course, he knew how rough it would be to refine this ball of life force. Even Immemorial Dark Phoenix egg had to carefully extract this life force for its own use.","He could feel every cell in his body being torn apart. In an instant, his entire body was bleeding from every pore, turning him into a bloody man. It had been a long time since he felt this way. With his physical cultivation, ordinary energy entering his body was no different from a clay ox entering the sea, let alone cause great damage to him.","As soon as Chu Yunfan’s body was torn apart, it was repaired, and this process repeated over and over. In the process of continuous tearing and recovery, Chu Yunfan gradually felt that his body had begun to undergo a huge transformation.","This was an indescribable feeling. Chu Yunfan was immersed in it. He could even feel that the essence of his life was improving at an amazing speed and constantly transforming.","It was as if a mysterious force had invaded his body’s cells, tearing them apart over and over again, carving traces of a special law into them. This was something that human genes did not possess. The order of the genes in his body was transforming. This was a leap in the level of life.","This enormous energy had completed an unprecedented transformation in his body.","Boom!","After an unknown period of time, a terrifying energy torrent swept out."]},{"number":1784,"title":"Chapter 1784 Life Transformation, Peak Abstract Interpretation Stage","paragraphs":["1784 Life Transformation, Peak Abstract Interpretation Stage","As the torrent of energy dissipated, Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. Two rays of golden light burst out from his eyes and shot into the sky.","“I can actually become so strong. This is great!”","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed an ecstatic expression. He counted with his fingers and realized that it had been a month since he started to devour the phoenix life force in seclusion. During this month, his body had undergone a world-shaking transformation.","Just the divine power in his body had increased by five times. It should be known that the original divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body was very dense. It was much stronger than those in the Cosmos Stage, let alone those on the same level. Now, it had increased by five times in one go. This was an astonishing improvement. This was the difference between the levels of life and the origin of life.","The wounds on Chu Yunfan’s body started to heal at an astonishing speed. In just a few seconds, he had fully recovered. This was not his own strength. Although his original recovery ability was amazing, it was definitely not to this extent.","In a breath, he had already recovered 70 – 80%. He did not even need to consume much divine power. Instead, it was similar to a kind of life instinct. Chu Yunfan knew that this was what was known as an innate ability.","Innate divine abilities could not be compared to the divine abilities cultivated after bitter training. Not only did divine abilities cultivated after the day have to be compatible with the physique, but it also had to be cultivated day and night. If one cultivated incorrectly, all their previous efforts would be for naught, and it might even backfire on one’s body.","However, innate divine abilities were different. Basically, one was born with a certain divine ability. When they reached the age, they would be able to naturally use this divine ability.","This was different for every race. In the human race, there were occasionally people who could awaken this kind of innate ability, but the probability was too low. On the contrary, some powerful monsters had such a bloodline in their bodies, which could be easily activated and obtain powerful strength that humans could not reach.","This was Chu Yunfan’s amazing recovery ability. This was the recovery ability that originally belonged to the phoenix clan. The phoenix clan was famous for their rebirth powers. In other words, even if they suffered an unimaginable heavy blow, they could be reborn and reach a new realm.","In the area of healing, phoenixes were gifted. It was not something that other races could compare to. Although the Immemorial Dark Phoenix was a rare ferocious beast during the immemorial era, it was still from the phoenix clan in essence and had a phoenix’s innate divine ability.","Although this innate divine ability was not eye-catching, in terms of recovery ability, it was simply an undying cockroach, especially when it encountered an expert whose strength was not much different or even much stronger than it.","When the other party thought that they could kill you, you could easily recover. This was a huge deterrent to the enemy itself. In a prolonged battle, you could kill the other party.","Other than that, Chu Yunfan had mastered the Immemorial Dark Fire. Before this, he could only faintly emit some of the Immemorial Dark Fire and it could still hurt him, but now, his physique was completely able to adapt to the Immemorial Dark Fire.","He had never heard of an Immemorial Dark Phoenix being injured by the Immemorial Dark Fire that he had cultivated. However, once Chu Yunfan used it, he might burn himself. It could be said that it was a double-edged sword.","But now, with the changes in his physique, Chu Yunfan had solved this weakness. Even if he used the Immemorial Dark Fire, he would not be injured. He could feel that his body seemed to have undergone an unprecedented change. It was as if he had turned into a half-human, half-phoenix. From the outside, he could not see any clues because this profound change came from the change in his genetic sequence.","Chu Yunfan had undergone genetic modification. In addition, his lifespan had also increased by several times, although there was still a huge gap compared to the long lifespan of phoenixes.","However, compared to ordinary people, this was earth-shattering. Just like in the Ancient Zenith Era, ordinary people could live for 50 to 70 years, but some could easily live to 600 years. How shocking was this?","Moreover, what cultivators lacked the most was time. Many people had no choice but to die regretfully before they could cultivate to a higher level. But now, Chu Yunfan had solved this problem.","Although his lifespan had only increased by several times, it was still a terrifying lifespan that ordinary people could not look up to. Even the emperors had to fight for the qualification to live forever, which directly led to the collapse of the ancient era.","Coupled with Chu Yunfan’s divine power that had increased by five times, it could be said that he had completed an unprecedented transformation. Even cultivation had broken through to the peak Abstract Interpretation Stage under this transformation. He was much more powerful than before. Now, even fourth-level Cosmics were no match for him.","However, what made him the happiest was not the increase in his strength, but the leap in his life level, allowing him to reach a level of transformation that ordinary people could not imagine. As for the increase in strength, it was just a side effect.","At this moment, he truly understood the essence and true meaning of cultivation. The essence and true meaning of cultivation was to defy the heavens and fight for life in order to live longer and better. Blindly fighting and only knowing how to increase one’s strength to fight was the lowest cultivation method. It could not be considered a high-class method.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan realized that the core cultivation technique he had previously cultivated, the Emperor Method, was essentially completing the transition of life level. The other martial arts and divine arts were only a means and support to achieve this transition. There were many paths, but they all pointed in the same direction.","Only now did Chu Yunfan truly understand what cultivation was and what the essence of cultivation was. He understood that this was the true meaning of the Cosmos Stage.","The Cosmos Stage was to defy the universe and fight for one’s life. Most Cosmics did not understand this principle. They only knew how to be brave and ruthless.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan realized that the barrier of the Cosmos Stage was loosening slightly. If he wanted to break through, it would be much easier than before. This was the principle of ascending in broad daylight."]},{"number":1785,"title":"Chapter 1785 Returning and Receiving a Promotion","paragraphs":["1785 Returning and Receiving a Promotion","The cultivation Chu Yunfan comprehended was far higher than his true level. Coupled with the transition of his life essence and the breakthrough in his cultivation base, there was simply an earth-shattering change. Moreover, after his lifespan became several times longer than that of ordinary people, some techniques that were originally taboo to others and required him to burn his life became a direction that Chu Yunfan could choose.","For cultivators, their ultimate goal was to defy the heavens and take lives so that they could live forever. For many cultivators, time was not enough, let alone using time to exchange for the use of some divine abilities. Unless they were forced to, they wouldn’t do such a thing.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His lifespan had increased by several times in one go, allowing him to use these methods. This was equivalent to him having another huge trump card—a trump card to deal with Li Qianyuan.","Through this operation, Chu Yunfan saw the strength of Meng Tianren, Huangfu Li, Zi Buyu, Hu Qingxuan, and others. Although they could not be compared, Chu Yunfan saw some clues about Li Qianyuan.","He was at least at the peak of the Cosmos Stage, maybe even past it. After all, he had been famous for many years, and few people had really seen his full strength. During this time, Chu Yunfan had made rapid progress, let alone Li Qianyuan. Of course, if he could, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t want to use such a cruel method. After all, every extra bit of lifespan was a chance. He could continue to break through until he reached the peak of martial arts and live forever.","There was an endless number of camps near Pingyao. In one of the most remote camps, You Chuyun, who was dressed in armor, looked up at the sky with a worried expression. Chu Yunfan had been away for a long time, and there had been no news from him. Li Qianyuan was putting even more pressure on him than ever before, trying to move the Baotai soldiers to the most dangerous front line.","During this period of time, You Chuyun witnessed the most tragic battlefield. It was the most intense part of the entire Pingyao battlefield. The elite armies of both sides continued to enter. Countless powerful monsters ran amok, and many powerful martial arts experts continued to kill. It was like a mill of flesh and blood, swallowing countless elites. The terrifying killing efficiency made him tremble in fear.","If the Baotai garrison were to be thrown into such a battlefield, they would probably not be able to hold on for more than an hour and would be completely annihilated. After all, they were only a small army of 500 people, and they lacked an absolute expert to oversee them. If it wasn’t for the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed many monsters and reported them, You Chuyun probably wouldn’t have been able to stop the transfer order from Pingyao.","Even so, in these two days, if they didn’t go to the battlefield, Li Qianyuan would behead them all for disobeying military orders. At this time, You Chuyun really understood what it meant to be a high-ranking official. Moreover, Li Qianyuan was the first marquis of the younger generation. He could be said to have monstrous power. How could ordinary people like them be compared with Li Qianyuan?","“What should we do? If Senior Chu doesn’t come back soon, the Baotai garrison won’t be able to hold out,” You Chuyun said gloomily.","Suddenly, a light beam streaked across the sky. You Chuyun’s vision blurred, and a figure appeared in the military camp. He immediately revealed a surprised and happy expression.","“Senior Chu, you’re finally back!”","He was sure that the person in front of him was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at You Chuyun and strode into the camp.","“Greetings, General.”","“Greetings, General.”","“Greetings, General.”","Seeing Chu Yunfan walk in, the soldiers immediately bowed to him with fanatical expressions. Chu Yunfan had become a god-like existence among the Baotai soldiers. If it weren’t for him, they wouldn’t have been able to escape the fate of being enslaved and their strength would not have improved by leaps and bounds. They might even have the chance to reach a higher cultivation level by following Chu Yunfan.","“General? Has the promotion document from the Ministry of War been delivered?” Chu Yunfan frowned, but he immediately understood why.","“Yes,” You Chuyun answered, “The Ministry has already issued a promotion document. From today onwards, you are promoted to a fifth-grade Tiger General.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. Tiger General, it was obvious that he was a miscellaneous general, which was the lowest rank among the generals. However, he had also become a general and gotten rid of his lieutenant colonel rank. In the future, he would be directly under the the Grand Commandant’s Office. It would not be so easy for Li Qianyuan to exert influence on him through the Ministry of War.","However, though he was just a general with a miscellaneous title, it would take at least a few decades for an ordinary person to become a general with a miscellaneous title. It was only possible for them after serving in the army with dignity for some time. Chu Yunfan took another path and was promoted through military merits. As long as he killed enough powerful enemies, his official position would be promoted very quickly. Moreover, it was a real battle record, and others would have nothing to say.","Li Qianyuan was the first marquis of the younger generation because he had presided over several wars and killed many powerful enemies. This allowed him to surpass many of the older generation’s experts and become a marquis.","The title of marquis wasn’t just a title of nobility. It also represented Grand Xia’s recognition. From a cultivator’s perspective, it would benefit Grand Xia’s luck, allowing them to achieve twice the results with half the effort. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many experts joining Grand Xia. Wasn’t it all for the sake of sharing resources and luck?","Although there was Li Qianyuan’s influence, Grand Xia’s Ministry of War was a behemoth. Even Li Qianyuan could only influence a small part of it and could not affect Chu Yunfan’s promotion.","“However, the Ministry of War wants you to go to the capital to report on your work within a year,” You Chuyun added.","“All right.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “What has happened since I left?”","“Nothing much except for Li Qianyuan trying to mobilize the garrison to the most intense battlefield through the Ministry of War. It’s obvious that he wants to kill us with a borrowed knife. Fortunately, we have the corpses of the monsters left by you, Senior Chu. We handed them over for military merits. Even Li Qianyuan can’t do anything to us. After all, we’re in the army, and he has to follow the rules,” You Chuyun reported, “However, we won’t be able to hold out for much longer. Fortunately, you have returned, Senior Chu. Otherwise, we might not be able to escape death.”"]},{"number":1786,"title":"Chapter 1786 Heavily Inflicting Damage to the Enemy in One Move","paragraphs":["1786 Heavily Inflicting Damage to the Enemy in One Move","“You’ve worked hard during this time.” Chu Yunfan patted You Chuyun’s shoulder.","Li Qianyuan’s pressure was not something that an ordinary person could bear. It could be imagined how much pressure You Chuyun had suffered during this period.","You Chuyun’s heart ached. During this period, he had been under a lot of pressure. Li Qianyuan even hinted that Chu Yunfan had died outside and would not come back. That heavy pressure almost crushed him. Only now did he understand what kind of pressure Chu Yunfan had to endure every day.","However, he could not feel such pressure from Chu Yunfan. He even felt that Chu Yunfan had unimaginable confidence. Such self-confidence could infect everyone, making them unknowingly believe that they could rise to the top by following him.","When it was You Chuyun’s turn to control the situation, he realized that things were far more complicated than he had imagined. Chu Yunfan had arranged the Baotai garrison in such a casual manner that You Chuyun didn’t think much of it. When he took over, he realized that what Chu Yunfan could do easily was too difficult for him.","He was troubled internally and externally, and this made him feel very broken. However, he could not just give up. The military rules of Grand Xia were strict. He could choose not to join the army, but once he joined the army, he had to accept the restrictions of military law.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had relied on the harsh military law to uproot the spies planted by the various major forces in the Baotai garrison. If he fled, even the Flying Celestials would not tolerate him.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan was finally back. All his waiting was worth it.","“Don’t worry. Now that I’m back, Li Qianyuan can’t do anything to us.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“During this period, I’ll be personally overseeing the army. Even if I have to go to the most tragic battlefield, I’m confident that I can protect myself. This place won’t become our burial ground, but a whetstone for the entire camp,” Chu Yunfan said, “I have some spiritual fruits. Help me distribute them to the soldiers. Everyone will get one, including you. Your cultivation is too weak. Hurry up and raise it.”","At this point, You Chuyun realized that Chu Yunfan’s aura was even more unfathomable. He could vaguely sense Chu Yunfan’s bottom line in the past, but he could no longer see through Chu Yunfan’s depth. All of his senses fell on Chu Yunfan, but they disappeared without a trace like a clay ox entering the sea.","You Chuyun was speechless. Without a doubt, this meant that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had undergone another earth-shattering change. This made him feel incredulous. This senior’s improvement was way too fast.","From the moment he met Chu Yunfan, he had felt that Chu Yunfan’s future prospects were limitless. He was betting on Chu Yunfan. But now, Chu Yunfan had already made him feel that he could not see clearly.","His progress during this period was not small, even greater than the progress he had made in the past few years. However, Chu Yunfan was still saying that his cultivation was too weak. He was immediately helpless.","You Chuyun didn’t know what kind of terrifying scene Chu Yunfan had seen on this trip. There were over 10,000 Interpreters and over 2,000 Cosmics. What a shocking scene it was. You Chuyun’s cultivation might seem decent, but compared to the 10,000 Interpreters, he was an existence at the very bottom.","It was precisely because of this that Chu Yunfan felt that the cultivation of You Chuyun and the others was not enough. This time, not only did he have to raise You Chuyun’s strength, but he also had to raise the cultivation of his other ten followers to the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Normally, it would be impossible to pull up the seedlings to help them grow. However, with the Brahma Fruit, everything was easily solved.","After entering the main tent, Chu Yunfan plucked the ripe Brahma Fruits and handed them to You Chuyun. He gave one to each person in the army to increase the strength of the entire force.","This kind of spending was not small. No one knew how many resources were consumed. Ordinary people did not have such great ambition and strength.","Not long after Chu Yunfan returned, a figure with a terrifying aura rushed over. A middle-aged man in armor entered the camp.","“Where is Chu Yunfan?” the man boomed.","This shout shook the entire camp. Immediately, the army spirit of Baotai appeared. This was the instinctive reaction of the army.","The army spirit was in mid-air, faintly confronting the middle-aged man, and the middle-aged man stared back at the army spirit. He didn’t expect to see such a thing in a third-rate army. This was simply a miracle. Even among the many armies of Grand Xia, only the elite troops could condense a true army spirit.","The conditions to condense an army spirit were very harsh. The man knew this best after being in the army for a long time. It was precisely because of this that he was shocked when he was blocked by the army spirit. Although he did not care about those soldiers, if they could produce an army spirit, they could even pose a huge threat to Cosmics.","“This is an important place in a military camp. Who dares to be impudent?”","A clear voice rang out, and a figure appeared in the air.","“I’ll take you down first.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he raised his hand slightly. The army spirit also raised its hand and attacked the middle-aged man.","“You dare?!” The middle-aged man was shocked and furious. He could not believe that Chu Yunfan dared to attack him first, and without any warning.","The army spirit pounced over at lightning speed, and the man felt like he was in extreme danger. If the army spirit of the Baotai garrison had only posed a threat to him, then now, with Chu Yunfan in charge, the army spirit erupted with shocking strength, completely unleashing the strength of the entire army. There was no one to host the army spirit before. Now, with Chu Yunfan in charge, it was on a completely different level. It was more earth-shattering than ever before.","The attack hit the middle-aged man head-on.","Spurt!","He screamed and spat out a mouthful of blood. He was thrown backward and crashed heavily into the ground. He was severely injured."]},{"number":1787,"title":"Chapter 1787 Li Yu Was So Angry That He Coughed up Blood","paragraphs":["1787 Li Yu Was So Angry That He Coughed up Blood","Li Yu was heavily injured by one strike. Disbelief flashed through his eyes. He was heavily injured in just one move. Being a Cosmos, he was not considered weak. However, he had been severely injured in one move.","As a general who had been in the army for a long time, he naturally understood why. This was because he was in a military camp near Pingyao. The military camp stretched for thousands of miles, and countless military souls and military enegy condensed into a single stream of energy. They were condensed into one through a special formation. The military spirit of a million-strong army was a massive force. Even a demon king would be killed by a full-powered attack.","Of course, it was impossible for everyone to have the ability to mobilize the military energy of a million soldiers. In the entire world, there were only two people who had this ability. One was the current king, and the other was the number one person in the military, the grand commandant of Grand Xia. The stronger the cultivation base of the person, the higher the status of the person in Grand Xia, the more powerful the portion of soldiers they could mobilize.","Of course, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation wasn’t top-notch, and his status wasn’t very high either. He was just a general with a random title, but this was his home ground. The power he could mobilize was naturally extraordinary.","He just didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to attack him so casually.","What was audacious? This was audacious!","When he found out that Chu Yunfan had returned, he immediately went to find Chu Yunfan for Luo Zhao. Ever since the elder of the sect, Luo Zhao, was ordered to kill Chu Yunfan, Li Yu had lost contact with him. He did not care in the slightest. With Luo Zhao’s strength, he was almost on par with Li Qianyuan. With such strength, Chu Yunfan had no possibility of escaping.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would return in the end?","This matter instantly made Li Yu realize the seriousness of the problem. Luo Zhao was one of the hidden elders of the Iron Spears, and he was the one who had invited Luo Zhao. It was impossible for him to ignore Luo Zhao. He had never thought highly of Chu Yunfan, so he had never thought that Chu Yunfan would dare to make a move like this. He was severely injured in the name of trespassing into the military camp and gave him no chance to speak.","Vicious and decisive!","Suddenly, Li Yu felt like he was looking at Li Qianyuan of the past. Li Qianyuan’s shadow had also been this this. This feeling made Li Yu’s heart tremble. He did not dare to imagine it. In fact, he felt that this was simply impossible.","Who was Li Qianyuan? He was the Lord of Destiny, the first Marquis of the younger generation, known as the number one master of the younger generation. What kind of virtue and ability did Chu Yunfan have to be on par with Li Qianyuan?","Chu Yunfan stood high and mighty as he looked at Li Yu, who had been severely injured. His eyes narrowed slightly. He had seen through Li Yu’s cultivation in an instant—the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage.","Even among Cosmics, Li Yu was considered an expert.","Such a cultivation was not bad. There was no doubt that the identity of the person who came was related to Li Qianyuan. Otherwise, the others would not be in such a hurry to find trouble with him. He had a deep understanding of Li Qianyuan’s power. Li Qianyuan was indeed extraordinary. He had many masters under him, including Gongsun Liang, this middle-aged man, and Luo Zhao, who was killed by him before.","These experts were all above the Cosmos Stage, and each of them was extremely powerful. The strongest among his subordinates was You Chuyun, who was only at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. The difference in their foundations was too great.","Li Qianyuan was worthy of being regarded as a great enemy. Such strength and foundation were enough to make Chu Yunfan vigilant. This was why Chu Yunfan did not attack him directly. Instead, he used the military spirit of the camp to seriously injure him.","With Chu Yunfan’s current combat strength, he was invincible in against fourth-level Cosmics. He could even protect himself if he encountered an expert in the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage. If he took on the hou for,, he was confident that he could kill a fifth-level Cosmic within ten moves.","However, this was his trump card and he would not reveal it easily. He had to keep a low profile and not let Li Qianyuan know his strength. Previously, he was able to kill Gongsun Liang because Li Qianyuan had underestimated him. If Luo Zhao had attacked him from the beginning, Chu Yunfan would have been in big trouble.","The best thing to do now was to let Li Qianyuan relax his vigilance and buy himself time to enter the Cosmos Stage. Once he entered the Cosmos Stage, even if he faced Li Qianyuan, he would not be as embarrassed as he was in the past.","Slowly, unconsciously, the gap between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan had changed from the gap between a divine dragon in the sky and an ant on the ground to the gap between an adult divine dragon and a young dragon. Although there was still a gap, it was no longer a fundamental gap.","Therefore, he had to endure. He needed time.","It would be best if he could confuse Li Qianyuan and make Li Qianyuan think that his strength was only so-so and that he only had such means because of the military spirit of the million troops near Pingyao.","“Chu Yunfan, are you trying to rebel?!” Li Yu roared.","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “I think you’re the one who’s rebeling. Who are you? Even the grand commandant wouldn’t dare to be so arrogant. Let’s see how many heads you have left to break into the military camp.”","Of course, Chu Yunfan was fearless. As long as Li Yu was detained and charged into the military camp, he would have nothing to say. In Grand Xia, the military had strict rules. Even the most elite troops would be inspected if they did not have a warrant. Even if the king were here, he would not be able to rush in so casually.","Li Yu choked up. If he could defeat Chu Yunfan and capture him, he could say whatever he wanted. However, he was severely injured by Chu Yunfan and could not fight back.","“You’re not a messenger, nor are you my direct superior. You have no relationship with the Baotai garrison. Of course, I’m aware that you’re trying to silence me for the sake of the demons,” Chu Yunfan continued.","Li Yu suddenly spat out a mouthful of blood and almost fainted. Chu Yunfan was so shameless that he had easily pinned a crime on him. This was once his privilege, but now Chu Yunfan was using similar methods to deal with him. It made him so depressed that he wanted to vomit blood.","“I know who sent you. If that person wants to come, tell him to come personally. There’s no need to resort to such sneaky means. I’m already a Tiger General and am under the Grand Commandant’s Office. Only the grand commandant can give me orders,” Chu Yunfan said proudly, “Now, scram!”","Chu Yunfan shouted, and Li Yu was immediately sent flying out of the camp."]},{"number":1788,"title":"Chapter 1788 His Name Shocked the Army","paragraphs":["1788 His Name Shocked the Army","Although the Baotai garrison camp was at the edge of the Grand Xia encampment, such a huge commotion attracted the attention of many experts stationed there. Chu Yunfan’s words, in particular, shocked them.","Li Qianyuan’s reputation in the army naturally went without saying. His prestige was extremely high, and he had presided over many wars. He had grown up in mountains of corpses and seas of blood and was definitely not a flower that grew up in a greenhouse.","To ordinary people, Li Qianyuan’s resume was simply golden. He was destined to be the protagonist of the world. He was born into a prominent family and smoothly became the first noble of the younger generation of Grand Xia.","But now, the commander of this third-line army didn’t put Li Qianyuan had no regard for this great figure. They did not believe that their hearing was failing, and neither was their vision.","Chu Yunfan showed no respect to Li Qianyuan. Li Qianyuan, who was extremely terrifying in the eyes of ordinary people, was nothing in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","“Who is this new general?”","“He’s so arrogant. He has no respect for Li Qianyuan.”","“That’s really interesting. Li Qianyuan has stepped on the faces of us old folks. It has been many years since anyone dared to challenge him.”","In the camp in the distance, a strong aura was communicating with each other. Many people were watching the joke. After all, Li Qianyuan had risen at the speed of a comet in recent years. He had stepped on the faces of many people. As a result, he had many fans in the army, but there were also many people who disliked him.","Although Chu Yunfan looked unfamiliar, the strength he displayed made many people feel that he was extraordinary. He was not an ignorant person. On the contrary, he was very strong. It was impossible for an ordinary person to severely injure a fifth-level Cosmic with one strike, even if they had the help of the military spirit of a million soldiers.","Many people engraved this newcomer named Chu Yunfan into their hearts. He might surprise even more in the future.","Not long after, in the commander’s tent of Marquis Huntian, Li Yu, who was sitting cross-legged and recuperating, told Li Qianyuan everything. Beside him, there were many people who looked very solemn. Above them sat Li Qianyuan.","Cupping his chin with one hand, Li Qianyuan tapped the armrest of his chair with the other. His eyes were cold and his face showed a cold expression. He was like a demon god, and the pressure he gave off felt like hell itself.","“You’re saying he used the military spirit to heavily injure you?” Li Qianyuan asked after a long silence.","“That’s right, Marquis. He was only able to heavily injure me using military energy. Otherwise, how could he possibly have hurt me?” Li Yu said with grief and indignation.","Today was a great humiliation for him. To be humiliated by Chu Yunfan like this was something he had never experienced before. He had never thought that he would be beaten up so badly.","However, it was not Chu Yunfan’s true strength, but the military spirit of the million-strong army. This made Li Yu particularly unconvinced.","“Although he borrowed the military energy, Chu Yunfan’s growth speed is still very fast. He must have already entered the Cosmos Stage. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be able to mobilize the military energy to such an extent,” a person said with a worried expression.","The rest of the people had worried looks on their faces. Although in their eyes, Chu Yunfan’s strength was still too weak for them to withstand a single blow, there were still many ways to kill him. What they were really worried about was that Chu Yunfan’s strength was growing at an astonishing speed. It was so fast that it made them tremble with fear.","It had only been a short time since they started to notice Chu Yunfan, but he had already entered the Cosmos Stage. Though it was the lowest level of the Cosmos Stage, it was still shocking for his age.","And now, when another Li Qianyuan-like figure appeared, they instinctively felt a threatened.","“Impossible. The Marquis is a genius. He’s of noble birth and has great fortuitous encounters and luck. Who is Chu Yunfan?” someone said unhappily.","“Even if it doesn’t pose a threat to the marquis, he’s still like a toad crawling on one’s feet. It can’t hurt people, but it’s disgusting!” someone retorted.","Li Qianyuan’s eyes flashed with a hint of impatience. Even now, when he heard that Chu Yunfan might enter the Cosmos Stage, he didn’t really take it to heart. What kind of person was he? In front of him, there were only the top geniuses of the older generation and the top figures of the world. What was a mere pursuer? If he had to care about everyone, then he wouldn’t have to do anything else.","However, Chu Yunfan had made him feel disgusted time and time again. He could have killed him with one finger, but he couldn’t get away with it.","“Chu Yunfan is nothing. I don’t care about him. The spring sweep operation was the best time to get rid of him, but the grand commandant is in charge of the army. The grand commandant is observant and can see through everything. Even I can’t do anything while under the grand commandant’s nose, so I handed it over to you. Who knew that none of you could do anything? You’re simply trash!” Li Qianyuan said coldly.","“Li Yu, where is Luo Zhao? Why is he missing? Is he toying with me?” Li Qianyuan looked at Li Yu coldly.","Li Yu trembled and quickly said, “That’s Impossible. Martial Uncle Luo isn’t that kind of person. He must be looking for an opportunity. After all, he won’t let go of the chance to extend his life.”","“That better be the case. If he dares to play with me, I will let him know what it means to live a life worse than death,” Li Qianyuan said coldly, “As for Chu Yunfan, you don’t have to worry about him for now. The next time I break through, I will be the top expert in the world.”"]},{"number":1789,"title":"Chapter 1789 Secluded Cultivation, Accumulating Strength","paragraphs":["1789 Secluded Cultivation, Accumulating Strength","At this time, Chu Yunfan, who had just defeated Li Yu, gathered his army. Since there were only 500 people, they were quickly gathered together.","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, their hearts beat wildly. For soldiers like them who were originally at the bottom of the hierarchy, their lives were already destined. There was no possibility of any change. However, Chu Yunfan had pulled them out of the abyss of hell and given them dignity. From then on, no one would dare to look down on them. They were no longer the dogs of Baotai. On the contrary, they had become an existence that countless people in Baotai envied.","They had followed Chu Yunfan for a short time, but not only had they entered the Core Stage, but they had also entered the Golden Core Stage. If they cultivated on their own, they might not be able to reach the Golden Core Stage in their lifetime.","Now, Chu Yunfan not only provided enough pills but also countless cultivation methods and martial arts manuals. They had almost everything they wanted. They were not inferior to the disciples of ordinary small sects.","Now, Chu Yunfan was even going to help all of them break through to the Abstract Stage. This was something that they did not even dare to think about. In the original Baotai, any Abstract, even the weakest one, was a high and mighty figure that they had to look up to. They were above the level of ordinary people.","But now, they could enter that level. This was simply the best opportunity to bring glory to their ancestors and their families. No matter which general they followed, they wouldn’t be able to get better opportunities or better conditions.","“General, you are too good to us. We swear that from now on, we will go through fire and water for you. If we violate this oath, we will die a horrible death!” You Chuyun shouted.","“General, you are too good to us. We swear that from now on, we will go through fire and water for you. If we violate this oath, we will die a horrible death!”","The other soldiers echoed this sentiment, and their momentum shook the camp slightly. It was different from before. Chu Yunfan knew that he had completely won the hearts of the soldiers.","Looking at the fanatical expressions on their faces, even the words of the king were not as effective as Chu Yunfan’s words. After all, he had pulled them out of the abyss and gave them dignity.","“Thank you. In the future, everyone will naturally understand that as long as I, Chu Yunfan, don’t die, everyone will soar in the future and bring glory to their ancestors sooner or later.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","After his speech, Chu Yunfan distributed some of the pills that he had obtained, as well as 500 Brahma Fruits. These were enough to allow the Baotai soldiers to grow tremendously in a short period. However, these ordinary soldiers were not like Chu Yunfan. He had all kinds of fortuitous encounters, the help of the godhead, and the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. He could quickly digest these things perfectly and turn them into his own power.","This would affect their future growth. The possibility of them reaching the peak in the future was too small. It was basically impossible. However, with their status and talent, it was almost impossible for them to cultivate to the Abstract Stage. Now, it seemed to have damaged their ability to reach the top in the future, but for them, this was an amazing fortuitous encounter.","Not everyone had the ability to ascend to the top. There were so many people in Grand Xia, and those with such potential were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns, one in a hundred thousand. With the pills and the Brahma Fruit that Chu Yunfan had given them, the Baotai garrison immediately entered a state of bitter cultivation.","There was a transfer order from the Ministry of War. It questioned where Chu Yunfan had been during this period and why he had left his post without permission. Of course, he knew that these questions had ill intentions. If he admitted that he had left his post without permission, the consequences would be unimaginable.","With the military orders of Grand Xia, it could be said that this was an extremely serious matter. As a general with no title, he might not only be dealt with, but also might face military punishment.","Of course, Chu Yunfan wasn’t that stupid to say that his whereabouts were unknown. Instead, he threw out the head of first-level Cosmic monster to prove that his whereabouts weren’t unknown. He said he went deep into the demon region to hunt down a Cosmic monster.","Cosmic monsters were on the must-kill list of Grand Xia. The head of every Cosmic monster was a great merit. No matter how it was obtained, Grand Xia only recognized the final military merit. It did not matter even if the person who exchanged it for military merit was a demon expert.","The head of the Cosmic monster that Chu Yunfan had handed over immediately resolved the Ministry of War’s inquiry. He casually made up a story about the bizarre chase.","Some people in the Ministry of War didn’t believe him, but they couldn’t doubt him. After all, the head of a Cosmic monster was the best evidence. No matter how dissatisfied they were, they couldn’t question it.","Because Chu Yunfan had set up a barrier, no one in the outside world knew about this."]},{"number":1790,"title":"Chapter 1790 The Final Sweep","paragraphs":["1790 The Final Sweep","The collective advancement of hundreds of people would be enough to shake the military camp. Even in a place where millions of soldiers gathered, such an advancement was still very shocking. But Chu Yunfan had covered it up, so no one knew what had happened in the Baotai garrison camp.","The Baotai garrison spent ten days in seclusion. Time flew by.","During this process, the incident where Chu Yunfan had severely injured Li Yu was slowly forgotten. On this battlefield where millions of soldiers gathered, all kinds of miracles were born every day. Countless people died in the cruel battles, but at the same time, there were also talents who stood out. This was using a cruel war to train talents. It seemed cruel, but the effect was clear. Almost every day, people were promoted from ordinary lieutenants to generals, and there were countless ordinary soldiers who were promoted to lieutenant.","In this aspect, Grand Xia had always done well, especially in the military. They had maintained a smooth path of advancement. As long as one had enough talent and made enough contributions, they would always be able to rise. Although there were very few people like this, those with true talent were often chosen by the various large sects or even the imperial court of Grand Xia at a very young age. These people would be nurtured from a young age.","The true pearl of the vast ocean was very rare. However, when the scope of the selection of the pearl was expanded to the entire army of Grand Xia, due to the huge number of troops, these people emerged in an endless stream. Moreover, many people were late bloomers. Even so, they were extraordinary.","The matter of the Baotai garrison was forgotten in the blink of an eye.","Although Li Qianyuan had been exerting influence to transfer the Baotai garrison to the most difficult front line, it was quickly rejected by the Grand Commandant’s Office. In the eyes of many people, the Baotai garrison was just a third-line local garrison. The Grand Commandant’s Office wasn’t stupid enough to send such a team to their deaths, and there was no need for that.","In many people’s eyes, it was an accident that the Baotai garrison was transferred here. Even the guards in the main camp were second-line troops. The Baotai garrison did not even have the qualifications to transport grain. After all, the rations of Grand Xia were sent to the front lines by the elite troops using spatial artifacts. It was a completely from the past where they recruited a large number of commoners to deliver these goods.","There was no such thing as a logistics supply line. This was the reason why the Pingyao dared to establish itself at the entrance of the demon region. Even if the demon besieged the city with tens of millions of monsters, they would not be able to trap the city. As long as an experts rushed to the city with countless supplies from the spatial artifacts, all the sieges would become meaningless.","Ten days later, the Baotai soldiers had undergone a drastic change. Chu Yunfan did not stay idle either. He helped the soldiers digest the Brahma Fruit, as well as many pills to increase their strength. It took him a full ten days to raise the entire army to the Abstract Stage. They had undergone earth-shattering changes and was extremely powerful.","At this moment, the Baotai garrison received an order from the Grand Commandant’s Office. All of them were to move out to carry out the last sweep of the demon region. This would be the last sweep of this spring.","Whoop, whoop, whoop!","A loud and desolate horn sounded out. Grand Xia’s army changed their previous method of sending troops to the frontlines to train their troops. Millions of soldiers flew in the air, and millions of Grand Xia drakehorses strode forward with firm steps. It was as if countless lightning bolts had exploded, and they were densely packed together, causing the heavens to tremble. One by one, elite troops were mobilized and acted as arrows. They attacked from all directions and slowly but firmly swept toward the demon region.","Chu Yunfan, who was at the rear of the army, jumped onto his mount. He urged the drakehorse under him and raised one of his hands into a fist.","“Everyone, attack! Humans seek fame and glory. Today is a good opportunity for us to make contributions and bring honor to our ancestors. Kill the monsters and protect humanity!” he shouted, and the entire Baotai garrison began to move forward with the main force.","Grand Xia didn’t need to use any tricks. Just their absolute strength alone was enough to sweep away all their enemies.","“Kill them!”","Rrraaaagggh!","The roars of countless human and demons resounded. The first to attack was countless arrows that swept out from the rear of the army like a torrential rain. They were the most elite Divine Archers out of the millions of soldiers. Only the best archers in Grand Xia could join them. Although 200,000 soldiers were not a lot, they were a nightmare to any enemy.","In just a few short breaths, six waves of arrows covered everything. Every arrow in this rain was covered with divine power. Every arrow was like a missile. More than a million arrows covered the entire ground. Countless monsters were completely defeated by this arrow formation. It was as if they were swept away, and no one survived. The elite troops of Grand Xia at the front could easily kill the remaining monsters after the arrow formation and turn them into their own military merits.","These monsters, who had once dominated the battlefield, were powerless against the attack of millions of regular soldiers. But soon, the true elites of the demons appeared. Terrifying ferocious beasts lined up in an army. At this moment, all the schemes and plots were useless. They could only rely on true strength to fight head-on.","One after another, terrifying wa rbeasts clad in armor charged toward the million-strong army of Grand Xia. Each of these terrifying war beasts had the strength of a Cosmic. Behind these war beasts, countless elite troops of the demon rushed forward in the most orderly formation.","The real collision between the two behemoths had finally begun.","Soon, Chu Yunfan’s Baotai garrison arrived at the front line of the battle. He quickly realized that something was wrong.","The entire army of Grand Xia had formed an incomparably huge formation. It was like a millstone, constantly killing the monsters. However, the Baotai garrison was not included. There was not even a messenger to inform him from where to approach.","This was abnormal in an army of a million. The person in charge of this battle was the highest ranking military commander of Grand Xia, the grand commandant. Under his control, the million strong army was as agile as his hands and feet. This situation was simply too abnormal."]},{"number":1791,"title":"Chapter 1791 Trash","paragraphs":["Chapter 1791 Trash","The Baotai garrison had been forgotten.","Chu Yunfan’s expression suddenly changed. At this time, more and more monsters gathered around them. One of the war beasts led thousands of demon elites and rushed toward this lone army. It was clear that they wanted to devour this small troop that had fallen outside.","At this time, in a carriage high in the sky, Li Qianyuan looked at the Baotai garrison where Chu Yunfan was at the edge of the huge military formation, and a cold smile appeared on his face. This was naturally his doing. He didn’t need to anything personally. As long as he reported one less insignificant team, it would be enough to make Chu Yunfan consigned to eternal damnation.","As the highest ranking officer of the Grand Commandant’s Office, why would the grand commandant pay attention to a mere third-line garrison? Therefore, in his plan, there was no Baotai garrison.","Although Li Qianyuan couldn’t make a move directly, it was enough to kill Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan died silently, even the Flying Celestials could not blame him. In a battlefield where millions of soldiers were roaming, even a noble could die, let alone a small general.","Thinking of this, Li Qianyuan was relieved. Behind him, in the clouds, an elite troop was ready to set off.","“Let’s go!” he roared.","Behind him, 50,000 elite troops launched an attack at lightning speed. He himself rushed out like an arrow and pierced through the demon lineup. The saber in his hand could destroy the world. It was just a simple slash, but it instantly cut a few huge war beasts into two. This terrifying battlefield had become the world where he could roam freely. He was no stranger to it.","Such a situation was not uncommon on the battlefield. The strength of Grand Xia’s military was undoubtedly reflected. Countless figures flew out, and the Cosmics that were rarely seen on normal days swept through all the strong enemies like tigers that had been released from their cages.","Chu Yunfan coldly looked at the small team of demons charging at him. His eyes were unmoved. Such a lineup was not enough for him. With his strength, he could dominate the entire battlefield. In addition, the strength of the Baotai garrison had undergone a world-shaking change.","Li Qianyuan’s attempt to kill him with such a trick was truly wishful thinking.","“Get ready! Arrows, fire!” Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold as he spoke.","Immediately, the Baotai garrison took out their bows and arrows, and hundreds of arrows rained down. Hundreds of Abstracts shot at the monster army with astonishing power.","In an instant, the monster army was bombarded until they were thrown off their feet and suffered heavy casualties. Although there were more monsters in the army, there were more than a thousand of them. However, their cultivation was only equivalent to the Golden Core Stage. How could they compare to the Baotai garrison?","At this moment, a behemoth that was dozens of stories tall rushed through the dust and rushed toward the Baotai garrison.","“Get into formation and meet the attack with the army spirit!” Chu Yunfan shouted. With his military knowledge, the command of a few hundred soldiers was nothing.","At this moment, an army spirit appeared above the Baotai garrison. This army spirit covered the Baotai garrison and collided with this huge war beast.","Boom!","A huge explosion shook the entire sky.","Chu Yunfan watched but did not make a move. In his eyes, this cruel battlefield was an opportunity to train the Baotai garrison.","The Baotai soldiers retreated several steps after receiving such a terrifying attack. They used their entire army to block such a terrifying attack. Everyone felt as if they had been struck by a heavy blow, but none of them gave up. They knew that once the army spirit collapsed, they would be unable to withstand a single blow from this massive war beast.","Chu Yunfan stood in the middle of the army and watched coldly, looking at the battle between the huge army spirit and the war beast. At the same time, there were hundreds of other monsters charging over in a formation.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred, and a figure rushed in front of him. Everyone saw a blood-red figure flash, and a blood-red light swept toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","“Die, you damned human!”","An incomparably loud roar was accompanied by a saber light that was about to chop off Chu Yunfan’s head.","Clang!","There was a loud collision sound. Chu Yunfan had raised his hand to block the knife. The blade was extremely fast, but Chu Yunfan easily blocked it.","At this moment, the blood-red figure finally appeared. It was a human-like figure wearing a blood-red robe.","“Damn it! It’s the Demon God Sect!”","You Chuyun recognized the assassin immediately. He was shocked and furious. The Demon God Sect was extremely daring. They actually dared to appear on such a battlefield. They wanted to capture the leader first. As long as Chu Yunfan died, the Baotai garrison would be finished.","This assassin was a Cosmic!","You Chuyun was already at the late Abstract Interpretation Stage. Even a peak Interpreter would not be able to make him not react, but this assassin was a Cosmic.","The assassin from the Demon God Sect was dumbfounded. He had never expected that his full-powered attack would not be able to hurt Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","“Sh*t!”","Even though this assassin was extremely passionate about the demons, he knew that he had kicked a hornet’s nest. He immediately turned into a red beam, wanting to escape.","Chu Yunfan sneered.”It’s too late for you to leave!”","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and grabbed the assassin’s neck. The assassin was caught in an instant. He couldn’t control his divine power and was instantly suppressed. A seal word appeared on his body.","Bam!","The Demon God Sect assassin was thrown to the ground on the spot, unable to move like a log.","“Trash,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently."]},{"number":1792,"title":"Chapter 1792 Chu Yunfan’s Shocking Command Attainments","paragraphs":["Chapter 1792 Chu Yunfan’s Shocking Command Attainments","When this assassin of the Demon God Sect, who was in the Cosmos Stage, faced Chu Yunfan, he was powerless to fight back. This assassin had only just entered the Cosmos Stage. However, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, ordinary Cosmics would be ambushed if they were not careful.","Unfortunately, the assassin had met a freak!","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level had yet to reach the Cosmos Stage, but in terms of combat strength, ordinary Cosmics were not enough to defeat him, not to mention this kind of Cosmic who walked the path of assassination. It was fine if he could kill people, but if he couldn’t, he would definitely be the weakest and lowest among the Cosmics.","The key to assassination was to escape thousands of miles away when the attack failed. Unfortunately, Chu Yunfan was much faster than him, and he was defeated by Chu Yunfan before he could react. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t kill him. A Cosmic assassin of the Demon God Sect was much more valuable alive than dead.","Immediately, a personal guard came forward and tied up the assassin. All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only taken a few breaths. The surrounding guards looked at Chu Yunfan with fanatical expressions. His strength was even more unfathomable.","It would have taken them a lot of effort to defeat an expert of the Demon God Sect, but Chu Yunfan had turned a Cosmic of the Demon God Sect into trash with a casual grab. His strength was simply unimaginable.","You Chuyun and the other Flying Celestial disciples who had followed Chu Yunfan since before were even more dumbfounded. Now they understood why Chu Yunfan didn’t take Wang Yifan seriously.","How much time had it taken? Many of the Cosmics who were high and mighty to them had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Although they didn’t know what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had reached, there was no doubt that he was no longer afraid of Wang Yifan.","The battle between the giant war beast and the Baotai soldiers continued. As they fought, their experience slowly increased, and they quickly stabilized their position. They could even counterattack the monsters that were charging at them.","Chu Yunfan was in the middle of the formation, constantly changing the formation, causing great damage to the elite demon troops. Due to strict training, even on a battlefield where millions of soldiers were fighting, the Baotai garrison was still in order. They instinctively changed their formation.","They changed the battlefield at a critical moment. At one moment, the garrison would turn into an arrow formation, and at the next moment, it would turn into a long snake formation. Under Chu Yunfan’s command, many formations were easily completed. In addition, the Baotai soldiers were at least Abstracts now. They were much stronger than those monsters, and there were zero casualties.","Like a meat mill, the Baotai garrison easily killed these monsters that pounced over.","You Chuyun looked at Chu Yunfan with his mouth agape. He watched as Chu Yunfan commanded the army like flowing clouds and flowing water. The overall offensive was like mercury pouring down the ground. Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan had amazing attainments in military command. He didn’t look like a newbie who had just joined the army.","Even for a colossus like the Flying Celestials, although there were some military books open to the disciples, very few would actually peruse them. After all, just daily cultivation alone already consumed too much time. How could they have the time to study this course? Even You Chuyun had only read the basic military books before he went out of the sect and roughly knew some things about marching and fighting. That was all.","Moreover, even if one truly understood those books, it would be difficult to have truly astonishing attainments. After all, the essence of the true books on war was hidden in the aristocratic families and would only be open to the most direct descendants of the family. Outsiders could not learn it and could only learn some common things. If they encountered a powerful commander, they would be killed in no time.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t look like he had just joined the army. He looked like a veteran, and he knew all kinds of formations and damage. How was he doing this? It was definitely not as simple as being gifted. He needed a lot of real combat experience. Otherwise, it would only be theories. The problems encountered in a real battle were far from as simple as what the military books said.","You Chuyun would never know that the place where Chu Yunfan came from was completely different from the current Grand Xia. It emphasized nurturing everyone into talents. Everyone was like a dragon, knowing the sky and the earth. It could be said that everyone was an all-rounder.","In terms of strength, they couldn’t be compared to Grand Xia. However, in this aspect, this was not something Grand Xia could compare to.","Chu Yunfan had the help of the godhead, and his comprehension ability was far beyond ordinary people’s imagination. In addition, he had presided over many military expeditions back in the Federation. In terms of military skills, Chu Yunfan’s attainments could definitely be called a master of his generation.","Boom!","The Baotai soldiers became stronger and stronger. After a series of fierce battles, the halberd of the army spirit landed on the war beast and pierced through it. The creature let out a blood-curdling scream and fell to the ground, dead.","Everyone was stunned. This was the first time they had killed a Cosmic with their own strength. They felt as if something had been added to their hearts. It was the belief that they would definitely win. This confidence was never born out of thin air, but needed to be accumulated through an endless stream of victories.","This time, they did not need to rely on Chu Yunfan, but on their unity. By relying on their own strength to kill a Cosmic war beast, it meant that they had made a great contribution. At the very least, they would be collectively awarded third-class merit. It was only a matter of time before they were promoted and made rich.","At the thought of this, everyone looked thrilled. However, they did not make any flashy moves. They just indifferently cleaned up the battlefield and put away their gains with spatial artifacts.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the corpse of the war beast into the Mountain River Diagram and squeezed it into a ball of blood. He left behind only the head, and the rest was poured onto the Brahma Tree.","Chu Yunfan then shouted as mounted his drakehorse, “Arrow formation! Break through the demon defense line!”","The Baotai garrison mounted their drakehorses and formed an arrow formation. With Chu Yunfan as the arrowhead, they began to rush toward the demon army. Facing the endless army of monsters, the Baotai garrison launched their charge."]},{"number":1793,"title":"Chapter 1793 The Nuclear Bombs Reveal Their Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 1793 The Nuclear Bombs Reveal Their Might","Chu Yunfan’s army had easily killed thousands of elite demons and a Cosmic war beast, and this attracted the attention of some big shots among the demons. Immediately after, thousands of demon elites rushed over, sweeping in from all directions like a tidal wave.","These monsters were too terrifying. Although they had transformed into human forms and wore battle armor, all of them had green faces and sharp fangs. They looked extremely terrifying. An ordinary army would probably instantly collapse at such a sight.","Faced with so many demons, Chu Yunfan decided to change to the arrow formation and break out of the encirclement. Otherwise, with only 500 men, they would simply die. No matter how elite the Baotai garrison was, it was still not enough in the face of such a large-scale battle. Therefore, Chu Yunfan decided to lead his team in the direction of the main force.","“Sharp Arrow Formation! Heaven Locking Arrow Formation! Clear out the enemies!”","At Chu Yunfan’s command, the Baotai soldiers took out their longbows. Hundreds of long arrows plowed the path in front of them like missiles, and countless monsters were blown up. However, many more pounced on them one after another.","“Breakthrough everything! Charge with me!” Chu Yunfan gave the order and clashed with the elite demon army.","You Chuyun and the other elites of the Flying Celestials were next to him as Chu Yunfan took the lead. Then, the Baotai soldiers were the strongest elites. They stood at the forefront. This was the profound meaning of the arrow formation.","With absolute strength, they could break through the encirclement.","Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air, and countless thunderbolts condensed into a halberd. As he waved the halberd, a terrifying light that was thousands of feet long swept out, cutting hundreds of monsters in front of him into two.","Soon, a path was carved out of the demon army. They could not stop the Baotai garrison.","“Hmm? What’s that?”","Chu Yunfan’s battle soon attracted the attention of a figure among the demons. This demon looked like a middle-aged man. He was wearing a gorgeous robe, but he had a long tail behind him. He clearly wasn’t human.","He was currently organizing an army to besiege Grand Xia’s army. The demon troops had been mobilized to this battlefield of millions. Including the monsters, there were millions of demons roaming the battlefield. All of this was under the command of this middle-aged man. One could imagine his status among the demons.","But he felt that his command was not smooth. Soon, he discovered that on the left wing of Grand Xia, there was an army of hundreds of humans attacking left and right. Although there were not many of them, they were all elites. This army was the elite among elites formed by Abstracts.","The middle-aged man was a little confused. This did not seem like the work of the Grand Xia grand commandant. In a war of millions of troops, all schemes and plots were meaningless. There was only a real, head-on competition of national strength. If such a small-scale elite troop of a few hundred people had been sent out, they should have died soon enough.","Sending these hundreds of people out was simply sending them to their deaths!","However, he soon realized that something was wrong. This small army was not as he had expected. They were not quickly drowned by the tide-like monster army. On the contrary, they had killed their way out, disrupting his deployment on the left wing and causing the troops on the left wing to be in chaos.","“Interesting. Send another 10,000 elites. We have to make sure that army stays there.” The middle-aged man’s gaze was like a torch, and he discovered Chu Yunfan on the battlefield of millions.","He was surprised to find that Chu Yunfan’s attainments in war were extremely high. He could actually find the loopholes in the formations he had set up and open a bloody path. If Chu Yunfan had just charged forward without thinking, he would have died a long time ago. Such a talent was definitely a genius descendant of a family of generals in Grand Xia who had come out to gain experience. In his eyes, such a person was more threatening than ordinary martial arts experts.","A powerful master in the art of war was equivalent to a million soldiers. As for powerful martial arts experts, whether it was Grand Xia or the demon, could there be a lack of such people? In comparison, the art of war was extremely rare. In a race war, this ability was a true treasure.","Tens of thousands of elites received orders from the demon camp and rushed toward Chu Yunfan, who was galloping on the left flank of the battlefield. Soon, the elite army of tens of thousands of demons arrived and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. Among them, there were no less than ten Cosmics.","Chu Yunfan understood that his reckless charge must have attracted the attention of the demon commander. However, to send so many experts to encircle and suppress him, they must think highly of him.","The expressions of You Chuyun and the others changed when they saw this. In addition to the enemies they already had, there were now thousands more demon elites in the surroundings. In this battlefield of millions, this was nothing. But to them, it was simply a dead end.","“Senior Chu, we have to get out as soon as possible or we’ll die,” You Chuyun said.","Chu Yunfan laughed. “I have something that I haven’t taken out for a long time. It’s usually not very useful, but this is the perfect time to unleash its power! Watch carefully. What’s the big deal about tens of thousands of soldiers?”","Chu Yunfan jumped up, and everyone’s vision blurred. They saw a few arrows with long tails of flames flash across the sky and fall into the ranks of the demon army.","The demons instantly felt their hair stand on end as if a terrifying power of death was approaching. They immediately looked up at the sky. After all, they were all demons. They immediately sensed the danger.","However, they were too late. They had never seen these things before, so they naturally did not understand how terrifying they were. They thought that it was just an ordinary arrow formation, just a little funny-looking.","When all the items fell, they wanted to intercept them, but by then, it was already too late.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Huge mushroom clouds rose up, covering the sky and shaking the earth."]},{"number":1794,"title":"Chapter 1794 The Grand Commandant of Great Xia","paragraphs":["Chapter 1794 The Grand Commandant of Great Xia","After a long time, the nuclear bombs exploded! A terrifying mushroom cloud covered everything and devoured everything!","Everyone was stunned. Even You Chuyun and the others did not know that Chu Yunfan had such a method. It was a terrifying magic weapon that could destroy tens of thousands of troops in one go!","They had never seen a high-tech weapon before, so they thought it was a spirit artifact. However, they were soon shocked. The level of martial arts development in Grand Xia far exceeded that of the Federation. Although they had never seen a nuclear bomb, they had heard of the power of many spirit artifacts.","It wasn’t strange that Chu Yunfan could wipe out tens of thousands of soldiers in one strike. However, they didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to have such means.","Chu Yunfan felt the heat wave sweeping over from afar. The high temperature of the nuclear explosion was enough to destroy everything in an instant. These tactical nuclear bombs had been placed in his Mountain River Diagram for a long time, but he had never found a suitable opportunity to use them.","The nuclear bombs would be ineffective if used on a single person. This was especially true for true top-notch experts. As long as they had surpassed the Core Stage, their perception of danger would be extraordinary. Even if they were caught off guard, it would be like using a butcher’s knife to kill a chicken. If they were Abstracts or even Cosmics, they would be able to escape a safe distance in an instant.","Unless a strategic nuclear bomb was used to cause city-destroying damage, it would be possible to pose a threat to such experts. However, that was also very difficult. Therefore, Chu Yunfan had been keeping these bombs, but now on the battlefield, it had become the best place to use these tactical nuclear bombs.","These were the well-trained troops of the demons. Even if they felt the intense danger, they would instinctively gather together instead of fleeing in all directions. This was the difference between an army and an individual martial arts expert.","This time, Chu Yunfan caught them all in one fell swoop. The 10 Cosmics in the core area were melted, not even leaving a single piece of flesh behind. Even those who were far away were severely injured by the terrifying explosion.","This time, Chu Yunfan had killed at least 30,000 elite demons.","It didn’t seem like much, but in the Federation, it would be a shocking battle record. The weakest of these demon elite troops was much stronger than Chu Yunfan’s mortal enemy, God.","Back then, the Federation had used many nuclear bombs to deal with the God, but they could not do anything to him. Now, these bombs could eliminate more than 30,000 supreme God-level experts. It could be said that the Baotai garrison had profited greatly.","“General Chu is mighty!” someone shouted, and the entire battlefield was instantly filled with the cheers of the Baotai garrison.","They didn’t care how Chu Yunfan destroyed these powerful enemies. They only knew that he had destroyed more than 30,000 demon troops in one breath. It was unprecedented for a local garrison to be able to make such a great contribution.","They were now even more impressed by Chu Yunfan than ever.","***","At this moment, within the formation of the Grand Xia army, a middle-aged man with a resolute face and clad in armor turned his gaze toward the left wing of the army.","The commotion Chu Yunfan had raised had finally alarmed him.","This man with a resolute face was none other than Grand Xia’s war god, the grand commandant of Grand Xia. He was the number one person in Grand Xia’s army. He usually lived in seclusion. Only in a battle of this level would he come out to command the army.","The grand commandant hadn’t noticed that there was an army of a few hundred people on the left wing. In a battlefield of millions of people, a small change in the left wing was nothing. But now, he finally noticed the existence of that small troop.","“A local garrison?” The grand commandant frowned slightly.","He saw that the armor of this troop was only light armor. This was usually used to equip local garrison troops. If it was the main force, even the second-tier main force would usually be equipped with heavy armor that covered the entire body.","After all, these soldiers were martial arts experts. They were strong and could carry a thousand pounds. Heavy armor weighed like nothing to them. It was easy to distinguish the different troops based on the armor they were wearing.","The grand commandant did not remember issuing a transfer order to mobilize a local garrison troop. After all, this was just a spring sweep operation. It was not a war of life and death. It was unnecessary to call upon a local garrison.","It would be a miracle if such troops could last more than ten minutes on this battlefield. Even if they were mobilized, they would only be cannon fodder.","However, what surprised him was that this local garrison possessed extraordinary strength. Every soldier was at least an Abstract. This was not an ordinary local garrison. Even in the Imperial Army, they would be the elites of the elites. This immediately piqued his interest. To be precise, he was interested in the commander of this local garrison and the powerful magic artifact he possessed.","With his experience, the grand commandant could see the power and flaws of this weapon with just a glance. However, on the battlefield, it was considered a lethal weapon.","“Send me the information on that unit,” the grand commandant ordered.","Soon, a guard gathered all the information and sent it to him. The grand commandant took the jade slip and glanced at its contents. He immediately understood everything.","“Chu Yunfan of the Flying Celestials.”","All kinds of information about Chu Yunfan was stored in the jade slip. Chu Yunfan came from the famous Flying Celestial Sect, and he had been there for less than a year. It was indeed a little surprising that he could train such an army to such a level. Even the reason why Chu Yunfan was transferred here was recorded.","“Li Qianyuan.”","The grand commandant’s eyes narrowed. He had read the information that stated that Li Qianyuan had used his authority to influence the Ministry of War’s transfer order and ordered Chu Yunfan to the battlefield. Moreover, he did not report it to the higher-ups, which was why Chu Yunfan was accidentally exposed to the demon army.","“Pass down my order. Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian, has been stripped of his official position for personal reasons. He’ll be fined a year’s salary and is dismissed as the Left Assistant Minister of the Ministry of War.”","Li Qianyuan, who was high and mighty to others, was nothing to the grand commandant. This was just a small punishment.","***","“How is this possible? What kind of magic artifact is that?”","The middle-aged man who was commanding the demon army looked shocked. The 30,000-strong demon army had been completely wiped out before he could even blink.","On a battlefield of this level, it was normal for hundreds of thousands or even millions to die. What he cared about was that special magic artifact. When it was activated, there was no fluctuation of divine power. This was the fundamental reason why it could attack so suddenly. There was not even the slightest sign."]},{"number":1795,"title":"Chapter 1795 A World-Destroying Strike.","paragraphs":["Chapter 1795 A World-Destroying Strike.","The army of Grand Xia had strict military rules, but the rules of the demon were not far off. Although the demon was wild and difficult to tame, and most of them were tribes that gathered in the mountains and forests, they had resisted Grand Xia for many years. It was thus impossible for them to ignore the strict military system of Grand Xia.","Many years ago, they had adopted Grand Xia’s army and established their own elite troops. This was the reason they were able to resist Grand Xia so many times. However, the more elite the troops were, the more helpless they were in the face of such an attack. The weakest of these elite troops was a Golden Core. Their perception was naturally very sharp, and they could easily sense danger. However, the strict military discipline and long-term training made them not dare to run around. They could only fight with collective strength. This was the most dangerous part of this magic artifact.","At the thought of this, a cold expression flashed across the man’s eyes. No matter where that officer from Grand Xia came from, he could not be allowed to remain here.","***","On the other side, Li Qianyuan led tens of thousands of troops to cut a huge gap in the demon army and swept through everything. He stood on his chariot, high and mighty, looking like a celestial emperor. He only dealt with the threat of some Cosmic demons from time to time. For him, these things were considered easy.","Suddenly, he noticed a mushroom cloud rising from the west side of the army. Even from afar, he could easily sense them. His gaze pierced through the battlefield and saw Chu Yunfan leading his troops.","“He’s still alive!”","Li Qianyuan frowned. He thought that Chu Yunfan would be destroyed by the demons’ attack. Who knew he would still be alive and could gallop freely?","Thinking of this, Li Qianyuan could not hide the killing intent on his face. At this moment, he didn’t know that the grand commandant had already punished him with a salary penalty, but even if he knew, he wouldn’t care. With his status, his salary was just icing on the cake. It was nothing.","“This brat is so tenacious. I have to think of a way to get rid of him, or else there will be future trouble.”","***","Chu Yunfan did not know that because of the nuclear explosion, he had attracted the attention of two big shots of Grand Xia and the demon commander. After wiping out tens of thousands of demon elites with nuclear bombs, he led the Baotai garrison toward the main army. After annihilating tens of thousands of soldiers, there was naturally no one left to stop them.","Before Chu Yunfan and the others, the army opened up a gap as if welcoming them. The Baotai garrison was delighted. They had been floating around outside and faced the danger of being destroyed at any moment. Now, they were finally out of danger.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan felt an intense sense of danger. This feeling rushed from the soles of his feet to the top of his head, making him feel as if he had fallen into an ice cave.","“Sh*t!”","Chu Yunfan knew that this was not good. He looked up and saw that a huge energy hand had appeared in the sky. It was as big as a cloud and suddenly came crashing down. The huge hand that was hundreds of kilometers long was a terrifying thing. It was like a mountain crashing down, almost collapsing the world.","Within a radius of a hundred kilometers, everyone felt an unprecedented terrifying pressure, making them unable to move. Let alone resist, even escaping was a pipe dream. They could only wait for death. This feeling made them feel despair.","In those few moments, it felt as if a century had passed.","Not only did the Baotai garrison kneel down, but the elite troops of Grand Xia also knelt. At the same time, terrifying auras rose from the army, wanting to resist, but it was useless. Everything within a radius of a hundred kilometers would be crushed.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, he could still escape if he was no match for Li Qianyuan. However, this big energy hand was simply terrifying. It could easily crush him to death like an ant. This was the first time he had encountered an expert of this level.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to risk everything and expose all his trump cards, he saw a divine light about the thickness of a finger descend from the sky and pierce through the terrifying energy hand.","Boom!","The hand exploded, turning into a terrifying airflow that swept out wildly, forming a tornado. Everyone instantly felt the suppression in their hearts disappear. They were overjoyed and hurriedly used their shields to block the wind that swept over.","Chu Yunfan’s clothes fluttered in the tornado and his back was cold. The terrifying attack just now had almost killed him. Although he could have escaped into the Mountain River Diagram, he instinctively felt that it would not be safe in there anyway. After all, even Li Qianyuan had a way to attack the Mountain River Diagram, let alone that terrifying existence.","And he also felt another terrifying factor. The huge hand had been coming for him. Although it covered a radius of more than a hundred miles and the surrounding tens of thousands of troops were within the range of attack, he still had this feeling.","He was sure that the attack was aimed at him, and the others were just collateral damage."]},{"number":1796,"title":"Chapter 1796 The Mind of a Big Shot","paragraphs":["Chapter 1796 The Mind of a Big Shot","In the eyes of those high and mighty figures, he was probably nothing. He was no different from an ant. However, even under such circumstances, he was being targeted. Other than him using a nuclear bomb, there was no other reason for this. Such a weapon, even if it was just a tactical nuclear bomb, was enough to affect the balance of a battle. If Chu Yunfan had more nuclear bombs in hand, it would be enough to make the demons suffer on the battlefield.","Of course, this did not mean that nuclear bombs were invincible. Even in the Federation, they could rely on the defensive barriers of large base cities to resist nuclear bombs. Not to mention Grand Xia, which had developed far more martial arts than the Federation. However, if it was used for a surprise attack, it was indeed terrifying, more terrifying than any spirit artifact.","The divine light that had saved him earlier was only as thick as a thumb. If one did not look carefully, one would not be able to see it. However, in terms of power, it was even stronger. This was the battlefield where top figures clashed.","Chu Yunfan felt his blood boiling. After what had just happened, not only was he not afraid, but he was also extremely excited. The strength of this one person could rival an entire country.","“Brother Yang, attacking an ordinary junior is not the behavior of a gentleman.”","At this moment, a deep middle-aged man’s voice sounded. His voice revealed a hint of leisure.","“It’s the grand commandant!”","Many people immediately realized that the person who had attacked just now was the grand commandant. On the entire battlefield, only someone like him could save someone at such a critical moment.","“Let’s go!” Chu Yunfan said and led the Baotai garrison into the army.","In the distance, in the demon camp, the middle-aged man in a luxurious robe watched Chu Yunfan lead his men into the main array of the Grand Xia army. He sighed slightly. It was a real pity. He was just a little bit away from destroying Chu Yunfan, but he had failed.","He knew that his action would attract the attention of the grand commandant. It would be almost impossible for him to launch a surprise attack next time.","However, the grand commandant of Grand Xia was actually paying attention to the situation here at all times. This confirmed his previous guess that this young general was definitely not an ordinary person. He might be a genius from some family of generals who had not encountered any trouble. It was more likely that he had a weapon that could change the balance of the battlefield.","Thinking of this, he immediately said, “Pass on my order. Have the Demon God Sect investigate that young general. It would be best if they can capture him. If they can’t, kill him on the spot and leave no one alive.”","If he could kidnap Chu Yunfan, he had a hundred ways to make Chu Yunfan work for him. After all, the method of controlling one’s mind was not something unknown. However, if they couldn’t capture him, they had to kill him.","In Grand Xia, the Demon God Sect was of utmost importance. This was why the demons spent so much effort to nurture the Demon God Sect.","The demon commander looked at the battlefield in the distance. The humans and the demon were fighting each other. Both sides did not give in to each other, and a large number of elites died tragically at every moment.","He didn’t even blink. He just sighed slightly and said, “The grand commandant is still as powerful as ever. Even I can’t gain any advantage in the art of war. Pass down my order. All armies are to withdraw from the battlefield. Other than the troops that cover the rear, all troops are to withdraw from the battlefield in one day.”","This time, he could not gain any advantage over the grand commandant. However, he had achieved his goal. Grand Xia’s army used the spring to train their troops. The same was true for the demons. Although he didn’t gain any advantage, the losses weren’t great either. It was still within the range that he could bear.","Both sides had formed a tacit understanding over the years.","However, he naturally understood that this spring sweep was about to end. Soon, the enemy would retreat. Now, they could still beat the demon army while it was down. They had fought so many times that they knew each other’s movements like the back of their hands.","He then added, “Pass on my order. The captain of the Baotai garrison, Chu Yunfan, will be promoted to the rank of External General. He will also be ordered to form an external army with a quota of 10,000 people. The Ministry of War is to replenish the soldiers and armor in his army as soon as possible.”","The grand commandant’s personal guard looked at him in shock. This was the number one person in the army of Grand Xia—the grand commandant of the world. All the high-ranking officers above the general rank were his subordinates.","External Generals were second-grade guardians. They seemed to have a high position and great power, but to a person someone like the grand commandant, they were still small figures. Even those high and mighty marquises had to make an appointment long in advance to meet the grand commandant. The grand commandant was a great figure who was truly below one person and above tens of thousands of people.","Now, he was concerned about the promotion of such a small character. This made the personal guard look at Chu Yunfan in a new light. He made a mental note of this name in his heart. However, no matter how his heart fluctuated, he naturally did not dare to be careless in the slightest. He quickly accepted the order and went to handle it.","The grand commandant’s eyes were like torches as if he could see through the battlefield and see Chu Yunfan, who was fighting with all his might.","“The Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan, the Violet Thunder Prefecture...” The grand commandant’s eyes narrowed. “I hope you don’t disappoint me. In this world of great strife, there are many masters from all over the world. It isn’t enough to have only one Li Qianyuan. A single branch is not a true spring. A hundred flowers blooming is the right way.”"]},{"number":1797,"title":"Chapter 1797: Li Qianyuan’s Amazing Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 1797: Li Qianyuan’s Amazing Strength","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The conflict between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan was highlighted in the information collected. However, to the grand commandant, this was just a small matter.","Within Grand Xia, there were all sorts of conflicts. There were civil and military conflicts, conflicts between the Imperial Court and the ten great sects, as well as conflicts between the central and local powers. It would be strange if the situation was peaceful.","The grand commandant was not focused on the gains and losses of a city or a place but on the entire world. There were not many who were qualified to fight with him that he cared about.","“There are too few talented people among the younger generation. When that time comes, Li Qianyuan will not be enough. I hope Chu Yunfan won’t disappoint me,” the grand commandant said faintly, his voice audible only to himself. “Besides, that little girl asked me to do it. Forget it, I’ll give her some leeway.”","Chu Yunfan naturally did not know what the big shots on the battlefield were thinking. He was busy attacking left and right, blending into the battle formation. He immediately felt that his situation was much better, unlike before when he was surrounded by enemies from all directions.","At this moment, he was surrounded by his own people. Only the enemies in front of him could make him attack as much as he wanted. This was the power of a military formation. There would always be comrades around you to protect you.","Soon, Chu Yunfan received the grand commandant’s orders. He then ordered the entire Baotai garrison to move out and beat up the demon army.","Chu Yunfan, from atop his drakehorse, said loudly, “The final battle is right in front of us!”","Suddenly, the Baotai soldiers became more imposing and followed Chu Yunfan to charge out.","On the other side of the battlefield, Li Qianyuan coldly watched Chu Yunfan, who was charging forward. His face was dark, causing Li Yu and the others who followed him to also look grim. Ever since they met Li Qianyuan, he had been indifferent and everything was under his control. Nothing could frighten him. But this Chu Yunfan had managed to do it. They instinctively felt that Chu Yunfan would be Li Qianyuan’s mortal enemy in the future.","Li Qianyuan had an ugly expression. Chu Yunfan was still alive, which meant that he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. In this series of mistakes, he had made too many. Every time he thought that he had overestimated Chu Yunfan, he still underestimated Chu Yunfan. If it was an ordinary person, they would probably think that Chu Yunfan’s luck was too good. However, for an expert like him, he did not believe in luck. Once or twice could be considered luck, but if it happened every time, it was not luck, but fate.","Chu Yunfan was favored by the heavens.","These people were the most difficult to deal with. If they could not be eliminated in time, the consequences would be unimaginable. It was possible for them to rise up at any time. Li Qianyuan knew this too well because he himself was such a person.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re lucky. I’m about to enter seclusion and can’t personally attack, but if you think you can pass this easily, then you’re wrong. Even if I don’t attack, I’ll still kill you,” Li Qianyuan said lightly.","He was the Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia, the first marquis among the younger generation. His power was naturally beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","Then, he retracted his gaze and looked into the distance. In the middle of the demon army, a young man in golden armor was holding a spear and confronting him from afar. This golden-armored youth actually had two dragon-like horns on his head. He was like an evil dragon that had come out of the sea.","“Li Qianyuan, I’ve long heard of you—the number one of Grand Xia’s younger generation. I hear that some people even praise you as the number one of the younger generation in the world. I think it’s just that there’s no tiger in the mountain, and a monkey calls itself the king. Today, I, Ao Bing, will show you that there’s always someone better than you.”","This golden-armored youth had an arrogant expression. Faint golden scales lined on both sides of his cheeks, making him look unimaginably powerful.","“You’re just an evil flood dragon. Ao Bing, I’ll show you that I live up to my reputation.”","Li Qianyuan jumped out. He had little concern for Ao Bing. Although Ao Bing’s race was called the true dragon race, he knew that Ao Bing was just an evil flood dragon with the bloodline of the true dragon. There were no longer any real true dragons in existence.","True dragons had gone extinct during the immemorial era and were no longer anywhere to be found. Among the ten ferocities, there was an evil dragon that had been famous. However, this clan had the bloodline of true dragons, and they had extraordinary talents. Everyone in the clan was like a dragon, and every one of them was a master. This made every one of their clansmen arrogant and haughty. Ao Bing did not even care about a famous master like Li Qianyuan.","Boom!","Ao Bing thrust out his spear at Li Qianyuan at lightning speed. The spear transformed into a giant dragon, trying to swallow Li Qianyuan.","Li Qianyuan didn’t even look at this attack. He brandished his saber and slashed out a black light, immediately cutting the dragon.","Clang!","The spear and the saber collided, producing a metallic clanging sound. In just a split second, Ao Bing felt as if he had been struck by a heavy blow. His arms exploded, blood spurting out, and his muscles ruptured. The web between his thumb and forefinger became a bloody mess.","“This is impossible!” Ao Bing said incredulously.","He thought that his strength should be comparable to Li Qianyuan, and his cultivation was extremely brilliant, so he personally came to find Li Qianyuan. Who knew that just as they exchanged blows, his arms would be severely injured by a saber strike?","“D*mn you! You broke through!” Ao Bing said in disbelief.","If this wasn’t the case, he wouldn’t be able to find any other reason. Although they were only one level apart, once they broke through, the difference would be like heaven and earth.","At this moment, he immediately knew that things were not good and wanted to escape.","Li Qianyuan sneered and said, “Not yet, but just about. It’s enough to kill you. It just happens I’m looking for a dragon tendon to make a bowstring.”","He then attacked again. He slashed out a saber light that filled the sky, causing a tsunami. In just a few moves, Ao Bing was forced into a dead end. Li Qianyuan displayed his elegance as the number one expert among the youths of Grand Xia.","Ao Bing was no longer as high-spirited as he was at the beginning. Although his cultivation was also at the peak of the Cosmos Stage, he was no match for Li Qianyuan. He could only parry and could not fight back.","In just a few moves, Ao Bing’s head was separated from his body and he was killed."]},{"number":1798,"title":"Chapter 1798: Full Force Seclusion to Deal With the One-Year Agreement","paragraphs":["Chapter 1798: Full Force Seclusion to Deal With the One-Year Agreement","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To Chu Yunfan’s surprise, even though they were retreating in large strides, the demon army did not show any signs of weakness. Everything was retreating in an orderly manner. The troops at the rear resisted desperately, while the other troops retreated in an orderly manner.","From this alone, Chu Yunfan could tell that the demon commander was a master of military strategy. As a master of military strategy himself, Chu Yunfan could see this.","It wasn’t the most difficult thing to make an army attack in an orderly manner. The real difficulty was to make an army retreat in an orderly manner without causing the entire army to collapse. Since ancient times, there have been many such cases. During the retreat, they would be utterly defeated, not to mention that this collective retreat of millions could still be organized in an orderly manner.","Chu Yunfan was speechless. There was indeed a master in the demon army.","However, the grand commandant of Grand Xia was also extraordinary. He took advantage of the situation and killed, causing the demon army to suffer heavy losses.","Chu Yunfan led the Baotai garrison and killed several Cosmic monsters and thousands of elite demons. After the battle, the Baotai soldiers finally showed some of their elite demeanor and had incomparable confidence. To them, the high and mighty existences in the past had all been cut down. There was nothing else that could unite the hearts of the people more than this.","After taking advantage of the situation and killing for more than a thousand miles, the Grand Xia army finally withdrew their troops and did not continue to pursue them. Otherwise, they might face a counterattack from the demon army. If that happened, the losses would be even greater. The harvest from this spring sweep was already great enough. The elite troops from all over the world had received sufficient training.","After the troops were withdrawn, orders were quickly passed down. The troops returned to their original positions in different orders, and the million-strong army was to be dispersed. Of course, among these troops, the Baotai garrison was the most special. They were only a local garrison and were soon ordered to return to Baotai.","Soon after Chu Yunfan returned to Baotai, the promotion order from the Grand Commandant’s Office arrived. He had been promoted from Tiger General to External General. Although he was still a general with a miscellaneous title, his status was completely different now. Rank-2 was a dividing line. He was considered a high official of the imperial court, not a dispensable small figure.","Chu Yunfan had made great contributions and killed many Cosmic monsters. If it weren’t for his lack of experience, he might have been able to advance another level.","However, this was what made Chu Yunfan special. Those who could kill Cosmic monsters must be Cosmics themselves. These people had high statuses. They would not be like Chu Yunfan, who had suddenly risen from the bottom. This made Chu Yunfan very special.","In the Baotai garrison camp, Chu Yunfan instructed You Chuyun to stay back after dealing with the representatives sent by the many forces in the city and nearby to congratulate him on his promotion.","You Chuyun was ecstatic. It wasn’t just Chu Yunfan who had been rewarded. The entire Baotai garrison had been promoted. Even he was given a Rank-5 general title. Though he was only a low-grade general, there were countless Interpreters in Grand Xia. Only a small portion of them could become a general with any title.","It was rare for someone to be promoted to a general in such a short time, especially for someone who had served in the army for many years and made many contributions. This could be considered bringing honor to his ancestors!","You Chuyun was glad that he had made the right choice to follow Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, he might still be a nobody in the Flying Celestials.","“Congratulations, General Chu. Now that you have been promoted to External General, it will not be easy for Li Qianyuan to attack you,” You Chuyun said.","“This is just the beginning,” Chu Yunfan said with a wave.","He did not think that this was his limit. To him, this was just the beginning.","“You saw the promotion document from the Grand Commandant’s Office, yes? Our garrison is going to be upgraded to an External Army. The garrison will be the backbone of Grand Xia. The Ministry of War will also send new recruits who have completed their training as soon as possible,” Chu Yunfan said, “However, a recruit is just a recruit. It’ll take time for them to integrate. When they get here, they’ll have to undergo special training.”","“Yes, I understand,” You Chuyun said.","“The grand commandant is very generous. I can write imperial edict for all the positions in this army. There is no one else above me. Now, I am the commanding general, and you’re the deputy general. When I’m not around, your words are equivalent to my words,” Chu Yunfan said.","You Chuyun looked incomparably excited. He had never thought of this before. This was because there were tens of thousands of soldiers. The previous Baotai garrison only had a few hundred people, and they were just low-level officers. It was impossible for them to hold a high position. The possibility of a group of officers dropping from above was very high.","However, to everyone’s surprise, the Grand Commandant’s Office did not send a group of officers down. All of them were to be appointed by Chu Yunfan. The situation was completely different.","“I’ll be going into seclusion for two months to prepare for the one-year agreement with Wang Yifan. I’ll have to rely on you to handle military matters,” Chu Yunfan said.","“I will handle it. Rest assured, General Chu,” You Chuyun said.","At this moment, he was no longer worried about Chu Yunfan’s defeat. After seeing Chu Yunfan’s short-term methods, he understood that Wang Yifan had made a huge mistake by giving Chu Yunfan a year. For ordinary people, a year might not change anything, but for Chu Yunfan, it was enough to make everyone shocked.","After giving his instructions, Chu Yunfan went into his seclusion with all his strength.","At the same time, in the imperial capital of Grand Xia, within the Marquis Huntian residence.","Li Qianyuan, his followers, Li Yu, and the others gathered together. Everyone looked depressed because they had heard that Chu Yunfan had been promoted from fifth-grade general to second-grade general. Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t considered a big shot in all of Grand Xia, it was extremely difficult for anyone to be granted such a title. Even Li Qianyuan had experienced many battles before he was finally granted the title of marquis.","This was not good news for them."]},{"number":1799,"title":"Chapter 1799: The Iron Spears’ Troubles","paragraphs":["Chapter 1799: The Iron Spears’ Troubles","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To them, Chu Yunfan was like a cockroach that could not be killed. They had attacked him several times, but he was still alive and kicking. And now, he had actually advanced to second-grade External General.","To them, this was a huge irony.","As Chu Yunfan became stronger and stronger, the price they had to pay to deal with him became greater and greater. They started to suspected that Chu Yunfan had already broken through to the Cosmos Stage. They were sure at least his strength had entered the Cosmos Stage.","Whether or not a warrior was in the Cosmos Stage was extremely important. It was an important benchmark. If they were still at the Abstract Interpretation Stage, then even if they died, no one in the Flying Celestials would stand up for him. The person would just be a minor character. The higher-ups of the Flying Celestials would never notice such a minor character. Even if they were known as geniuses, there were far too many in the Flying Celestials. In Grand Xia and the entire world, geniuses were like fish crossing the river.","However, once one entered the Cosmos Stage, they would be considered a big shot in the Flying Celestials. They would no longer be considered a nobody. To deal with such a person, one had to be more careful. It might even cause the Flying Celestials to interfere. After all, the Flying Celestials was one of the top ten sects, and its strength was far above Li Qianyuan.","“There’s no news about Senior Luo Zhao.”","A follower of Li Qianyuan took the lead and said.","Li Yu looked a little awkward, and it was precisely because of Luo Zhao’s matter. Everyone was looking for Luo Zhao’s whereabouts, but they couldn’t find any trace of him. They even suspected that he had been killed by Chu","Yunfan. Although the probability of this was very low, it was still possible. After all, Chu Yunfan was mysterious and cunning, and many people had suffered at his hands.","However, some time ago, there was news that Luo Zhao had been at the Ancient Ten Ferocities Cave. They even swore that Luo Zhao had massacred the Cosmics of the other sects.","When Li Yu first heard this news, he couldn’t believe it. However, everyone’s statements were the same, and there was no way to deny it. Not to mention, there were representatives of several sects who had sent people to the Iron Spears to inquire about this matter.","There were many forces whose strength was on par with the Iron Spears. Although the Iron Spears was strong, it did not have absolute strength like the ten great sects, who were not afraid of any threat.","The Iron Spears was now in a terrible state. The representatives of other sects were on their way here with great fanfare. Not to mention, among the experts killed were demonic and heretical experts. The origins of these people were greater than the last one. Dealing with these people was enough to make the Iron Spears suffer. Who knew how much trouble they would have to deal with in the future?","Everyone swore that it was definitely Luo Zhao of the Iron Spears. Appearances could be faked, but the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear technique that Luo Zhao had displayed had clearly reached perfection. It was clear that he was cultivating the core secret manual of the Iron Spears. It was impossible that he wasn’t Luo Zhao from the Iron Spears.","Even the Iron Spears had to admit this point. After all, only those who had reached a certain level could be taught the last level of the Tiger and Dragon Roaring Spear. In the entire Iron Spears, there were only a few dozen people who had cultivated it to the perfection. There was no way to deny it even if they wanted to.","Therefore, the Iron Spears didn’t suspect that Luo Zhao had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. However, after he suddenly went crazy and killed people, and he was reported, the negative effects were now beginning to show.","Li Yu would never have thought that Luo Zhao had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. The person who had attacked him was Chu Yunfan. This was Chu Yunfan’s plan to cause trouble for the Iron Spears. After all, with his current strength, he was not strong enough to uproot the Iron Spears. He could only cause them some small trouble.","Those forces that could cultivate Cosmics were not simple. Many of them were comparable to the Iron Spears. If they were to come to the Iron Spears to denounce them, the Iron Spears would be under unprecedented pressure.","However, they had to swallow this bitter fruit. There was no other way. “Martial Uncle Luo must have his own plans. He won’t give up so easily.”","At this point, Li Yu could only stubbornly refuse to admit it, even though he didn’t know what Luo Zhao’s motive was. At this time, he naturally could not admit that he did not know anything.","“I don’t care what Luo Zhao’s plans are. Since he dared to lie to me, he’ll definitely pay the price,” Li Qianyuan said coldly, “Now that Chu Yunfan has been promoted to External General and has entered the eyes of the Grand","Commandant’s Office, it’s difficult for us to act. However, I heard that Chu","Yunfan has a one-year agreement with Wang Yifan of the Flying Celestials.”","Li Qianyuan had no plans to make any mover personally as he knew that his previous small actions had already aroused the grand commandant’s dissatisfaction. Although he thought highly of himself and was the number one expert of the younger generation, there was still a world of difference between him and the grand commandant. He was only the number one expert of the younger generation while the grand commandant was recognized as one of the top experts in the world.","The grand commandant was in charge of all the soldiers in the world. If Li Qianyuan angered the grand commandant, he could easily strip him of his title with a single order.","As someone who came from an aristocratic family of the imperial court, Li","Qianyuan knew better than most geniuses from the sects what the title of grand commandant meant. When he was conferred the title of marquis, he had personally seen the grand commandant of Grand Xia once. The man was truly a god-like figure.","Because of the grand commandant that Grand Xia was like a stabilizing needle. The foreign races in the four directions did not dare to act rashly. Although he never admitted defeat, Li Qianyuan understood the gap between him and the grand commandant.","“That’s right. There is a one-year agreement between them. At that time, everyone ridiculed Chu Yunfan for overestimating his own strength, but now it seems that although Wang Yifan had long entered the Cosmos Stage, he might not be Chu Yunfan’s match,” Li Yu said.","Chu Yunfan’s cunningness had left a deep impression on him.."]},{"number":1800,"title":"Chapter 1800: Breakthrough, the Cosmic Stage!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1800: Breakthrough, the Cosmic Stage!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After the series of events, he naturally would not underestimate Chu Yunfan anymore. Otherwise, it would be an insult to his intelligence. He originally thought that Wang Yifan would win, but now it seemed like that might not be the case.","“That’s right. Now that the grand commandant is keeping an eye on this matter, it won’t be easy for us to make a move. The best way right now is to use Wang Yifan’s hands to get rid of Chu Yunfan,” another person said.","“But no one knows how strong Chu Yunfan is now, and Wang Yifan might not be able to win,” someone said worriedly.","“I know what to do. Li Yu, represent me in talking to Wang Yifan. He should understand what I want,” Li Qianyuan said coldly, “No matter how strong Chu Yunfan is now, he will die when the time comes. This time, I don’t want to any accidents, do you understand?”","“Understood, my lord.” Li Yu nodded.","“I’m going to go into seclusion. I’m putting you guys in charge of the rest.” Li Qianyuan strode out of the room.","Everyone looked at each other, then focused on Li Yu. He understood that this series of events, especially the death of Gongsun Liang and Luo Zhao’s unknown whereabouts, had caused him to lose a lot of points in Li Qianyuan’s side. If he did not think of a way to make up for it now, who knew how many people would clamor to take over his position. After all, the benefits of following the number one expert of the Grand Xia’s youth were unquestionable.","Chu Yunfan did not know that Li Qianyuan was planning to kill him. He had been cultivating in the Mountain River Diagram for a whole month. During this period, the progression of his strength was very shocking. He was improving at rocket speed. If outsiders knew about this, they would be instantly shocked to death.","During this entire month, he had been constantly repairing himself and strengthening his cultivation foundation. This was very important for his future. After a whole month, he had consolidated his cultivation at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage and was about to start breaking through to the Cosmos Stage.","There was a fundamental difference between the Cosmos Stage and the Abstract Interpretation Stage. If one’s lifespan broke through to 300 after entering the Divine Abilities Stage, then after reaching the Cosmos Stage, their lifespan would undergo another earth-shaking change.","They would gain the lifespan of a thousand years old.","This was the first step to reverse the universe and seize the fortunes of the world. It was to break through the limits of human life, divine arts, and divine abilities. In the Abstract Interpretation Stage, all the human limits that could be reached had to be broken through. Once in the Cosmos Stage, all this would have been long settled, and they would go against the flow.","At this stage, only those who had a long lifespan could be considered as the truly important figures in Grand Xia. Such a person was qualified to be the guardian of a sect or even a dynasty.","The Cosmos Stage was a completely different concept from the Abstract Interpretation Stage. This was especially true for Chu Yunfan whose strength was ten times stronger than the average person. When he broke through, it was naturally ten times more difficult than the average person.","If cultivating at at normal speed, one would need at least ten years to break through. Of course, this speed was still unbelievably fast compared to others. After all, Chu Yunfan was still so young.","On top of all this, Chu Yunfan had an Evolution Pill, and now was just the right time to break through. The reward for killing Lone Star was finally coming in handy. It was the most effective item for breaking through to the Cosmos Stage.","Chu Yunfan immediately consumed the Evolution Pill, and he instantly felt a terrifying power emerge from his body, constantly tearing at his strength. It was as if every cell in his body was being torn apart and reassembled over and over. This huge amount of energy was not something that ordinary people could imagine.","He felt as if he was about to collapse.","This was the true meaning of the Evolution Pill. It allowed a person to be reborn. This was the nature of humans. They were constantly reborn from an ordinary life form, and achieving a leap in the level of life. And now, Chu Yunfan could feel such a transformation. Such a terrifying power was contained within it.","Chu Yunfan didn’t resist. He allowed the huge force to tear him apart and for his blood to trickle out of his every pore. However, in the next moment, he was reformed. His body was being torn apart and reassembled in this process, becoming stronger and stronger. This power even extended into the depths of","his soul, tearing it apart.","This tearing was a rebirth!","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had come into contact with the domain of the divine soul. This was a cultivation direction that was completely different from the Abstract Interpretation Stage. After cultivating both life and death, one’s soul would continuously transform after one’s physical body was sufficiently powerful.","After an entire month, Chu Yunfan finally opened his eyes. His body had changed drastically compared to a month ago. His body turned into a kind of celestial skin and jade bones. He looked like a jade person.","His entire mental appearance had undergone a huge change. He was like a celestial being from the heavens. A faint golden color seeped through his skin, and a layer of lightning flickered faintly above his skin.","“I’ve finally broken through to the Cosmos Stage!”","Chu Yunfan slowly exhaled. After a month of bitter cultivation, he had finally digested all the medicinal power of the Evolution Pill and turned it into his own strength. He had also deduced the transformation of his entire body. He could feel the terrifying power contained in his body. To put it bluntly, his current strength was almost ten times that of before.","He was only a step away from breaking through.","At this moment, he truly felt that the Abstract Interpretation Stage and the Cosmos Martial Stage were not on the same level. There had been a complete earth-shattering change. He could feel his life force surging through his body.","His lifespan had undergone earth-shattering changes compared to before. However, compared to ordinary people, his lifespan had increased to at least several thousand years. This was absolutely terrifying!","This meant that he had plenty of time to cultivate. Compared to ordinary people, he had at least several times more time. This was his greatest advantage.","As soon as Chu Yunfan entered the Cosmos Stage, he could feel that his spirit had become ten times stronger, and he had a clearer understanding of heaven and earth.","This transformation was all-rounded.","He was reborn!"]}]);
